window.FWN_KEYBOARD_IMMORTAL_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_KEYBOARD_IMMORTAL_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2901,"title":"Chapter 2901: Chapter 2853: About Time","paragraphs":["Zu An had been wanting to visit the capital. The Universal Conglomerate thought that he'd died in the Battle of Songjin and had held a huge funeral for him.","Not long later, news about his surrender reached the capital. That caused great anger and shock within the Universal Conglomerate.","Isabella must be in anguish.","In contrast, he wasn’t too worried about Chu Chuyan. He was certain that the latter would trust him. Even if he'd truly defected to the Annihilation faction, she would be willing to accompany him there. Unlike Isabella, she wasn’t tied to any faction.","Also, he had lost contact with Tang Tian’er. I wonder if she’s in danger now that Li Zicheng’s army has become a part of the Reproduction faction.","Dissonant Melody had refused to let him return to Beijing because he feared that Zu An would rejoin the Order faction. In contrast, the Conqueror King knew that he had tied Zu An onto the same boat as him, so there was no way Zu An would turn his back on him.","Not to mention Jiang Luofu and Zhao Xiaodie were still with the Annihilation faction. Unless he planned to abandon the two of them, he would have to return here.","The Little Fiend Empress, who had been relieved from role-playing Harjol, had wanted to follow Zu An to the capital to take a look around; but she thought it was too dangerous to leave Jiang Luofu here alone, so she decided to stay behind and disguise herself as a palace maid to take care of the latter.","The two ladies reluctantly bade Zu An farewell.","Shortly after Zu An left the palace, he saw Zhao Xiaodie waiting for him at the city gates. Surprised, he asked, “What are you doing here?”","“I can’t vie with those two women in the palace, so I chose to wait for you here instead,” Zhao Xiaodie said with a sly grin resembling a little fox.","Zu An’s heart shuddered. She must have recognized the disguised Little Fiend Empress. “Did you tell the Conqueror King about that?”","Zhao Xiaodie’s smile stiffened. She murmured in displeasure, “So that’s how you view me.”","“I have to tread carefully because this concerns the lives of many,” Zu An replied apologetically.","“He’s not my real father. Even if he is, you’re my husband now. I won’t do anything that hurts you,” Zhao Xiaodie said. It might have only been a marriage of convenience in this world, but she already viewed him as her husband.","Her sorrowful expression left Zu An in a daze. I've bullied her so much that she’s really suffering from Stockholm syndrome.","Frankly speaking, there wasn’t much of a history between them, which was why he remained guarded against her. However, her sentimental eyes didn’t seem to be a lie.","After all he had been through, he realized that love could be whimsical. Indeed, something that could be properly explained and justified might not necessarily be love.","He grabbed Zhao Xiaodie’s hands and consoled her.","It didn’t take long for Zhao Xiaodie to wipe off her tears and break into a smile. “You should compensate me by bringing me along.”","Zu An was stunned So that’s what she’s after!","“You have betrayed the Order faction. They would probably want your life much more than an insignificant princess like me.”","“It’s different...”","“What’s different? You can use me however you like. Sell me out to the Ming imperial court if you want to. I’m yours anyway.”","“We aren’t married yet.”","“You want to shirk responsibility?”","...","Zu An ended up bringing Zhao Xiaodie with him to the capital.","Her words had convinced him. Having her tag along made him seem much less suspicious to the guards along the way, and the Annihilation faction would feel much more at ease with her by his side.","Otherwise, the Annihilation faction was likely to send spies to keep tabs on him. That would make it tough for him to move around.","Fortresses like Shanhai Pass served to guard against large armies, but Zu An and Zhao Xiaodie traveled alone through the mountains. They had to keep their guard up to make sure that they weren’t discovered by sentries.","The arrival of foreigners like them had induced great changes in this world. Even wild animals had mutated into powerful monsters. There was no chance that normal people could survive in the mountains.","Zu An and Zhao Xiaodie weren’t afraid of the monsters; they were more worried that if they got into a fight, the commotion would attract the attention of sentries.","It was a good thing that it had been raining heavily in the last few days. That helped to conceal their tracks. The two of them made use of this natural cover to circumvent Shanhai Pass.","Their tense nerves loosened, and they could finally get some rest. They took cover in a cavern, started a campfire, and built a simple rack to serve as a divider and to dry their clothes.","They could have dried their clothes with their cultivation, but they still retained habits from the time they were weak.","Zu An was planning their next move when a head popped over the rack. “Big brother Zu~”","“What’s wrong?” Zu An snapped out of his daze. Luckily, I’m still wearing my pants, or else she would have seen me completely naked now.","“Nothing. I just feel uneasy not being able to see you through these clothes,” Zhao Xiaodie replied with a grin. She eyed his body, and her cheeks turned red.","What man could reject a lady’s adoration? Zu An chuckled. “Have a good rest. We still have to travel tomorrow morning. Given our identities, we won’t be able to let our guard down and catch a proper rest once we’re inside the Ming Empire.”","“All right.” Zhao Xiaodie nodded as she reluctantly retracted her head.","The two of them casually chatted over the rack. Their conversation was no longer filled with ulterior motives; it was just casual talk about daily life.","Some time later, Zhao Xiaodie remarked, “Big brother Zu, even though it has been tense and nerve-wracking trying to dodge the sentries, these are some of the happiest days I have had in a long time. I wish such days could continue forever.”","Zu An was silent for a while before he replied, “I’ll be with you from now on.”","“Mm.”","The two of them slowly fell asleep amid chatter.","Halfway through the night, Zu An suddenly felt a smooth and youthful body slipping into his arms. Before he could utter a word, the woman sealed his lips.","Zu An’s body stiffened up, but he still embraced her the next second. He knew how damaging it was to reject a woman at a time like this. Considering their unique relationship, the love she had for him could even turn into hatred.","His embrace put Zhao Xiaodie’s heart at ease, and her kiss became more passionate.","Zu An’s breathing also hastened.","The Little Fiend Empress had already advised him to do the deed with Zhao Xiaodie and completely bring her over to their side, but he didn’t want to make things happen between them with an ulterior motive.","But now that things had finally reached a tipping point, there was no reason for him to continue playing the gentleman.","Zu An took the reins, forcing Zhao Xiaodie to defend herself in embarrassment..."]},{"number":2902,"title":"Chapter 2902: Chapter 2854: Conquer","paragraphs":["An intense battle had broken out at Juyong Pass, which was around 25 kilometers northwest of Beijing.","Li Zicheng’s army had swept through Shanxi, Datong, Xuanfu, and several other important strongholds. The Reproduction army had already built up the momentum required to conquer the world. It wouldn’t be long before Juyong Pass was encircled.","The Order faction understood the importance of Juyong Pass. Were it to collapse, there would be no natural terrain to guard Beijing anymore. So, they channeled all their remaining generals and soldiers there.","An intense siege battle ensued.","Li Zicheng’s army had extremely high morale. His soldiers relentlessly scaled the fortress walls without any fear for their lives.","The Order faction understood that this was a fight for survival, so they layered Order buffs on their troops. They proved to be formidable foes. Brilliant lights enveloped their soldiers as they reaped Li Zicheng’s army like crops.","It didn’t take long for the perimeters of the city to be soaked in blood.","But the Order faction didn’t look relieved at all. Li Zicheng’s army was too huge. As quickly as they killed off their enemies, many more rebel soldiers would appear to take their place. Reinforcements were never a problem for the Reproduction faction.","To make things worse, Order soldiers were continuously defecting over to the Reproduction faction’s side under the influence of the latter's powers.","This was the most terrifying aspect of the Reproduction faction. A fight against them would require the total eradication of their army, or else one would risk being assimilated into their fold.","When the Ming army’s defenses began to weaken, Li Zicheng began rolling out siege weapons. Their battering rams were reinforced with formations and skills, making them nigh-indestructible.","The Ming army struggled to damage the weapons even after concentrating attacks on them. This left them with no choice but to tightly shut their gate. Light halos enveloped the gate as defensive skills and formations were layered on it.","Despite that, they still struggled to fend against the battering rams. The gate stood firm even after several rams, but the impact caused blood to splatter everywhere on the other side.","Each time the peasant rebel army struck the gate, many Ming soldiers lost their lives. Seeing that, the Ming army didn’t dare get careless. They hurriedly altered the area around the gate with Order laws.","The stone pavement around the gate loosened into dirt, and the ground began quaking violently to push the battering ram back.","Upon seeing that their battering rams were being pushed back, the Reproduction faction hurriedly cast a spell to extend the rams to the point where they were even larger than the fortress gate itself. Now, the Ming army would have to induce a much more powerful quake to push the battering rams away, but that would risk destabilizing their own fortress walls.","So, the Order faction resorted to another formation—Order Rain.","A powerful tsunami gushed forth from the gate. They were trying to use the gentle nature of water to push the nigh-indestructible battering rams away.","Unfortunately, they forgot that they had just terraformed the ground around the gate into loose dirt. Casting a water formation at this juncture resulted in the ground becoming very muddy. Not only did they fail to push the battering ram backward, but they also made it easier for the invading party to push ahead. The fight was turned into a pure clash of military prowess.","Needless to say, that was to Li Zicheng’s advantage. The peasant rebel army had high morale, whereas the Ming army had already lost their resolve. Many of the Ming soldiers even thought about surrendering and joining the enemies.","In the end, the battering rams smashed through the gate, and bloodshed ensued.","Li Zicheng’s army was highly motivated. They charged into the fortress with furious war cries. Wherever the battering ram struck, soldiers were reduced into mush. Casualties swiftly hiked.","Soon, the lofty Juyong Pass was conquered.","But Li Zicheng’s army didn’t stop and rest. He wanted to continue his momentum and not give the Order faction any chance to catch a breather, until their spirit was completely crushed. This way, he could lower the casualties in the fight for the capital, Beijing.","The kneeling Ming soldiers cowered at his feet and offered him their loyalty, allowing him to baptize them in Reproduction’s radiance.","...","Back in the cavern, Zu An gently kissed away Zhao Xiaodie’s tears. “What’s wrong? Was I too rough?”","“That’s not it.” Zhao Xiaodie shook her head. She clutched onto Zu An like an octopus, embracing his whole body with her tenderness.","She didn’t want to answer that question. She had just thought about her father and big brother, and she suddenly felt that she was useless.","She'd chosen to join the Annihilation Divine Palace after she had heard about how the Shadow Group had posed a threat to Zu An by tapping into Annihilation power. She'd thought that mysterious power could help her in her vengeance.","She'd undergone trials in the Annihilation Divine Palace and nearly died many times, but in the process, she continuously grew stronger, to the point where she started to become confident in her ability to exact vengeance.","She hadn’t expected to bump into Zu An in this world. Neither had she anticipated that there would be such a switch in their relationship.","She'd become a part of Annihilation’s upper echelons, whereas Zu An had fallen from grace and was reduced to a prisoner. She had thus planned to slowly tease and corner Zu An like a twisted cat and mouse game so as to redress the grievances faced by King Qi’s manor. But for some reason, she'd helped him conceal Jiang Luofu and the Little Fiend Empress’ identities.","Back then, she'd told herself that she was playing the long game. She would lead him into thinking that she had fallen in love with him, and when he thought that everything was in his grasp, she would plunge the knife of betrayal into his back and pull him down from his lofty heights into the dirt. He would experience the pain of losing everything.","She hadn't thought that he could slowly rise from a lowly prisoner into an esteemed guest whom both Dissonant Melody and the Conqueror King sought the loyalty of.","His compelling confidence and incredible abilities made her remember how he had defied all odds to rise to the top in the Cultivation World.","He’s always so self-assured. He’s always able to make the impossible happen. He's undefeatable...","That thought had dominated her mind back when she was in the Cultivation World. She had thought that she could turn the tables on him after attaining annihilation power, but this reunion with him showed that he was infallible, no matter where and when.","She kept telling herself that this was all an act for her ultimate vengeance, yet she found happiness in this play. Instead, the thought of vengeance plunged her into misery, and she found herself averting it.","All of a sudden, she no longer understood how she truly felt toward him.","Her rational mind told her that she was approaching him to earn his trust and investigate his weakness, so that she could avenge her father and brother. But she couldn’t control her feelings of wanting to get close to him.","For a moment just now, she even thought that he was her everything, and vengeance didn’t mean a thing anymore.","Father, big brother, I might not be able to avenge you anymore...","Zu An didn’t know about Zhao Xiaodie’s complicated thoughts, but he could sense a change in her. The tenderness and adoration in her eyes couldn’t be faked easily.","The following morning, the two of them marched ahead. On the way, they learned that Li Zicheng’s army had breached Juyong Pass and was gathering around Beijing. That left them shocked."]},{"number":2903,"title":"Chapter 2903: Chapter 2855: Beauty that Bewitches the Capital","paragraphs":["Zu An and Zhao Xiaodie knew that under the combined assault of the Reproduction faction and the Annihilation faction, the Order faction was on its last legs, but even so, they hadn’t expected the latter to crumble so swiftly.","Who could have expected the Order faction would be forced back to their base camp in just a few days?","Thinking about the people he knew in the capital, Zu An traveled toward Beijing without rest and finally arrived at its doorstep.","Li Zicheng’s vanguard had arrived at the outskirts of Beijing, but they hadn’t encircled it yet. Unlike in history, the Beijing in this world was an enormous fortress that required a massive army to surround. Thus, they'd first stationed their vanguard force outside the city to sweep away the surrounding garrison troops while isolating Beijing from the rest of the world.","Zu An told Zhao Xiaodie to remain outside lest the two of them get trapped inside the city.","After sharing the most intimate bond, Zhao Xiaodie had dropped much of her previous skepticism toward him, so she agreed. She worriedly said, “It’s too dangerous to enter the city now. Let’s not bother with the mission.”","Her lover’s safety was the topmost priority for her. In comparison, she wasn’t too concerned about Annihilation’s future.","“There’s something I need to verify.” Zu An wouldn’t have risked his life if it was just a mission from Annihilation. However, there were people he cared about in the city, and that matter was of utmost importance.","This wasn't his first time in Beijing. Even though Li Zicheng’s main army hadn’t arrived here, the capital had already been plunged into chaos.","The people wanted to leave the city, but they were blocked at the city gates. Their meek pleas and the cries of the infants formed a stark contrast to the cold garrison guards.","There was no way the Ming soldiers could open the door when their enemies were already outside. The enemy could exploit this opening to attack them or sneak in a spy. Either one would be fatal to the Order faction.","Zu An sighed. No matter which world it is, the populace always receives the news last. The clans with some background have already caught wind of the news and left. They wouldn’t have waited for the enemy force to arrive before acting.","Security at the entrances was tight, but that was no problem for Zu An. Certain military personnel were bound to be granted special access. He could easily slip in using his Myriad Transformations.","He made his way straight to the imperial palace. Along the way, he heard the populace discussing the upcoming war. While the people were alarmed, most maintained an optimistic outlook. Beijing was a formidable fortress, after all.","They still had tens of thousands of soldiers guarding Beijing. Similar to how Minister Yu Qian had protected the capital a hundred years ago, they believed that as long as they stood their ground until reinforcements from other provinces arrived, they could tide through this danger.","Zu An sighed upon hearing those sentiments.","The circumstances are different now. The problem is that the Ming Empire has lost its morale. After suffering several wipeouts and the loss at Juyong Pass, Great Ming’s upper echelons and soldiers have already lost their confidence. Many are probably secretly reaching out to Li Zicheng’s army, hoping to strike a good deal for their surrender.","The battle might just end much faster than expected.","The first thing Zu An did upon entering the imperial palace was to look for Zheng Dan.","There were fewer eunuchs and palace maids, either because they had fled or because Zheng Dan had dismissed them. In any case, she sat alone by the window in a daze. Her face looked much thinner, and her eyes carried a deep and enduring melancholy.","“Some told me you were dead. Some told me you surrendered. But I believe in you...”","“Dandan knows me the best.” A person suddenly hung down from the window.","That shocked Zheng Dan. It was only when she got a good look at the person that surprise and joy erupted on her face. “Am I dreaming?”","She grabbed Zu An’s face to take a closer look. To confirm, she even bit him.","“Ah~ Not so hard!”","That familiar sensation brought tears to Zheng Dan’s eyes. “You baddie! I used to be the one saying that. It’s now your turn to suffer.”","Zu An flipped into the room, and the couple embraced tightly. He took some time to console her before sharing the situation.","Zheng Dan felt jealous when she learned that Jiang Luofu and the Little Fiend Empress were at the Manchus’ imperial court. “That explains why you joined the Annihilation faction. It’s because they're there.”","At the same time, she felt self-pity.","I’m alone in the Order faction, so there’s not much I can do here. Isabella is a good person, but we haven’t verified each other’s identities, and we don’t share a close bond. It’s a pity Chuyan is with Taiwan’s Zheng clan, or else we could have defeated the Little Fiend Empress and Jiang Luofu even if they joined forces.","Zu An burst into laughter. What is she thinking about? “I have my reasons. I’ll explain it in detail to you in the future.”","Zheng Dan shook her head. “You don’t have to. I’ll be with you no matter which faction you're in. You'll always have my support.”","Zu An felt warmth in his heart. She has indeed been with me since Brightmoon City. No amount of money could possibly be worth her unconditional trust in me. “What’s the situation in the Ming court?”","“There are two divergent stances in the Ming court. One advocates moving the capital southward to Jiangnan, rolling out a series of reforms, and leveraging the empire’s economic advantage to build a strong foundation, so it can reclaim its lands in the future.","“The other holds the opinion that the emperor has always guarded the capital ever since its establishment, so moving the capital would crush the people’s morale. If the empire lost the people’s support, the entire country would spiral into decline. It wouldn’t be able to build a stable footing.","“Both sides have been arguing nonstop, but there's still no conclusion even now that Li Zicheng has arrived at the outskirts of the capital,” Zheng Dan sneered in disdain.","Despite the lofty nature of the Universal Conglomerate’s higher-ups, in the face of danger, they were no different from ordinary mortals. Ultimately, it was just their position of power that allowed them to remain calm in the face of trouble. When they lost that lofty position, they panicked just like anyone else.","“Speaking of which, Isabella is in a wretched state,” Zheng Dan suddenly said. “First, she thought you died in battle and bawled her eyes out. Later, she heard about your surrender, and all kinds of rumors floated around the Conglomerate. That made her cry even harder.”","Zu An sighed. “It must have been tough for a young lady like her.”","“You don’t plan to meet her?”","“Considering my current position, it’s not convenient for me to meet her. I’m also unable to explain most things to her right now, so I’d rather meet her later to clear things up. Please help me console her when you have a chance.”","“Tsk. Only a jerk like you can ask your woman to console another one of your women.” Zheng Dan accepted his request despite her annoyed grumbles. “On that note, what prompted you to risk your life to enter Beijing at a time like this?”","“Do you know a woman named Chen Yuanyuan?”","Zheng Dan widened her eyes. “You took such a huge risk for a woman?”","“It’s not what you’re thinking. That woman is of grave importance...”","“You always have a way to justify your flirting.”","“...”","“I've heard about Chen Yuanyuan. She had the entire capital mesmerized the moment she stepped into Beijing. I heard that Noble Consort Tian’s father searched the world for the number one beauty and found her.","“He gifted her to the emperor in an attempt to please him, but the First Elder has his hands full with the Order ceremony and couldn’t care less about a beauty, so he kicked her out of the palace. She ended up in the Second Elder’s manor. The Second Elder spends most of his time at Shanhai Pass right now, so I reckon she spends most of her time alone in the manor.”","“Have you met her?” Zu An asked.","“Why would I meet her? I’m not into women. However, I heard the eunuchs and palace maids praising her beauty.”","“That woman could be the key to solving this problem.”"]},{"number":2904,"title":"Chapter 2904: Chapter 2856: Deity of Love and Beauty","paragraphs":["Zheng Dan looked regretful. “I would have paid her a visit then, if I'd known that.”","In view of her special position as the emperor’s sister-in-law, she steered clear of affairs relating to the forbidden palace. On top of that, she had taken Zu An’s warning to heart and prepared to flee from the imperial palace when crisis struck. That prompted her to keep an even lower profile.","“It’s fine. I’ll look into it.” Zu An was suddenly curious about something. “Speaking of which, Noble Consort Tian is Sixth Elder Lilith. I wonder why her father suddenly brought another woman into the imperial palace.”","“Ah Zu, you might not know because you haven’t been in this world for too long. Other than foreign visitors like us, this world has an indigenous population as well.”","“Noble Consort Tian’s father is indigenous to this world. He's a low-ranking official who has risen to prominence because of his daughter. That’s why he feels insecure about his position, and he wants to reinforce his standing. The way he seeks to do so is by looking for beauties to please the emperor.","“Little does he know that the world has changed. The emperor has now become the Conglomerate’s First Elder, and he only has his eyes on restoring Order’s radiance to this world. He has no interest in the imperial harem at all.”","Zheng Dan felt disdain for what Noble Consort Tian’s father had done.","Zu An chuckled. “The Chongzhen Emperor in history had no interest in women, either. He was devoted to restoring Great Ming’s glory. But the more he tried, the more his poor governance ability hastened the empire’s downfall.”","“After Chen Yuanyuan was kicked out of the palace, Noble Consort Tian’s father turned his attention to Wu Sangui, an official favored by the emperor. He couldn’t have known that the emperor favors Wu Sangui because he's the Conglomerate’s Second Elder.” At this point, Zheng Dan’s expression became weird. “You told me that the Second Elder is a devoted man who steers clear of women. Why did he accept Chen Yuanyuan then?”","“That’s why I think that woman is a special one. I have to meet her in person to know what’s going on,\" Zu An replied.","After gathering some information from Zheng Dan, he left the palace and made his way to Wu Sangui’s mansion in the capital.","The Second Elder was the Conglomerate’s second-in-command, so his mansion was bound to be even more luxurious than that of the Wu clan in history. The winding paths and fake mountains in its garden had to have been a master’s handiwork.","There was an arrangement of scholar’s rocks that conformed to the ideals of thinness, openness, perforations, and wrinkling. These rocks had to be worth a fortune. They were specially imported from Jiangnan, which was Chen Yuanyuan’s hometown.","While an unnerving atmosphere had settled upon the capital, the Wu mansion’s garden was in full bloom. It felt like a paradise, untouched by war and bloodshed.","But this beautiful scenery paled in comparison to the woman in the courtyard. It felt like nothing more than a background to her beauty.","When the woman smiled, the courtyard lit up. When she frowned, the courtyard became dull.","There was no need for introductions. Anyone could tell at a glance that she was the number one beauty in this world, Chen Yuanyuan.","Several soldiers were kneeling before her. “Miss Chen, the capital is too dangerous now. Lord Regional Commissioner has instructed us to take you to Shanhai Pass.”","Even as they spoke, their minds were still shaken by the sight before them. They were all veterans with unwavering hearts who had survived the cruelty of war. Yet a single glance at Chen Yuanyuan’s ethereal beauty was enough to intimidate them. They dared not raise their heads, fearing that they would blaspheme her.","“I won’t go anywhere,” the woman calmly replied.","She looked at the pond, which reflected her ravishing appearance. Her eyebrows were sharp like the mountains, and her eyes glistened. Yet she carried a troubled frown.","The soldiers were alarmed. “You can’t stay here, Miss Chen! If Li Zicheng’s army breaches the capital...”","It wasn't hard to imagine the terrible plight that would befall this beautiful woman if she were captured by those brutes. For a moment, they even considered dragging her away by force. At most, they would just end their lives afterward to atone for their disrespect.","The woman shook her head. “Tell Wu Sangui that I’m not going anywhere. I am waiting for someone here.”","“But the rebel army is already right outside the capital! You’ll be in danger once the enemy stomps the capital! It’s not worth it!” the soldiers exclaimed in a panic.","The woman smiled. “It’s worth it if it’s for that person. He’ll find me.”","Her smile was so radiant that the soldiers’ minds went blank. We're dead. How can there be someone this beautiful in the world?","Knowing that he had to fulfill his mission, the commanding soldier mustered his courage and said, “Miss Chen, this is a military order. Please cooperate with us.”","“Do you intend to take me by force?” The woman looked at him.","The commanding soldier felt his throat turning dry as he replied in a fluster, “N-No, that’s not what I mean! Miss, we just don’t want you to get hurt.” His willpower wavered under her gaze.","All of a sudden, a sigh came from afar. “You shouldn’t force the fair maiden when she’s not willing to go with you.”","The woman shuddered. She shot to her feet and looked over with incredulous eyes.","The soldiers turned their heads over as well and saw a dashing man appearing from behind the fake mountain. Their eyes quivered as they asked, “Who are you?”","This was Military Commissioner Wu Sangui’s private mansion. Outsiders weren’t allowed here. Clearly, this man was up to no good. Knowing that they had to protect Miss Chen from all harm, they drew their swords and attacked the young man.","The man lifted his palm. Before the soldiers could grasp what was going on, they fainted.","The man walked over to the pond and stared at the beautiful woman in disbelief. “I’d have never thought that you were Chen Yuanyuan.”","“Ah Zu!” The woman couldn’t control her raging emotions anymore. She leaped into his arms, and the two of them embraced tightly.","The man was Zu An, and the woman was indeed the Chen Yuanyuan he was looking for. However, she was also the missing Yu Yanluo!","“I knew you’d come, Ah Zu.” Yu Yanluo’s troubled frown was replaced with joy and bliss.","“How did you know I was in this world?” So I was the one she was waiting for.","“You made quite the splash in the Universal Conglomerate. They want nothing more than to tear off your skin and crush your bones.” Yu Yanluo chuckled. “I bumped into an adorable lady while I was still in the imperial palace. She was this world’s Ninth Princess, though her true identity is the Conglomerate’s young miss. She seems to be very fond of you.”","Zu An’s face reddened. “She probably hates me now.”","He was reminded about how Yu Yanluo had calmly maneuvered among different powers in the Cultivation World despite being in a vulnerable position. One would be in for a rude awakening if one thought she was only good for her looks. Tapping into her wits and socializing prowess, she had obtained crucial intelligence from different places.","“Isabella doesn’t hate you. She was shaken up when she first heard about your betrayal, but upon calming down, she realized that you had to have your reasons for doing so.” At this point, Yu Yanluo stared at him and sighed. “You really are the bane of young ladies.”","Zu An was speechless.","He quickly changed the topic. “ Cough. I returned to the Cultivation World a while back, but I heard that you vanished despite not having entered any of the Divine Palaces. Where did you go?”","“Who says I didn’t enter a Divine Palace? I went to the Deity of Love and Beauty’s Divine Palace.” Yu Yanluo’s answer caused a mini explosion in Zu An’s mind."]},{"number":2905,"title":"Chapter 2905: Chapter 2857: Welcoming Death","paragraphs":["“Didn’t the Deity of Love and Beauty go missing? Why is there still a Divine Palace?” Zu An remembered the conspicuous absence of the Love and Beauty Divine Palace in the Cultivation World.","“I don’t know either. The Divine Palaces suddenly appeared in the Cultivation World, and everyone was red-eyed trying to obtain the powers of the universal deities. I didn’t visit any of the Divine Palaces because none of them were suited for my path.","“But shortly after, I entered a peculiar Divine Palace in my dream. Only later did I learn that it was the Love and Beauty Divine Palace,” Yu Yanluo replied.","“Did you meet the Deity of Love and Beauty?” Zu An anxiously asked.","The Deity of Love and Beauty had disappeared for so long that there were many rumors that they had died. Yu Yanluo could be the only person in the world who knew what was truly going on.","Yu Yanluo shook her head. “I didn’t meet any universal deity. I only had a feeling that I had to accomplish certain tasks.”","It sounds like the Deity of Love and Beauty is already gone. It could be the path itself choosing worshipers and assigning missions.","“Did you come to this world because you received a mission from t he Love and Beauty Divine Palace?” This world sure is lively. Now, it isn't just a stand-off between Order and Annihilation; Reproduction and Love and Beauty have gotten involved as well.","“That’s not it. I was undergoing a trial in another world when a summoning formation suddenly appeared in the sky. I was engulfed by the formation, and before I knew it, I had already transmigrated into this world as Chen Yuanyuan,” Yu Yanluo explained.","“I heard that Noble Consort Tian’s father found you and brought you into the palace as a gift to the emperor?”","“Yes. When I first arrived in this world, I was confused. I didn’t know what was going on, so I went with the flow while gathering intelligence. I didn’t expect it to be such a chaotic world.” Yu Yanluo sighed. “The emperor never visited me after I entered the palace, but I did meet Noble Consort Tian. I could tell that she was a foreigner. She stared at me with a peculiar gaze for a long time. Shortly after, I was kicked out of the palace and sent to Wu Sangui’s side.”","Zu An was startled. “Noble Consort Tian...”","Noble Consort Tian was Fifth Elder Lilith. At first glance, Chen Yuanyuan’s involvement in this matter appeared to be a maneuver from her father to secure power, but it looked as if Lilith could have been the mastermind instead.","It was worth considering what Lilith’s motive could be.","“Wu Sangui was away at Shanhai Pass when I was sent to his mansion. He was averse toward me and refused to accept me, but Noble Consort Tian sent him a message, saying that he would change his mind once he met me. Later, he returned to the capital and met me, and indeed, he was interested in me.”","Zu An was perplexed. “How do you know what Noble Consort Tian told Wu Sangui?”","“Many servants in the Wu mansion deliver information to me on their own accord to get a chance to speak to me,” Yu Yanluo replied as if this was perfectly normal.","Zu An was speechless. Pretty privilege. She was also the number one beauty in the Cultivation World, but her charm wasn’t this exaggerated.","Yu Yanluo continued her story. “Wu Sangui showed a peculiar expression when he saw me. Then, he agreed to let me into his mansion. The servants said he fell in love with me at first sight, but I know that isn’t true. I think he saw his old lover in me.","“He is indeed a gentleman, and maintains a polite distance between us. He did approach me to talk while I was in the capital, presumably to find connections between me and his lover, but the result disappointed him.”","Zu An explained, “It’s rumored that Second Elder Hermes used to have a lover, but no one knows who she was or what she looked like. I never expected you to resemble her. Did you face any danger after coming to this world?”","Yu Yanluo smiled. “I may appear helpless, but that’s because I usually go with the flow to grasp intelligence. After joining the Love and Beauty Divine Palace, I gained an ability—no one can coerce me into doing anything I refuse to.”","Zu An was surprised. “That’s quite a formidable ability.”","While Love and Beauty worshipers possessed incredible charisma that allowed them to sway their surroundings, it was still rather ridiculous for Yu Yanluo’s ability to be this reality-bending. He had never heard of any Love and Beauty worshipers being this overpowered.","Yu Yanluo replied with a chuckle, “I've understood for a long time that beauty is a double-edged sword. It comes with benefits, but it also draws enmity and trouble. I’m glad that I gained this ability, or else I would have died many times in the Myriad Worlds.”","Zu An pulled her into his embrace as he said, “It’s also because of your high intelligence and quick wits. Your socializing ability must have gone a long way.”","“You have a sweet tongue. That must have been how you coaxed the young lass to devote herself to you.”","“Do you want to taste it?”","“You’re terrible~”","...","The two of them spent some time sharing their warmth before Zu An got to the matter at hand. “What’s your mission in this world?”","Yu Yanluo shook her head and replied, “Didn’t I tell you earlier that I was summoned to this world by a random force? I don’t have any mission in this world. However, I have a feeling that someone wishes to exploit me to achieve some goal.”","“Who is it?”","“I don’t know the details, but I am exceptionally sensitive toward malice. Someone is scheming something huge, and I'm the crux of the plan.”","Zu An frowned. What kind of scheme could that be?","Yu Yanluo asked Zu An about his agenda, only to frown after hearing his story. “They’re using me to get Wu Sangui to open Shanhai Pass?”","She wasn't from the Order faction, but she knew that if the Annihilation army breached Shanhai Pass, everything would be devastated.","“The Reproduction army isn’t anything good, either. If they conquer the world, the populace would be reduced to livestock to grow their army. It might be better to let the Annihilation army in, so they can wear each other down,\" Zu An mused.","“But there will eventually be a victor between them. It doesn’t bode well for us, no matter who wins.” Yu Yanluo was someone who had braved many storms. She had her own take on this matter.","“There's no other way now. We can only fight fire with fire.”","“So, you’re going to support the Annihilation faction?”","“That’s right.”","Yu Yanluo was momentarily silent before nodding. “All right, I’ll help you.”","“Aren’t you going to ask why?”","“I am indeed perplexed, but I trust you,” Yu Yanluo replied with a gentle smile. She had witnessed and experienced the powers of the universal deities, and that had taught her that some things couldn’t be spoken aloud—certain entities could eavesdrop. It would be meaningless to probe.","...","In the days to come, Li Zicheng tightly encircled the capital. First Elder Oberon personally joined the battlefield to protect the city, but the soldiers had already lost their fighting spirit. There was no way to turn things around.","It didn’t take long for some generals to defect to the enemy side, allowing Li Zicheng’s army to conquer the super fortress without paying too heavy a price.","These were the generals who'd spoken about dying with the capital and urged the emperor to protect the capital. Only then did First Elder Oberon learn that he had been backstabbed, but by then, it was already too late for him to escape.","It was an unprecedented crushing defeat for the Order faction.","First Elder Oberon was extremely irate. He went around massacring people in the imperial populace, determined not to let Order worshipers be tainted by the Reproduction faction. He viewed it as a testament of his devotion to the Deity of Order.","Standing on a mountain of corpses, he slowly approached a young lady. “Don’t be afraid, Isabella. It’s only for an instant. Otherwise, you’ll be humiliated for life if you end up in the Reproduction faction.”","Isabella’s face turned pale. The First Elder had gone completely mad, but he still retained his strength. She didn’t have the means to escape him.","Just then, the First Elder swung his sword at her. The cold gleam from the sword made her instinctively close her eyes.","The Order faction has been defeated. Big brother Zu has defected. There’s no way we can be together anymore. Death doesn’t seem that frightening anymore..."]},{"number":2906,"title":"Chapter 2906: Chapter 2858: As Long As You Aren’t a Time Scribe","paragraphs":["Isabella awaited the end with closed eyes, but she felt no pain even as moments passed. Instead, warmth engulfed her body, and she felt a sense of safety and security.","“YOU!” First Elder Oberon roared.","You have successfully trolled Oberon for +444... +444... +444...","Isabella hurriedly opened her eyes and saw the person she had been yearning for. “Big brother Zu!”","Zu An’s heart quivered at the sight of her tearful eyes. “Bella, I'm late.”","He pulled Isabella behind her and said, “First Elder, the tides are no longer on your side. You should have gathered your remaining forces to break out of the encirclement instead of killing your own people. As long as you survive, there’s still a chance to turn things around.”","Oberon sneered in anger, “The Order faction wouldn’t have suffered such a crushing defeat if not for your betrayal!”","You have successfully trolled Oberon for +888... +888... +888...","Zu An replied with a sigh, “It looks like you still don’t understand how you lost. We lost the border fight because of the Sixth Elder’s betrayal. There''s nothing I could have done to change the outcome. Similarly, I already curbed the rebel troops in the northwest, but as soon as the Fourth Elder was sent there, Li Zicheng’s army miraculously came back to life. Do you truly think there’s no connection between those two matters?","“The Conglomerate’s elders have long since defected to other powers, yet you remain painfully oblivious to it...”","“Shut up!” Oberon roared. “How dare a traitor slander others? How shameless can you be?!”","You have successfully trolled Oberon for +999... +999... +999...","Zu An shook his head. He couldn’t be bothered to convince Oberon. He grabbed Isabella’s hand and said, “Bella, I’ll take you away from here.”","Oberon flashed in front of them. He glared at Isabella with a darkened face. “Bella, work with me to kill that Order traitor!”","Isabella gritted her teeth. “First Elder, you want me to join hands with you when you just tried to take my life?”","Oberon harrumphed. “I was trying to prevent you from being humiliated by the Reproduction faction. I was rescuing you! Besides, it'dl be an honorable death if you died in the name of Order. The Deity of Order could even take pity on you and save you.”","Isabella was dumbfounded. She tugged Zu An’s hand and said, “Big brother Zu, he’s out of his mind. Let’s leave.”","Oberon’s face darkened. “Bella, are you betraying the Order faction as well? If so, I’ll kill you right here, together with those traitors!”","Zu An sighed. “If you have the energy to do that, you might as well spend that effort taking down another enemy group.”","“You traitors deserve to die more than the enemies!”","“...”","With a swing of his sword, Oberon trapped the two of them in a cage forged out of Order laws. The cage slowly contracted on them, threatening to slice them into countless pieces.","Zu An drew the Slaughter Fang and sliced through the cage. Then, he grabbed Isabella and fled the scene using Rainbow Morph. He didn’t want to fight Oberon now, lest he reveal his cards.","Oberon narrowed his eyes. What’s with that blade? Why does it wield such tremendous destructive prowess against Order laws? That fellow must be an enemy of the Order! I should have killed him when I first met him in the Conglomerate!","However, it looked as if he would never have the chance to rectify that error.","Zu An took Isabella out of Beijing.","As she watched Li Zicheng’s army slowly encircling the capital, Isabella fell into a daze. “Big brother Zu, is the Order faction doomed?”","Zu An fell silent.","Isabella’s face turned gloomy. Having been in the Order faction all her life, it was painful for her to witness its terrible plight. “Big brother Zu, do you plan to return to the Annihilation faction?”","“Mm.”","“I won’t be joining you.” Isabella’s eyelids drooped. She couldn’t abandon her faith and family for love and join her nemesis.","“What do you plan to do now?” Zu An didn’t explain his actions.","“I’ll head southward and see if I can rally Heshan together.”","“What if the remaining half of Great Ming still crumbles?” Zu An knew the fate of Southern Ming. It wouldn’t survive long.","“Then I’ll head to Taiwan to look for big sister Chu and seek help from the Zheng clan. Otherwise, I’ll venture further out to seek opportunities. Regardless, I can’t just give up.” The innocence in Isabella’s eyes had faded. Her gaze showed resolve.","Zu An’s mind was finally put at ease. “Bella, promise me that you’ll stay safe no matter how terrible the circumstances look. Anything is possible as long as you survive.”","Isabella’s eyes lit up. She looked at him with hopeful eyes. “Big brother Zu, do you believe in miracles?”","“You never know what will happen until the very end.” Zu An looked at the sky solemnly.","Isabella nodded. “I’ll remember those words, big brother Zu. Can I embrace you one last time?”","Who knew when they would meet again after this farewell? It could even be an eternal farewell. So, the two of them embraced tightly.","A long time later, Isabella left with determined eyes.","Zu An looked at the moist patch on his chest and sighed.","“You’re going around scourging young ladies.” Zhao Xiaodie emerged from the forest with a wistful expression. She seemed to have seen the old her in Isabella.","“We’ll be on different sides from now on. I can only wish her the best of luck.” Zu An turned around and left.","While Zhao Xiaodie was a member of the Annihilation faction, there was no need to pursue Isabella over something this minor. Instead, she asked, “Big brother Zu, what’s the situation with Chen Yuanyuan?”","“She was captured by Li Zicheng.”","“Ah?” Zhao Xiaodie was startled. “Don’t we need her to persuade the Second Elder to surrender?”","“That’s exactly why we need to convince the Second Elder to surrender.”","“???” Zhao Xiaodie was baffled. She chased after Zu An while asking him why.","...","It didn’t take long for word about Beijing’s collapse to spread. The emperor realized that he was no match for the enemies and hanged himself on Coal Mountain.","Shanhai Pass’s Military Commissioner Wu Sangui led his army back to reinforce the capital.","Li Zicheng sent an envoy over to convince Wu Sangui to surrender. Initially, the latter considered surrendering, but he quickly learned that the Wu mansion had been breached, his father and Chen Yuanyuan had been held hostage, and that Li Zicheng was mesmerized by Chen Yuanyuan and sought to take her into his harem.","In a fit of anger, Wu Sangui decided to surrender to the Manchus instead and allowed them in.","Li Zicheng led his main army northward. His intention was to eliminate Wu Sangui, reclaim Shanhai Pass, and block the Manchu army outside Shanhai Pass.","When they received Wu Sangui’s request for help, the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons were initially bewildered. Many of them wondered if the Second Elder had colluded with Li Zicheng to put on a show in order to lure the Manchu army into a trap.","It didn’t make sense for the Second Elder to surrender to the Manchus when the Order faction and the Annihilation faction were mortal enemies.","The Conqueror King couldn’t make up his mind, so he sought Zu An’s opinion. Zu An fought against all the naysayers and urged the Manchu army to head to the frontlines to reinforce Wu Sangui.","So, the Conqueror King led the Annihilation army to travel to Shanhai Pass without rest. During the journey, he received several more reinforcement requests from the Second Elder.","While the Second Elder’s army was highly trained, they were few in number. They wouldn’t be a match for the Reproduction army.","But the Conqueror King ordered his subordinates to rest up and regroup before heading into the battlefield. He was hoping for the Second Elder’s army and the Reproduction army to wear each other thin before reaping the rewards.","After pacifying and sending off the Second Elder’s envoy, the Conqueror King noticed that Zu An was swiftly writing something in a book. Intrigued, he asked, “What are you doing?”","“I am still a Memory envoy. I ought to record the events of history,” Zu An replied as he continued writing in the book.","The Conqueror King burst into laughter. “You better make sure to properly record how our Annihilation faction achieved a perfect victory then!”","Most people weren’t averse to Memory worshipers, since Mirror Scribes didn’t interfere in worldly affairs, unlike those detestable Time Scribes of the Chaos and Enigma path."]},{"number":2907,"title":"Chapter 2907: Chapter 2859: Who Is the Traitor?","paragraphs":["Zu An stood alongside the Conqueror King as they watched the battle unfold. This was his first encounter with the Reproduction army, and he finally understood how the First Elder’s army was defeated.","Reproduction soldiers were nowhere as strong as Order soldiers or Annihilation soldiers, but there were simply too many of them around. Furthermore, they had insect armies that flew in the sky and crawled on the ground—they were everywhere! This was a nightmare for those suffering from enochlophobia[1].","The insect army was a force to be feared. The cockroach soldiers on the frontlines scythed enemies with ease like the Grim Reaper. Behind them, beetles opened up their wings and gurgled out balls of acid that bombarded their enemies. It felt almost like a scene from Star Wars.","But that wasn't the most frightening aspect of the Reproduction army. Upon sustaining injuries, those fighting against Reproduction worshipers became vulnerable to the latter's contagion. There was a high chance of the wounded losing their rationality and becoming Reproduction worshipers as well.","Thus, the Reproduction army only grew stronger as the war dragged on. The pressure from facing such an enemy was bound to be immense.","The Second Elder’s army was filled with elites, but they were no match for the massive Reproduction army. Soon, they were cornered until they were on the verge of being wiped out.","The Conqueror King could also tell as much, so he immediately led the Annihilation army onto the battlefield.","That boosted the morale of the Second Elder’s army. They began fighting back with greater vigor than before.","In contrast, the Reproduction army descended into chaos. The Conqueror King lived up to his reputation as the conqueror of many worlds; his commanding ability was top-notch. Exploiting the opening created by the Reproduction forces' fluster, he charged in with his elites.","He knew the Reproduction army’s weakness. Even though there were many of them, they were controlled by a single brain—Li Zicheng. Once he was dead, the great Reproduction army would swiftly collapse by itself.","The countless insects and humans of the Reproduction army quickly surrounded the Conqueror King and his elites, but the Annihilation army was a force to be reckoned with. They proved why they were the destroyers of worlds with their skills.","Furthermore, the enemies who were killed by Annihilation power couldn’t be resurrected as zombies to continue fighting.","Zu An observed the fight. No wonder the Deity of Annihilation and the Deity of Death are at odds with each other. The Deity of Death preaches that the dead enter a cycle of reincarnation, whereas beings slain by annihilation power means being reduced to nothing.","It was a terrible fight. Blood flowed like rivers. Stars plummeted from the sky. It felt as if even dao could be grated down.","Individual strength was negligible in a battle of such massive scale. There were so many experts on both sides that, more often than not, one would be bombarded to death by countless skills before even getting a chance to unleash one’s ultimate move.","In the end, the Annihilation faction proved to be the superior one. They had been in this world much longer, so it was only natural that they boasted greater military might.","Perhaps the Reproduction faction had more worshipers, but they didn’t have as much time to grow. Furthermore, during their fight against the Order faction, they had lost many of their top experts, and their new batch of experts hadn’t had enough time to fully mature.","That wouldn’t have been a problem against other enemies; the Reproduction army could compensate for quality with quantity. But the Annihilation faction hadn’t prepared for so many years just to let the Reproduction army grow under their watch.","Thus, the Reproduction army began to waver.","Li Zicheng noticed that the Conqueror King and his troops were closing in on him, so he hurriedly retreated. Unfortunately, his retreat caused the battle to descend from a roughly equal fight into a one-sided slaughter.","So, Li Zicheng fled back to Beijing with his remaining army.","He'd lost the battle, but he didn’t lose hope. Reproduction’s unique trait was that it produced soldiers quickly. As long as he had time to catch his breath, he could produce another hundred million-strong army. The only thing he needed was time.","But how could the Annihilation army possibly give him time? The Conqueror King and his army marched southward, and it didn’t take long for them to arrive at the outskirts of Beijing.","Beijing was the Order faction’s main camp. The Reproduction faction had only just conquered it, so they couldn’t fully exploit its defensive prowess as a mega fortress yet.","Under Zu An’s schemes, the Annihilation army steadily cornered the Reproduction faction.","In the Battle of Zhending, Li Zicheng attempted a counterattack, only to suffer a huge defeat. One of his key subordinates, the great General Gu Ying, died in the battle.[2]","Li Zicheng tasked Chen Yongfu to guard Taiyuan City, hoping to stall the Annihilation army’s footsteps using Shanxi’s defensive line and buy more time for the Reproduction army to rebuild its forces.","However, the Annihilation army employed a two-pronged approach of intense assault and diplomacy. It didn’t take long for Shanxi’s generals and officials to defect, causing the defense line to crumble.","Li Zicheng retreated to his old base located at Shanxi’s border. He gathered his remaining forces, hoping to stand his ground by utilizing Tong Pass’s treacherous terrain.","But after assimilating the Second Elder’s forces, the Annihilation army was now stronger than ever, boasting both the Annihilation faction’s experts and the Order faction’s energy cannons.","The Reproduction faction suffered huge losses, but they still just barely stood their ground.","However, news arrived that Zu An’s army had defeated Li Guo, one of Li Zicheng’s key generals; he'd crushed Shanxi’s defensive line and was gathering at Xi’an. With that, Li Zicheng’s army at Tong Pass crumbled.","Li Zicheng abandoned Xi’an and made his way through Lantian toward Henan and Hukuang.","However, Zu An caught wind of his plan via Tang Tian’er and attacked Xi’an.","In Xi’an’s city lord manor, the plump Fourth Elder Mastema glared at Tang Tian’er. “You little bitch! You betrayed us!”","Tang Tian’er revealed a sweet smile. “Didn’t you betray the Order faction yourself, Fourth Elder? How can you be so shameless as to talk about betrayal to me?”","Zu An finally understood how Li Zicheng had made such a huge comeback despite being left with only eighteen cavalrymen. He looked at Mastema with confusion. “Fourth Elder, you are already standing at the peak of the Order faction. What do you stand to gain by defecting to the Reproduction faction?”","Instead of answering the question, Mastema asked, “What is order to you?”","“Chaos is the natural state of the world. Order builds structures within the chaos, and it is the crux of the rise of civilizations,\" Zu An replied.","Mastema sneered in disdain, “Yes, that is indeed true... at the start. That was the faith that fueled me all this time. But it all changed.”","“Changed?”","“As the radiance of Order expands across the Myriad Worlds, its rules tighten. The slightest mistake is considered blasphemy. Order has already diverged from its primary objective, but the First Elder arrogantly insists on going his way. He refuses to seek counsel from the Deity of Order. On the contrary, he only grows more obstinate with time.”","“Many people have grown discontented with him. I am one of them. I’m not the one who betrayed Order. It’s the First Elder, and even the Deity of Order, who have betrayed Order!” Mastema cried with increasing agitation.","Zu An was perplexed. He dares to blaspheme a universal deity. Is he not afraid of divine retribution?","Mastema suddenly burst into laughter. “Do you think I’m the only traitor? There are more disgruntled people in the Elder Council. Our Sixth Brother has defected to the Annihilation faction. Our Second Brother has done the same as well. We’re all outstanding talents who shine no matter where we go. Do you think we’ll guard the current Order to our dying breath?”","Zu An widened his eyes. “Which factions have the other elders defected to?”","Black blood seeped from Mastema’s mouth as he replied with a sinister smile, “You’ll know very soon.”","With that, he breathed his last. He had taken poison beforehand to end his life.","1. Enochlophobia is the fear of huge crowds. ☜","2. The Chongzhen Emperor, Li Zicheng, Huang Taiji, and Dorgon all lived in the 17th century, whereas the Battle of Zhending happened in the 14th century. ☜"]},{"number":2908,"title":"Chapter 2908: Chapter 2860: A Deity’s Death","paragraphs":["Zu An frowned. What could those words mean? The First Elder has committed suicide. The Fourth Elder has died. The Second Elder and the Sixth Elder have defected to the Annihilation faction. The Fifth Elder is nowhere to be found.","That leaves only Isabella’s father and the Seventh Elder to guard the Conglomerate. Have they defected to other factions as well?","Meanwhile, the Conqueror King was chasing after Li Zicheng because he was more worried about the latter’s reproduction power. Given enough time, Li Zicheng could generate an endless army of soldiers.","To corner Li Zicheng, the Conqueror King divided his army into several platoons to encircle Li Zicheng’s troops. Zu An led one of the platoons.","Tang Tian’er had once been a part of Li Zicheng’s faction, so she was well aware of how they moved. It didn’t take long for her to find Li Zicheng’s whereabouts.","She was also worried about the situation, so she secretly looked for Zu An and said, “Big brother Zu, you should know that a bow becomes useless once all the birds have been hunted down. If the Annihilation faction eliminates all its enemies, we'll become useless to them.”","Zu An sighed. “The tides are no longer on our side. Do you think we can turn the tables around even if we aid Li Zicheng or Southern Ming?”","Tang Tian’er shook her head. They could buy time, but they wouldn’t be able to stop the Annihilation faction’s advance. But that only made her even more panicked.","Zu An stroked her head and said, “Don’t worry. Things aren’t as simple as you imagine.”","Tang Tian’er smiled. “Forget it. Nothing else is important as long as you’re here with me.”","Eventually, Li Zicheng’s remnant army was surrounded and cornered at Hubei’s Jiugong Mountain. There was finally nowhere for Li Zicheng to escape to.","The Conqueror King personally led a ferocious assault against Li Zicheng, but he surprisingly suffered huge losses. It was only when Zu An arrived at the scene and saw the terrifying sight that he finally understood why the Conqueror King was struggling.","Li Zicheng should still have had tens of thousands of troops left, but his soldiers had vanished, having transformed into a field of flesh and blood that covered the entirety of Jiugong Mountain. He had turned the mountain into a fortress of flesh. It devoured Annihilation soldiers and used them as nutrients to expand further.","Just looking at it could erode one’s sanity.","The Conqueror King finally got serious. With a wave of his hand, he unleashed a fiery meteor storm upon Jiugong Mountain.","The Annihilation faction specialized in destroying worlds.","Each of the Conqueror King’s meteors contained sufficient destructive prowess to destroy a world. When they smashed into the flesh mountain, it shook violently, and the charred smell of flesh and blood filled the air.","Under the relentless bombardment of meteors, the flesh mountain shattered. No new meat could grow on it anymore.","Then, the Conqueror King took out a flag, and a pitch-black chariot appeared beneath him. Countless black soldiers appeared out of thin air around him.","This had to be the Conqueror King’s unique ability. Zu An had seen the Monster World’s War Priest using a similar ability. These soldiers were manifested from the void, so they weren't affected by the Reproduction power’s assimilation trait.","Feeling the immense pressure coming from the battlefield, Zu An suddenly felt as if his fight with the War Priest had merely been a squabble between two bumpkin villages.","The Conqueror King’s black army charged onto Jiugong Mountain and laid waste to the remaining flesh. The previously blood-red mountain turned completely black, except for one tiny section on the mountaintop beside an old tree.","Zu An took another look—that turned out not to be a mere tree, but Li Zicheng’s body.","Li Zicheng had fused with the old tree, and countless tendrils flailed menacingly around him. Even when the black soldiers hacked down some of the tendrils, more sprouted out right after.","Li Zicheng knew he was cornered, so he was determined to inflict as much as damage as he could to the Conqueror King before going down. If he could drag the Conqueror King down with him, his life wouldn’t have been in vain.","Black light and bloody light clashed on the mountaintop, and a furious storm brewed. Just the shockwaves that emanated were enough to reap the lives of the Annihilation soldiers, so they hurriedly retreated a safe distance away.","Zu An made use of this opening to sneak onto the mountain. His trail was covered by the shockwaves produced by the clash of two top-notch experts. It was a huge relief that he had absorbed Dissonant Melody’s cultivation, or else he wouldn’t have lasted long here.","A furious roar suddenly echoed from the eye of the storm. “You despicable scum, Annihilation Progenitor! We agreed to cooperate against the Order faction, but you turned your back against me as soon as the deed was done!”","Zu An was startled. That wasn’t Li Zicheng’s voice. It carried divinity unique to only the universal deities. Could the one who had just spoken be the Deity of Reproduction?","Is the Deity of Annihilation’s name the Annihilation Progenitor? Why does that name sound weirdly familiar to me?","Another cold voice replied, “You were too foolish, Shang.”","Zu An’s mind shook. That voice carried the will of destruction, such that even top experts from the Myriad Worlds could go berserk upon hearing it.","Just then, Zu An’s Time Annal and Annals of History emanated gentle surges of energy to protect him. If not for the artifacts of the two universal deities, he would have been discovered.","Who could have thought that there were universal deities possessing the Conqueror King and Li Zicheng?","The Deity of Annihilation should have only descended into the Conqueror King’s body recently, or else he would have blasted me to bits when I was dealing with Dissonant Melody.","“Are you planning to kill me while I’m trapped in Li Zicheng’s body?” the Deity of Reproduction roared in anger.","“It would have been difficult to kill you under any other circumstances. You’re immortal as long as you have a single clone left. It’s a pity that you let your guard down this time, descending into Li Zicheng’s body. How could I let such an opportunity slip through my fingers?”","“I understand. You want to destroy everything, including us universal deities. How are you different from Death?”","“Don’t compare Death to me! They wanted to implement the system of reincarnation. What a joke! That isn’t death at all. Everything in the Myriad Worlds will eventually be reduced to dust!”","“You lunatic! Once I tell the others about this, you’ll suffer the same fate as Death!”","“Do you think you can leave?”","“We’re equally matched. I’m not afraid of you.”","“That might have been true in the past, but I just assimilated that fool, Order. You’re trapped in my cage now. You aren’t a match for me.”","“What? That’s impossible!”","“Like you, Order sensed that his worshipers were struggling in this world, so he descended into the body of the First Elder, hoping to understand what was going on. Little did he know that I was waiting for him.”"]},{"number":2909,"title":"Chapter 2909: Chapter 2861: The Seed of Reproduction","paragraphs":["Waves crashed down on Zu An’s heart. He finally understood what was going on.","The Order Ceremony was a trap.","On the surface, it was a ritual for the Universal Conglomerate and the Holy Knight Order to pay respect to the Deity of Order, but many higher-ups in both the Universal Conglomerate and the Holy Knight Order had already betrayed Order. Some had defected to Annihilation, and others had defected to Reproduction.","The Deity of Reproduction and the Deity of Annihilation had struck a deal to cooperate against the Deity of Order in this world.","Order’s jurisdiction was spread out far too broadly, whereas Reproduction tended to expand chaotically. That had led to many clashes between both factions.","The Deity of Order had been waiting for their worshipers’ tribute when they sensed something going awry in the Order Ceremony. They could tell that other universal deities were tampering with the Order Ceremony.","This world was a unique place, where the powers of several universal deities overlapped. Karma was obscured here, such that even the universal deities struggled to sense what was happening in here.","So, the Deity of Order had descended upon this world, hoping to see what was going on. They had possessed the body of the highest-ranking First Elder Oberon.","The Annihilation Progenitor hadn't prepared such an elaborate scheme just to let the Deity of Order escape. Universal deities were weakened when they possessed the body of a worshiper. In this case, the Annihilation Progenitor had been scheming for a long time now, whereas the Deity of Order was caught off guard.","The outcome wouldn't have been a surprise to anyone.","Li Zicheng’s blood tendrils fell one after another. His rate of recovery couldn’t keep up with the rate of annihilation.","Zu An watched the scene with bated breath while remaining concealed in the Annals of History.","Mortals couldn’t hope to interfere in a fight between universal deities, even if the latter had been weakened many times over after descending. Should it become known that he had overheard such a secret, he would surely be killed many times over.","Fortunately, Time Scribes and Mirror Scribes wielded concealment powers, so they could eavesdrop on the happenings of the world. Otherwise, they couldn’t learn about the secrets of the world.","It was thanks to the compounded concealment power of the two roles, as well as the fact that the Annihilation Progenitor wasn’t at his full strength and was occupied with his fight against the Deity of Reproduction, that Zu An was able to go unnoticed.","The terrifying energy rippling from the mountain caused the Annihilation soldiers to turn pale, and they retreated even further away. Zhao Xiaodie was worried, knowing that Zu An had gone onto Jiugong Mountain.","Jiugong Mountain has already been leveled many times over. Will he be in danger?","Tang Tian’er remarked with a smile, “Don’t worry, princess. He’ll be fine.”","Zhao Xiaodie frowned. Isn’t she from the Hub of Freedom? She shouldn’t be on good terms with Zu An either. So, why is she acting like she knows him very well?","Despite her confidence in Zu An, she couldn’t help but worry after seeing the devastation that had befallen Jiugong Mountain and sensing the overwhelming auras that seemed to belong to universal deities. How can she be so certain that big brother Zu is all right?","Zhao Xiaodie tried to probe, but Tang Tian’er merely responded with a smile. That made her clench her jaw in anger. What a sweet smile this wily vixen has. No wonder big brother Zu is interested in her.","Some time later, the battle concluded. Li Zicheng’s body abruptly exploded into a bloody mist. Soon after, blood rained upon the world. Bushes and trees grew frenziedly, and animals evolved at a ridiculous pace.","The Annihilation Progenitor harrumphed. “You’d rather give your power away than let me have it? Hmph. But as long as your power remains in this world, it’ll be mine in the end.”","The Annihilation Progenitor transformed into countless surges of light that flew in all directions as he sought the origin energy hidden by the Deity of Reproduction.","A long time later, Zu An finally stepped out from the river of time. By then, his back was already drenched in cold sweat. He had ventured onto Jiugong Mountain hoping to find a chance to work with Li Zicheng to pull one over the Conqueror King.","Little had he expected them to be possessed by universal deities.","It’s a huge relief that I haven’t made a move against the Conqueror King thus far, or else I wouldn’t even have known how I died.","This place is too dangerous. I need to leave right away.","Even the lingering auras of the universal deities were so overwhelming that Zu An’s cells went into panic mode. He had to quickly escape elsewhere before his heart would finally calm down.","But a moment later, his face suddenly darkened. He belatedly noticed something abnormal about his surroundings. He had been transported into a world that resembled a womb with wriggling red flesh.","No, it’s not just a single womb. There are countless wombs.","This is... Reproduction’s aura! Are they not dead yet?","“No, I’m already dead. This is my lingering will.” It was a frail voice, but it still shook Zu An to his core.","Zu An raised his head and saw it was the wombs talking to him. Is this Reproduction’s main body?","“No, this isn’t my main body. I have merely manifested in a manner comprehensible to you.”","Zu An was stunned.","I forgot that universal deities can read minds. He quickly said, “Paying respects to the Deity of Reproduction.”","“You carry the divine powers of Chaos and Enigma, Memory, and Death. No wonder I didn’t notice you earlier,” the Deity of Reproduction remarked.","Zu An was sweating profusely. “But you still found me in the end.”","If the Deity of Reproduction could find him, it stood to reason that the Annihilation Progenitor could do the same as well. He was confident in his ability to fight against Annihilation envoys, but he had absolutely no chance against a universal deity.","“Don’t worry. The Annihilation Progenitor hasn’t found you yet. I was only able to find you because Li Zicheng harbors a strong grudge against you. I was only able to vaguely sense you because of this karmic tie.” The wombs wriggled.","Zu An was speechless.","That Li Zicheng sure is... Is he still harboring a grudge against me over how I crushed his army until he only had eighteen cavalrymen left? Ah, I schemed against him during the Battle of Tong Pass as well.","“You’re a universal deity. Are you really going to die here?” Zu An asked.","“This world is too special. Even though I have only descended with a sliver of my will, losing this part will still result in my main body becoming incomplete. I won’t be a match for the Annihilation Progenitor anymore. They’ll soon come knocking at my door. That’s likely going to be the case with Order as well,” Reproduction said.","“Why don’t you reveal Annihilation’s scheme and band together with other universal deities to deal with them?”","“That’s impossible. The relationships between universal deities can’t be fathomed by mortals.”","Zu An fell silent. Indeed, he couldn’t comprehend that, so he changed the topic and asked, “Is there anything I can do for you?”","He knew that the Deity of Reproduction wouldn’t visit him for no reason. He was already destined to become the Deity of Annihilation’s nemesis, so it would be beneficial for him to help the Deity of Reproduction if possible.","“I need you to help me pass down the Seed of Reproduction.”","“???”"]},{"number":2910,"title":"Chapter 2910: Chapter 2862: Cheating","paragraphs":["Zu An frantically waved his hand. “I don’t think I’m suited for it. Please find someone else.”","He didn’t want to become a reproductive organ. Just thinking about Li Zicheng’s horrifying final form and looking at the countless wombs around him was enough to induce goosebumps.","“It’s not what you’re thinking. The Seed of Reproduction is the rudimentary form of Reproduction’s authority. It’s similar to the Death authority you obtained. It doesn’t mean that you’ll be controlled by the authority. Ultimately, what it manifests as will depend on yourself,” the Deity of Reproduction spoke with a compelling voice that shook the soul.","Zu An wasn’t surprised that the Deity of Reproduction knew about Death’s authority, since he had offered tribute to the Deity of Reproduction in Death’s trial as well.","Sensing his hesitation, the Deity of Reproduction continued, “You’re on hostile terms with the Annihilation Progenitor, but with your current cultivation, you're far from a match for them. You should be grasping every bit of power you can lay your hands on. We’re both enemies of the Annihilation Progenitor. An enemy of an enemy is an ally.”","“You almost have me convinced, but I don’t want to be reduced to a reproductive organ,” Zu An replied bitterly. “Pardon me, but I don’t align with the dao of Reproduction. In my view, you’ve been cloning yourself without any restraint in pursuit of power. No matter how many worshipers you have, they''re merely underlings obeying a single mind. They're no different from the lowest ants in a colony.”","He didn’t want to take the Seed of Reproduction, so he spoke with increasing boldness. “The countless worker ants born from the queen ant exist only to serve the queen ant. If the queen ant dies, the entire colony dies with it. In essence, it's no different from the dao of Order. Order is merely a set of rules dictated by a supreme being to restrain its worshipers.”","The wombs stopped wriggling, and Reproduction fell silent. Zu An even wondered if they had left in a fit of anger.","Eventually, however, the Deity of Reproduction answered, “I finally understand why I stumbled here with Order. Unbeknownst to me, our paths converged.”","The wombs ‘looked’ at Zu An and asked, “What do you think Reproduction should be?”","Zu An gave the matter some thought before replying, “In my opinion, Reproduction symbolizes the birth of new lives. Reproduction is a continuation and a choice. It isn’t about the number. Be it grass growing in the wilderness or trees trimmed in a well-tended garden, all lives wield the potential to become anything.”","“If you do grasp Reproduction, when a famine happens, will you sacrifice the minority to save the majority?” the Deity of Reproduction asked.","Zu An frowned. He felt as if he had stumbled into a trial, but there was nothing he wanted from the Deity of Reproduction, so he honestly replied, “Your question conflates the concept of Reproduction with the issue of resource scarcity. You assume that power is used for selection and not creation.","“Even if you temporarily ‘saved’ the majority, it’d only lead them into a deeper calamity. The survivors would live in fear, and trust in society would crumble. The one grasping Reproduction would only be viewed as a tyrant who has little regard for life.”","The Deity of Reproduction harrumphed. “There’s no point speaking such beautiful words. How would you resolve the problem in actuality?”","Zu An replied, “I’d reconstruct life itself instead of dictating who survives. I’d greatly reduce humans’ metabolic requirements so they could hibernate and return after the famine passed. I’d also expend my divine power to bestow some simple lifeforms such as algae the power to reproduce quickly, so they could provide the energy required for humans to survive.","“Famine is both a crisis and a chance to evolve. As the saying goes, people live in crisis and die in contentment. Without woes, humans would slowly walk down the path of self-destruction. A famine is a trial for evolution.","“Most living beings have the power to adapt to their environment, so there’s no need for deities to interfere too much in their affairs. We should be equipping humans with the skills to survive, not blindly providing them with the resources they need.”","The Deity of Reproduction took in Zu An’s words and commented, “Your answer is too theoretical. I might have limited the scope of my question to humans, but what if you extend the boundaries to all living beings?”","“The weak capelins swim to the shore every year to lay eggs, and the process is fraught with danger. They face many predators, including whales, dolphins, sea lions, tunas, birds, and mammals. There are many ways they can die. Only a small handful survive the journey to the beach to lay their eggs. If not for their ability to mass reproduce, they would have gone extinct,\" Zu An answered.","“You mentioned earlier that it would be meaningless to focus on quantity instead of quality, but it’s the opposite here. The capelins’ ability to mass reproduce has not just sustained themselves, but also other higher-tier races.\" The Deity of Reproduction continued, “In my view, there’s nothing wrong with sacrificing a portion of the capelins to ensure the survival of other races.”","Zu An’s heart shuddered. As expected of a universal deity. There’s no way they would be that easily convinced by me. He didn’t want the Seed of Reproduction anyway, so he replied, “I was being too shallow. I have failed to see things from a higher angle. This shows that I’m not suited for the path of Reproduction. Please choose someone else.”","“No, I now think you’re more suited for the path of Reproduction,” the Deity of Reproduction said with a teasing voice.","Zu An was stunned. Huh, how did you come to this conclusion?","“Why?”","“I stand by my interpretation of Reproduction, and I have ensured the survival of countless life forms in the Myriad Worlds over the years. However, I think I have reached the end of my path. Your earlier words have sparked some thoughts in me. You might be able to pave a new path ahead.”","That heaped huge pressure on Zu An. He hurriedly replied, “Based on what I know, universal deities usually prepare a convoluted trial to test their successor. You can prepare a trial, and I’ll help you look for challengers. I’m sure you’ll find a more suitable successor than me.”","“ That was the trial.”","“...Ah? Isn’t that a bit too rash? Shouldn’t trials to obtain a universal deity’s legacy be fraught with dangers?”","“The Deity of Death was stupid. Why would they make their trial so difficult when the other universal deities were already ganging up on them? That only left room for other universal deities to tamper with their trial. In the end, they waited countless years before you finally came along. Even so, they still failed to pass down Death’s full legacy to you.”","Zu An was speechless. The Deity of Reproduction is surprisingly convincing.","He tried to put up one last struggle. “But I failed to give the correct answer to your question. That should count as failing the trial...”","The Deity of Reproduction interjected, “Who says you failed? Instead, I found your answer meaningful. I’ll consider it a pass.”","“That’s cheating! I was clearly talking bullshit earlier!”","“Even your bullshit satisfies me. That only goes to show that everything is fated. Now, accept my Seed of Reproduction.”","“...”"]},{"number":2911,"title":"Chapter 2911: Chapter 2863: Legacy","paragraphs":["Zu An was rendered speechless. Why is the Deity of Reproduction insisting on choosing me when I've already turned them down in every way possible?","But there was no way to resist a universal deity’s will, especially one who was already on the verge of death.","The countless wombs squirmed and squeezed out a ray of light, which manifested into a single seed imbued with iridescent colors. It felt divine.","The seed passed into Zu An’s body without him having to ingest it. He suddenly felt a burst of inspiration, as if he had experienced the birth of a universe and countless beings sprouting to life...","But as the seed fused with him, that inspiration swiftly faded.","“Take care of the Seed of Reproduction. I have processed it to temporarily conceal its powers lest the Annihilation Progenitor notices it and goes after you.” The Deity of Reproduction’s voice grew increasingly weaker, although it was uncertain whether that was because they were on the verge of death, or because they'd lost the Seed of Reproduction.","Zu An bowed. “Thank you for your generous gift.”","His only option now was to graciously express his gratitude, especially when the other party had made meticulous preparations for him.","“You can’t tap into most of the Seed of Reproduction’s powers for the time being, but it still retains two abilities. One, universal deities can no longer read your thoughts, so you don’t have to worry about exposing yourself. Two, it enhances your reproductive ability.”","Zu An was stunned. I get the former, but what’s the use of the latter?","He hurriedly asked, “Won’t it be more suspicious if universal deities fail to read my mind?”","“Don’t worry. The ability allows universal deities to pick up unimportant, miscellaneous information, but it obscures your truest thoughts. You won’t be discovered by the Annihilation Progenitor.”","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. With this ability, he wouldn’t feel as stressed dealing with universal deities anymore. “Thank you!”","“It’s fine if you choose not to walk down the path of Reproduction. When the time comes, you may simply pass down the Seed of Reproduction to another suitable candidate, although...” The Deity of Reproduction paused briefly before adding, “I honestly think you’re suited for this path. You have many lovers. Using your world’s terminology, you’re a stallion. You were naturally born with outstanding reproductive conditions. The more women you have, the more offspring they can bear for you. Isn’t that the heart of Reproduction?”","Zu An was speechless.","The Deity of Reproduction laughed. Then, they hummed a song that was incomprehensible to Zu An. The lyrics whispered the secrets and laws woven into the universe during its birth.","However, the song slowly softened until there was absolute silence. The countless wombs stopped wriggling, and they began withering rapidly. A breeze blew, and everything disintegrated along with the wind.","Only then did Zu An realize that a blood-red rain had started falling. It was as if the world was grieving.","So, this is the death of a universal deity...","Zu An reined in his emotions and returned to the military camp. There, he heard Zhao Xiaodie arguing with an Annihilation soldier. The Conqueror King seemed to have ordered everyone to root out the remnants of the Reproduction army. If the Annihilation soldiers discovered that Zu An wasn't in the camp, it would surely draw suspicion.","So, Zhao Xiaodie was using her identity as the Conqueror King’s daughter to stall them. But it looked like she was at her limit, as the Conqueror King had arrived in person.","“Where is he?” the Conqueror King asked.","Zhao Xiaodie shuddered under the Conqueror King’s glance. Why does his gaze feel so terrifying today? “He... I don’t know where he went.”","Her face paled right away. She had no idea why she'd subconsciously uttered the truth as if she had been compelled to do so.","“Oh?” The Conqueror King’s gaze turned sharp.","All of a sudden, he looked outward and saw Zu An carrying an unkempt Tang Tian’er over from the distance. He asked with a frown, “Where did you go?”","Zu An sheepishly replied, “I got excited and went to the forest over there...”","The soldiers gave understanding nods.","Zhao Xiaodie’s eyes reddened. Despite already knowing about their relationship, she still felt a twinge of envy hearing about it.","The Conqueror King stared at him for a long time before coldly remarking, “You’re married to Xiaodie now. Watch your attitude.”","“Yes,” Zu An hurriedly replied with an apologetic bow.","I wonder if the Annihilation Progenitor is still in his body.","As soon as that thought surfaced in his mind, he momentarily panicked as he remembered that universal deities could read minds, but he soon calmed down when he realized that the Seed of Reproduction protected him from the universal deities’ mind-reading ability.","The Conqueror King didn’t notice the drama happening in his mind. “Li Zicheng is dead, but some remnant Reproduction power has escaped. Search the area. Find the power, even if it means digging three feet underground!”","“Yes!” Zu An figured that the Seed of Reproduction must be very important to the Annihilation Progenitor, and that made him even more determined to not let the other party find it.","After the Conqueror King left, Zhao Xiaodie and Zu An went behind closed doors.","“That scared me! How did the two of you end up together?”","Tang Tian’er replied with a reddened face, “I went to look for big brother Zu while you were stalling them here. I bumped into him outside. He knew he needed a reasonable excuse for leaving the camp, so he carried me back like that.”","Zhao Xiaodie looked at the two of them with envy. “Did the two of you really do it?”","Zu An replied, “...What are you thinking? Of course not!”","Only then did Zhao Xiaodie feel slightly better. Hmph! That woman might have a sweet smile, but I got into the household first.","Tang Tian’er couldn’t be bothered to entertain Zhao Xiaodie, so she asked, “What happened to the Conqueror King? His aura feels much more frightening than before.”","“Stay away from him from now onward. Xiaodie, you should stay with me instead of at the Conqueror King’s manor as well.” Zu An didn’t tell the two ladies about the Annihilation Progenitor. That matter concerned a universal deity’s secret; it could bring unknown danger upon them.","“All right.” Zhao Xiaodie’s eyes lit up. She would stick to Zu An all day long if she had a choice.","For the next few days, the Annihilation army searched the area and found many Reproduction remnants, but none of them held what the Conqueror King wanted.","Months passed, but there was no progress. The Annihilation Progenitor could only give up for the time being, but they weren’t too bothered. They had already sealed this world, so there was nowhere for Reproduction’s power to escape. Once they assimilated this world, that power would still be theirs.","The Annihilation faction had the absolute upper hand in this world. The Reproduction faction had been destroyed, and the Order faction was barely holding on in Southern Ming. It wouldn’t take long before Annihilation completely vanquished Southern Ming.","Taiwan’s Zheng clan could hold on for a little longer, but it wouldn’t be able to resist the tides.","Once the Annihilation faction conquered the world, the Annihilation Progenitor would be able to assimilate this world.","For now, though, the Annihilation Progenitor had more important things to attend to, such as bringing death to the Deity of Reproduction and the Deity of Order, who had lost a huge chunk of their powers.","The Annihilation Progenitor’s departure brought great relief to Zu An. Perhaps he'd still be able to deal with the Conqueror King, but no plan could possibly work against a universal deity."]},{"number":2912,"title":"Chapter 2912: Chapter 2864: Show Hand","paragraphs":["After vanquishing Li Zicheng’s Reproduction faction, the Manchus continued to execute the Annihilation Progenitor’s will and marched on to invade Southern Ming.","The Order faction was in utter chaos. Their remaining leaders accused one another of colluding with the enemy. On top of that, each had their own strategy and direction, and they refused to compromise on those grounds.","The First Elder had died. The Second Elder and the Sixth Elder had surrendered. The Fourth Elder had betrayed them. The Universal Conglomerate’s prestige was at an all-time low. No one was willing to follow the Conglomerate’s directive anymore. Isabella tried to rally the Order faction together, but it was a futile endeavor.","Under such circumstances, how could the Order faction withstand the Annihilation army’s invasion? The Conqueror King barely faced any resistance as he marched southward. He swiftly conquered Nanjing, thus signaling the end of Southern Ming.","Amid the chaos, Zu An snuck into Nanjing and saved Isabella.","“Big brother Zu, you've saved me again.” Isabella looked conflicted.","Zu An frowned. “Bella, come to my side. I should be able to ensure your safety if you put on a disguise.”","“Big brother Zu, I want to be with you even in my dreams, but...” Isabella shook her head as tears brimmed in her eyes. “I worship Order. My uncles and my aunties have all died in the war against Annihilation. I can’t seek refuge with Annihilation.”","“You aren’t seeking refuge, but rather...”","Isabella interjected before Zu An could finish speaking, “Big brother Zu, I know what you mean, but I can't bear the thought of staying in the Annihilation faction. Even if it’s just a pretense.”","Zu An fell silent. Order and Annihilation were sworn enemies—this fact was imprinted deep in the souls of their worshipers. And Isabella was a stalwart worshiper of Order.","“What do you plan to do now?”","“I don’t know, but I’ll continue rallying Order’s remnants to fight against Annihilation.” Isabella’s eyes had momentarily glazed over, but they quickly hardened with determination.","“Order’s momentum has passed. There’s no point persisting.”","“Big brother Zu, some things have to be done even when we know they're impossible,” Isabella replied with a smile. “In the worst case, I’ll die for my beliefs if I fail.”","Zu An stared at Isabella in a daze. He couldn’t help but think that the innocent young miss of yesterday had grown up.","“Speaking of which, big brother Zu, I met big sister Chu a few days ago,” Isabella suddenly said.","Zu An was overjoyed to hear that. “Where is she? How is she faring?”","“Our intelligence was right. She’s with Taiwan’s Zheng clan. Her identity in this world is Zheng Zhilong’s daughter. We cooperated with them to fight against Annihilation, but who could have foreseen our faction would crumble so quickly?” Isabella said with a sigh. “We talked about you. She was initially shocked when she learned that you'd defected to the Annihilation faction, but she quickly concluded that you have your reasons for doing so. Big sister Chu truly loves you.”","Zu An’s heart warmed up. His previous investigations had also led him to conclude that Chu Chuyan was indeed in Taiwan, but having confirmed her safety, his mind could finally be put at ease.","“Big brother Zu, I was infuriated when I heard that you'd defected to the Annihilation faction, but I later realized that you must have your reasons. So, let’s all fight for our own ideals, shall we?” Isabella waved him farewell before flitting into the distance.","Zu An sighed as he returned to Nanjing City.","The Conqueror King had appointed him as the Grand Secretary and Governor-General for Military Affairs tasked with pacifying the Southern Regions. He was to be stationed in Nanjing to convince the Ming remnants to surrender.","On the one hand, Zu An had made great contributions to the Conqueror King by helping him deal with Dissonant Melody and Li Zicheng, so it wouldn’t do to not reward him. On the other hand, the Conqueror King remained guarded against Zu An, especially given the latter’s aptitude for military stratagems.","Putting Zu An in this position would distance him from the Annihilation army, preventing him from gaining greater influence from within. Ultimately, Zu An wasn’t a member of the Annihilation faction, after all!","Zu An was more than happy to avoid fighting with the Order faction. He spent his days calming down the people who surrendered, pacifying the Jiangnan area, and doing everything he could to ensure the safety of the populace and some Ming war heroes. He even paid a visit to Wu Sangui, who was also Second Elder Hermes, in the meantime.","“Why have you come?” Hermes asked. He'd harbored no goodwill for Zu An in the first place, and it didn’t help that Chen Yuanyuan appeared to be on close terms with the latter.","“I’m curious to know why you defected to the Annihilation faction.” Zu An recalled Isabella’s downcast expression, and that left him feeling incredibly displeased. If only her uncles were more reliable, the Order faction wouldn’t have crumbled like that.","“You should know better than anyone why I surrendered,” Hermes sneered. “You maneuvered for Chen Yuanyuan to fall into Li Zicheng’s hands. I would never have betrayed the Order faction otherwise.”","Zu An laughed. “That kind of ‘doing it for love’ rhetoric only works on the populace. Do you think it’ll fool me as well? You're the Universal Conglomerate’s Second Elder. Everyone knows you steer clear of women. You wouldn’t betray the Order faction over a woman in this world.”","“What are you getting at? You betrayed the Order faction, too.” Hermes’ expression turned cold.","“I am a Memory worshiper, not an Order worshiper. I joined the Annihilation faction to better record history.” Zu An was unfazed. “Let me guess. Is your old lover the legendary Deity of Love and Beauty?”","Hermes’ expression darkened. “I don’t know what you’re talking about!”","“I also don’t know what you’re up to. Chen Yuanyuan is a Love and Beauty worshiper, not the Deity of Love and Beauty. Someone like you wouldn’t misattribute your feelings to someone who just looks similar to her.” Zu An expressed his confusion.","While he was the one who designed the plan to fake Chen Yuanyuan’s capture by Li Zicheng, he hadn’t expected Hermes to defect to the Annihilation faction so easily. Something felt off.","“You’re ranting about conspiracies. If there’s nothing else, I shall be taking my leave. I still have Southern Ming remnants to deal with.” Hermes harrumphed as he flung his sleeves and left.","Zu An looked at the other party's departing silhouette contemplatively. He had some guesses in mind, but he didn’t have enough information to pinpoint Hermes’ motive.","It was a good thing Yu Yanluo was currently in the capital and was being cared for by the Little Fiend Empress and Jiang Luofu. On top of that, she had her special ability to fall back on, so it was unlikely danger would befall her.","The Conqueror King continued pressuring the Southern Ming remnants.","King Tang, Zhu Yujian, proclaimed himself the emperor in Fujian with Zheng Zhilong’s support.","King Lu, Zhu Yihai, served as Southern Ming’s regent from Zhejiang, Shaoxing. He maintained the defensive line against the Manchus from the Qiantang River.","But they were no match for the Annihilation army and were swiftly wiped out.","Seeing that Southern Ming’s defeat had become inevitable, the Conqueror King entrusted the job of cleaning up the battlefield to his generals and the other kings while he returned to the capital himself.","His prestige reached an all-time high, having accomplished the unparalleled feat of unifying the Central Plains under the Manchu banner. He was determined to inherit everything Dissonant Melody had, be it his title, his authority, or his women.","Zu An had already snuck back into the capital ahead of time, knowing that this day was going to come."]},{"number":2913,"title":"Chapter 2913: Chapter 2865: The Conqueror’s Path","paragraphs":["As soon as the Conqueror King returned to the capital, he accused Defiant Providence[1] of concealing the merits of his subordinates and appointing the younger brother of a sinner, subsequently throwing him in jail.","The Annihilation faction’s upper echelons knew that the Conqueror King was using his newfound power to suppress his rival, but the Conqueror King had recently vanquished Li Zicheng’s Reproduction faction and the Order faction’s Ming Dynasty.","On top of that, a while back, the Annihilation Progenitor had even descended into his body. Naturally, that prompted everyone to treat him as an Annihilation envoy. No one would dare to oppose him under such circumstances.","Defiant Providence had been cursing the Conqueror King in prison when he heard footsteps at the doorway.","He looked over and saw his consort, Tasina. Even though he was only a passer-by in this world, he had fallen in love with his wife in this world after the time they had spent together.","“Hooge, how are you?”","“I’m fine. I am my father’s oldest son. The Conque... Cough cough , Dorgon can’t kill me.” Defiant Providence knew better than to reveal their true identities to the indigenous populace of this world.","“You can’t be sure about that,” a cold voice echoed.","The Conqueror KIng walked into the prison as well.","Defiant Providence’s expression darkened, and his heart quivered in fright. “What do you mean by that?” Why did he suddenly appear in this prison? Does he really intend to kill me?","The Conqueror King walked up to Tasina and wrapped his arm around her waist. Then, he looked at Defiant Providence and taunted, “Tasina was worried about you and wanted to meet you, but someone who has committed a grievous sin can’t be allowed to meet anyone. So, she came to beg me. I was too kind to turn down a request from my grieving sister-in-law.”","Tasina shivered. She felt uncomfortable, but she dared not push the Conqueror King away. Instead, she tried to explain to Defiant Providence, “Hooge, I sought help from my big sister, and it was my big sister who told brother-in-law to help me.”","Tasina was sisters with Dorgon’s consort, so that made her Dorgon’s sister-in-law.","Defiant Providence’s eyes blazed with fury. “Why did you beg him? He was the one who put me in my predicament!”","The Conqueror King laughed. “Indeed, you’re getting what you deserve now. You should have never stood up against me. But I can still consider sparing your life.”","Tasina quickly got on her knees and pleaded, “Brother-in-law, please have mercy on Hooge.”","The Conqueror King’s lips curled upward. “Whether I spare him or not depends on your performance.”","Tasina’s body shuddered. Someone of her position naturally understood what the Conqueror King wanted. She bit her lips, and a while later, she finally nodded. “Alright!”","Defiant Providence was shocked and infuriated. He roared, “I don’t need you to save me. Let him kill me!”","Tasina smiled miserably. “You’re my husband. I need to do whatever I can to save you. There’s still hope as long as you’re alive.”","The Conqueror KIng laughed heartily. “You’re a sentimental one, aren’t you? Let’s begin now.”","Tasina’s face paled. “Here?”","She was prepared to offer herself to save her husband, but she'd assumed that it would be done in private. She hadn't thought it would be done in front of her husband.","The Conqueror King sneered, “What’s the point of doing it if not here? I can get any woman I want in the world. I only covet you for the thrill of conquering you.”","He was named the Conqueror King not because he had conquered many worlds, but because he enjoyed conquering his enemies’ women. That brought him immense satisfaction, and that was also what drove him further on his path.","Defiant Providence charged at the prison bars and glared at the Conqueror King so intently that it felt like blood might seep from his eyes. “You scum! You dare!”","“A weakling’s threat holds no meaning to me. It only excites me further. What are you going to do about it? Bite me?” The Conqueror King suddenly chuckled to himself. “Ah, you can get your wife to do it on your behalf.”","Defiant Providence was infuriated. He couldn’t care less anymore. Defiant notes began manifesting around him. He was determined to pull the Conqueror King down with him.","But the prison was specially forged. A formation swiftly activated, and countless light whips appeared out of thin air and struck his body, causing the music notes to shatter.","The Conqueror King’s expression turned cold. He raised his hand, and a massive hand manifested inside the prison cell, grabbed Defiant Providence’s neck, and lifted him into the air.","Tasina hurriedly grabbed the Conqueror King’s hand. “Brother-in-law, please spare his life!”","“I’ve already said that it depends on your performance,” the Conqueror King replied with a vile grin.","Tasina’s face paled even further. Looking at her suffocating husband, her eyes glistened with tears as she replied, “Alright.”","She kneeled before the Conqueror King and began loosening his belt.","Defiant Providence wanted to stop her, but the countless restrictions imposed on him prevented him from even speaking.","“Ahhh~” The Conqueror King exhaled deeply in pleasure. “Not bad. If your mouth was half as delicate as your wife’s, you would have never landed in this plight.”","Defiant Providence looked defeated, as if someone had siphoned away his soul. He closed his eyes in pain.","But the Conqueror King wasn’t planning on sparing him just like that. He pulled Defiant Providence up against the prison bars as he said, “Take a good look. This was all the result of your incompetence. You should never have gone up against me!”","Conquering wasn't just about making his enemies’ wives beg for mercy, but also about enjoying their useless howls of regret. It was all about crushing their will! Only then would his conquering power become more complete.","“You’ll die a terrible death!” Defiant Providence roared with anger in his eyes.","“Yes, that’s more like it. The more fired up you are, the more excited I am.” The Conqueror King laughed gleefully.","Tasina, who had been pushed against the prison bars, covered her face in shame. “My husband, please don’t look at me.”","The Conqueror King harrumphed. “Put down your hands and take a good look at your incompetent husband. He’s the one who landed you in your current plight. What do you have to be embarrassed about?”","Tasina thought about the Conqueror King’s condition and had no choice but to put down her hands.","Looking at his wife’s guilt-ridden and pained expression, Defiant Providence felt stabbing pain in his heart. He grabbed her hand and cried out, “It’s all my fault, Tasina...”","But Tasina shook her head and replied, “No, we were just unlucky.”","Seeing the couple pouring their hearts out, the Conqueror King smiled even more gleefully.","...","Some time later, the Conqueror King finally left the prison with a satisfied smile. This conquest had brought his strength to a greater height.","Before leaving, he didn’t forget to give the collapsed Tasina a hug and tell Defiant Providence, “Your wife has satisfied me tremendously. I’ll spare you for the time being.”","Defiant Providence sat in the corner, looking as if he had lost his energy, willpower, and spirit.","“You’re trash indeed.” The Conqueror King harrumphed, not wanting to look at his old enemy anymore.","...","Defiant Providence sat in a daze. The restrictions in the prison cell even prevented him from taking his own life.","All of a sudden, a figure appeared outside. “Don’t you want to exact vengeance?”","Those words brought a gleam back into Defiant Providence’s dead eyes.","1. Recap: He’s Dissonant Melody’s son, the crown prince who fought against the Conqueror KIng to take over Dissonant Melody’s position. ☜"]},{"number":2914,"title":"Chapter 2914: Chapter 2866: Madness","paragraphs":["“It’s you?” Defiant Providence exclaimed as he recognized the person.","“I can create an opportunity for you to exact vengeance.” Zu An looked at the pitiful man crouched in the corner of his cell. He had to admit that the Conqueror King was a perverted man.","Defiant Providence’s eyes quivered in agitation, but he quickly calmed down and sneered, “You’re merely the Conqueror King’s lackey. Is he using you as bait to lead me into making a mistake, so he can find a proper pretext to deal with me?”","Tasina had made a huge sacrifice to protect him. He couldn’t let her down.","Zu An could guess what he was thinking. He shook his head and said, “I'd never have expected the proud Defiant Providence to have become trash who survives by offering others his wife.”","“What did you say?!” Defiant Providence was enraged. He charged up to the prison bars, glaring at Zu An as if he would eat him alive.","You have successfully trolled Defiant Providence for +799... +799... +799...","Zu An nodded. “At least you’re still capable of anger. You haven’t completely fallen yet.”","Then, he reined in his smile and said, “If the Conqueror King truly intended to deal with you, he would have countless ways of doing so. Are you sure you can guard against all of them just by treading carefully?”","Defiant Providence fell silent. He’s right. Even if I avoid this ‘trap’, there may be countless more waiting for me.","“Will you content yourself with sacrificing your wife for a moment’s peace until the Conqueror King is done toying with you, or will you risk everything for a chance to avenge your wife?” Zu An spoke with an inexplicably compelling voice.","Defiant Providence narrowed his eyes. “How do you intend to do it?”","“I’ll create an opportunity for you,” Zu An spoke calmly as if he had it all under control.","Defiant Providence was silent for a moment before nodding. “Alright.”","Zu An left the prison and paid a visit to Oboi right after.","The Oboi in this world was also a high-ranking member of the Annihilation faction. He had supported Defiant Providence in his bid to inherit Dissonant Melody’s authority, but that gamble backfired when Defiant Providence failed to inherit the throne.[1]","Oboi was both surprised and vigilant when Zu An visited him, but he changed his attitude when Zu An revealed Defiant Providence’s token and revealed knowledge of their secret code.","When Oboi learned about their plan, he clenched his teeth and declared, “Count me in!”","He knew that at this rate, he would soon face the same plight as Defiant Providence. Once the Annihilation Progenitor chose the Conqueror King as his envoy, there would be no chance for him to rise to prominence anymore.","If they could deal with the Conqueror King before the Annihilation Progenitor’s next descent, it was unlikely that the Progenitor would punish all of them for the sake of a deceased individual.","Zu An also reached out to a powerful Manchu king named Jirgalang. The latter was an expert of the Annihilation faction, as well as one of the founding kings of Manchuria. He wielded great prestige and rallying power.","In the fight between the Conqueror King and Defiant Providence, Jirgalang hadn’t supported the Conqueror King; instead, he'd backed Dissonant Melody’s ninth son, Confounding Crossroads, who was also this world’s Shunzhi Emperor, Fulin. The Conqueror King might not have said anything then, but he already harbored a grudge against Jirgalang.","If you aren’t going to be on my side, Jirgalang, I should simply get rid of you.","Due to that, Zu An was able to quickly come to an agreement with Jirgalang. The latter had already learned about the Conqueror King’s intention to implicate him in Defiant Providence’s charges. Given that, he decided to make a gamble here.","In a secret chamber, Jirgalang said, “To deal with the Conqueror King, you’ll have to first deal with his aides, especially Dodo and Ajige. They are the Conqueror King’s blood-related brothers, and they wield military authority.”","Zu An replied, “Dodo is tied up in Southern Ming and won’t be returning any time soon. Ajige is a reckless man without wits. We can easily deal with him once we handle the Conqueror King.”","Jirgalang nodded, agreeing with his judgment. “Another target we need to be wary about is the captain of the imperial guards, Suksaha. He’s in charge of defending the imperial palace. If unrest happens, there’s a high chance he may hold the emperor and the empress hostage. He may frame us as rebels, and that’ll put us in a very bad position.”","“Oboi is the vice-captain of the imperial guards. He’ll be able to tie down Suksaha.”","“What about Leng Sengji? He’s the Commander of the Nine Gates, presiding over all troops in the capital. If he closes the Nine Gates, we’ll be trapped like turtles in a jar.”","“Who says we’ll make a move in the capital? It's now the Conqueror King’s turf; his influence runs deep here. Our odds of bringing him down here are too slim.”","“Where else do you intend to deal with him?”","“Outside the city.”","“He’s a vigilant man. He won’t leave the city easily,” Jirgalang said with a frown.","“I have a plan. You just need to make preparations.” Zu An didn’t reveal everything to Jirgalang.","“All right.” Killing intent brimmed in Jirgalang’s eyes, knowing that the only way for him to survive this ordeal was to kill the Conqueror King.","...","After taking Defiant Providence’s wife, the Conqueror King was feeling refreshed. He set his eyes next on the imperial palace, or more specifically, the cold, young empress dowager whom he had been interested in for a long time now.","He hadn’t been able to do anything about that thus far due to the massive influence wielded by Dissonant Melody and his sons, but now that his prestige was at an all-time high, nothing could stand in his way anymore.","Thinking about her identity as an Order envoy further stoked his desire to conquer her. His only regret was that Dissonant Melody had beaten him to it.","Hmph! Dissonant Melody is now dead. Everything is falling into place now. That fellow is of no use to me anymore. I should find an excuse to kill him someday.","Come to think about it, he has quite a few beautiful ladies following him.","The female spy who infiltrated Li Zicheng’s army has a sweet smile.","The woman named Zheng Dan exudes a dignified air. I heard she resembles the Ming court’s imperial sister-in-law.","How audacious. Does he think he’s worthy of such women?","Zhao Xiaodie isn't bad, either. She might be my daughter in name, but there’s no blood relation between us.","...","Thinking about those beautiful women made the Conqueror King’s heart pound in excitement. He felt that he had some potential in the path of Reproduction as well. He quickly made his way to the imperial palace’s inner court, where he found the cold empress dowager.","Her succulent thighs wrapped in black stockings were so enticing that the Conqueror King couldn’t hold himself back anymore. He was about to rush in when the other party stopped him.","“There are many people in the imperial palace. It wouldn’t be good if news were to spread.”","“The palace is now filled with my people. Who would dare to run their tongue?”","“Aren’t you on bad terms with the vice-captain of the imperial guards, Oboi? The little emperor is in the imperial palace as well. It won’t be good if he learns about it and a falling-out happens.”","The Conqueror King frowned. The other party was right. There was already pushback from others due to him taking Defiant Providence’s consort. If news about him offending the empress dowager were to spread, the others could work with the little emperor to create trouble for him.","“Empress dowager, do you think you can send me away just like that? As long as I can have you, I can shoulder the rumors.”","“No one in the world can oppose the Conqueror King now. I am merely saying that I don’t want to do it in the imperial palace. We can head outside the palace, where the little emperor isn’t around, and there are fewer eyes on us.”","The Conqueror King was overjoyed. Not only did he get to conquer the cold empress dowager right away, but he would even get to do it outdoors. This was something to look forward to. “Very well. Tomorrow morning, we shall set off to the Chengde Hunting Ground!”","1. Oboi was a highly influential official. He was famous for being a regent for the young Kangxi Emperor, and he grew so powerful that he nearly became another ‘Dorgon’. ☜"]},{"number":2915,"title":"Chapter 2915: Chapter 2867: The Sure Kill Ploy","paragraphs":["The following day, the Conqueror King led the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons to the hunting field north of the capital to hunt wild beasts.","The world now belonged to the Annihilation faction. All that was left was for the Annihilation Progenitor to descend and claim this world for his own. In the meantime, they were free to enjoy themselves.","The Conqueror King still brought the little emperor along as a cover, since it wouldn’t be appropriate for the empress dowager to leave the palace by herself.","After setting up camp, the Conqueror King could no longer hold himself back and rushed to the cold empress dowager’s tent. He even made sure to dismiss the guards ahead of time, so it would be more convenient for them to do the deed.","When he entered the tent and saw Jiang Luofu, he was enchanted. Her cold demeanor was irresistibly charming to him.","“You shouldn’t wear that, empress dowager. It’s such a waste of your figure. I brought ten other pairs of stockings for you. I want to see you try them on.” The Conqueror King grinned as he opened up the chest he carried with him.","“Conqueror King, I fear the consequences would be hard for us to bear if news about this were to spread.” Jiang Luofu frowned.","The Conqueror King sneered, “You complained that there were too many eyes in the imperial palace, so I brought you out to the grassland. I have dismissed all the guards and maids, but you continue to reject me. Are you making a fool of me right now?”","Jiang Luofu quietly replied, “I wouldn’t dare.”","“Hmph! Don’t forget your identity. Others might think that you’re the empress dowager, but you’re our hostage. I can make you the empress dowager, but I can also make you a lowly slave.” The Conqueror King’s eyes gleamed menacingly. He tossed a pair of stockings at Jiang Luofu. “Strip!”","Seeing Jiang Luofu’s humiliated and tearful expression, even as she didn't dare to disobey him, the Conqueror King felt something click in his mind. There was nothing that excited him more than someone having to smile for him despite being reluctant to.","Unable to take it anymore, he rushed forward. “I’ll put it on for you. Your legs are truly a work of art. Hahaha~”","In truth, the Conqueror King was holding a palace maid’s legs, roughly playing with them.","The Little Fiend Empress’ ability was incredible, but an expert of the Conqueror King’s caliber could see through it if the target he was venting at was merely a blanket. So, she'd picked out an aide among the palace maids and trained her to be a substitute for Jiang Luofu.","The Little Fiend Empress gently patted Jiang Luofu’s hand, consoling her. “Let’s leave this place first and follow the plan.”","Meanwhile, the Conqueror King was in bliss. He played with the Order divine maiden’s beautiful legs while pinning her down and making her moan. Her pleading eyes and cries of mercy were the perfect tonic to his dao of conquest.","But there was one step left—making the Order divine maiden bear his child. The Annihilation Progenitor would surely approve of his actions.","It also helped that Jiang Luofu was Dissonant Melody’s widow. He had suffered so much under Dissonant Melody’s suppression over the years. It was only now that he had the chance to turn the tables around and become the master instead.","All these factors made him howl in delight. He erupted in manic bliss.","Just then, however, he felt the things he had shot out re-entering his body. It was such a ridiculous sensation that it left him stumped for half a second.","Defiant Providence was an entity who wielded the power to distort fate and prophecies. Anything he tampered with would go in the opposite direction, including acts of pleasure.","Exploiting the Conqueror King’s momentary daze, Defiant Providence charged in and unleashed a devastating move.","The Conqueror King was no pushover, however. In this critical moment, he snapped out of his daze and wrapped his body in a golden light, activating his Invincible Military Domain.","But Defiant Providence hadn’t come this far just to back down. After what the latter had done to Tasina in the prison cell, his hatred for the Conqueror King had already hit its peak.","He did have feelings for Tasina, but considering he was an outsider to this world, they weren't that deeply tied together. What maddened him more was the significance behind the Conqueror King’s actions. The latter hadn't just raped Tasina, but trampled over his spirit and dao.","On top of that, the Conqueror King had stolen the authority that ought to belong to him. Such a grudge could only be repaid in blood.","Instead of dodging the Conqueror King’s attack, he charged in fanatically to attack instead. He intended for the two of them to go down together.","Defiant Providence was able to compete with the Conqueror King over the envoy authority not just because he was Dissonant Melody’s oldest son, but because he wasn't that much weaker than the Conqueror King in the first place.","Furthermore, the Conqueror King had been caught off guard. He was in a relaxed state after having just blown his load, and the bizarre feeling induced from reversing his eruption had left him discombobulated. This surprise element equalized the difference in their strengths.","The Conqueror King’s aides had been talking about his conquest of the empress dowager when they sensed a terrifying aura coming from the empress dowager’s tent and widened their eyes. They realized that something must have happened.","Suksaha immediately gathered his men to investigate the situation, but Oboi and his subordinates quickly stepped right in to stop them. “Who could hurt the Conqueror King, given his capabilities? He’s merely playing around with the empress dowager.”","The expressions of Suksaha and the others darkened. No one would cause such a huge disturbance just for fun.","But Oboi and his men had come prepared. Suksaha and his men couldn’t circumvent them. They could only console themselves with the thought that the Conqueror King was just having fun. Earlier, the latter had strictly ordered them not to head over no matter what they heard.","After all, it was true that the Conqueror King was too strong for anyone to harm him.","Meanwhile, the Conqueror King’s other aides were stopped by Jirgalang. “This is an internal affair of the imperial family. Let them handle it within. Otherwise, if you see an unkempt empress dowager asking for help, are you going to help her or not? It won’t sound good no matter what you do.”","...","Such words stopped the Conqueror King’s aides.","Meanwhile, the battle ended. Such surprise assaults usually didn’t drag out for too long. The assaulter would either finish the battle in a single move, or have the tables turned on him and be killed instead.","Defiant Providence, fueled by his hatred and overwhelming killing intent, had made thorough preparations, but the Conqueror King had conquered too many places and important figures in the meantime, causing him to enjoy a huge spike in his fighting prowess.","Ultimately, Defiant Providence had underestimated his enemy. Despite his desperate fighting style, he failed to cleanse his honor and avenge his wife. He breathed his last in indignation.","But the Conqueror King didn’t fare well, either. The surprise assault had inflicted significant injuries on him. He eyed the destruction caused to the surroundings and the deceased palace maid, as well as Jiang Luofu standing in the distance.","The truth immediately became evident to him. He roared, “You bitch! You planned this scheme!”","The Conqueror King rushed forward to grab Jiang Luofu’s hand, enveloping her with his terrifying aura.","Suddenly, he felt a sharp pain in his palm. He quickly released his hand and inspected it. There was a tinge of black blood on his palm.","At the same time, the Jiang Luofu before him transformed into Zu An, who was holding the Poisonous Prick in his grasp.","“Death energy...” The Conqueror King panicked. He finally understood how Dissonant Melody had died so quietly. Zu An was indeed behind it.","“Y-You...” He wanted to reveal Zu An’s scheme to the other members of the Annihilation faction, but by then, death energy had already suffused his body. It stole his final sliver of life, and his large body collapsed to the ground.","—","Translator Note:","This is similar to how Dorgon died in real life.","He went on a hunt and got a cut. They applied some ointment without calling for a physician, but the cut became infected and eventually claimed his life."]},{"number":2916,"title":"Chapter 2916: Chapter 2868: Like Yesterday","paragraphs":["Zu An had a good grasp of the Conqueror King’s strength. Even if the latter was at a disadvantage, there was a chance that Defiant Providence wouldn’t have been able to kill him. He'd thus needed a backup plan in case Defiant Providence failed.","So, he'd transformed into Jiang Luofu via Myriad Transformations, and when the Conqueror King let his guard down after killing Defiant Providence, the Poisonous Prick claimed his life.","Obtaining Death’s authority had greatly strengthened the prowess of the Poisonous Prick. Even envoys of universal deities couldn’t resist its powerful death energy.","Zu An siphoned away the Conqueror King’s immense strength, causing his experience bar to surge ahead. Ahh~ Devouring the cultivation of others feels as marvelous as ever!","That thought horrified Zu An. No wonder people call skills like the Essence-Sucking Skill demonic skills. They can easily affect a person’s temperament.","He quickly purged all miscellaneous thoughts and proceeded to clean up the battlefield and the Conqueror King’s corpse.","To be honest, Zu An could have probably slain the Conqueror King with the help of Jiang Luofu and the Little Fiend Empress without reaching out to Defiant Providence. However, he hadn’t wanted the two women to take the risk, and he had to consider the aftermath.","In history, Dorgon had accrued many ailments from fighting on the battlefield. During a hunting trip, he'd fallen off a horse and died.","But the Conqueror King was a top-notch expert of the Myriad Worlds, so how could he die from falling off a horse? Without a strong justification, the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons would thoroughly investigate the matter, and they would have been put in danger.","Fortunately, the Conqueror King had courted his own death.","A few days ago, he'd gone to the prison to humiliate Defiant Providence and Tasina. He'd even gone around bragging about his exploit, so everyone in the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons knew about the matter. That laid the groundwork for Defiant Providence’s desperate vengeance here.","And indeed, when other members of the Annihilation faction finally arrived and learned about the ‘events’ that had transpired here, they didn’t doubt a thing at all.","Even the Conqueror King’s aides were only doubtful about how Defiant Providence had escaped from the prison cell. They didn’t suspect another person of being the murderer.","A purge followed soon after.","Zu An worked with Jirgalang and Oboi to suppress Suksaha’s troops.","The little emperor, Confounding Crossroads, cooperated with them, having grown tired of the Conqueror King’s arrogance. He understood that he was a puppet, and it was only a matter of time before he would need to steal power for himself.","Now that his biggest threat had been eliminated, he could finally step onto the forefront. Naturally, he was enthused. He even promoted Jirgalang, Oboi, and Zu An.","The group transported the Conqueror King’s corpse back to the capital.","Ajige, an aide whom the Conqueror King had left to guard the capital, stepped forward to receive the Conqueror King’s casket. He had briefly considered using this chance to kill off Jirgalang, Oboi, and the others to regain control over the little emperor.","However, after learning about the Conqueror King’s death, the supporters of their group had scattered. It also didn’t help that Ajige was a tyrannical person and had never been popular, so he failed to rally the remaining members of the group together.","After some fighting, Ajige was captured.","Zu An thought it was a pity, since he couldn’t absorb Ajige’s cultivation in front of so many Annihilation’s upper echelons.","Nevertheless, the Conqueror King’s death came as a relief to not just him, Jiang Luofu, and the others, but the upper echelons of the Annihilation faction as well. A joyous atmosphere suffused the capital.","The little emperor even hosted a banquet in the imperial palace under the pretext of celebrating his son’s birth, but everyone knew that he was celebrating the Conqueror King’s death. It also doubled as an opportunity to pull the other upper echelons of the Annihilation faction over to his side.","Zu An might have contributed greatly to the Conqueror King’s death, but he wasn’t an Annihilation worshiper in the end. The rewards he received paled in comparison to what Jirgalang and Oboi were bestowed.","But he didn’t mind it. Instead, he found a chance to slip into the forbidden palace.","Jiang Luofu had been on tenterhooks in recent years. First Dissonant Melody, then the Conqueror King. Trouble had kept knocking one after another, refusing to grant her any peace.","She hadn’t expected Zu An to quietly eliminate two powerhouses just like that. The other women were right. This man is a miracle-maker.","“Ah Zu, what do we do next?” They might have caught a breather, but the path ahead of them remained dark.","The Annihilation faction still wielded the absolute advantage in this world. The Reproduction faction had been wiped out, and the Order faction was barely holding on. No one could stop the Annihilation faction from conquering the world.","And once they did so, the Annihilation Progenitor would be able to assimilate this world and obtain a tremendous amount of power. All of them, including Chu Chuyan, Isabella, and the others, would die.","“Let’s celebrate this victory for now and not think about the troubles ahead. Worst case, we’ll just defect to Annihilation,” Zu An replied with a smile. He used intoxication as an excuse to kiss Jiang Luofu’s cheek, ear, and neck.","“Stop messing around...” Jiang Luofu read between the lines. She understood that many things couldn’t be spoken aloud. It might only be a private conversation between them, but there were no secrets before the universal deities.","The most important thing was that she trusted this man, so she didn’t probe further.","The Little Fiend Empress rolled her eyes. Are these two treating me like I’m non-existent?","Not wanting to be a third wheel, the Little Fiend Empress went out to keep watch for them. They were currently in the imperial palace, the heart of the Annihilation faction.","Jiang Luofu understood that as well, so she hammered Zu An’s chest awkwardly. “The Little Fiend Empress will be making fun of me for this.”","Zu An was unbothered. “Principal Jiang, when did you become so shy?”","That address brought Jiang Luofu back to her time in Brightmoon City. She put on a stern expression and said, “I’d never have let you through the academy’s doors if I had known you were such a brazen student.”","“That feels more like you.” Zu An looked at the woman before him. “Those empress dowager clothes look awful on you. Come, change into this.”","He reached into the Brilliant Glass Bead and took out an office lady's outfit... and, naturally, a classic pair of black stockings.","Jiang Luofu had the most peculiar look on her face. “You’re on beat with the Conqueror King.”","“I see we have a common sense of aesthetics.” Zu An burst into laughter. “I got these from Dreamland. It’s definitely better than the outfit you found inside the dungeon back then.”","Jiang Luofu’s face reddened.","She had obtained similar clothes from a dungeon in the Cultivation World, and she had been extremely fond of them. When she ventured into the Myriad Worlds, she learned that they were professional attire in technological civilizations, and that they carried certain connotations. Since then, she had started dressing more conservatively.","That said, she still preferred that style of dress. Since she was dressing up for her lover, there was no need for her to hide.","“Turn around.”","“I’ll put it on for you.”","“Pui.”","In the end, Zu An had to turn around. He heard a series of movements behind him. “Are you done yet?”","A leg gently kicked his body. He turned around, and his breathing quickened.","The clothes automatically tightened to be a perfect fit. There were no unnecessary crinkles, and the subtle tightening around the waist shaped out Jiang Luofu's jaw-dropping curves. Her white silk shirt was buttoned to her collarbone, and she exuded an air of nobility. Yet that only tempted one to sully her.","But what was more eye-catching were her slender legs. The smooth, shimmering texture of the black stockings that covered her from toes to thighs was simply too alluring. The domain between the stockings and her skirt left much to the imagination.","Her long hair was tied neatly behind her, leaving only a few strands to hang by her ears. They added a touch of coyness to her cold demeanor.","She even wore a pair of delicate glasses. She looked at him with a proud, teasing voice, saying, “Student Zu, what mischief are you up to this time?”"]},{"number":2917,"title":"Chapter 2917: Chapter 2869: Nine Tribulations","paragraphs":["Some time later, Zu An rushed back to the banquet. He couldn’t leave for too long, lest the other upper echelons of the Annihilation faction notice something.","The Little Fiend Empress returned to the room. Taking in the scent and looking at Jiang Luofu, who was lying exhausted on the bed, she muttered enviously, “You must have had an intense battle.”","Jiang Luofu finally recovered some of her senses and tried her best to cover herself with the blanket.","But the Little Fiend Empress was even faster. She kicked away the blanket and looked at Jiang Luofu’s tattered stockings. “You aren’t taking them off even when they're tattered to this extent?”","At this point, Jiang Luofu was already blushing furiously. “He wouldn’t let me take them off. He said he felt more excited that way.”","The Little Fiend Empress said, “...That fellow is a pervert.”","She casually reached into the blanket and lightly pinched Jiang Luofu. “Even I’m tempted to touch these thighs of yours, let alone that fellow...”","Then, the Little Fiend Empress’ expression abruptly stiffened. She retracted her hand and awkwardly wiped it on the blanket. How is there so much of it?","Even though the two of them had become as close as sisters after the time they'd spent together, Jiang Luofu still felt so embarrassed that she wanted to find a hole to hide in.","...","In the following days, the little emperor took charge of the imperial court and began clipping the Conqueror King’s wings.","Zu An was one of the Conqueror King’s aides, but he had made huge contributions to the Annihilation faction. That put the little emperor in a tough spot. If only Zu An were an Annihilation worshiper, he could have entrusted great responsibilities to the latter.","Ultimately, it was hard to trust an outsider who had surrendered to them.","Zu An also understood the position he was in, so he requested to be dispatched to the south to aid Dodo in curbing Southern Ming.","The little emperor approved the dispatch.","Dodo was one of Dorgon’s closest allies. Now that Dorgon was dead and Ajige had been captured, there was no saying what Dodo could try if left alone.","Thus far, Southern Ming hadn’t had any rulers who lasted long.","Isabella threw her support behind King Gui, Zhu Youlang, and proclaimed him as the Yongli Emperor in Zhaoqing. At the same time, they reached out to Zhang Xianzhong’s supporters.","Zhang Xianzhong and his army were also peasants who had risen against Great Ming back then, but they were being suppressed by the Manchus to the point where they struggled to catch a breather. Naturally, it made sense for them to join forces.","But Dodo’s military force was too strong. It was only a matter of time before Southern Ming collapsed.","Zu An secretly reached out to Isabella and schemed with her to lure Dodo’s army into an encirclement, where he would be ambushed.","Dodo was strong, but there was little he could do when both the Annihilation faction and the enemy faction wanted him dead. In the end, he was defeated and died in battle.","While the armies cleaned the battlefield, Isabella and Zu An took a stroll in the forest.","“Big brother Zu, I didn’t misjudge you. Thank you for doing us this huge favor.” Isabella looked at Zu An with tender eyes.","Zu An couldn’t help but notice that Isabella looked a little frail. He wiped off the dirt on her face and said, “Bella, it's been tough on you.”","“It’s my mission,” Isabella replied with a smile. She looked at him with expectant eyes. “Big brother Zu, you’re still closer to our side. Why don’t you come back and help us? If we join forces and get help from big sister Chu in Taiwan, we might just be able to turn the tables.”","“Do you think it’s possible?” Zu An sighed. He couldn’t tell her about the Deity of Order and the Deity of Reproduction’s demise, or else it would plunge her deeper into despair.","Isabella fell silent. Deep down, she knew that the best they could do under the current circumstances was to survive. A moment later, she revealed a carefree smile and replied, “My answer is the same as ever. This is something I have to do even if it’s impossible.”","Zu An was awed. She’s different from before. He said worriedly, “Bella, I won’t ask you to turn your back against your faith, but if you find yourself cornered, you have to prioritize your safety and make sure to survive.”","Isabella shook her head miserably. “If that day comes, it’ll be the end of the Order faction. My uncles and my friends are all dead. What reason do I have to continue living?”","“There’ll be hope as long as you live.” Zu An paused. “Anyway, you can’t die earlier than me.”","Isabella thought about the miracles Zu An had produced to date. Her eyes wavered. She wanted to ask more, but Zu An pressed his finger on her lips and said, “Promise me!”","A moment of silence lingered before Isabella nodded. “Alright.”","Zu An remained worried. He took out a nun's robe, a horsetail whisk, prayer beads, and a certification of nunhood. “If chaos strikes, given your identity and your looks, it’ll be tough for you to get away. You’ll have to disguise yourself.”","Impersonating priests and monks was forbidden in this world. One needed to receive proper certifications before they were allowed to enter cities and clear checkpoints.","Isabella looked at the certification of nunhood and saw the Dharma name ‘Nine Tribulations’[1]. She smiled. “This name fits the experiences I have been through.”","She had been through too many tribulations recently. She truly wanted to cry, but she couldn’t.","...","As the Yongli Emperor and Isabella’s reputation grew, they reclaimed quite a few provinces.","The Qing imperial court had sent Zu An to aid Dodo in conquering Southern Ming, but Zu An kept going easy on the enemy, hampering their efforts. So, the imperial court stripped him of his position. The little emperor’s main goal of sending him there had been to eliminate Dodo anyway.","Taking his place was Second Elder Hermes. The Annihilation faction wanted to use this chance to test his loyalty, as well as to thin the remaining forces of Order.","Zu An thought that given the fact that he had been forced to surrender back then, Hermes would go easy on Southern Ming.","But Hermes dished out a heavy blow right from the get-go. He exploited his insider knowledge about the Order faction to unravel them from within. He turned Zhang Xianzhong’s two generals, Sun Kewang and Li Dingguo, against each other, and Sun Kewang eventually led his men to defect to Hermes.","That greatly weakened the Yongli Emperor’s momentum.","Hermes struck while the iron was hot and continued attacking Southern Ming.","Zu An was perplexed. Unlike Sixth Elder Naraka, Hermes hadn’t defected to the Annihilation faction right from the start. There was no reason for him to fight so hard for Annihilation.","However, his attention was quickly drawn elsewhere. The little emperor, Confounding Crossroads, had just welcomed an imperial child.","They might be visitors to this world, but they still needed to obey the laws of this world. Most people didn’t know the truth about their identities, after all. The emperor had to ensure that the imperial harem flourished with offspring, or else the nation would be destabilized.","The birth of the imperial child brought forth a huge celebration.","But something happened shortly after. Smallpox struck the capital, taking away countless lives.","This was unlike the smallpox Zu An knew about in his previous life. It came from an artifact that the Conqueror King had used when conquering other worlds. Even experts from the Myriad Worlds wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","Confounding Crossroads was shocked and infuriated. He hadn’t expected the Conqueror King to cause trouble even after his death!","He quickly took countermeasures against the plague while dispatching his men to investigate its origin. Unfortunately, the smallpox soon spread to the imperial palace, and even the imperial child was afflicted by it.","This plunged the Annihilation faction into chaos. They might have conquered the world, but sustaining the imperial bloodline was of utmost importance as well, or else it could disrupt the Annihilation Progenitor’s plans. If so, they wouldn’t be able to make up for their mistakes even if they died a hundred times over!","1. Nine Tribulations (Jiu Nan, or Ah Jiu) is a character in Jin Yong’s work, ‘Deer and the Cauldron’, that is modeled over Princess Changping, aka the character played by Isabella in this world. ☜"]},{"number":2918,"title":"Chapter 2918: Chapter 2870: Turning the Tables","paragraphs":["Despite the many experts in the Annihilation faction, none had the power to deal with the Conqueror King’s artifact. It wasn't without reason that the Conqueror King had conquered many worlds through it. Three days later, the imperial child passed away.","Confounding Crossroads was anguished. This was the child born to his most doted-on Consort Donggo. Only before this beautiful and gentle woman did he feel like a great man. She really admired him as if he were her heaven.","He had already made up his mind to let Consort Donggo’s child inherit his throne in the future. Little had he expected their child to pass away shortly after birth.","Curse that Conqueror King! He continues to be a thorn in my flesh even after he’s dead!","Since they hadn’t identified the source of the plague, an official proposed bringing the other prince out of the capital to seek refuge in an imperial manor. There were fewer people in the imperial manor, so the odds of catching the plague were much lower.","Confounding Crossroads agreed. The other prince was born from a consort he didn’t favor anyway. He'd been so angry at being bullied by the Conqueror King that he had too much to drink and vented on a random consort in the imperial palace. He hadn’t expected the consort to get pregnant just like that.","If not for this incident, he might not have remembered that he had this son.","Since I’m not fond of this son anyway, I might as well send him out of the palace.","So, that prince was escorted out of the imperial palace by a nanny and several palace maids.","Confounding Crossroads spent the following days consoling Consort Donggo while furiously ordering his men to investigate how the Conqueror King’s artifact had ended up outside, and who was behind the plague.","The experts of the Annihilation faction had been through storms. While the plague was terrifying, they knew about methods to control it. It took them a few years, but they finally resolved the plague.","Many people died in the meantime, including several higher-ups in the imperial palace, but on the whole, it was within an acceptable margin. The only regret was that even though they had retrieved the Conqueror King’s artifact, they failed to uncover the culprit behind this catastrophe.","The blame was eventually attributed to the Conqueror King’s remnants. Since the Conqueror King was dead, and his remnants had been thoroughly purged, this incident was left unresolved.","Putting aside the plague, the Annihilation faction was faring well on other fronts.","Wu Sangui was very successful in pushing back the Yongli Emperor’s forces, and at this rate, it wouldn’t take long for him to quell Southern Ming.","The other remnants of the Order faction in Jiangnan were also shrinking. The Zheng clan’s territories on the continent had shrunk to just Xiamen and a few cities in the vicinity.","One day, Confounding Crossroads suddenly decided to personally join the battlefield. This wasn’t decided on a whim; it was a carefully-considered decision.","Despite being the ultimate victor in the battle against the Conqueror King, in recent years, he noticed a horrifying trend—the power vacuum was being filled up.","Jirgalang, Oboi, and even Suksaha, who had aided them in purging the Conqueror King’s remnant powers, were beginning to wield significant influence.","Confounding Crossroads felt suffocated. He was worried that another Conqueror King would rise to power, reducing him to a puppet yet again. Ultimately, he was still much too young and lacked prestige within the Annihilation faction. Among his brothers, many were more qualified than him.","He'd only become the emperor because the Conqueror King and Defiant Providence wanted to put the weakest person on the throne so that they could control him.","If the Annihilation Progenitor descended upon the world and saw how weak he was, they wouldn’t choose him to be their next envoy. Thus, he needed to accrue some accomplishments, and the best way to do so was in battle.","As much as he hated the Conqueror King, he had to agree with the latter’s philosophy. The more one conquered, the stronger one became. The Annihilation faction respected experts who achieved things on the battlefield.","Of course, there were also risks involved when the emperor personally joined the battlefield. Should the battle end in a defeat, the emperor risked losing all his prestige. That was also the reason he had only chosen to join the battlefield now.","The Order faction was on the verge of being wiped out. The Zheng clan, after suffering a series of defeats, only had a few cities left on the continent. They no longer had the power to resist the Manchu army.","In other words, this was a low-risk opportunity to accomplish a huge merit. More importantly, Confounding Crossroads could win over the lower-ranking and middle-ranking military officials during the war, and he could use this base to create his own following.","Once he built up his own aides, the other powerful officials would no longer be able to treat him as a puppet.","Many in the imperial court were opposed to him joining the front lines, but Confounding Crossroads had already made up his mind. He pushed his decision through.","For insurance, he brought the Upper Three Banners Imperial Guards along with him. The Upper Three Banners were the strongest armies of the Eight Banners, and they were usually under the emperor’s direct control.","Confounding Crossroads knew that he didn’t wield true control of the Upper Three Banners yet. Most of its generals were more loyal to the Conqueror King or other powerful officials. His goal for participating in this war was to truly establish control over this power.","The Bordered Yellow Banner’s commander, Tasu, first led the Manchu cavalrymen to Quanzhou, where they prepared to travel via sea to attack Xiamen’s north.","The Plain White Banner’s commander, Laita, and the Guangdong Manchu army would make their way to Chaozhou, where they would work with Tongan’s navy to attack Xiamen’s south.","Confounding Crossroads and the Plain Yellow Banner’s commander, Namusange, would lead the main naval force. With their superior military might, they would lead a frontal assault.","Faced with this overwhelming assault, the Zheng clan panicked, and internal strife broke out.","The Zheng clan was currently under Zheng Chenggong’s leadership, but many of his subordinates were pushing him to avoid a confrontation with the Manchus for the time being and hold their base in Taiwan instead.","Zheng Chenggong was put in a tough spot. He decided to seek his little sister’s opinion.","His little sister’s beauty and incredible abillity had left a mark not just within the Zheng clan but on the enemies as well. Those within the Zheng clan called her the Glacier Mountain Goddess, whereas the Annihilation faction called her the Glacier Mountain Demoness.","So, Zheng Chenggong approached a beautiful woman dressed in an icy-blue dress and consulted her on the issue.","“There is no way we can guard Xiamen. Retreating would have been a wise decision. However, the Qing emperor is personally joining the front lines, making this a rare opportunity for us. If we can assassinate him in the battle, it’ll surely shake the Qing dynasty to its core.”","The woman in the blue dress was Chu Chuyan. After years of bloodshed, her disposition had gotten much colder.","Zheng Chenggong replied with a bitter smile, “I know, but the enemy is too strong. We don’t have enough troops on our side. Even avoiding a rout is a tall order, let alone assassinating that dog emperor.”","They could have the advantage in a naval battle, but the enemy had far more ships than them.","“I have my ways,” Chu Chuyan replied confidently.","Zheng Chenggong was surprised, but he chose to trust his little sister. “All right.”","As soon as Zheng Chenggong left, Chu Chuyan dropped her glacier mountain expression and ran behind the screen to tightly embrace the man behind it. “Ah Zu, you’re finally here!”","Zu An also tightly embraced the delicate, trembling body in his arms. Indeed, they had been in this world for many years now, and despite knowing about each other’s existence, this was their first time meeting.","They exchanged a passionate kiss. Their yearning and adoration for each other were so great that they wanted to melt into each other’s bodies.","That night, the Glacier Mountain Goddess melted.","...","The tides suddenly changed. The seawater receded without warning, leaving the bigger Manchu ships stranded on the shallow coast. That turned them into living targets for the Zheng clan’s smaller ships.","“How is this possible? Why did the seawater suddenly recede at this moment?” Confounding Crossroads roared furiously.","There was no way the Annihilation faction, with so many experts on their sides, would make such an elementary mistake. They had already calculated this world’s tides beforehand, so such an anomaly shouldn’t have happened.","It didn’t take long for the Annihilation faction to realize what was going on.","“The enemy has a powerful water element user!”"]},{"number":2919,"title":"Chapter 2919: Chapter 2871: The Glacier Mountain Demoness","paragraphs":["There were also experts who specialized in water control in the Annihilation faction. It didn’t take long for water skills to be invoked as these experts attempted to control the sea.","The next moment, a furious wave crashed down on their ship, dragging the water control experts from the deck into the sea. Terror filled their expressions as they anxiously tried to return to the ship.","Water control experts like them should have felt comfortable in the water as if returning home, but their faces showed no composure, only shock and fear. It was as if there was a monster in the water dragging them down.","This baffled everyone in the Annihilation faction.","A hint of cold ran down their spines as they realized that the enemy had a water control expert who far surpassed theirs. But this didn’t make sense. Even if the Zheng clan specialized in naval warfare, they shouldn’t have had experts who could overpower them like that.","Confounding Crossroads rushed to the ship’s bow to supervise the battle. As Dissonant Melody’s son, he was neither lacking in power nor courage. He calmly issued orders to his troops, and his presence significantly boosted their morale.","The soldiers shook off their earlier fluster and quickly returned to their formation to fight back the Zheng clan’s navy. Soon, they inflicted considerable damage upon the Zheng clan.","After all, the Annihilation faction had the overwhelming advantage right now.","The Zheng clan’s navy fled. That prompted many Annihilation soldiers to raise their hands and cheer loudly while praising Confounding Crossroads’ valiance.","Confounding Crossroads smiled. This battle would greatly raise his prestige, and now that he had been through a life-and-death situation with the soldiers, perhaps he'd be able to win over some aides and promote them into powerful positions as a counterweight to those powerful officials.","The Plain Yellow Banner’s commander, Namusange, had been standing guard near Confounding Crossroads to ensure his safety when his eyes suddenly narrowed. He murmured in confusion, “Why is that mountain over there so tall?”","Confounding Crossroads looked over and saw a towering mountain that pierced the clouds. He, too, muttered in incomprehension, “Isn’t it a sea over there? Why is there a mountain?”","It was his first time here as well, so he wondered if there was some kind of divine mountain in the sea.","Namusange’s face suddenly paled. He roared, “That isn’t a mountain, but a tsunami!”","His shout made everyone’s hearts turn cold. They finally understood why the tides had receded earlier. It turned out that all the seawater had gone to the tsunami!","Several Annihilation experts stood forward. These individuals were strong enough to unravel even a towering tsunami. They channeled their ice element skills and unleashed storms at the wave. Even the sky began to snow under their sheer prowess.","When the snow touched the Annihilation soldiers, the weaker ones swiftly froze into ice sculptures. However, no one uttered a complaint; if anything, they were thrilled. The ice had to be cold enough for them to seal off the tsunami. Otherwise, all of them would die once it crashed down on them.","Under the raging snowstorm, the tsunami began to solidify into ice with creaking sounds. Meanwhile, the entire sea region was encased in ice. Even the tsunami had solidified in place as a massive ice wall.","The Annihilation faction’s ice users crumbled weakly to the ground. They had squeezed out every bit of their energy to freeze the tsunami in place.","Nevertheless, the Annihilation faction’s soldiers still cheered in delight. Indeed, ice users curb water users. The indigenous population of this world can’t possibly stand a chance against the overwhelming might of the Annihilation faction!","Just then, the soldiers spotted a gorgeous woman wearing a flowing blue dress standing on top of the frozen tsunami. Her graceful figure and beautiful appearance prompted many soldiers of the Annihilation faction to whistle at her.","She is truly beautiful. How wonderful would it be if we could capture her and play with her for a night?","The Annihilation faction had destroyed countless worlds. Arson and plunder were everyday activities for them. In particular, they enjoyed conquering the wives and daughters of deceased enemy soldiers.","Unable to hold back their urges, many soldiers rushed at that woman, fearing that someone would beat them to it.","Only the soldiers who had been stationed at Jiangnan paled in fright as they stuttered, “I-It’s the Glacier Mountain Demoness!”","As the ones who had been fighting against the Zheng clan’s navy all this time, they had witnessed many of their comrades dying to this woman’s frigid ice. Their fear of her had been deeply imprinted in their souls.","Her ice skills were already powerful before. They trembled to imagine how powerful she had to be now that the world was encased in ice...","Many Jiangnan soldiers instinctively turned tail and fled.","It went without saying that the woman wearing a blue dress, standing atop the tsunami, was none other than Chu Chuyan.","She looked at the faces beneath and sighed. Everything is going as Ah Zu planned. We first used his water control ability to plunge the Annihilation faction into a panic, prompting them to freeze the surroundings with their ice element users without thinking deeper into it.","And now, this is my battlefield.","Chu Chuyan gently stepped on the ground. The towering frozen tsunami shattered into countless ice spikes that surged toward the Annihilation faction.","She wouldn’t have been able to unleash such overwhelming power under normal circumstances, but the Annihilation faction’s ice users had helped her out greatly. It was as if they had worked together to unleash this powerful move.","Confounding Crossroads was horrified. He roared at his subordinates to control the ice spikes hurtling toward them, but the Annihilation faction’s ice users had already depleted themselves to freeze the tsunami. They no longer had the energy to stop Chu Chuyan.","Those who preserved some energy were nowhere near powerful enough to stop this intense bombardment of ice spikes, which was even denser than rain. There was no way to dodge the spikes at all.","Cries of agony echoed from the Annihilation faction, though they quickly came to a halt. Those struck by the spikes swiftly turned into ice sculptures, even before their blood could splurt out of their injuries.","The Annihilation faction’s remaining experts desperately defended against the ice spikes while trying their best to protect Confounding Crossroads. However, the spikes were too terrifying. The battlefield descended into chaos, to the point where the Annihilation faction’s troops could no longer keep track of Confounding Crossroads’ whereabouts.","In Xiamen’s naval battle, the Annihilation faction’s army of a hundred thousand elites was wiped out. This was a defeat of unprecedented proportions. It caused a huge stir in the world.","There were even rumors that Confounding Crossroads had been killed amid the chaos.","The officials managing Jiangnan were plunged into fear. If the emperor died on their turf, there was no way they would be spared. So, they anxiously dispatched their subordinates to search for Confounding Crossroads.","Amid their despair, Confounding Crossroads finally returned. He was severely injured, but at least he was still alive!"]},{"number":2920,"title":"Chapter 2920: Chapter 2872: Fooling the World","paragraphs":["“Your Majesty!”","A group of people rushed out to welcome Confounding Crossroads. It was no exaggeration to say that their worlds would have collapsed if he had died in battle.","Several of Confounding Crossroads’ guards staggered as they escorted him. They had sustained significant injuries, though it didn’t look as if they were fatal.","After settling Confounding Crossroads down, an Annihilation faction’s expert asked him what happened and how he had sustained such severe injuries.","Confounding Crossroads replied, “That demoness’ ice spikes were too strong. Our ship was destroyed before we could react. My guards died protecting me...”","He shuddered, as if memories of that day still haunted him.","“Later, we fell into the water. Namusange initially escorted me, but the Zheng clan’s navy was hot on our tail. In the end, he valiantly sacrificed himself to cover my escape.”","Tears brimmed in his eyes as he spoke.","The Annihilation faction’s experts exchanged looks. They had just received confirmation of Namusange’s death not long ago. Confounding Crossroads’ story was in line with the facts.","“Namusange has valiantly died on the battlefield for the sake of our nation. There’s nothing more important than Your Majesty’s safety. I’m sure Namusange would be heartened to learn that you have returned to us safely,” the Annihilation faction’s experts consoled Confounding Crossroads.","Soon, an imperial physician arrived to tend to Confounding Crossroads’ injuries.","In the meantime, the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons separated Confounding Crossroads’ guards to question them individually. Their accounts of the events matched what Confounding Crossroads had told them.","Just then, the imperial physician came out. He, too, was dragged away for questioning.","The imperial physician replied, “His Majesty is severely injured, but it’s not fatal. He should recover after some recuperation.”","“Did you find anything amiss about His Majesty? Is there a possibility that someone has impersonated him?”","“I have thoroughly checked His Majesty’s body. It is most definitely him and not an impersonator.”","The crowd breathed a sigh of relief.","Next, the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons escorted Confounding Crossroads back to the capital. They decided to leave Taiwan’s Zheng clan alone for the time being. Since they were no match for the Annihilation faction on land, the Zheng clan wasn’t a major threat anyway.","Although it was also true that the Annihilation faction wouldn’t be able to cross the sea and conquer the Zheng clan any time soon, especially now that it was revealed that the Zheng clan had a formidable water user.","The powerhouses of the Annihilation faction—Jirgalang, Oboi, Suksaha, and the other kings—made sure to visit Confounding Crossroads and offer him words of consolation, though most of them sneered in contempt when they returned.","Confounding Crossroads had gone to the frontlines to build his prestige, only for his army to be wiped out. His reputation was now in shambles.","But this worked to their benefit. Having a weak emperor remain on the throne could help maintain peace among different factions for the time being. It wasn't as if they could become the Annihilation envoy anyway, so it was better to avoid unnecessary conflicts.","All kinds of rumors spread within the imperial palace. It was said that Confounding Crossroads spat blood when he heard about that, and his physical condition deteriorated further.","Consort Donggo had already been grieving for her deceased son when the emperor disappeared. That further plunged her into fright. It was a huge relief that the emperor returned safe and sound, so she exerted herself to take care of him.","Unfortunately, she caught a cold as a result, and her body soon crumbled. She passed away shortly after.","Confounding Crossroads was anguished. He held a grand burial ceremony for her and was often spotted sitting despondently in her room, crying pitifully.","His actions only further stoked the contempt of the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons. Confounding Crossroads is indeed trash. How can someone on the path of Annihilation be so sentimental?","Confounding Crossroads dismissed the palace maids and eunuchs taking care of Consort Donggo’s bedroom and forbade anyone from approaching her quarters.","Everyone thought that Confounding Crossroads was grieving for his deceased wife, so they steered clear of his path lest he vent his emotions on them.","But in truth, Confounding Crossroads wasn’t the only one in the room. He was accompanied by the empress dowager and her beautiful maid.","“She was innocent. We didn’t have to kill her,” Confounding Crossroads said with a sigh.","Had anyone else from the Annihilation faction heard that voice, they would have been shocked. It wasn't Confounding Crossroads’ voice, but Zu An’s!","The guards had frantically tried to rescue him, but little did they know that Zu An had already taken Confounding Crossroads’ place in that short gap.","Zu An had the Crown of the Ocean Deity’s water control ability. The ocean was his turf. Naturally, Confounding Crossroads had died in the depths of the ocean without anyone knowing better.","The Little Fiend Empress harrumphed. “Yes, your Myriad Transformations is formidable. You could have fooled her for a day or two, but it was only a matter of time before she saw through you. Do you take women for fools? Do you think they can’t recognize the person sleeping beside them?”","Zu An fell silent. He understood that logic as well.","He had intentionally chosen to play the role of a grieving husband to keep the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons from seeing through his disguise. This way, they would attribute any anomalies in his character to his grief.","Myriad Transformations allowed him to impeccably take on the appearance of a target, but ultimately, they were still two different individuals. There were bound to be subtle differences in their habits and speech patterns.","There were plenty of old monsters among the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons. Some of them had to be aware of transformation skills. If they started to doubt Confounding Crossroads’ identity, that would be the first thing that would pop into their heads.","Jiang Luofu added, “Consort Donggo had a weak physique and was already nearing her end. Her death was already inevitable. Big sister Little Fiend Empress merely gave her a little push.”","The Little Fiend Empress grumbled in indignation, “Why bother explaining to him? He wants to play the good person here, so you can just let me be the bad person. Ah, no. Perhaps he was thinking of bedding Consort Donggo for a few more days. I must have gotten in his way.”","Zu An was rendered speechless. He quickly stepped forward to embrace her. “What are you saying? I was wrong. You made the right move.”","The Little Fiend Empress wasn’t planning to let things go that easily, but Zu An’s hands were too formidable. Before long, she was already trembling nonstop. “Explain yourself if you want to, but where are your hands touching...”","Jiang Luofu’s cold face reddened. She had experienced the prowess of those hands just a few days ago. Isn’t it too much for them to do this in front of me? She interjected with a light cough and asked, “What’s our next move? You might have taken over Confounding Crossroads’ position, but this won’t work for long.”","While they could attribute Confounding Crossroads’ change in temperament to Consort Donggo’s death for the time being, that reason wouldn’t work in the long run. The Annihilation faction’s upper echelons weren’t fools. It was only a matter of time before they saw through Zu An’s disguise.","“That’s why I wanted to have a child with you a while back,” Zu An looked at Jiang Luofu tenderly. “The Annihilation faction’s upper echelons are familiar with Confounding Crossroads, making it hard to disguise as him. But if it’s a new little emperor... They won’t be any wiser.”","Jiang Luofu’s face reddened.","A while back, when Confounding Crossroads and Consort Donggo’s child died of smallpox, the other prince was escorted out of the capital to seek refuge from the plague. That was a chance for them to replace that prince with their child.","Other than the parents, who could tell the difference between two infants?","The thought of bearing their child brought a maternal smile to Jiang Luofu’s face.","The Little Fiend Empress felt envious. “Ah Zu, are you doing it on purpose? How is it that I never got pregnant despite doing it so many times with you, but you put a baby in her right away?”"]},{"number":2921,"title":"Chapter 2921: Chapter 2873: Heartless Man","paragraphs":["Jiang Luofu felt embarrassed. Why is the Little Fiend Empress saying all these things out loud?","Zu An replied with an awkward smile, “You also know that the stronger a cultivator is, the harder it is for them to have offs...”","But the Little Fiend Empress interjected before he could finish his sentence. “What about her? How did you knock her up in a single shot?”","She thought about the time she had to stand guard for the two of them, and she felt as if she was radiating a ‘cuckolded’ halo.","“I’ll explain it to you once things are settled here,” Zu An coaxed her. This was one of the abilities he had received from the Seed of Reproduction he'd inherited. Most of its abilities were sealed, but its fundamental ability remained intact.","So this is the power of reproduction... I can knock up any woman right away as long as I will it. But he couldn’t say it aloud lest the Annihilation Progenitor sense it.","The Little Fiend Empress was aware of the existence of universal deities, and upon noticing his vague statements, she was sharp-witted enough to know not to probe further. At Zu An’s coaxing, she slowly broke into a smile.","Zu An continued his sentimental act as Confounding Crossroads, and his actions only got increasingly ridiculous over time.","The Annihilation faction’s upper echelons didn’t suspect much; instead, they just mocked him behind his back, saying that he was pretending to be sentimental because he couldn’t bear the humiliation of having his army wiped out in the Battle of Xiamen.","This continued for a few more years. Confounding Crossroads’ physical condition continued to deteriorate before he abruptly passed away.","No one was surprised. If those on the path of Annihilation failed to bring annihilation upon others, they themselves would be annihilated instead. Confounding Crossroads clearly looked as if he had been on the path of self-annihilation in the last few years.","Confounding Crossroads had brought back the little prince, who had been sent out of the palace, in advance and called for Oboi, Suksaha, and the other Annihilation faction’s powerhouses to aid the little prince[1].","The Annihilation faction’s powerhouses could have refused to acknowledge the little prince, but now that they were living in it, they had to respect this world’s rules. Besides, it was much easier to control a young emperor than to let Confounding Crossroads’ unruly brothers take the throne.","So, the powerhouses came to a tacit agreement to support the little prince’s ascension. They also followed this world’s tradition and named the era Kangxi.","Zu An was finally freed from the imperial palace, and he made his way to Yunnan.","By now, the Annihilation faction had already recovered from their two tragic defeats arising from Dodo’s death and the Battle of Xiamen. The gap in resources between both sides was too great. Even if the Annihilation faction didn’t do anything special, the rate of their growth was still bound to far surpass that of the Southern Ming’s Yongli administration and Taiwan’s Zheng clan.","The Zheng clan soon lost Xiamen and had to retreat to Taiwan.","The Yongli administration also suffered a series of defeats, resulting in them losing several provinces. Hermes and his army made huge progress, and it didn’t take him long to completely destroy the Yongli administration.","The Yongli Emperor, his officials, and his bodyguards were forced to escape to Burma[2].","Hermes led his troops into Burma and coerced them to hand over the Yongli Emperor.","“I don’t know why he’s going so far,” Zu An murmured in confusion while taking a brief rest in a cavern.","The Wu Sangui in history would have been doing this for glory and wealth, but Hermes was most definitely not that kind of person. He could claim at least 50% of the credit for the Universal Conglomerate’s rise to prominence.","Hermes should have been a man of impeccable virtue, be it based on his reputation or from Isabella’s testimony. He wasn't lustful, greedy, or power-hungry... In fact, he didn’t have any vices at all.","Why would someone like that side with the Annihilation faction and work even harder for them than Sixth Elder Naraka, who had defected right from the start?","“He could be trying to distance the current him from the old him. He’s currently in an awkward position. The only way he can get a footing in the Annihilation faction is by accruing merit,” Zhao Xiaodie replied.","She looked at Zu An with moved eyes.","In this world, she was the Conqueror King’s daughter. Even though there was no true blood tie between them, this connection still put her in a lofty position. Little had she expected the Conqueror King to suddenly die and his allies to be purged.","If not for Zu An shielding her from this turmoil, she might have been dead by now. He even constantly consoled her and took her out on walks, fearing that she wouldn’t be able to tolerate the abrupt plunge in her standing.","As such, the two of them led carefree lives... though it would have been better if they didn’t have a third wheel accompanying them.","‘Third wheel’ Tang Tian’er paid no heed to Zhao Xiaodie’s look of contempt. She shook her head and said, “Hermes has already done enough to gain a footing in the Annihilation faction. There is no need for him to go to this extent. It would have been wiser for him to take a step back and nurture his troops. That would strengthen his position while making the Annihilation faction more reliant on him. Someone as smart as him should have already considered this move.”","“He must have his reason for doing this!” Zu An frowned.","“Could it be because of Chen Yuanyuan?” Tang Tian’er suggested.","That was also Zu An’s conjecture, since Hermes had indeed surrendered because of her. However, Hermes had been fighting on the front lines all these years, while Chen Yuanyuan, also known to him as Yu Yanluo, remained in the capital. The two of them hadn’t met at all.","Zu An had often visited Yu Yanluo, but the latter had no idea what Hermes’ motive was.","“Forget it, we’ll know once we meet Hermes.” Zu An had no clue what was going on.","I wonder if Isabella managed to make an escape in that battle... I’ve already written down the fate of ‘Nine Tribulations’ in the Annals of Time, so she should be fine.","Just then, Tang Tian’er wrapped her hands around his neck and said, “I want to sleep with you tonight.”","Zhao Xiaodie leaped to her feet. “Can you have some shame? Stop throwing yourself at him when you two aren’t even married yet.”","“You speak as if you didn’t throw yourself at him,” Tang Tian’er scoffed. “Also, it’s none of your business that we aren’t married yet. Stop putting on matriarch airs before me. The real one is in Taiwan right now.”","Zhao Xiaodie’s face reddened. “I don’t care. I am his legitimate wife in this world. You need my permission to get together with him.”","Tang Tian’er didn’t bother arguing with her. Instead, she placed herself in Zu An’s arms and wept, “Big brother Zu, look at how fierce she is.”","I can almost smell the scent of green tea lingering in the air [3].","Unable to take it anymore, Zhao Xiaodie rushed forward to tear Tang Tian’er’s arms off Zu An. Of course, Tang Tian’er wasn’t about to take it lying down either. A fight broke out between the two of them.","Zu An felt a headache settling in. It was precisely because the two of them were unable to get along that he dared not leave them in the capital by themselves. Otherwise, who knew what would happen between them?","If he only took one of them along, the one who was left in the capital would get upset. So, he'd chosen to bring the two of them with him. He didn’t think that they would start fighting so quickly.","“Enough, enough. Let’s stop bickering.” Zu An separated the two of them.","Zhao Xiaodie hurled her fist at Tang Tian’er threateningly.","Tang Tian’er sobbed. “Big brother Zu, you promised to marry me, but you haven’t given me a proper title even after so many years. If you continue being such a scumbag, I’ll really leave you for good.”","—","Just to elaborate a bit more on history:","The little prince (Zu An and Jiang Luofu’s child) is the Kangxi Emperor.","In his earlier years, the Kangxi Emperor was supported by four regents (aka Sonin, Ebilun, Suksaha, and Oboi), but by then, the Qing Dynasty had learned its lesson and was very wary of regents.","Oboi, in particular, was growing very powerful, so the then 14-year-old Kangxi Emperor reached out to Empress Dowager Bumbutai (aka Jiang Luofu) to help him oust Oboi.","Empress Dowager Bumbutai aided him, and by the time the Kangxi Emperor was 16, they succeeded. It was said that this was the reason the Kangxi Emperor was extremely filial to her.","The Kangxi Emperor (together with his son and grandson, Yongzheng and Qianlong) ushered in a golden age of prosperity for the Qing dynasty.","—","1. This little prince is the Kangxi Emperor, known to be one of the greatest emperors in not just the Qing Dynasty but in China’s long history. ☜","2. Now known as Myanmar. ☜","3. A reference to 'Green Tea Bitch', a Chinese internet slang term used to refer to scheming people who put on an innocent front. ☜"]},{"number":2922,"title":"Chapter 2922: Chapter 2874: Heart to Heart","paragraphs":["Zhao Xiaodie harrumphed. “Go ahead and leave right now. You have been saying that for a while now, but you continue to linger around.”","This woman is a schemer, but she acts like an innocent lily in front of big brother Zu. Look at how fake her smile is!","Zu An stopped Zhao Xiaodie from continuing her taunts. At the same time, he grabbed Tang Tian’er’s hand and gently consoled her. He had been busy dealing with affairs in the imperial palace, which resulted in him neglecting her.","Even though his promise to marry her was built on the promise of mutually beneficial cooperation, it was also a way for them to huddle together in the face of a powerful enemy. Putting himself in her shoes, his previous actions did seem as if he was going to abandon her after exploiting her. It was understandable for her to be upset.","“I was busy with something important, so I ended up letting you down...”","His gentle consolation made Zhao Xiaodie stomp her feet in anger. She ran out, not wanting to see this frustrating sight.","You have successfully trolled Zhao Xiaodie for +333... +333... +333...","“Aren’t you going to chase her?” Tang Tian’er looked at Zhao Xiaodie’s disappearing silhouette and asked worriedly.","“No need. That’s her personality. Her temper comes and goes quickly. It’ll be better to let her cool down for a while.”","Zhao Xiaodie looked like a troublesome person to get along with, but in truth, she was merely pampered from a young age and couldn’t keep her thoughts hidden. In contrast, Tang Tian’er appeared understanding, but it was hard to see through her thoughts and fathom her true intention...","But Zu An couldn’t be bothered to speculate. He decided to just brute force it.","He sealed Tang Tian’er's lips, while his hand adeptly slid down her curvature. Wherever his fingers touched, her body shuddered.","Tang Tian’er panicked. “You don’t need to feel sorry for me...”","“I’m not doing this because I feel sorry. I want you,” Zu An replied with a grin. His finger skillfully removed her belt. “Are you reluctant? Didn’t you ask me to marry you?”","“But we haven’t gone through the ceremony yet.” Tang Tian’er bit her lips shyly.","“I already see you as my wife.” Zu An smirked.","He casually waved his hand and shrouded the ground in a colorful haze. Rolls of red silk unfurled in the cavern. Two wedding candles were lit. The cold cavern suddenly felt much warmer.","Tang Tian’er watched this scene in a daze. She, like many other women, had dreamed about the consummation of her marriage. She had felt a tinge of disappointment when Zu An made a move earlier, thinking that it lacked a touch of legitimacy.","But the feeling of regret now turned into surprise.","“My husband...” Her current smile wasn’t as sweet, but there was a touch of embarrassment and sincerity to it.","The two of them embraced as loving words flowed endlessly between them.","Some time later, an exclamation echoed in the cavern. Tang Tian’er tightly embraced her lover.","Zu An gently consoled her. The woman before him was no longer the enigmatic woman he struggled to decipher, but a maiden who was feeling lost while going through the most important moment of her life.","Under his gentle coaxing, Tang Tian’er slowly regained herself and looked at him with a shy and sweet smile. She leaned into his ear and whispered, “Big brother Zu, are you in a hurry to tie me down?”","Zu An honestly replied, “I don’t want any problem to crop up between us in this crucial moment due to misunderstandings.”","Tang Tian’er grumbled, “It looks like you still don’t trust my feelings in you. It’s fine. I’ll prove it to you.”","Her movements were clumsy, but she was sincerely offering her tenderness to him.","Zu An cherished that. There was no politics between them at this very moment; it was a true exchange of hearts.","“Big brother Zu, the Hub of Freedom was founded because of you. I have always belonged to you,” Tang Tian’er gently bit his shoulder while conveying her thoughts coyly.","Being born in the Hub of Freedom, she had grown accustomed to witnessing debauchery. However, theory and practice were still two different things. Ultimately, she was still a maiden with zero experience. There was no way she was a match for Zu An. It didn’t take long before her defenses crumbled completely.","“I don’t want you to feel shackled to me because of the responsibilities you shouldered,” Zu An replied hesitantly.","Tang Tian’er smiled. She wrapped her hands around his neck and said, “If I wasn’t interested in you in the first place, do you think I’d have sacrificed my happiness to serve the organization? I fell for you from the first time I saw you in Cloudcenter Commandery. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have gone to such an extent to rescue you.”","Zu An recalled how he had hidden in her bathtub to escape from his enemies, and that stirred something in his heart. He had thought that her skin was smoother than water back then, but it was only now that he realized that he had barely scraped the surface. He had failed to grasp the true wonders of it.","Tang Tian’er shyly remarked, “You terrible fellow. I saved you back then, but this is how you repay me.”","Zu An burst into laughter as he pulled her into his arms once more.","...","Some time later, Tang Tian’er ran out of energy and gently pushed Zu An aside. “Big brother Zu, you should look for Xiaodie. It isn’t safe for her to be wandering around alone in the wilderness.”","After so many factions had intervened in it, this world had mutated. Ordinary animals in this world had transformed into powerful, ferocious beasts capable of devouring cultivators.","Zu An responded with a nod. He draped on his robe and left the cavern. It didn’t take him long to find Zhao Xiaodie sitting on a boulder at the edge of the cliff, hugging her thighs. She stared at the moon in a daze.","“Xiaodie, what are you looking at?” Zu An went up to her and asked.","“Big brother Zu, your stamina is incredible. My thighs are on the verge of going numb.” Zhao Xiaodie glared at him.","Cold sweat rained down Zu An’s back. He considered making an excuse, but such matters couldn’t be hidden.","“You don’t need to explain anything, big brother Zu. I intentionally left the cavern so you two can have some private time.”","Zu An was taken aback. Zhao Xiaodie had been displaying such great jealousy along the way that it seemed unlikely for her to show such generosity.","“I don’t know what you’re planning to do, but I know it must be of great importance. I’ll never forgive myself if that Tang woman leaves or betrays you because of me,” Zhao Xiaodie said with a self-deprecating smile.","“Xiaodie~” Zu An hadn’t expected Zhao Xiaodie to care so much for him. He felt moved and guilt-ridden at the same time.","Zhao Xiaodie leaned on his shoulder as she said, “Big brother Zu, I have lost my father and my big brother. Even my fake father in this world has passed away. You’re my only kin. Please don’t leave me too.”","Zu An hugged her tightly. “Don’t worry. We’ll always be together.”"]},{"number":2923,"title":"Chapter 2923: Chapter 2875: The Altar","paragraphs":["When Zu An returned to the cavern with Zhao Xiaodie, Tang Tian’er was lying lazily on the bed in a state of undress. When she saw the two of them walking in, she cast a taunting look at Zhao Xiaodie and said, “Ahh, I’m feeling weak from head to toe now. Little sister Xiaodie, I hope you don’t mind.”","Despite having mentally prepared herself for this, Zhao Xiaodie still felt anger surging through her when she saw Tang Tian’er’s expression. She sneered, “Call me big sister.”","Tang Tian’er ignored her and pitifully said, “My whole body is aching from just now. Can you help me put on my clothes?”","Zhao Xiaodie plopped down by the side and rolled her eyes. “Stop acting like your arms are fractured.”","“Little sister Xiaodie, are you angry at me?” Tang Tian’er pulled her robe to cover her body while asking with a concerned tone.","Zhao Xiaodie had already thought of a comeback. “Why would I be angry? I’m more than happy to have someone help my husband vent his needs.”","There was the concept of ‘bedroom maids’ in this world. Bedroom maids took on the responsibility of serving the patriarch when the matriarch was feeling unwell. In other words, Zhao Xiaodie was proclaiming that she was the matriarch, whereas Tang Tian’er was just a bedroom maid.","Tang Tian’er narrowed her eyes, having understood what Zhao Xiaodie was driving at. But as someone who had grown up in the chaotic Hub of Freedom, there was no way she would lose to an imperial princess like Zhao Xiaodie in a battle of words. She first beamed a smile at Zhao Xiaodie before leaning in and whispering, “Your husband is fantastic!”","Zhao Xiaodie’s face heated up. Her hand flew straight toward Tang Tian’er’s cheek.","Tang Tian’er reacted fast and dodged to the side.","But Zhao Xiaodie wasn’t about to let her slip away like that. She gritted her teeth and chased Tang Tian’er. Soon, the two women began fighting outside the cavern.","What a commotion!","...","The group arrived at Yunnan amid bickering. The first thing Zu An did upon arriving was to look for Hermes.","Both of them were defectors from the Order faction’s upper echelons, and Zu An, in a sense, was the mastermind behind Hermes joining the Annihilation faction. So, from the viewpoint of the Annihilation faction, the two of them were in the same boat.","Once again, Zu An tried to persuade Hermes not to crack down so harshly on Southern Ming, and that he should focus on maintaining an appropriate level of troops to reinforce his position instead.","But Hermes’ attitude remained cold. “If not for your earnest attitude, I’d have reported your earlier words to the Annihilation faction, and that would have been the end of you.”","The current emperor is my son, the empress dowager is my lover, and I’m on good terms with the Annihilation faction’s powerhouses. What can you do even if you report me? Zu An scoffed in his mind, though he wouldn’t voice those words aloud.","“You used to be the Conglomerate’s Second Elder, after all. Not even Sixth Elder Naraka is as hardworking as you after joining the Annihilation faction. What do you seek to get from doing all these?”","“This is the least I can do as a show of faith to the Annihilation Progenitor!” Hermes replied matter-of-factly.","Like I’d believe those words . Zu An got straight to the point and asked, “Are you doing this for the Deity of Love and Beauty?”","Hermes reacted explosively. “What nonsense are you spouting?!”","Zu An stared intently into Hermes’ eyes. “Chen Yuanyuan must resemble the Deity of Love and Beauty a lot.”","“I don’t know what you are saying. You may leave now.” Hermes flung his sleeves and left.","His vehement reaction verified Zu An’s conjecture.","Hermes’ old lover was likely the Deity of Love and Beauty, but a universal deity wouldn’t romance a mortal. It was more likely to have been one-sided love from Hermes’ side. In other words, he was actually a Love and Beauty worshiper.","The next thing Zu An did in Yunnan was to gather news about Isabella.","He discovered that when the Yongli government was destroyed, she hadn’t fled to Burma with the Yongli Emperor. Instead, she'd gone missing.","Zu An exploited his influence to gather the checkpoint records. There was a record of a nun named Nine Tribulations passing through one of the checkpoints. With that, his heart was finally put at ease.","My words must have gotten through to Isabella. She didn’t guard the Yongli government to the bitter end. This defeat must have made her realize that there was no way for the Order faction to turn the tables around anymore, so she decided to leave.","Zu An could have left after confirming Isabella’s safety, but Hermes’ reaction spurred his unease. He wanted to get to the bottom of what Hermes was scheming, especially since this matter concerned Yu Yanluo.","“Big brother Zu, I received news that the Burmese king has succumbed to the pressure and handed the Yongli Emperor and his followers to Hermes. They have been transported back to Kunming,” Tang Tian’er said.","Zhao Xiaodie had also uncovered some news, so she added, “The Yongli government’s Empress Dowager Ma and Empress Wang have also been captured, and they tried to strangle themselves to death on the way back. Empress Wang died, but they managed to rescue Empress Dowager Ma. Quite a few officials and eunuchs were captured as well, but they are being imprisoned in a residence right now. Only the Yongli Emperor was taken away, and his whereabouts remain unknown for the time being.”","Zu An remarked, “Empress Dowager Ma and Empress Wang are valiant women.”","The current Yongli Emperor was a descendant of the Ming dynasty’s King Gui, who was the cousin of the Chongzhen Emperor. Their lineage was settled in one of the fiefs, so Zu An had never met any of them. But just listening to their affairs was enough to move him.","He was extremely relieved that he had long since sent Zheng Dan to Taiwan’s Zheng clan and requested Chu Chuyan to take care of her. He shuddered to think about her plight otherwise.","Zu An suddenly thought about something else and asked, “The Yongli Emperor has been captured?”","“Indeed. It’s rumored that Hermes took him away personally. No one knows where he went.”","“I’ll investigate it. The two of you leave the city first,” Zu An instructed.","“We’ll go with you,” Zhao Xiaodie anxiously said.","Tang Tian’er laughed. “You’re lacking in capability. You’ll only drag big brother Zu down if you tag along. You should wait outside the city instead.”","“You damned woman. Does your skin itch when you don’t provoke me for a day?” Zhao Xiaodie raged.","A fight broke out between them, and before long, they had already unknowingly moved into the distance.","Zu An chuckled. It almost feels natural to see them bickering. I don’t know why, but Tang Tian’er enjoys teasing Zhao Xiaodie, and Zhao Xiaodie sees Tang Tian’er as her nemesis.","He channeled his divine sense and discreetly spread it across Kunming City. With his current cultivation, he could accomplish that with ease without alarming anyone.","Hm?","He quickly noticed an anomalous region. It was shrouded in a mysterious formation that hindered his divine sense from probing in. Something was clearly amiss there.","He made his way over and arrived at Bizi Hill.","The area was tightly guarded by Hermes’ troops, but something of this level couldn’t stop him. Zu An strutted past the guards without any of them noticing him, almost as if he had morphed into the void.","When he finally breached the innermost area of Bizi Hill, his eyes suddenly narrowed.","He saw Hermes standing before a towering altar. The latter was dressed in a peculiar robe, murmuring an obscure incantation while performing a bizarre dance. He was conducting an enigmatic ritual.","—","Unimportant but filling in the gaps of history:","In history, the Yongli Emperor indeed fled into Burma, and the Manchus pressured the Burmese king to hand him over. The Yongli Emperor was then brought to Bizipo (Bizi Slope) in Kunming and was reportedly killed by Wu Sangui (Hermes) there.","People began referring to Bizipo as Bi si po (‘Coerced to death’ Slope) because of this historical connotation.","Trivia:","Empress Wang (the Yongli Emperor’s wife) was a Catholic, with the baptized name of Anne.","Empress Dowager Wang (the Yongli Emperor’s mother) was also a Catholic, with the baptized name of Maria. She attempted to commit suicide after being captured, but the Manchus saved her. She was later brought to the Qing court and was respected and taken care of by them there.","The Manchus (Later Jins/Jurchens) were sharp rulers. They know when to show mercy and when to take forceful measures to assimilate the people. They weren’t exactly benevolent rulers, but they were pragmatic and effective in the sense that they didn’t hesitate to learn from the Ming dynasty and Han officials if it benefited them.","In this case, they knew that Empress Dowager Wang didn’t pose much threat to their rule, in the sense that the Ming loyalists couldn’t rally under her. Rather than killing her, it was much better to show some magnanimity and treat her kindly as a show of goodwill to the Han."]},{"number":2924,"title":"Chapter 2924: Chapter 2876: Reincarnation","paragraphs":["Fire totems surrounded the altar, and they resonated with the stars in the sky. Zu An sensed a sliver of starlight energy descending from heaven.","There was a circular platform at the center of the altar, and a man dressed in a dragon robe was kneeling on it. He was the captured Yongli Emperor, and he was dead. A bow was hanging around his neck—Hermes must have just strangled him using the bowstring.","Hermes murmured an obscure incantation, and the formation soaked in fresh blood lit up. Mysterious pulsations rippled in the surroundings and resonated with the stars in the sky,","The blood on the ground looked demonic, but the stars in the sky looked pure and sacred. The altar felt like an amalgamation of contradicting properties, and that only made it seem more eerie.","Zu An frowned. What is Hermes up to? I sense spatial pulsations. Is he summoning something? Hermes must have planned to use the poor Yongli Emperor as tribute from the very start.","Just then, a wormhole appeared, and a beautiful figure fell out of it.","Zu An flinched. He recognized the beautiful figure—it was Yu Yanluo!","But Yu Yanluo was supposed to be held hostage at King Pingxi’s manor in the capital. Zu An had even paid her a visit before leaving the capital.","Neither the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons, Jiang Luofu, nor the Little Fiend Empress would have allowed her to leave the capital and go to Hermes’ side.","Yu Yanluo looked bewildered. She looked at the man on the altar and asked, “Hermes, what are you doing? Why was I suddenly teleported here?”","She had been cultivating in the manor’s garden when a wormhole suddenly engulfed her. Before she knew it, she had already been transported here.","“I stowed away the imperial edict I received from Oberon. Using that as the foundation, I instructed my aides to tamper with King Pingxi’s manor. I have no intention of harming you with this formation, which is why you failed to notice it.” Hermes’ calm eyes reddened with fervor at the sight of Yu Yanluo.","Yu Yanluo widened her eyes in realization, but she didn’t lower her guard. “Why did you summon me here?”","Loneliness flickered across Hermes’ eyes. “You resemble her so much. Even your demeanors are alike.”","Yu Yanluo was confused. “Who is 'her'?”","Hermes continued rambling instead of answering her question, “Why don’t you like me? Countless women in the Myriad Worlds would commit murder just to have me smile at them, but I never gave them the time of day. I showed you utmost concern and got the best things for you. I even betrayed the Ming Empire and the Order faction for you. Yet you refuse to smile at me.”","Yu Yanluo shook her head. “Love can’t be forced.”","“You have someone you like. Who is he?” Hermes suddenly looked irritated. The goddess he had been pining for actually fell in love with someone else. No man could tolerate that.","Yu Yanluo fell silent. She wouldn’t give Zu An away. Eventually, she said, “If you truly love a person, shouldn’t you wish for her happiness?”","Hermes sneered, “What farcical words. Only brainless fools would fall for that. It’s one thing if I don’t fall in love, but once I do, I must have that person!”","“You’re out of your mind.” Yu Yanluo frowned. While she didn’t fancy Hermes, she had to admit that he was a good catch. He was a charming gentleman who was not only respectful but also made good conversation. It was no wonder so many women in the Myriad Worlds fancied him.","But that side of him was currently nowhere to be seen. His face was now distorted like a feral beast.","“I’m not out of my mind. I know what I’m doing.” Hermes harrumphed. “She also disliked this side of me.”","Yu Yanluo was even more confused now. “Who are you talking about?”","A chuckle echoed. “Who else other than the Deity of Love and Beauty?”","A seductive woman strutted over from the starlight.","Zu An, who was watching the situation from the shadows, immediately recognized her. It was the Universal Conglomerate’s Fifth Elder Lilith!","What is she doing here?","Back when Beijing was breached, First Elder Oberon committed suicide, and Fifth Elder Lilith went missing. Many speculated that she had died in the chaos. She was known for her beauty and charm, so it wasn't hard to imagine the fate that would befall her if the enemies got their hands on her.","To think that she would appear here!","Furthermore, the nonchalance on Hermes’ face showed that he was aware of her presence all along.","Zu An widened his eyes in realization.","The Fifth Elder is Noble Consort Tian in this world, and Noble Consort Tian’s father was the one who found ‘Chen Yuanyuan’ and presented her to Wu Sangui. I should have known there was a connection between them right from the start!","Yu Yanluo was shocked. She had some guesses, but she hadn't thought that the person she resembled would be the legendary Deity of Love and Beauty.","“I know the person you fancy.” Lilith looked at Yu Yanluo and laughed.","Before Yu Yanluo could answer, Hermes asked with a roar, “Who is it?”","He wanted to know the identity of the bastard who stole his lover.","“Who else other than the man who claimed Isabella’s heart?” Lilith said with a sigh. “That fellow is indeed a charming one. Had I not met you first, Second Brother, I might have lost my soul to him too.”","Zu An was speechless. My apologies, but I have no interest in public bicycles.","But her words suggest that she’s a couple with Hermes? A public bicycle with an abstinent man... What massive gossip this is!","“Zu An!” Hermes gritted his teeth. No wonder I didn’t like him from the very start. This explains it!","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +499... +499... +499...","Zu An was glad that Hermes was only learning about this now, or else the latter could have sprung an ambush on him when he visited several days ago. This man is clearly insane!","Lilith harrumphed. “Second Brother, why are you wasting time? Everything is already in order. It’s about time to revive the Deity of Love and Beauty.”"]},{"number":2925,"title":"Chapter 2925: Chapter 2877: Descent","paragraphs":["Hermes’ eyes reddened fervently. “You’re right!”","He flipped open a mysterious book and murmured an obscure incantation. Golden waves rippled from the book and resonated with the starlight from the sky and the blood formation on the ground.","Zu An sensed a hint of divinity emerging in the vicinity. Is the Deity of Love and Beauty really going to descend? Isn’t she dead?","Yu Yanluo was alarmed. She quietly took a step back while channeling her ability, but her expression suddenly stiffened. To her shock, she had lost control over her body.","How is this possible?","Her ability was a unique one. While it had no offensive prowess, it also ensured that no one could harm her. How had she suddenly lost control of her body?","Sensing her confusion, Lilith explained with a smile, “Your ability was bestowed by the Deity of Love and Beauty. Do you think she’d stop us from using your body to revive her?”","Yu Yanluo’s heart plummeted. Are they planning to use my body to revive the Deity of Love and Beauty? She tried to channel her other abilities, but it was to no avail. Her mind was still active, but her body refused to budge.","“Why are you struggling? You have already put your faith in Love and Beauty. You should be honored to become the vessel of her descent,” Lilith said with a smirk.","Yu Yanluo’s body turned cold. She worshiped the Deity of Love and Beauty, but there were other important things in her life as well, such as the person she loved. The thought of having to part ways with Ah Zu filled with her inexplicable sorrow.","Her intense emotions caused her body to shake and she attempted to regain control of herself.","Startled, Lilith quickly reinforced the restriction, but a wave of sword ki suddenly flew in her direction, forcing her to stop what she was doing to jump back. Despite her fast reaction, a clump of her hair was still severed.","Her face turned cold. She looked at the perpetrator. A dashing man was embracing Yu Yanluo, inspecting her condition.","Lilith’s frostiness melted into a coy smile. “It’s you. I at least helped you before. Don’t you think it’s too cold of you to launch a lethal attack at me?”","“Ah Zu~” Yu Yanluo was both overjoyed and astonished at the same time.","With a wave of his hand, Zu An shattered the frozen space around Yu Yanluo.","As soon as she regained her ability to move, she embraced him and said, “Ah Zu, what are you doing here?”","“This is fate’s decree.” Zu An tenderly stroked her smooth hair.","“Ah Zu~” Yu Yanluo was so moved that tears glistened in her eyes.","Lilith’s face stiffened. That brat is completely ignoring me! He only has his eyes on that woman!","You have successfully trolled Lilith for +666... +666... +666...","Hermes’s face turned livid. The goddess who had kept her distance from him was treating another man so tenderly as if she wanted to melt into his arms. That made him feel as if he was being cuckolded.","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +888... +888... +888...","“How could the two of you have an affair?!” Hermes had still been hoping for Lilith’s words to be a lie, but after witnessing it in person, he could no longer deceive himself.","Zu An eyed him coldly. “I've been consoling and taking good care of her while you weren’t at King Pingxi’s manor.”","This bastard had been hostile from their first meeting, and now, he was even seeking to harm Yu Yanluo. Zu An couldn’t be bothered to maintain a polite appearance anymore. I'll farm all the Rage points I can from him!","Yu Yanluo coyly hammered Zu An’s chest. Ah Zu is so bad~ How can he say that in front of others?","Hermes noticed Zu An’s emphasis on the words ‘taking care’ and understood what the latter was implying. He was so infuriated that he almost spurted blood. “You bastard!”","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +999... +999... +999...","Seeing that Hermes was on the brink of going berserk, Lilith reminded him, “Calm down, Second Brother. She isn’t the Deity of Love and Beauty.”","Those words snapped Hermes out of his trance. “You’re right. She’s merely a lookalike. She’s nothing compared to her!”","He turned his head away from the duo and continued flipping the golden book while murmuring his incantation.","The rippling golden waves grew even more intense, and Yu Yanluo shuddered. She found herself gradually losing control of her body once more.","“Ah Zu...” Her voice quivered. She couldn’t accept an eternal farewell with him when they had only just reunited.","Zu An realized that he couldn’t stop the mysterious pulsation, so he charged at Hermes. He figured that he could stop whatever was happening by disrupting his ritual.","A coy laughter echoed. Lilith blocked Zu An’s path and smiled at him. “I won’t let you foil my Second Brother’s plan.”","“Scram!” Zu An swung his sword, unleashing a powerful wave of sword ki that threatened to rip the altar apart.","To his shock, he was suddenly transported into a space shrouded in a pink mist. A fragrance lingered in the air. Fairies and demonesses flew across the air as they assessed the dashing man beneath while laughing coyly.","Just one of these fairies or demonesses could easily stir the lust of any men, let alone when they were gathered together.","“Darling, why don’t you enjoy your time with us?”","“Don’t worry, Hermes won’t hurt your lover. He’ll only summon the Deity of Love and Beauty into her body. The Deity of Love and Beauty is the most beautiful being in the Myriad Worlds. It’s rumored that anyone who looks at her true appearance will feel bliss beyond measure. That was what happened to Hermes—a glance was all it took for him to fall deeply in love with her.","“If the Deity of Love and Beauty possesses your woman’s body, won’t that make her your woman as well? You might have the chance to enjoy the Deity of Love and Beauty. This is something that no man in the Myriad Worlds dares to dream about! Isn’t that wonderful?”","...","Lilith was indeed a skilled bewitcher. She appealed not just to the body but to the mind as well. Even someone of Zu An’s resilience found himself moved by her offer.","“No matter how beautiful the Deity of Love and Beauty is, she’s an unknown entity to me. She can’t possibly compare with Yanluo!”","Zu An whipped out the Slaughter Fang and swung it, slicing through one of the fairies in the sky. The pink world crumbled.","Lilith spurted blood and collapsed to the ground. Shock flickered across her face. “Impossible! How did you find me?”"]},{"number":2926,"title":"Chapter 2926: Chapter 2878: Threatening a Universal Deity","paragraphs":["Hermes’s chanting grew louder and more impassioned.","The nearby withered trees turned green at a visible pace, as if spring had arrived. Flower buds emerged on the branches, and flowers began to blossom. It felt as if they were putting on their most beautiful form to welcome an exalted entity.","Yu Yanluo slowly rose into the sky. She had closed her eyes at some point, and the rough boulder beneath her transformed into a smooth white jade. Golden lights rippled at a steady tempo.","An ethereal fragrance wafted through the air. It didn’t come from the flowers but the ‘moon’, carrying the scent of ‘the first snow’.","Music hummed in the background. The stellar movements and the seasons had been manifested as music, and it sounded even more divine than what Zu An had previously heard in the Celestial Court.","A graceful humanoid figure imbued Yu Yanluo’s body. Her face seemed to flicker between multiple forms. Even when staring at her face, it was still a struggle to picture it in one’s mind. All that remained was the impression of perfection.","Her appearance differed according to the beauty standards of her beholders. Warriors saw the valiance in her tenderness. Poets noticed the serenity behind her passion...","The entirety of Kunming City was awestruck by her flawless beauty. Soldiers of the Annihilation faction, warriors who only knew destruction, swooned in her presence and fell to their knees. Even the ferocious beasts fighting in the wilderness began embracing each other.","Hermes was excited. He began walking over with arms opened wide while conveying his feelings of adoration, “O great Deity of Love and Beauty, I finally see you once more. I am your most devout worshiper and most passionate lover...”","Lilith, who had collapsed on the ground, severely wounded, suddenly felt ashamed of herself. She had always had a crush on Hermes, but the latter had never shown any interest in her. His mind had always been dominated by the legendary goddess.","And the reason for that was obvious now. She couldn’t even begin to compare to the Deity of Love and Beauty.","Her dao heart shattered. She felt nothing, even when she saw the lofty Hermes fawning on the Deity of Love and Beauty as the lowest simp. It felt as if everything she had done all these years was pathetic and laughable.","“Lover?” The Deity of Love and Beauty laughed softly—that was the most pleasant sound in the world. She raised her graceful finger and pointed it at Zu An. “My lover is him.”","Hermes’s expression stiffened. It was his turn to have his dao heart shattered. Fearing that ‘Chen Yuanyuan’s’ main body had tainted his perfect goddess, he hurriedly explained, “No, he’s just your previous vessel’s lover.”","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +444... +444... +444...","But Zu An couldn’t care that much. He glared at the flawless figure emanating a divine glow in the sky and said, “I don’t care who you are. Get out of Yanluo’s body right now!”","Before the Deity of Love and Beauty could react, Hermes screeched, “Audacious! How dare you disrespect the Deity of Love and Beauty!”","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +666... +666... +666...","He'd already had gripes with Zu An before. When he first saw Zu An and Yu Yanluo being lovey-dovey, he could still console himself that Yu Yanluo was merely a lookalike and not the Deity of Love and Beauty.","Little had he expected the Deity of Love and Beauty to still identify Zu An as her lover as well.","He felt as if his world had collapsed. Years of scheming, persistence, and hard work suddenly became a joke.","No, I’m not the wrong one! He quickly found a way for the situation to make sense. As long as I kill that hateful fellow, everything will go back to normal!","His handsome face warped in mania. Little wings sprouted from his shoes, and he took out a serpent staff. It pierced through Zu An’s body at a speed so fast that it completely defied common sense. It was as if he had traversed through space and dimension to launch the attack.","But Hermes felt no glee, as Zu An’s body slowly dissipated. What had been pierced was merely a silhouette.","Zu An reappeared elsewhere. He secretly wiped off his cold sweat. Hermes’s speed surpasses even my instantaneous movement. If I hadn’t employed the Annals of History in advance, that attack would have left me severely wounded.","“I can see why you’re a Memory envoy, but not even the River of History can overcome my speed!” Hermes spat through gritted teeth. His body moved once more.","But Zu An didn’t bother competing with his speed. Instead, he raised his hand.","All of a sudden, Hermes found himself imprisoned in space.","“Impossible!” Hermes was shocked. How could anything stop him when his speed transcended even space and dimensions? No, the spatial laws around us have been altered.","Zu An looked at Hermes solemnly. He had recently defeated many experts like Dissonant Melody and the Conqueror King and absorbed their energies, making him far stronger than before. With his deep understanding of spatial transformation laws, he could directly alter space to cripple Hermes' ability.","Hermes sneered, “Did you think I’d be helpless just because you trapped me in place?”","He raised his serpent staff, and its eyes lit up with a dreamy glow. He wielded the ability to lull others into a dream, and in the dream, he was a god!","Just then, a chilling bird cry echoed. Hundredwarble rushed at Hermes, causing the latter to temporarily lose his focus. This lapse in attention only lasted for an instant, as Hermes hurriedly snapped out of his daze to continue controlling his dreamscape.","But it was already too late. A seven-colored divine halo enveloped Hermes.","In the past, Zu An had undergone the Seven-Colored Divine Tribulation and forged a seven-colored divine halo. It allowed him to imprison anything in the world, but it had a severe limitation. As fast as light moved, there were entities in this world that moved faster than light.","The seven-colored divine halo should never have worked on an opponent capable of moving at absurd speeds like Hermes. But Zu An still managed to make it work by altering spatial laws to temporarily freeze Hermes’s movement.","Hermes was transported into the seven-colored space. By the time he broke free, he was already feeble, as if he had been siphoned of his strength. He was no longer capable of fighting.","Zu An was relieved.","Hermes lived up to his reputation as the Universal Conglomerate’s second-in-command—his strength didn’t pale in comparison to Dissonant Melody and the Conqueror King.","Zu An had only defeated Dissonant Melody and the Conqueror King because they underestimated him and let their guard down, but this time, it was an all-out fight with Hermes. Things could have easily gone awry.","Instead of celebrating his victory, Zu An hurriedly turned to the woman who radiated a divine glow and roared, “In the name of the Netherworld’s master, I command you to leave her body right away. Otherwise, I’ll vanquish your soul even if you used to be a universal deity!”","—","Translator Note:","At this point, I should mention that the author has slightly altered the first chapter of Keyboard Immortal.","I only noticed it myself a while back when Zu An found the term ‘Annihilation Progenitor’ oddly familiar, so I conducted a thorough search and realized that it was mentioned in none other than Chapter 1 of the entire series.","To sum it up, the story starts with an extremely powerful expert failing to defeat the Annihilation Progenitor, only managing to seal him off. Knowing that the Annihilation Progenitor will return stronger than ever, he prepares the Keyboard system and the Deity Slaying Sword before undergoing reincarnation, in hopes that he can defeat the Annihilation Progenitor. Meanwhile, his junior enters the Deity Slaying Sword.","That said, Zu An is still said to be from the modern-world Earth.","I don’t think I’ll change the current first chapter on Wuxiaworld, but I’ll probably translate it and post it when my hands are free."]},{"number":2927,"title":"Chapter 2927: Chapter 2879: My Lover","paragraphs":["The other party might have once been a universal deity, but she was already deceased. That put her under his jurisdiction as the Netherworld’s master.","The Deity of Love and Beauty laughed. The moonlight shining on her body condensed in a thin shawl of light. “You’re merely the Netherworld master of a remote world. Do you think that you can exert your jurisdiction on a universal deity?”","Zu An took out the Netherworld Book of Life and Death and flipped it open. “What if I combine it with the Deity of Death’s power?”","He channeled Death’s authority and infused death energy into the Netherworld Book of Life and Death. The altar suddenly felt haunted. Flowers withered, and lush trees dried up.","The Deity of Love and Beauty’s smile stiffened. She sighed. “Can you really bear to hurt me?”","Her voice wielded compelling power reminiscent of a friend’s advice or a lover’s whisper.","Hermes, who was lying weakly on the ground, looked at her zealously. Yes, this is the goddess I have been pursuing all this time.","Even Zu An fell into a daze. He suddenly felt a strong urge to protect her from all harm. This reminded him of Yu Yanluo’s ability. The ability is bound to be even more powerful when used by the Deity of Love and Beauty herself.","Even so, Zu An had been through countless life-and-death situations, and he had many ravishing beauties as his lovers. His mental resilience was far stronger than most people's. He took a deep breath and said, “I don’t want to hurt you either, so I suggest you leave her body. This will be for the best for everyone.”","“But I am her, and she is me. We are one entity. How can we be separated?” the Deity of Love and Beauty said with a chuckle.","“I don’t care. Return to wherever you have come from.” Zu An’s face darkened.","“But I don’t want to return to that place. It’s too scary. It’s too quiet. Can you bear to send me back there to suffer?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty slowly walked toward Zu An. Moonlight morphed into a dress around her. Colors that Zu An had never seen and couldn’t name flowed through her dress, forming the most beautiful sight he'd ever seen.","The ground touched by her bare feet became pristine. The air touched by her presence turned clear, devoid of even the slightest particle of dust.","As she walked over, it didn’t feel as if she was traversing through space; instead, space paved a path for her to glide through. A trail of divine light followed her. Translucent golden waves rippled from her, as if it was the most spectacular firework welcoming her arrival.","Her finger gently touched Zu An’s face. “My lover, can you bear to do so?”","Her face carried a dreamlike quality that conformed to her beholders’ ideal notion of beauty.","When Hermes heard her calling to Zu An so intimately, blood gushed up his throat and out of his mouth. This made hisalready feeble body grow even weaker.","“Second Brother!” Lilith crawled to his side and pulled him into her arms. Tears fell from her eyes. “Second Brother, why are you so foolish?”","In the Universal Conglomerate, Fifth Elder Lilith was known to be a confident woman who exuded charm with every gesture. There was always a smile on her face, no matter how dire the circumstances were. No one had ever seen her tears before. Yet she was crying so miserably with Hermes in her arms.","Zu An was too occupied with the situation to bother with that wretched couple. He activated the Eye of Truth to see through her dreamy facade and regain his senses, but to his surprise, what lay hidden beneath it was Yu Yanluo’s appearance.","No, there are subtle differences. Her facial features are the same, but they look more beautiful.","The biggest difference is in her eyes. They reflect the inevitable end that all beings face, as well as the alternation between eternity and change. It’s a divine beauty that makes one feel insignificant and commands respect, yet induces a deep sorrow at the same time.","Zu An didn’t know if this was the true appearance of the Deity of Love and Beauty, but it was his first clear glimpse of a universal deity. The Eye of Truth wouldn’t work on other universal deities close up.","Concealed beneath her beautiful appearance was deep, inconsolable sorrow, but what was she grieving about?","...","Doubts surfaced in Zu An’s mind, but he quickly snapped out of it and said, “You aren’t her, and I’m not your lover.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty was startled. A faint smile formed on her lips as she said, “Countless people have wanted to be my lover, but none ever succeeded. I’m the one making the advances now, yet you refuse me.”","Her gestures, her smiles, and even the way she enunciated the words relayed impeccable charm. Zu An took in a deep breath and tried to control his raging emotions. “You can be my lover, but you can’t sacrifice her!”","Lilith, who was bawling her eyes out, suddenly fell silent.","To think there’s someone that shameless in the world! Not only are you haggling with a universal deity, but you even want the Deity of Love and Beauty, who is known to be the most beautiful entity in the Myriad Worlds, to become a mere member of your harem?","Where do you even find the courage to utter such words?","Hermes nearly spurted blood out of anger. “You shameless scum!”","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +1024... +1024... +1024...","Lilith quickly patted his chest to comfort him. “Calm down...”","Even the Deity of Love and Beauty was briefly astounded, but she soon revealed the most beautiful smile in the world. “I have never heard such a request before. Men usually abandon their wives and lovers to pursue me.”","Zu An sighed. “That’s why we aren’t suited for each other. Return her to me, and I won’t have to harm you.”","He had negotiated with her because he wasn’t confident of dealing with her. Even if she was in her weakest state ever from having just returned from death, she was still a universal deity.","Furthermore, the Deity of Love and Beauty truly lived up to her reputation. He found himself unable to harbor any killing intent toward her.","“You are different. I see why she fell in love with you.”","Zu An was perplexed. Who is she referring to?","But he dared not continue wasting time, fearing that at this rate, he wouldn’t be able to save Yu Yanluo’s soul. So, he opened the Netherworld Book of Life and Death and said, “Stop stalling for time. If you don’t leave, I’ll have to make a move, no matter how much I’m reluctant to. The fact that you've died once before shows that you aren’t invulnerable to harm.”","“What a heartless man.” The Deity of Love and Beauty laughed. She waved her hand, and the surroundings were suddenly inundated by a faint fragrance and a dreamy, divine light.","The next moment, they were both transported into an isolated world."]},{"number":2928,"title":"Chapter 2928: Chapter 2880: Choice","paragraphs":["It was a world filled with surreal lights, reflecting places Zu An was familiar with, including those from his previous life’s Earth.","The Deity of Love and Beauty chuckled. “This world was created based on the most beautiful places in your memories. You have been through quite the experience. No wonder I fell in love with you.”","Zu An’s face darkened. “You aren’t her!”","He placed his hand on the Netherworld Book of Life and Death, but looking at her beautiful silhouette, he couldn’t bring himself to do it. No one could bear to destroy such an impeccable entity.","The Deity of Love and Beauty sighed. “I’m not lying to you. I’m her, and she’s me.”","Zu An frowned. “What do you mean?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty looked at the starry sky with a complicated expression. “Back then...”","She paused for a long while before finally continuing, “Using terms you comprehend, you can say that Yu Yanluo is my reincarnation.”","“Reincarnation?” Zu An was taken aback.","“Yes. I reincarnated to avoid something scary. There should have been some time more before my consciousness returned, but I didn’t expect that fellow to awaken me prematurely through a ritual.”","Zu An was astounded. He had to concede that Yu Yanluo was indeed the incarnation of beauty. Countless men had fallen at her skirts. Even Zhao Han and the old Fiend Emperor were unable to resist her. In a way, Yu Yanluo carried the traits of the Deity of Love and Beauty.","But Zu An wouldn’t allow himself to be persuaded so easily. “Your words suggest that you indeed died back then, but who has the means to overlook your charm and harm you?”","“There is no lack of madmen in the world.” The Deity of Love and Beauty looked at Zu An. “You shouldn’t probe too deeply into affairs concerning universal deities.”","Zu An sneered, “Then how can I confirm that Yu Yanluo is your reincarnation?”","“Why would she look identical to me if she wasn’t my reincarnation? On top of that, she awakened the long-disappeared Love and Beauty Divine Palace.” The Deity of Love and Beauty’s voice carried a dreamy quality. Every syllable she enunciated evoked a sense of wonder in one’s soul.","“Your words make sense, but...” Zu An spoke forcefully. “Even if she’s your reincarnation, you still aren’t her!”","The Deity of Love and Beauty was taken aback. “You’d rather choose her instead of me, even when we are both the same entity?”","All entities in the Myriad Worlds would be giddy with joy to receive the Deity of Love and Beauty’s favor, regardless of their gender. No one would have chosen someone else over the Deity of Love and Beauty. Especially after the deity had emphasized they were the same person.","“You two aren’t the same. She wasn’t you when I first met her at Brightmoon City. It was also her and not you who came to the capital to save me. When we were pursued in Cloudcenter Commandery, she was the one who protected me and sustained severe injuries as a result. She was also the one who braved untold dangers with me to escape to the Fiend races' territory...”","Zu An reminisced about the things they had been through.","The Deity of Love and Beauty’s finger trembled, as if another soul was gradually awakening within her. Her eyes widened in astonishment, and in the end, she let out a sigh. “I understand why she fell in love with you now. I am also confident that you’ll protect her well.”","Sensing her intention to leave Yu Yanluo’s body, Zu An couldn’t help but ask, “In its current condition, will your soul dissipate without a body?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty smiled at him. “Are you worried about me now? You were threatening to kill me just a moment ago.”","Even the stars dimmed before her radiant smile. It felt like the limelight was all on her.","Zu An fell silent. He solemnly warned himself against feeling sorry for the Deity of Love and Beauty; rescuing Yu Yanluo took priority here.","“That’s how men are. They never mean their words.” The Deity of Love and Beauty chuckled. “It isn’t time for my awakening yet. I hope I’ll hear a different answer the next time I return.”","The dreamy silhouette faded as the Deity of Love and Beauty closed her eyes. Yu Yanluo’s body suddenly plummeted to the ground. Zu An rushed forward to catch her.","The world collapsed, and the two of them were transported back to the altar.","Yu Yanluo’s body trembled before she slowly opened her eyes. She touched her face with a tender expression. “Ah Zu, I heard your conversation.”","She was confident in their relationship, but she hadn’t thought that there would be a man in the world who could resist the Deity of Love and Beauty’s charm. She remained uncertain even when the Deity of Love and Beauty made a bet with her.","Unable to suppress her overflowing feelings, she leaned forward and kissed her lover.","Zu An could immediately tell that Yu Yanluo had returned, and he was overjoyed. The two of them were ecstatic at their reunion, especially since just moments ago, they were only inches away from an eternal farewell.","To Hermes, it looked as if the Deity of Love and Beauty was offering her kiss to Zu An. He was already in a feeble state, and this was the final blow. “Deity of Love and Beauty, I have done so much for you, so how can you treat me like that? I feel so aggrieved!”","You have successfully trolled Hermes for +1024... +1024... +1024...","In a fit of anger, he breathed his last.","Lilith tightly embraced his lifeless body and smiled miserably. “Isn’t it the same for me as well, Hermes? I have done so much for you, but you never looked me in the eye. But this is fine. At least we’re finally together now.”","Fresh blood seeped from her mouth, but she still helped Hermes to tidy up his messy hair. She leaned down and gently kissed his forehead. A hint of her smile lingered on her lips, but she had already stopped moving for good.","This sight alarmed the other two. Yu Yanluo sighed. “I didn’t expect the woman who looked so lascivious on the surface to have such a sentimental soul.”","“They fell in love with people they shouldn’t have,” Zu An remarked.","“I’m glad that I fell in love with you.” Yu Yanluo clutched his clothes tighter.","The two of them embraced for a long time.","Just then, footsteps echoed. The earlier commotion had alarmed Hermes’ subordinates. Hermes had strictly ordered his men not to come over, no matter what they heard, but the earlier phenomenon was so wondrous that they had to muster their courage to investigate.","Zu An reacted fast and morphed into Hermes to stop the soldiers. “There’s no need to panic. Several rebels infiltrated the area in an attempt to capture Yongli, but I have made quick work of them.”","“All hail King Pingxi!” The soldiers cheered.","Zu An exuded an intimidating aura, and he was embracing his consort. There was little reason to doubt his identity. But isn’t our consort being held hostage in the capital? There’s no way the imperial palace would allow her to slip out here.","After dismissing the soldiers, Zu An buried Hermes and Lilith at a discreet location. Following Yu Yanluo’s advice, he buried them together.","“Ah Zu, are we going to return to the capital?” Yu Yanluo asked.","Zu An shook his head. “An unexpected variable cropped up. We might have to stay here for many more years.”"]},{"number":2929,"title":"Chapter 2929: Chapter 2881: Something is Wrong","paragraphs":["Zu An’s initial plan was to rescue Isabella and see what Hermes was up to. Isabella had managed to escape safe and sound, but he hadn’t expected Hermes to be scheming something so huge.","Hermes’s Wu Sangui played a huge role in this world’s original history. There could be unexpected variables in the future plotline if he died just like that. The Annihilation faction’s upper echelons would investigate the matter, and it was only a matter of time before Zu An was implicated.","I’ll have to temporarily take on Wu Sangui’s identity to stabilize the situation and ensure that history goes down its intended trajectory.","I really am a natural-born Time Scribe. How many histories have I messed up? O great Deity of Chaos and Enigma, you should reward me handsomely!","Yu Yanluo understood Zu An’s intention here, so she decided to return and stay in King Pingxi’s manor as his consort.","Tang Tian’er and Zhao Xiaodie were initially worried that a mishap had befallen Zu An, prompting them to sneak into the manor to conduct an assassination, but Zu An captured them and revealed his true face in the secret chamber. Needless to say, the two were shocked speechless.","He spent some time consoling them before the two returned to the capital to relay a message to Jiang Luofu.","Soon, an imperial edict was issued.","Hong Chengchou had contributed greatly to the stability of the world and wanted to retire from his official duties. The imperial court agreed to his request and rewarded him handsomely.","In the first place, the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons were averse to seeing an outsider rising to power within their ranks, but at the same time, Zu An had indeed contributed greatly to their cause. This was a rare opportunity to sideline Zu An, so they were happy to oblige.","So, Hong Chengchou gradually disappeared from the imperial court.","Zu An spent his time in Yunnan with Yu Yanluo as King Pingxi, living an idyllic life. In the meantime, Isabella, in her identity as Nine Tribulations, also attempted an assassination on him.","When Isabella learned about his identity, her eyes nearly bulged out of their sockets. She had no idea what Zu An was up to, and Zu An didn’t explain things to her either. She chose to trust him and quietly backed off.","Tang Tian’er and Zhao Xiaodie claimed that they had returned to their old homes with Zu An, but in truth, they often spent their time in King Pingxi’s manor.","In between, Zu An snuck out to the capital several times. Jiang Luofu and the Little Fiend Empress took these chances to complain to him—everything was great when the three of them had lived in the capital together, but Zu An suddenly moved to Yunnan for good. That made it difficult for them to even meet up.","Zu An could only apologize profusely to them while discussing their future plans.","He also visited Taiwan several times to collude with Chu Chuyan and Zheng Dan, so as to coordinate their movements.","...","Many years passed in a flash. The little emperor in the capital slowly matured.","But Oboi was gradually gaining control of the imperial court.","Suksaha had fallen out of the race due to the stain on his record as one of the Conqueror King’s old aides. Oboi had colluded with others to exploit this stain on his record to eliminate him.","In the process, Jirgalang’s influence took a blow, resulting in Oboi’s rise in dominance in the imperial court.","Jirgalang secretly scoffed. The current emperor is Kangxi. No matter how you flounder about, the Annihilation Progenitor still won’t bestow you with the authority of an envoy.","The entire imperial court grew frustrated with Oboi.","Meanwhile, the little emperor spent his days frolicking around with his playmates. Oboi thought that the little emperor was still much too immature to oppose him, so his ambitions further grew.","One day, Kangxi summoned Oboi into his quarters for an audience, but much to Oboi’s shock, Kangxi suddenly made a move on him.","Oboi threw out punches and kicks while laughing heartily. “Hahaha! You’re indeed a child. Do you think you can curb me with just these few people? I thought I’d leave you as the figurehead for several years more, but since you’re courting death, I’ll take the throne for myself!”","...","Oboi was confident. There was just no way he would be defeated by a handful of brats. However, he soon noticed something amiss. “Hm? Why are there experts from the military here? And they're using the skills of the Order faction.”","Oboi’s expression finally turned grim. These weren’t ordinary brats but military experts who had undergone strict training. Furthermore, they were using the Order faction’s skills, which curbed his power.","Even so, Oboi didn’t lose his composure. All schemes were meaningless in the face of absolute strength.","He threw out another kick, causing a young guard to spew blood. Then, he grabbed another guard and was about to tear him into two when his body suddenly shuddered. He stared at the pitch-black dagger piercing through his chest.","He slowly turned his head around and found himself facing a cold-faced man.","“Who are you?”","Oboi had already crossed hands with this young man and verified that the latter was of no threat to him. But the young man suddenly displayed a burst of strength that rivaled him. There was no way he could have been a normal servant of the cloth department!","The young man’s face distorted into a familiar one.","“It’s you!” Oboi was shocked beyond words. The other party was the long-retired Zu An!","“Why?” Oboi couldn’t understand why Zu An was helping Kangxi, as well as why Kangxi would collude with an outsider to deal with a fellow member of the Annihilation faction.","There was no chance for him to think deeper into it. The Poisonous Prick swiftly robbed him of his life force.","Zu An took a good look at the little emperor before slipping away.","The little emperor’s lips quivered. He held back the words sitting at the tip of his tongue. Then, he put on a solemn face and regained his airs as the emperor. “Relay my words! The vile Oboi dared attempt an assassination on me, so I had him executed on the spot!”","Shock rippled through the capital. Everyone wondered if Oboi had been out of his mind. But then again, Oboi has been acting arrogantly these days, so maybe he has grown complacent and thought that he can do whatever he wants.","At the same time, respect for the little emperor surged. No one expected the little emperor to be capable of taking Oboi down, and they dared not underestimate his capability anymore.","The little emperor decisively uprooted Oboi’s faction and slowly took back power. His sharp maneuvers left the Annihilation faction’s upper echelons wondering if he would become the next Annihilation envoy.","For the next few years, everything unfolded according to history.","Dealing with the Revolt of the Three Feudatories was fraught with difficulties, but ultimately, those three powers were no match for the Annihilation faction’s overwhelming strength. In the end, King Pingxi died of illness, and the Three Feudatories collapsed.","It was the same for Taiwan. The Zheng clan was defeated. It was a pity they had failed to capture the much-hated Glacier Mountain Demoness, though.","Deep in the universe, a boundless black hole suddenly burst into arrogant laughter. “Mi Li, the world has been formed. I’m going to grow even stronger. You won’t be able to compete with me anymore.”","They proceeded to absorb the world’s annihilation power.","That was a world touched by other universal deities, so the power they could gain from it was incomparable to any other. They were the final victor here. Other universal deities were no longer a match for them.","“I wonder if that’s truly the case.” The everchanging constellations in the sky twinkled, as if smiling.","The Annihilation Progenitor suddenly felt worried. It’s hard to guard against this woman’s means. Moments later, they suddenly roared. “Impossible! Something is wrong. That isn’t Annihilation’s bloodline!”"]},{"number":2930,"title":"Chapter 2930: Chapter 2882: The Position of An Elder","paragraphs":["“You’re behind this?” The Annihilation Progenitor glared at the Deity of Chaos and Enigma.","Mi Li chuckled. “It was a random piece I inserted. I didn’t expect it to work.”","A powerful aura rippled from the Annihilation Progenitor as it looked as if they were going to destroy the world, but Mi Li stopped them. “Are you going to be a sore loser? We agreed to insert our representatives and let them fight it out. Are you going to personally intervene now?”","The black hole distorted, but sensing the other universal deity’s aura, they had no choice but to swallow this bitter pill and leave.","Meanwhile, a summoning gate appeared in the sky of the world where Zu An and the others were. The foreign visitors were all transported back to their original worlds.","Despite clutching tightly onto Yu Yanluo and the others, when Zu An regained his senses, he found himself transported back to the Universal Conglomerate, and none of his women were with him.","“Big brother Zu!” While Zu An was still dazed, a fragrance plunged into his arms. Isabella was so moved that she burst into tears. “I knew you would find a way out. I’m sorry. I misunderstood you.”","Her body was trembling as years of suppressed emotions spilled out from her.","She had been a flower in a greenhouse from a young age. While her previous encounter with Zu An in Dreamland had brought about some growth, having her nation and family destroyed, her faith shattered, and being forced to fight in a completely helpless battle were still too much for her to bear.","She had grown a lot over the years. She'd been forced to push her vulnerability down into the depths of her heart, as that environment she had been in allowed for no weakness.","It was only now, when she was before her lover, that she could finally show her truest side.","Knowing that the other party had single-handedly turned the situation around made her so overjoyed that she couldn’t help but cry tears of joy.","Zu An awkwardly glanced at Chu Chuyan, only to see that the latter had averted her eyes to look at the scenery outside. She was pretending not to notice. So, he tightly embraced Isabella and gently consoled her.","Just then, Aragorn walked over and said, “We already know about what happened during the Order Ceremony. I didn’t expect our fellow brothers to turn against us.”","Hearing her father’s voice, Isabella snapped out of her daze and shyly pushed Zu An away.","Zu An looked around and asked, “Why don’t I see Sixth Elder Naraka around?”","Had Sixth Elder Naraka not surrendered to the Annihilation faction right from the start, the Order faction wouldn’t have suffered such a tragic defeat.","“He has switched his faith to Annihilation. Naturally, he has already severed ties with us,” Aragorn sneered. “I’d skin him if he dared return here!”","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. At least he wouldn’t have to worry about Jiang Luofu and the others being transported back to the Annihilation faction’s camp. The only one he had to worry about was Zhao Xiaodie.","I wonder if she’ll meet with danger when she returns to the Annihilation faction. But I've been helping her with her cultivation in the past few years, and she’s much stronger than before now. With her sharp wits, she should be able to protect herself.","“What do you plan to do now? I learned that the Deity of Order has...” Zu An asked.","“The Deity of Order has fallen,” Aragorn declared. Sorrow could be seen on the faces around.","Zu An was perplexed. These people were grieving, but he had expected their response would be much more intense, considering how they had just lost their faith.","“Did Annihilation worshipers exploit this opportunity to attack the Conglomerate?”","The Universal Conglomerate’s rise to prominence could be credited to its Seven Elders’ competency and the Deity of Order’s protection. But the Deity of Order had fallen, and there were only two of the Seven Elders left in the Conglomerate. There were bound to be people who coveted the Conglomerate’s astronomical wealth now that it was down in the gutter.","“The great Deity of Protection has responded to our earnest wish to protect the Conglomerate,” Aragorn spoke with reverence. “As long as the Deity of Protection is around, no scum will dare to cause trouble.”","Zu An was speechless. The intense faith he felt from Aragorn sent chills down his spine.","Naraka had defected to Annihilation, and Mastema had secretly thrown his lot with Reproduction. Even Hermes, the man who built the Conglomerate to its current greatness, had abandoned Order and joined Love and Beauty. Lilith also seemed more like a worshiper of Bliss and Desire, or she could have joined Love and Beauty together with Hermes.","Only First Elder Oberon had been a stalwart Order worshiper. The others were all black sheep.","Now, it would appear that Aragorn was no exception. Chances were that he had secretly defected to the Deity of Protection long ago, and the Order Ceremony was an elaborate scheme to change the power dynamics within the Conglomerate.","And the final winner was evidently Aragorn.","But Zu An didn’t let anything slip. He continued interacting with Aragorn with a pleasant smile.","A grand night banquet followed. It celebrated the return of the Order worshipers and Zu An’s legendary comeback against the Annihilation faction. There had been too much negative news shrouding the Conglomerate recently so they urgently needed something positive to lift the people’s morale.","Aragorn generously praised Zu An for fighting against all odds to turn the tables on the Annihilation faction. No one refuted him, be it the Conglomerate’s members or the guests from the Myriad Worlds.","None of them thought that they could have reversed the tides in such a dire situation, unless they somehow knew about the other elders’ betrayal in advance.","In fact, despite having an overview of the situation, they'd had no idea what Zu An was doing. Even at the last moment, all of them had thought that the Annihilation faction had succeeded in their ploy, and the Annihilation Progenitor had obtained that world.","So, they were extremely shocked when things flipped around at the end. They hadn't thought that such a maneuver could have been possible.","By replacing the Annihilation envoy’s bloodline with his own, he'd reaped the fruits of centuries of hard work by the Annihilation faction. It was such a stylish comeback.","The crowd felt a mixture of awe and vigilance. I must keep him away from the women in my household. Otherwise, I might just get cuckolded without realizing it.","As the banquet’s atmosphere reached its peak, Aragorn suddenly announced, “Our Conglomerate has always been governed by the Seven Elders, but we have woefully lost five elders in the Order Ceremony. Still, the Conglomerate has to function. We’ll need to fill up the remaining five seats. Ah Zu has made a huge contribution this time, so I propose granting him one of the elder positions. Does anyone disagree with that?”","The crowd erupted in cheers.","With the other elders gone, Aragorn naturally assumed the highest position within the Conglomerate. He was undisputedly the First Elder, and Zu An was his future son-in-law. No one would be so tactless as to speak up against this motion.","There were still other elder seats available, so there was no need for them to vie over this one, especially since Zu An was very much befitting of it.","Isabella voiced her complaint, “Father, I disagree! Doesn’t that mean that I’ll call him uncle in the future?”","Aragorn burst into laughter. “Don’t worry about that. They are separate matters.”","The other guests chuckled. Isabella’s face reddened, and she snuck a glance at Zu An.","But Zu An grimly replied, “I’m afraid that I’ll have to turn down your kind offer, uncle.”"]},{"number":2931,"title":"Chapter 2931: Chapter 2883: It’s the Wrong Deity","paragraphs":["Aragorn’s smile stiffened. “Why? Are you not interested in being an elder of the Conglomerate?”","The atmosphere grew heavy. The crowd exchanged subtle looks. They knew better than to say anything in a situation like this.","Zu An replied, “Uncle, you've misunderstood me. I'm just used to being carefree. I wasn’t an Order worshiper before, and I’m not a Protection worshiper now, either. It might be inappropriate for me to become a Conglomerate elder.”","Isabella also spoke up for Zu An, “Daddy, big brother Zu is still too young. His qualifications might not be enough to silence the naysayers. Furthermore, he has other responsibilities on his hands. Becoming a Conglomerate elder might be overstretching him.”","Aragorn laughed. “That’s easy. Ah Zu, you can be our honorary elder. You don’t have to take on any responsibilities within the Conglomerate, and you’re free to do as you please. If you’re going to turn down even that, I’d have to wonder if you truly want to be with Isabella.”","Zu An couldn’t turn down Aragorn when he was already going this far. “Thank you for your generosity, uncle.”","Only then did Aragorn’s face brighten up. He adeptly smoothened the situation over, and the banquet regained its earlier vibrancy.","After the banquet concluded, Zu An returned to his room and chatted with Chu Chuyan. Just then, they heard knocks on the door.","Zu An opened the door and saw a slightly nervous Isabella outside.","Chu Chuyan stood up and said, “I’ll return to my room. You two talk.”","Isabella hurriedly waved her hands. “You don’t need to leave, big sister Chu.”","“What’s wrong, Bella?”","Sensing that Isabella had something to say, Chu Chuyan grabbed Isabella’s hands and guided her into the room. The two of them had taken care of each other for many years in the Order Ceremony, so they were no longer as awkward as they were when they first met.","Isabella looked at Zu An and asked, “Big brother Zu, why did you turn down my father?”","Zu An was hesitant to speak.","Isabella interjected, “Do you suspect that my father knew everything from the start?”","Zu An looked at Isabella in surprise.","Isabella replied sorrowfully, “In the decades I spent in the Order Ceremony, I've faced my brethren’s death, my nation’s collapse, and the despair of having to fight in a hopeless situation. There’s no way I wouldn’t have grown from that.”","Time flowed faster in the Order Ceremony. It was similar to how Zu An had previously spent decades with Pei Mianman in a dungeon, but only a short time had passed in real life.","“Indeed. Looking back at it now, the Order Ceremony feels like an elaborate ploy,” Zu An replied. “You shouldn’t blame your father. This Order Ceremony was a fight among the universal deities; we were all just pieces on their chessboard.”","Isabella’s eyes reddened. “But I still feel depressed. My uncles put on a united front for so many years, but it turned out that they'd been scheming to betray one another in the Order Ceremony all this time. Many Conglomerate members, who were kept in the dark, fought hard for Order till their dying breath, but it seems as if their sacrifice was meaningless right from the start.”","The thought of her dying comrades made tears trickle down her face.","“You’re a kind lady.” Chu Chuyan rubbed her shoulders to console her.","Zu An fell silent.","The universal deities were only concerned about the powerhouses who were worthy to serve as their chess pieces. In contrast, those who upheld their faith to their dying breath didn’t mean a thing to them at all.","Under Chu Chuyan’s consolation, Isabella recovered slightly and asked, “Big brother Zu, what do you plan to do next?”","“Someone promised to provide me with an answer. I hope I’ll get some good news.” Zu An recalled how Meng had told him to witness the Order Ceremony, and in return, she would tell him the method to find the Goddess of Wu Mountain. He suddenly felt nervous. What if her answer isn't something I’m looking for?","“You should stay in the Conglomerate longer. I still haven’t hosted you properly yet,” Isabella said with expectant eyes. Despite having spent decades in the Order Ceremony, they had spent more time separated than together.","Chu Chuyan teased, “Ah Zu, you should also settle your marriage with Bella while you’re at it.”","Isabella’s face turned as red as an apple. “That’s not what I mean. Big sister Chu, you’re terrible...”","Zu An looked at the two ladies with a warm smile.","Suddenly, there was a flicker, and the surrounding space distorted. Before he knew it, he had been transported into another dimension.","Sensing the unique aura of a universal deity, his heart swelled in excitement, knowing that he might acquire the method to save the Goddess of Wu Mountain soon. “O great Deity of Mem...”","“I see you miss that fellow more than me. I must have come at an inconvenient time.” The constellations in the sky distorted.","Sweat immediately rained from Zu An’s head. “O great Deity of Chaos and Enigma, I didn’t receive a response from you in your Divine Palace and was worried about you, which is why I sought information about you from the Deity of Memory. I’m glad that you’re safe and sound!”","“Hah. You’re as cunning as ever. I didn’t think you would be able to smooth that over,” Mi Li teased.","Zu An secretly wiped off his cold sweat. “It’d be for naught if not for your magnanimity. I heard from the Deity of Memory that you had your hands full dealing with some trouble. Is the matter resolved now?”","“It’s not completely resolved, but it’s much better than before. It’s all thanks to you.” Mi Li’s voice suggested that they were in a good mood.","Zu An immediately put the two together. He should have entered the Order Ceremony as a Mirror Scribe, but for some reason, he ended up as Hong Chengchou. “Is it because of you that I transmigrated into Hong Chengchou’s body?”","“Of course. I did it on the spur of the moment, but I didn’t expect you to pull off such a stunt. I was right about you. You are a natural Time Scribe.”","Zu An wasn’t happy about her compliment. “Next time, can you give me a heads-up first before doing anything? I won’t be that lucky every time.”","He didn’t want to experience the feeling of treading on thin ice too often.","“Many things can’t be revealed prematurely. Besides, how else could I force out your potential?”","Zu An felt his anger bubbling, but he dared not to let it show. He could only ask, “I've foiled Annihilation’s plans several times now. Will I randomly face divine retribution from them while walking on the streets?”","“You’re under my protection; they won’t be able to make a move on you directly. At most, they will send Annihilation worshipers after you.”","Zu An hesitantly pointed out, “But you had your hands full not too long ago.”","“Don’t you still have Meng?”","“...” Zu An took a deep breath and asked once more, “Where did my companions go after the Order Ceremony concluded?”","“They returned to their respective Divine Palaces. Don’t worry, I have checked on your behalf. They are safe.”","Zu An’s mind was put at ease. He mustered his courage and asked, “O great Deity of Chaos and Enigma, I offered my tremendous feat in the Order Ceremony to you. May I know if there is any reward for my accomplishment?”"]},{"number":2932,"title":"Chapter 2932: Chapter 2884: Heaven Plunderer","paragraphs":["“Aren’t you a bold one? But you do deserve to be rewarded after hindering the Annihilation Progenitor from devouring that world’s energy.” The Deity of Chaos and Enigma thought about the reward they should offer to Zu An.","Zu An asked, “What happened to that world afterward?”","The child he had with Jiang Luofu was still in that world...","“It was left to develop naturally. No deity can interfere with it for the time being.”","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. This was the best ending he could think of.","Some time later, the constellations twinkled, and a book descended from the sky. Zu An respectfully received the book with both hands. On the cover of the book were the words: Primordial Mirage.","Mi Li said, “I had an inspiration and crafted this using that world’s energy. It should be useful to you.”","“Thank you, o great Deity of Chaos and Enigma...” Zu An dropped another load of bootlicking. Even he was feeling goosebumps from his subservience.","“Enough. Decipher that book by yourself. I have more important things to attend to.” Mi Li sounded impatient. They disappeared right after leaving those words behind.","The distorted space-time reverted to normal. Chu Chuyan and Isabella were still secretly whispering to each other in the distance. It felt like nothing had changed at all.","Zu An looked at the ‘Primordial Mirage’ in his hands. As soon as he flipped it open, he heard the Keyboard system’s voice.","New secret manual detected: Primordial Mirage. Do you want to absorb it?","Zu An was astounded. He had obtained the previous secret manuals as rewards for clearing Unknowable Regions, but he had never wondered who was behind those manuals.","He did notice that the Netherworld Book of Life and Death had a profound connection with Death’s path, but he wasn’t absolutely certain about it. However, the Primordial Mirage was most definitely the Deity of Chaos and Enigma’s creation.","Could the other secret manuals be the creations of other universal deities? Which secret manuals were created by which universal deities then?","At the Keyboard system’s repeated prompt, Zu An selected ‘Yes’.","The Primordial Mirage transformed into a ray of light and imprinted itself on the F12 key.","A flood of information gushed into Zu An’s soul. He gained a rough understanding about the effects of Primordial Mirage.","First and foremost, it allowed him to peer into the fate and karmic threads of some entities and items.","Zu An looked at the two ladies and saw many red threads linking them to him. This was the proof of their intertwining karma and fate.","There were also threads of other colors extending into the void that represented other factors tied to their fate. There were even two threads linking them together. Is this thread due to the friendship they forged through the Order Ceremony, or is it because of me?","Soon, his head began to hurt from an overload of information. This ability is taxing on my mind, so I should only activate it when necessary. It might provide me with guidance when I need it.","Secondly, Primordial Mirage allowed him to infiltrate an unguarded target’s consciousness and extract the target’s memories, obsessions, or fears, to craft a temporary mirage to trap them.","Zu An frowned. Doesn’t this make me like Freddy Krueger from A Nightmare on Elm Street? My ability is far stronger than Freddy Krueger’s, though.","Thirdly, Primordial Mirage had the power to blur the distinction between mirage and reality, such as alternating between a corporeal body and an ethereal body.","This will be useful for self-defense. At least I won’t have to fear attacks from enigmatic entities anymore.","New secret manual collected. New function unlocked: Intelligence System.","“The Intelligence System provides you with information about famous historical items, but it won’t work on normal or extremely secretive items.”","The Intelligence System? An idea popped into Zu An’s mind. He took out the Poisonous Prick and soon acquired information about it. “The Deity of Death crafted this dagger using a segment of his finger. It brings death to all living beings.”","Next, he took out the Lord of Slaughter’s fang, and the Intelligence System provided him with information about it. “This item comes from a mysterious entity that wielded the power to unravel all powers. The Deity of Order abhorred this entity and destroyed it, but its fang, which wielded the power to unravel all powers, went missing.”","Zu An was taken aback. What fortuitous encounter did the Lord of Slaughter go through to acquire such a formidable weapon?","The Intelligence System should save me from a lot of hassle. Ah, didn’t I unlock the Title System from absorbing the Song of Righteousness back then? It hasn’t reacted at all since labeling me a Love Sage.","He peeked into the Title System and found that he had acquired another title.","“Using your flesh as the needle and desires as the thread, you wove an elaborate web to ensnare your enemies. While your enemies were dreaming, their empire had already changed hands. It is said that all rebellions start from the bed and are decided by bloodline.","“'King of Green Crown’ should have been the most fitting title for you, but your scheme deceived even the universal deities. On top of that, you obtained the Seed of Reproduction and enjoyed a close interaction with the Deity of Love and Beauty... So, your title will be elevated to ‘Heaven Plunderer’.","“Divinations and prophecies concerning you will be obscured. Your true bloodline ties will be layered with falsehoods, making it hard for even universal deities to track your relations. You’ll possess exceptional insight into matters concerning ‘betrayal’, ‘deception’, and ‘lust’. You can ignite the underlying problems in other people’s ties, and it will be easier for you to win goodwill from your hostile mates. However, you will also draw greater flak from enemies of the same gender.”","This title feels so awkward... But at least it’s not ‘King of Green Crown’. I'd be embarrassed for life if I had to walk around with this title.","The title’s most valuable effect was obscuring divinations and prophecies concerning him. He had been transparent to the universal deities thus far, unable to withhold any secrets from them. He dared not to even think in their presence, lest he offended them.","This ability granted him at least a basic level of privacy, making it easier for him to scheme against them.","On top of that, he felt a tremendous amount of faith power gushing into his body. It appeared to have been the faith of Annihilation worshipers...","Haa, I've made a complete enemy out of the Annihilation Progenitor. This title seems to be encouraging me to go around cuckolding others, but I’m not that kind of person!","It feels like the effects of this title might have mutated due to the Seed of Reproduction though, particularly the third ability. It just makes more people view me with enmity..."]},{"number":2933,"title":"Chapter 2933: Chapter 2885: Great Yin Ruins","paragraphs":["The two ladies noticed Zu An's peculiar expression. Chu Chuyan was able to hold herself back, but Isabella couldn’t withhold her curiosity. “What’s wrong, big brother Zu?”","Zu An’s face reddened. He couldn’t tell them about his new title, so he changed the topic instead.","They chatted for a while until Chu Chuyan abruptly stood up. “I’ll return to my room to cultivate. Undergoing the Order Ceremony has brought me some epiphanies that I need to digest. You can continue chatting.”","“Ah!” Isabella’s face turned bright red. She quickly stood up. “It’s getting late. I’ll leave too.”","But Chu Chuyan held her down. “Don’t. That just makes it seem as if I’m chasing you out. You can continue chatting. It’s not like we’re outsiders anyway.”","Isabella panicked at Chu Chuyan’s departure. She could tell that the latter was giving them some private time together, but they were in the Universal Conglomerate headquarters, and many people had seen her entering Zu An’s room. Speculations were bound to surface if she remained in his room through the night even after Chu Chuyan left. But they had already parted ways for many years in the Order Ceremony due to being on opposing sides. It hadn’t been easy for them to reunite, and there were countless words she wanted to tell her lover.","Her toes fiddled, but her feet stayed put.","Zu An noticed her nervousness and chuckled. “Are you afraid that I’ll eat you?”","Isabella grumbled coyly, “Big brother Zu, you’re teasing me~”","Zu An smiled. “I’m glad that decades in the Order Ceremony didn’t wear down your pure temperament.”","“Ha! Are you implying that after spending decades in the Order Ceremony, I’ve become an old hag?” Isabella stomped her feet.","“Our Bella is the big miss of the great Universal Conglomerate. What have you never seen before? There’s no way your temperament would change just because you spent decades in a dungeon.” Zu An pinched her cheeks. Her sweet ‘Ha!’ carried a fatal charm that Lilith could never hope to emulate.","Isabella felt embarrassed by his compliment. “I wouldn’t have been able to persist if not for you.”","They had been in a desperate situation in Dreamland as well, but back then, she had merely regretted her powerlessness. This time, she'd felt despair so deep that it crushed her entire world. Witnessing the deaths and betrayals of her elders had made her doubt everything she stood for.","When she learned that Zu An had defected to the Annihilation faction as well, her heart nearly shattered, though she'd decided to trust him after she calmed down. She might not have known him as long as her elders, but for some reason, she had a feeling that even if everyone else in the world turned their back on her, he would never do so. Even when the Order resistance was vanquished by the Annihilation faction, she'd still held on because of the final sliver of trust she had in him.","And he hadn’t let her down. Upon learning everything that had happened, she leaped in excitement.","“You’re a strong woman. I couldn’t tell you anything even though I knew you were in a vulnerable position. I was so worried that you would succumb.” Zu An gently held her hand.","Isabella’s body trembled. If big brother Zu makes a move... Should I accept him?","Even though she viewed herself as his woman, they weren’t officially wedded, and there were many eyes on her here. But she was reluctant to turn him down, knowing that they would part ways again very soon. She felt conflicted.","Just then, she remembered something. It felt as if she had found her salvation. She reached into her bag and took out an item. “Big brother Zu, my father acquired the items you requested from me.” She took out a small bottle that quickly enlarged into a vat.","Zu An was startled. “This is...?”","Isabella blushed furiously. She waved away her miscellaneous thoughts and explained, “This is the Agate of Enlightenment. My father has gathered all the stock we have. Let me know if it’s not enough. I’ll tell my father to find more.”","Zu An opened the vat and saw a pristine fluid resembling jade that emanated a familiar ki. He was overjoyed. “Yes, this is the Agate of Enlightenment! It’s enough!”","As expected of the Universal Conglomerate. I only managed to find a small bottle despite my best efforts, but they actually found an entire vat of it. This is enough for Mi Li to reconstruct her body. The previous amount was only enough to make her a loli body, but now, she can have any cup she wants!","Unless she wants to be a titan, anyway.","Isabella exhaled in relief after seeing his joy. She knew that big brother Zu harbored some gripes against her father, so she wanted to alleviate the tensions between them. She continued, “Our Conglomerate doesn’t have any One Life Water, but my father managed to dig up some information about it.”","“I’m truly grateful to uncle!”","Zu An thought to himself that Aragorn was a scheming man. The latter had pulled the rug out from under his long-time brothers, though his brothers weren’t any better either. However, Aragorn hadn’t done anything detrimental to him, and had even done him a huge favor this time. It was enough to resolve any gripes he had.","“The One Life Water is the mother of all water, the origin of creation. It’s rumored to be in the Great Yin Ruins.” Isabella relayed her father’s words to Zu An. In truth, her father had advised her against revealing this piece of information so she could use it as leverage for Zu An to stay a bit longer. However, she didn’t want to play such tricks.","“Where are the Great Yin Ruins?”","Isabella shook her head. “This is the only piece of information my father obtained despite tapping into the Conglomerate’s resources. No one knows where the Great Yin Ruins are. We only know that they don’t exist in the mortal plane. The entrance only manifests at a specific time, when the night moon is projected on the deep ocean at the convergence point of extreme yin.”","Zu An frowned. Where am I supposed to start searching?","Isabella was apologetic. “Big brother Zu, we’ll continue looking into it. I’ll inform you as soon as we have any news.”","Zu An patted her head to comfort her. “Bella, you've already helped me a lot. At least I have a lead to work with now.” She’s a kind woman. She has no temper despite being one of the loftiest scions in the Myriad Worlds.","Now that he knew about the Great Yin Ruins, he could ask the Deity of Memory about its whereabouts. She records all information in the world. No recorded information eludes her knowledge.","As soon as that thought surfaced, his surroundings suddenly distorted. The next moment, he was transported into a unique dimension filled with flowing data.","“So you did see me. Tell me, should I dig out your eyes?” the Deity of Memory asked coldly."]},{"number":2934,"title":"Chapter 2934: Chapter 2886: A Method to Return to the Past","paragraphs":["Sweat rained down Zu An’s face. He hadn’t expected her to be listening to his thoughts. He hurriedly put a halt to his train of thought and respectfully apologized, “I was only able to glimpse at your radiance thanks to the great Eye of Truth you have bestowed upon me. It’d be my greatest honor if you permitted me a look at your complete divine vestige.”","“...Is that how you speak to Mi Li too?”","Zu An obediently kept his silence. He didn't dare to speak ill of Mi Li behind her back. It would also be blasphemy if he complimented another deity at a time like this, though he was probably the farthest thing in the world from a faithful worshiper.","“Enough. I’ll overlook your offense in view of your outstanding performance in the Order Ceremony.” The digits flickered.","“Your magnanimity overwhelms me, Deity of Memory.” Zu An took this chance to probe, “You seem to dislike the Deity of Annihilation as well, no?”","“I don’t like or dislike anyone. I am a faithful recorder of the Myriad Worlds. I don’t involve myself in the conflicts of other universal deities.”","“Last time, the great Deity of Memory clashed with the Deity of Annihilation in order to protect me. I am moved by your utmost compassion...” Zu An blabbed a ton of fawning words, though they did reflect how he truly felt.","The Mirror Scribes’ lack of presence signaled the style of the Memory path. They recorded events from the shadows and avoided contact with others, lest they cause ripples in history. But the Deity of Memory had overlooked his tampering with history and even clashed with Annihilation for his sake...","“Hmph. Even if I turned a blind eye to your plight, Mi Li would have protected you.” the Deity of Memory sneered, though she didn’t sound truly angry. Zu An’s bootlicking had worked.","Zu An wisely steered the conversation somewhere else. “O great Deity of Memory, wouldn’t Memory lose its significance if Annihilation destroyed everything and plunged the Myriad Worlds into stillness?”","A long silence awaited him. His heart skipped a beat. He was worried that his words were blasphemous.","Finally, the Deity of Memory replied, “Every universal deity has their own way of dealing with what’s to come. I’ll only know if my way works when the time comes.”","Zu An was surprised. “Is there something that even universal deities are unable to resolve?”","“It's not something you should concern yourself with,” the Deity of Memory replied coldly.","Zu An had wanted to ask about Order’s and Reproduction’s fates, but the frigidity in her voice made him swallow his words and he asked something else instead. “My two friends, Xie Daoyun and Suolun Shi, bask in Memory’s radiance as well. May I know how they're faring?”","The digits twinkled. “They're talented. They're undergoing their respective trials now.”","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. It was enough for him to know that they were safe.","“They're all beautiful ladies. I think you’re more suited for Bliss and Desire.”","Zu An exclaimed in horror, “My loyalty lies with Memory!”","“You’re beating around the bush. You’re hesitant to ask about the method to travel across spacetime.”","Zu An’s heart shuddered. He quickly bowed. “I can’t hide anything from you.”","“Hand me the Nature Jade.”","Zu An carefully passed over the Nature Jade, which had turned into a stone. Light descended upon it and imbued it with a luster that flowed across its surface. It grew pristine and translucent, reverting to its original form.","Zu An was overjoyed. “The spirit of the past is eternally inscribed in flowing scrolls. I thank the revered Deity of Memory for bestowing me with everlasting Memory.”","The Deity of Memory continued, “This Nature Jade will allow you to travel across spacetime into the worlds you seek three times, but be warned that you may bring calamity upon yourself if you carelessly tamper with history.”","“I understand.” Zu An knew that this was Memory’s principle. His goal was only to visit the Goddess of Wu Mountain and the ancient Mermaid Queen. He wouldn’t interfere with anything else.","Sensing that the Deity of Memory was leaving, he hurriedly asked, “O great Deity of Memory, pardon my insolence, but may I ask about the location of the Great Yin Ruins?”","“Why are you looking for the Great Yin Ruins?” Meng sounded intrigued.","“I am seeking an ingredient. My investigation led me to the Great Yin Ruins,” Zu An replied carefully.","Meng was momentarily silent before replying, “You may run into them during your journey, but it’ll be up to fate.”","She vanished after leaving those words behind, leaving no room for Zu An to pose follow-up questions. He first confirmed that the Deity of Memory was truly gone before quickly accessing the Keyboard system and switching his title from ‘Love Sage’ to ‘Heaven Plunderer’. That would make him less vulnerable to universal deities from now on.","He had been too caught up with his conversation with Chu Chuyan and Isabella, to the point that he'd overlooked that. But when he thought about the Nature Jade and the lead to the Great Yin Ruins, his spirit immediately lifted.","Noticing Zu An’s irrepressible smile, Isabella asked, “What’s wrong, big brother Zu?”","“I just received an audience from the Deity of Memory and resolved a problem that has bothered me for a long time,” Zu An shared his joy.","“Congratulations, big brother Zu!” Isabella exclaimed. “You must be a blessed individual. Most people go about their lives without meeting a universal deity, but you're frequently granted audiences with them.”","“I wouldn’t have been able to meet the kind and adorable Bella if I wasn’t blessed.” Zu An felt more relaxed than before.","“Big brother Zu~” Isabella was embarrassed by his teasing.","Zu An gently embraced her. He felt as if he was about to explode from bliss.","Isabella felt nervous. If he takes things further, should I remain demure or let him act as he pleases?","But she soon realized that he had no such intention and breathed a sigh of relief. I was thinking too much. A gentleman like big brother Zu wouldn’t... It would be much better if we can do it after our official marriage.","The thought of that made her face turn completely red. She adjusted her body to snuggle in a more comfortable position against his chest. Just like that, the two of them cuddled on the sofa while looking at the starry sky outside. Sweet nothings flowed between them.","...","At midnight, Chu Chuyan snuck into Zu An’s room, hoping to see something exciting. She still vividly remembered how Isabella had walked in on them in the spaceship; it had made her so awkward that she considered burying herself on the spot.","But it turned out that the two had fallen asleep like that on the sofa! She felt both amused and maddened. When did Ah Zu become such a pure-hearted individual? But looking at Isabella’s sweet smile, she could see why he was hesitant to do anything to her. She placed a blanket over them before quietly leaving.","The following day, Isabella woke up in Zu An’s arms and felt a rush of embarrassment. She ignored Zu An’s invitation for breakfast and darted off. Along the way, she couldn’t help but notice unusual smiles on familiar faces. Even her maids were looking at her with gossipy eyes.","Zu An went straight to Aragorn to ask for Isabella’s hand in marriage.","Aragorn was rendered speechless. He'd wanted to use this matter as a bargaining chip against Zu An, only to learn that his daughter had spent the night in Zu An’s room. Word had already spread in the Conglomerate. To protect his daughter’s reputation, he had no choice but to agree to the wedding. Haa. No wonder they say daughters can’t be counted on.","After settling his marriage with Isabella, Zu An informed Chu Chuyan about his upcoming expedition into the Celestial Court world. Chu Chuyan was both astonished and happy for him. She wanted to accompany him. However, Zu An turned her down. As this matter involved traveling across spacetime, there was a risk that he could lose her there if a lapse occurred. That would become the greatest regret of his life, even if he rescued the other two.","Chu Chuyan weighed the pros and cons and didn’t insist on her stance. She was planning to return to the Cultivation World, but Isabella invited her to stay at the Conglomerate. In view of Isabella’s insistence and that it would be easier for her to raise her cultivation here, she decided to stay.","After settling everything, Zu An excitedly activated the Nature Jade. Yaoji, Suyin, I’m coming to get the two of you!"]},{"number":2935,"title":"Chapter 2935: Chapter 2887: A Man Doesn’t Cry Easily","paragraphs":["When he first obtained the Nature Jade last night, Zu An had been tempted to return to the Celestial Court world right away to look for the Goddess of Wu Mountain and the ancient Mermaid Queen, but he hadn’t wanted to upset Isabella. He couldn’t neglect his new lover for his old lovers.","So, he settled their marriage first and bade the two ladies farewell before activating the Nature Jade. Space rippled, and he vanished into thin air.","As she witnessed the disappearance of her lover, Isabella felt a profound sense of loss. She turned to Chu Chuyan and said, “Big sister Chu, big brother Zu must truly love those two ladies.”","Noticing her reddened eyes, Chu Chuyan wrapped her hand around her shoulder and said, “He’s a sentimental man. I have no doubt he’d go into a frenzy to save you if you went missing.”","Isabella bit her lips. She thought about the two precarious situations she'd been in, and how Zu An had saved her against all odds. “Big sister Chu, has big brother Zu gone to such lengths to rescue you before?”","Chu Chuyan’s pupils narrowed as she recalled the past. “Of course. He put everything on the line for my sake...”","“Can you share the story with me?” Isabella looked at her.","Chu Chuyan blushed. This request put her in a tight spot. She felt embarrassed sharing her stories with Isabella.","But Isabella grabbed her arm and insisted, “Big sister Chu, won’t you share your stories with me? I really want to know.”","She was so adorable that Chu Chuyan was reminded of her two sisters. Her heart softened, and she nodded.","Isabella was overjoyed. “You’re the best, big sister Chu!”","At the same time, she resolved herself to dig up stories about Zu An’s relationship with the Goddess of Wu Mountain and the ancient Mermaid Queen from Chu Chuyan.","No, it’s not just them. I should learn more about my other sisters as well. I want to know everything about big brother Zu.","...","Zu An was dazed. Within a second, he was transported from the Universal Conglomerate to the abyss near Feather Mountain. The familiar terrain filled him with joy. Yes, this familiar sensation of rich ki. I've finally returned to the Celestial Court world!","He hurriedly made his way toward the Wu Mountain from his memories. He had been here twice. His deep yearning for the Goddess of Wu Mountain made him extremely familiar with the path.","He noticed there were more ferocious beasts than normal along the way, but he paid them no mind. With the strength he wielded, these ferocious beasts were no different from pets to him. Even the Taowu, which he had nearly died to back then, couldn’t pose a threat to his current self.","And indeed, the beasts fearfully prostrated themselves upon sensing his aura. They dared not provoke him, lest it bring disaster to them. Zu An was in such a good mood that even the beasts looked adorable. He didn’t mind sparing their lives.","Soon, he arrived at Wu Mountain. His heart beat uncontrollably as he looked at the mountain shrouded in clouds. Hm? Why don’t I see Goddess Peak?","With a single step, he flashed toward the cavern’s entrance. “Yaoji, I'm back...” His voice quivered. The Goddess of Wu Mountain had waited tens of thousands of years for him, only to morph into Goddess Peak out of despair at the very end. He was determined not to let the tragedy repeat itself.","But he suddenly stiffened up. He noticed that the cavern was no longer there. He thought that he had gone to the wrong place, so he quickly searched the area. The more he looked around, the colder his heart felt. No, it’s not here at all!","His divine sense was more than enough to envelop the entirety of Wu Mountain, but neither the cavern nor Yaoji were anywhere to be found. Did I come too late again?","He quickly refuted that conjecture. The Goddess of Wu Mountain had left a projection for him in the present world. That proved that she had survived.","A terrifying thought arose in his heart, causing his body to turn ice-cold.","“Ten Shamans of Spirit Mountain, come out to meet me!” Zu An roared. His voice boomed through the mountain range with a hundred thousand kilometer radius. He wanted to know what had happened.","Several people flew over from all directions. They trembled in fear as they rushed over and kowtowed to him, uttering words that heralded him as their god.","These people weren’t mortals. How could they be ordinary mortals when they lived on a spirit mountain that was overflowing with ki? They were easily top-notch experts in the Cultivation World, but after sensing Zu An’s aura, none of them dared to step out of line.","Zu An was perplexed. They are indeed shamans, but they aren’t the Ten Shamans of Spirit Mountain whom I knew.","He asked some questions, and the shamans respectfully answered them. None of them had ever heard about the Ten Shamans of Spirit Mountain, and they had never met the Goddess of Wu Mountain, either. In fact, they insisted that the Wu Mountain had never had a goddess.","“How is this possible? How is this possible?!” Zu An panicked.","He suddenly raised his head and looked at the moon. Other things can change, but there’s no way the Frost Palace could have disappeared. Its existence predates even the Celestial Court. So, he flew toward heaven and soon vanished.","The shamans residing on the spirit mountain kowtowed to Zu An. They sensed not just his tremendous strength, but his pure shaman bloodline as well. They wondered where this lofty god had come from.","Zu An soon arrived on the moon. Only when he saw the Frost Palace did his furiously beating heart finally calm down a little. He'd been afraid that he would see nothing on the moon, just like what happened when he flew to the moon in the present day. Since the Frost Palace was still here, it meant that heaven and earth hadn’t been severed from each other yet.","“Suyin...” Zu An dared not to speak out loud, fearing that the earlier situation would repeat itself.","It was just a few hundred meters, a distance he could cover in an instant, but it felt longer than traveling between the corners of the world. He hesitated, but he knew that this was something he had to eventually confront. He mustered his courage and walked toward the Frost Palace. He called out with a quivering voice, “Suyin...”","A miracle didn’t happen. There was no response.","Zu An flew into the sky to inspect the Frost Palace from above. It was cold inside, and there was no sign of life whatsoever.","Gong Suyin was bound to the Frost Palace; she couldn’t stray too long away from it. Even if she had temporarily left, she should have returned by now. Clearly, she wasn’t here.","Why? This is the Celestial Court world, so why can’t I find the Goddess of Wu Mountain and Gong Suyin?","“Suyin, where are you?” Zu An sat on the steps of the Frost Palace. He felt like he had plummeted from heaven into hell. It had taken him so much trouble to return here, but he still couldn’t reunite with them.","Sorrow surged from his heart. He curled into a ball and wailed.","Some time later, a contemptuous voice echoed from the side. “Tsk tsk tsk. Don’t you find it embarrassing for a grown man like you to be sobbing like a child here?”"]},{"number":2936,"title":"Chapter 2936: Chapter 2888: An Unexpected Reunion","paragraphs":["Zu An’s body shuddered as he lifted his head in disbelief. The voice was extremely familiar to him—Xihe!","Standing before him was a radiant woman who naturally commanded attention. Flames flickered in her vicinity.","“Xihe!” Zu An was surprised and overjoyed. He had been in despair after failing to find the Goddess of Wu Mountain and Gong Suyin, but who could have thought that he would meet Xihe in this world instead?","He rushed forward and embraced her tightly. “It’s wonderful to see you again!”","Xihe had been looking at him with a mocking smile, only to freeze up at his embrace. The other party had moved so quickly that she couldn’t dodge him at all.","Before Zu An could reminisce about the past with her, he suddenly felt the woman in his arms becoming extraordinarily scalding, almost as if he was hugging a sun.","Boom!","Xihe roared with a reddened face, “You thug! You must have a death wish!”","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +777... +777... +777...","As she tossed out a barrage of miniature suns at Zu An, Xihe emanated a radiant light. Each of them wielded the destructive might of a meteor.","Zu An was startled. He dodged the suns while shouting, “What are you doing, Xihe? It’s me!”","“You thug! How do you know my name?” Xihe clenched her teeth in anger. She showed no inclination to stop her attacks at all. Who is this fellow? Why don't my attacks work on him?","Her fury told Zu An that something was amiss. Upon careful inspection, he realized that even though she was Xihe, her usual air of maturity was replaced with vibrant youthfulness.","“The current you still hasn’t met me yet!” Zu An suddenly burst into laughter. The stifled sensation he felt in his heart from failing to find the Goddess of Wu Mountain and Gong Suyin cleared in an instant.","There must have been a temporal deviation during my transmigration.","The current Gong Suyin hasn’t transmigrated into this world yet, and the Goddess of Wu Mountain hasn’t descended to Wu Mountain yet. That explains why I wasn’t able to find them.","Zu An’s sudden laughter made Xihe frown. “Are you insane?”","Her failure to land her attacks on Zu An only made her angrier, so she charged in and unleashed a series of lethal blows on him. It looked as if her attack was finally going to land on the other party, but for some reason, her palm passed through his body instead.","“Instantaneous movement? No...” Xihe’s heart clenched in shock.","She was about to turn around and continue her attack when the silhouette in front of her suddenly raised his hand and grabbed her wrists. Then, he circled behind her and held her hands firmly behind her back. With that, she was locked in place. She couldn’t break free no matter how she struggled.","She felt astounded and humiliated. An intense flame burst forth from her body. This was the True Solar Flame, a power capable of incinerating the world into ashes. However, Zu An’s body was like a black hole. He continuously absorbed the True Solar Flame, nullifying her attack.","“What kind of sorcery is that?” Xihe roared in shock.","Zu An had first used Primordial Mirage to turn his body ethereal, causing Xihe’s attack to pass through him instead. Then, he used the Taotie’s Heaven-Devouring Sutra to absorb her True Solar Flame. No matter how formidable a sun was, it was no match for a black hole.","Zu An’s head hurt. The current Xihe hadn’t met him yet, so he didn’t know how to explain the situation to her. He asked, “How old are you now?”","Xihe was momentarily stunned before she sneered, “Don’t you think it’s impolite to ask a woman for her age?”","“Let me switch up the question. How many children do you have?” In truth, Zu An also had no idea how old Xihe was when he first met her in the Celestial Court world.","That question infuriated Xihe. “I’m not even married yet! How would I have any children?”","“You aren’t married yet?” It was Zu An’s turn to be shocked. He had already guessed that he'd transmigrated further into the past, but he didn’t expect to go so far back.","“I shall have you know that my fiance is the renowned Emperor Jun, and that makes me the future Celestial Empress. I advise you to release me right now, or else you’ll die a tragic death!” Xihe struggled, but she was unable to struggle free of Zu An’s grasp. If anything, it felt as if she was only rubbing her body against Zu An’s body, which made her feel uncomfortable.","“You aren’t married to Emperor Jun yet?” Zu An was stunned.","“We might not be married yet, but we have already announced our engagement to the world!” Xihe spat in anger. “Who are you? Why don’t you know such common knowledge?”","Zu An looked at her with a bizarre glint in his eye. “Would you believe me if I said that I’m your future lover?”","Xihe was stumped, but then her face warped in fury. “You bastard! How dare you take advantage of me?!”","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +444... +444... +444...","Looking at her reddened face and sensing her surging body temperature, Zu An could tell that she was preparing a powerful move. He hurriedly advised her against it. “Don’t do anything rash that might hurt yourself. I’ll release you right now, but let’s have a proper chat.”","He freed her hands.","Xihe stared at Zu An in disbelief. He’s letting me go just like that?","She hurriedly summoned her golden carriage, leaped onto it, and fled into the horizon. That fellow is too strong. I’m no match for him. I should first escape from him before deciding on my next move.","This carriage was her artifact, and it was capable of moving at incredible speeds. In recent years, she had grown fond of traveling around the world using it. There was hardly anyone in the world who could catch up with her.","But then, she suddenly saw a flash of seven-colored light, and before she knew it, another person had appeared beside her. Who else could it be other than that bizarre man?","She was horrified. She was about to attack him, but Zu An looked at the carriage in nostalgia and murmured, “I can’t remember how many times I've ridden on this carriage now.”","For some reason, his wistful tone inexplicably convinced Xihe to stop her attack. “That’s impossible. I've never allowed anyone to board my carriage before.”","Zu An didn’t bother arguing with her. He looked at her calmly and remarked, “Your personality remains the same as ever—no, I should say that the current you is much happier.”","Xihe snorted, “What nonsense are you spouting? Your very existence brings me unhappiness!”","Zu An laughed, not bothering to explain himself.","The future her would suffer the pain of losing her child. She'd try to change that fate, only to realize that her efforts were in vain. There were times when she displayed happiness, but on the whole, she gave off an air of heaviness.","Zu An’s smile left Xihe dazed. She didn’t sense any malicious intent from him, so she didn’t feel an urgent need to escape from him anymore.","This could be Heaven Plunderer’s effect—it made it easier for him to win goodwill from hostile women!","“Is this how you usually deceive other women?” Xihe blurted out.","“I’m not deceiving you. I really am your future lover.” Zu An spent a moment in thought before continuing, “You have a red mole under your right breast; your ears are sensitive, and so is the back of your waist...”","“Stop!” Xihe’s face had turned completely red.","—","Translator’s Note:","In case advanced readers see it,","Dijun > Emperor Jun (for standardization with all previous chapters)"]},{"number":2937,"title":"Chapter 2937: Chapter 2889: Altering History","paragraphs":["Xihe stared at Zu An in shock. These were the most intimate aspects of her that no one else should have known about. Is he really my future lover?","She shuddered as soon as that thought popped up. “Impossible. I will become the wife of the Celestial Emperor, so how can I possibly have any ties with you? Are you insinuating that I will cheat in the future?”","Zu An’s head hurt. He had no idea how to explain the situation. “Our feelings developed naturally. It is nowhere as underhanded as you think.”","“Why don’t you tell me how we met and how we got together?” Xihe, as the Sun Goddess, naturally banished the cold with her warmth, but cold was slowly rising from the bottom of her heart at this very moment.","“I can’t elaborate on the details; it might affect the future.” Zu An shook his head. Besides, the two of them had met because of the Ten Suns Incident. There was no need to make Xihe worry about the future.","Xihe sneered, “You want me to believe you when you aren’t able to tell me any details at all?”","“Didn’t I just provide the evidence?” Zu An’s head hurt. He had no idea how else he could prove himself.","Xihe’s face reddened. “Who knows if you've secretly seen me bathing or found out through other means?”","“Is there anyone in the world who can peep on you bathing without you realizing it? Besides, your sensitive spots can’t be uncovered just by peeping on you,” Zu An huffed.","Xihe was speechless. That man’s words are annoying, but they make sense. But it’s impossible for him to be my future lover!","Zu An pondered a while more before divulging more of her little secrets. These were the things she had told him on her own accord in the future. By this point, Xihe had no choice but to take his words seriously.","“Are you really from the future?” Xihe was stunned. In truth, she didn’t want to marry Emperor Jun. Was that the reason she got together with this man in the future?","Zu An nodded.","“I didn’t expect space-time travel to be possible.” Xihe was intrigued. “What are you doing here? Why were you crying your eyes out in the Frost Palace?”","Zu An’s face reddened. “I didn’t cry!”","“Fine, fine, fine, you didn’t cry.” Xihe smirked. Despite being so strong, he has a surprisingly fragile heart.","“I came here to look for two friends, but I couldn’t find them,” Zu An said. Melancholy began creeping up his heart once more.","“Are they women?” Xihe glanced at him.","“Yes.”","“Hmph! You claim to be my future lover, but you came here not to look for me but other women?” Xihe gritted her teeth in anger. Did I really get together with such a fellow in the future?","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +233... +233... +233...","Zu An felt a little awkward. He told her the truth, “Our relationship was complicated. We were enemies yet allies at the same time—it’s hard to say that we were truly a couple. I’m really glad to be able to meet you like that.”","Xihe was silent. She understood the subtext of his words. It seems like we have quite the tense relationship.","“Who are you looking for? Is it related to the Frost Palace?” she asked with a stern face. “But no one has ever resided here.”","“I don’t think she’s in this world yet.” Zu An figured that the ancient Mermaid Queen was still at another point in spacetime at the moment, though it was also possible that she wasn’t born yet.","“That person became the master of the Frost Palace in the future?” Xihe was surprised. “Countless experts have tried to move into the Frost Palace but to no avail. Its divine marks have even killed quite a few experts. Since then, no one has dared to covet it anymore.”","Zu An had personally experienced the prowess of the Frost Palace’s divine marks. “Trust me, moving into the Frost Palace is nothing good. It's an eternal prison.”","Xihe’s expression changed subtly. Zu An’s words might be vague, but it revealed quite a few things. Luckily, I was never interested in the Frost Palace. “What about the other woman? Who is she?”","Zu An widened his eyes.","Gong Suyin might not be in this world now, but the Goddess of Wu Mountain could be here. Yaoji is the daughter of the Flame Emperor, so she might have been born not too much later than Xihe. It could be that she just hasn’t become the Goddess of Wu Mountain yet.","“Her name is Yaoji. She’s the Flame Emperor’s youngest daughter. Do you know her?” Zu An looked at Xihe with expectant eyes.","Xihe frowned. “The Flame Emperor?”","“What’s wrong?” Zu An sensed the hostility in her words.","“He’s our enemy!” Xihe spat coldly.","“Enemy?” Zu An was confused. “The Flame Emperor was the second Celestial Emperor, right? That should make him Emperor Jun’s elder. Why is he your enemy?”","“What elder?” Xihe spat. “He’s just an evil god from some foreign world. His succession is unorthodox!”","“Evil god?” Zu An blinked. Something feels off.","Xihe also noticed the peculiarity in Zu An’s response, so she asked, “You've never been in this era before, right? What happened in the history you know?”","Zu An pondered for a moment before replying, “My knowledge about the Celestial World is limited, but the first Celestial Emperor should have been the Azure Emperor.","“The Azure Emperor had two sons, Shennong and Xuanyuan. Shennong inherited the throne and became the second Celestial Emperor, and he became known as the Flame Emperor.","“Later, Xuanyuan defeated Shennong and took his place as the third Celestial Emperor.","“The fourth Celestial Emperor was the son of the Yellow Emperor, and was known as the White Emperor.","“The White Emperor then passed down his throne to his nephew, the Black Emperor Zhuanxu, who became the fifth Celestial Emperor.”","“The next one to take the throne after him was Emperor Jun.\"","Zu An pondered for a moment before asking, “Who is the current Celestial Emperor?”","“That’s an utter load of bull! There’s only one Celestial Emperor in the world—Emperor Jun!” Xihe was irritated. “All the talk about a Yellow Emperor and Flame Emperor are just nicknames that the barbarians came up with.”","Zu An was astounded. That doesn’t align with history. Did I not transmigrate into the Celestial Court world that I know about? But the woman in front of me is Xihe. Her looks, disposition, and even her subtle gestures are those of the Sun Goddess I know.","Xihe thought about another possibility and murmured, “Could it be that we fell into defeat, allowing them to alter history...”","Zu An, as a Time Scribe, knew that was very plausible. Emperor Jun could have concealed the true history and lauded himself as the only orthodox Celestial Emperor.","But that doesn’t make sense. Emperor Jun came up with an apocalypse formation in the end. If that history is fake, why would that Emperor Jun even exist in the first place?","Countless guesses surfaced in Zu An’s head. He said, “You’re Emperor Jun’s spouse. Where is he right now? Bring me to him.”","He hadn't been a match for Emperor Jun before, but things had changed now.","“What do you mean by spouse? We’re merely engaged!” Xihe was a little embarrassed. “I can’t bring you to him. I abandoned the wedding ceremony.”","Zu An was stunned."]},{"number":2938,"title":"Chapter 2938: Chapter 2890: Capture","paragraphs":["“You ran away?” Zu An was confused. “Emperor Jun is the Celestial Emperor. Why are you running away from him?”","“Hmph! Do I have to fancy him just because he’s the Celestial Emperor?” Xihe snorted. “He’s just a lustful old man. Despite being the Celestial Emperor, that fellow has no dignity. He goes around flirting with women. Who knows how many women and children he has to date?","“The Lower Realm’s Zhongrong Country, Siyou Country, Baimin Country, Heichi Country... Those are all made up of his offspring. Why would I like a bastard who goes around sowing seeds?”","Zu An was speechless. I thought I was a philanderer, but Emperor Jun sowed entire nations. In comparison, I think I’m pretty pure-hearted. He’d have been perfect for the Reproduction path.","“Why did you get engaged to him in the first place?”","“Did you think I wanted to? He’s the Celestial Emperor. If he points his finger at a woman, even if the woman doesn’t want it, her clan will wrap her up and deliver her to him,” Xihe replied with a stifled voice.","Zu An frowned. “Your clansmen aren’t anything good. They’re sacrificing your happiness for their selfish motives.”","“They aren’t the worst,” Xihe replied. “They already rejected several advances from Emperor Jun on my behalf, but this time, Emperor Jun is offering to wed me as his lawful wife. There aren’t many people in the world who could resist such an offer.”","Zu An could understand that. Emperor Jun was a philanderer, but most of the women he bedded were merely for fun; he had never officially wedded any of them. His wife was destined to become the Celestial Empress, and that position came with huge benefits.","“All women in the world must be jealous of you, but you escaped from the ceremony.” Zu An was awed.","“I don’t want to marry just for the Celestial Empress’ position. My man must be an upstanding hero whom I like and admire from the bottom of my heart...” Xihe said with glimmering eyes, only to turn to Zu An and become deflated. “But I ended up with a fellow like you. Was the future me out of her mind?” This fellow is handsome, but he’s far from the radiant person I envisioned.","Zu An said, “...Love comes without rhyme or reason. Often, feelings are born out of nowhere and deepen before you realize them...”","He was reminded of the notes Chu Chuyan had left on her romance novels. Back then, he'd cringed at them, but some of their words struck a chord in him now.","“Pui. Stop pretending to be a love sage when you’re a philanderer as well.” Xihe clutched her forehead. She didn’t like Emperor Jun because of his philandering ways, but to think the man she fancied in the future would be the same as well. It felt as if she had desperately struggled, only to end up at square one... or even worse, since Emperor Jun was at least the Celestial Emperor.","Zu An wasn’t in the mood to debate with her. “Since it’s inconvenient for you to bring me to Emperor Jun, I’ll look for the Flame Emperor first.”","Gong Suyin might not be in this world yet, so I’ll look for Yaoji first.","Upon hearing that he was about to leave, Xihe panicked. “You’re leaving just like that?”","Zu An was stunned. “Do you want to tag along?”","“Pui!” Xihe clenched her jaws. This man wants me to accompany him in looking for his lovers? Does he have no shame?","“I guess we’ll have to part ways here then.” Zu An was anxious to look for Yaoji to verify some matters. He could then use the Nature Jade to transmigrate to the right moment in spacetime, so he wouldn’t have to waste his time here.","Watching as Zu An’s silhouette vanished into the distance, Xihe was first stunned before melancholy seeped through her being. Is that man really my future lover? That man knew so many of her personal secrets that she felt that there was some credibility to his words.","Despite her curt attitude, she was actually curious about him and wanted to know more about him. She hadn’t expected him to pay so little heed to her and leave just like that. Of course, she could tell that his feelings for the so-called Goddess of Wu Mountain were far deeper than for her. The notion that she would fall in love with a man with little concern for her filled her with profound sorrow. She had fled from a marriage with the Celestial Emperor in search of true love, only to end up with a man who hardly loved her. What’s the point of my struggling? I might as well just marry Emperor Jun...","Her eyes became wet. Tears fell from her cheeks like meteors, inducing volcanic eruptions below, but she was completely oblivious to that.","Moments later, someone shouted, “Xihe is here!”","Celestial guards riding on clouds swiftly surrounded Xihe. The devastation caused by her tears carried the aura of the Sun Goddess, so they quickly rushed over to capture her.","Xihe dried her tears before facing the celestial guards with a cold expression. “You came faster than I expected.”","How could one escape from a marriage with the Celestial Emperor so easily? It seems my actions have enraged Emperor Jun.","A nine-headed celestial general roared, “Xihe, where did you hide the Celestial Emperor?”","The other party was one of Emperor Jun’s Ten Fiend Generals—the Nine-Headed Bird, Guiche.","Xihe was stunned by the question. “I only fled from the marriage. What does that have to do with anything?”","“The Celestial Emperor disappeared right after you left. How can there be such a coincidence in the world?” Guiche scoffed.","Xihe’s face darkened. “How can anyone have the power to interfere with the almighty Celestial Emperor? Stop trying to frame me here!”","“Refusing to confess? Capture this demoness first! We’ll have her judged by the celestial gods!” Guiche waved its hand, and the celestial guards quickly encircled her.","Xihe sneered, “It just so happens I’m in a bad mood.”","The light around her suddenly intensified. Waves of searing flames rippled from her into the surroundings, forcing the celestial guards to anxiously retreat amid cries of agony.","Seeing that, Guiche didn’t dare to let its guard down. It revealed its true form, a gigantic nine-headed bird that engulfed the sky. Its heads screamed at Xihe, unleashing invisible sonic waves into the surroundings.","Xihe felt her mind suddenly becoming dull. She thought her soul was going to be jolted out of her body. In the meantime, countless Immortal Binding Ropes wrapped around her, binding her firmly in place.","Guiche specialized in soul attacks, and it was known for feasting on human souls. It sucked in many souls each time it opened its mouth. Xihe was powerful, but its ability curbed her. She was at a disadvantage against it.","Even so, due to her identity, Guiche didn’t dare hurt her. It captured her and ordered, “Bring her back to undergo divine retribution. She’ll speak the truth in due time.”","When Xihe first escaped from her marriage, she had been extremely scared of being captured and taken back. Yet, at this instant, she realized that she was nowhere as afraid as she thought she would be. Instead, her heart felt dead.","That fellow has left me anyway. I’m destined not to find love in my lifetime. I should just accept my position as the Celestial Empress.","I wonder if he’ll ever regret this decision when he learns about it in the future. Maybe not...","Just then, she heard a familiar voice. “Haa, why are you so careless?”"]},{"number":2939,"title":"Chapter 2939: Chapter 2891: Firecloud Cave","paragraphs":["Xihe turned around in astonishment and joy. The person who had just spoken was wearing a mask, but she still recognized him as the man whom she had just met.","“I thought you'd left?” Xihe put on a stern face and harrumphed coldly.","“I couldn’t help worrying about you, so I came back to take a look.” Zu An had indeed left earlier, but when he sensed her teardrops falling to the mortal world, it suddenly occurred to him that he was being too cruel to her.","They might have gotten together over a misunderstanding, but they had fallen in love, and he was on good terms with the future Shang Hongyu as well. So, he'd slowed his footsteps, only to sense powerful auras heading in Xihe’s direction. Worried that something was going to happen to her, he rushed back.","Guiche frowned. “Who are you?”","He wondered if Xihe had escaped from the marriage because of this man, but he didn’t dare to voice his thoughts aloud, as this conjecture would be an affront to the Celestial Emperor.","Zu An didn’t answer. Instead, he flashed over to Xihe’s side and swung the Slaughter Fang, severing the Immortal Binding Ropes. Xihe regained her freedom.","Guiche roared, “Audacious!”","You have successfully trolled Guiche for +444... +444... +444...","The celestial guards transformed into golden-armored giants and charged at Zu An.","“Be careful of Guiche’s soul siphoning ability!” Xihe warned. She was about to make her move as well when a streak of seven-colored light flashed past her eyes.","All the celestial guards, including Guiche, were spirited away by the divine light. When they finally reappeared, they crashed weakly to the ground. None could summon the strength to stand on their feet. They looked nowhere as imposing as they had been before.","Xihe blinked in surprise. She had known that Zu An was strong, but she hadn’t expected him to be this powerful.","Zu An didn’t want to interfere too much with anything here lest it affect the future, so he grabbed Xihe’s hand, morphed into a rainbow light, and fled. The celestial guards were too weak to chase after them.","It was only when they were finally somewhere safe that Zu An released his grip on her hand. “How can they treat you like that? You’re the future Celestial Empress!”","Guiche and the others had bound Xihe with Immortal Binding Ropes as if she was a criminal. Even if she had escaped from the marriage ceremony, there was no need to go to this extent.","“Who knows what's gotten into them? They say that Emperor Jun has gone missing, and they suspect that I’m the culprit.” Xihe was speechless. If she had the power to make the Celestial Emperor disappear, she wouldn’t have had to flee in the first place, let alone get captured by these people.","“Gone missing...” Zu An frowned. He knew Emperor Jun to be a powerful and scheming individual. Is he secretly plotting some apocalypse formation yet again?","“Regardless, I’m grateful for your help.” Xihe bowed to Zu An. Her expression looked gentler than before. “Why are you wearing this mask?”","“I’m from the future, after all. I’m worried that I’ll affect the past if someone sees my true face here,” Zu An replied.","Xihe nodded, though it was uncertain whether she truly understood his words. “I can see why the future me got together with you. It must be because of this encounter.”","Zu An was taken aback. He had been grieving at the Frost Palace and didn’t have the spare energy to think deeper into the situation. On top of that, Xihe’s arrival had been too abrupt. But Xihe’s words jolted something in him.","Xihe hadn’t known him when they first met. Their fates had only intertwined when he resorted to the Golden Phoenix’s ability in that desperate situation. That realization plunged his mind into chaos. He was both unsure and worried about what this mistake would have on the future.","“What’s wrong?” Xihe asked with concern upon sensing his unusual behavior.","“It’s nothing,” Zu An replied with a strained smile. He felt that something was amiss, but he couldn’t put his finger on it.","“You really aren’t an honest person.” Xihe put her hands on her hips. “I wonder why the future me fell in love with you.”","Zu An found her youthful demeanor rather fascinating. “That’s fate for you.”","“Forget it. Since you saved me, I’ll return the favor by helping you once. You’re looking for the Flame Emperor’s daughter, right? I’ll take you to her.” Xihe harrumphed.","Zu An was startled. “You know her?”","“I don’t, but I’m bound to be more familiar with this world than someone from the future.” Xihe had another intention in mind. She wanted to see what the woman who haunted Zu An’s mind looked like.","Those words made sense to Zu An. This was a massive world, and he had no idea where the Flame Emperor resided. “I’ll be troubling you.”","“How courteous of you. Didn’t you say that we’re a couple in the future?” Xihe rolled her eyes.","You do know that the future us have enjoyed intimacy at a negative distance. Just because we’re a thing in the future doesn’t mean it’s the same now, Zu An thought.","“What’s your name?” Xihe asked.","Zu An didn’t answer. Xihe frowned in displeasure. “You aren’t even going to tell me your name, my future lover?”","“I’m worried that it’ll affect the future.” Zu An felt distressed. He wondered if this world was truly in the same timeline as the Celestial Court world he knew.","“My knowledge of your name will change the future?” Xihe gnashed her teeth in annoyance. I feel like beating up this fellow. “I can’t be calling you husband, can I?”","Zu An chuckled. “I don’t mind you calling me that.”","Xihe was speechless.","Seeing that she was getting angry, Zu An acquiesced, “You can call me Ah Zu.”","“Ah Zu? Sounds terrible,” Xihe mumbled, though she jotted the name down in her mind.","“So, where is the Flame Emperor?” Zu An asked out of curiosity.","“He’s down south, but he’s only known as Shennong now. Emperor Jun is the only one worthy of the title of ‘emperor’.”","“I thought that Emperor Jun would have made a move on Shennong.”","“You’re right, but Shennong inherited the bloodlines of the Vermilion Bird and the Divine Ox, and he has joined forces with the Xuanyuan Dragon Clan. Emperor Jun is unable to do anything about them for the time being,” Xihe explained.","“Vermilion Bird...” No wonder he’s known as the Flame Emperor. The future Pei Mianman also specializes in flames. I guess it’s in their lineage.","“That Shennong is a farmer; I doubt his daughter will be beautiful. I’m skeptical about your taste,” Xihe remarked with a frown.","“She’s gorgeous.” Zu An chuckled. “She’s as beautiful as you.”","Xihe was initially displeased, but Zu An’s latter words brightened her mood. She continued probing along the way, leaving Zu An distressed about what he could and couldn’t talk about.","All of a sudden, Zu An noticed the scenery beneath. “Hm? Why are we flying toward the sea? Didn’t you say that Shennong resides in the south?”","“Shennong’s Firecloud Cave is located on a southern island,” Xihe casually replied.","Zu An jolted. “Firecloud Cave?”","He had once visited the Firecloud Cave while seeking a cure for the ancient Ocean races. There, he'd encountered a mysterious entity whom he still didn’t know the true identity of, even to this day."]},{"number":2940,"title":"Chapter 2940: Chapter 2892: Saving Her","paragraphs":["Xihe noticed the subtle change in his expression and asked, “What’s wrong?”","“It’s nothing,” Zu An replied with a forced smile. Let me first check out the situation.","“Tsk. Keeping secrets from me again.” Xihe was frustrated by his tendency to leave her hanging.","Using Rainbow Morph, it didn’t take long for the two of them to arrive at the seaside Purple Ganoderma Cliff. Looking at its oddly familiar environment left Zu An momentarily dazed.","“Let’s land first. Shennong is of considerable standing, and there are many people guarding him,” Xihe advised. If they strutted into the Firecloud Cave recklessly, they would risk a conflict.","“There’s no need for that.” Zu An shook his head. He grabbed Xihe and flashed right past the guards at the entrance.","Xihe was taken aback. This fellow is unfathomably powerful. I guess I have a good eye for people after all.","As the two of them made their way deeper into the Firecloud Cave, they couldn’t help but notice the grim faces around. There was an air of melancholy in the place. This perplexed them.","They had wanted to sneak into the Firecloud Cave, but the closer they got, the more people there were. It was as if everyone in this region was heading to it.","They pricked up their ears to eavesdrop on the conversations around them. Soon, they got a grasp of the situation, and Zu An’s face turned pale.","The people lamented the death of the Flame Emperor’s daughter in an accident, and they felt sorry for the Flame Emperor. It was not long ago that the Flame Emperor’s little daughter had drowned while playing in the sea, and now, even his second daughter had died prematurely as well. Tragedies just wouldn’t stop befalling the pitiful Flame Emperor.","Zu An felt the world shaking around him. Yaoji is dead?","Xihe hurriedly supported him and consoled him, “You need not be too upset. It might just be a misunderstanding. She must still be alive if you've met her in the future.”","Zu An felt like a drowning man grasping onto a straw of hope. Yes, I did reunite with Yaoji in the future.","Not daring to waste any time, he rushed right into the Firecloud Cave.","Some people noticed his anomalous movement and tried to stop him, but a flash of seven-colored light struck them with vertigo.","“Who dares to cause trouble in the Firecloud Cave?!” an authoritative voice roared. A brawny figure with a human body and two ox horns appeared in midair. He had a darkened face, a sign that he wasn’t in a good mood.","Xihe hurriedly informed Zu An, “He is Shennong.”","Had it been any other occasion, Zu An would have been excited and curious to meet the legendary ancestor of the human race. However, the earlier news had turned his body ice-cold, and he couldn’t even muster the courage to talk about Yaoji, fearing the answer he would hear.","Shennong noticed Xihe and asked, “Sun Goddess, shouldn’t you be marrying Emperor Jun now? Why are you causing trouble here?”","Xihe harrumphed. “Do you think I wanted to come? My friend has business with you. Call your daughter Yaoji out.”","Shennong’s face darkened. “You are indeed here to cause trouble!”","The others also cursed under their breath. You’re asking for Yaoji despite knowing she’s dead? How much more grievance do you want to cause the Flame Emperor?","Zu An nearly fainted upon hearing those words.","“Are you all right?” Xihe looked at him anxiously.","Zu An had weathered countless storms. He took a deep breath in an attempt to compose himself before asking shakily, “Is Yaoji really dead?”","Shennong finally looked at Zu An. That man appears to be close to Xihe. What’s his identity?","“Yes, Yaoji suddenly died a few days ago,” he replied with utmost grief.","“I wish to see her,” Zu An replied with the calmest voice he could muster. He wanted to confirm this matter.","Shennong frowned.","Xihe quickly interjected, “He is Yaoji’s friend. He wasn’t aware of her demise, which was why he reacted so strongly earlier. Please pardon him.”","She usually wouldn’t have spoken so politely to Shennong, but her heart ached when she saw how Zu An was trying his best to maintain his composure. She wanted to do something for him, and the last thing he would want was to get into a fight with Yaoji’s family.","Shennong’s astonishment deepened. I’ve never heard about Yaoji having such a friend.","But Xihe was of high stature. She had spoken sincerely to him, so it didn’t seem right to reject them coldly. So, Shennong said, “Since you’re Yaoji’s friend, follow me.”","He gestured for his subordinates to open a path with a wave of his hand before leading Zu An and Xihe into the Firecloud Cave.","Despite the name, the Firecloud Cave wasn't a cave but rather a blessed land. The area was extremely rich in ki, and it resembled a palace built on a mountain peak. Fiery-red clouds shrouded the area. That explained the name ‘Firecloud’.","But Zu An was in no mood to bother about these details. His eyes were fixed on the woman lying among the flowers. Despite her smaller stature and younger features, her appearance and disposition left no doubt that she was Yaoji.","Unable to hold himself back anymore, he lurched over and grabbed her hand. “Yaoji...”","He was still hoping for this to be a misunderstanding, but when he touched her and felt her lifeless body, all his hopes shattered.","Shennong’s face darkened. He was about to pull Zu An away when Xihe blocked him and asked, “How did Yaoji die?”","Shennong was taken aback by the sheer grief Zu An displayed. The latter seemed to be even more distraught than him. He replied, “Yaoji was born deficient; her body has always been weak and prone to illness. I have been looking for spirit medicine to nourish her body, but it was all to no avail. She eventually left my side a few days ago.”","“Deficient...” Zu An belatedly realized that the current Yaoji was much thinner than the Goddess of Wu Mountain he knew. Her face was pale, and her breasts were much smaller as well. Despite these differences, there was no question that she was Yaoji and not anyone else.","“Yaoji shouldn’t have died here. There must be a way to bring her back to life.” Zu An turned to Shennong. “I heard that you possess extraordinary medical skills. Do you know any way to save her?”","Shennong shook her head. “I have tried practically all spirit herbs in the world, but none was effective. The Queen Mother of the West does have a legendary immortal medicine that might work. I visited Kunlun Mountain a few days ago to request it, but she has already presented it to Emperor Jun.”","He glanced at Xihe before adding, “I am on bad terms with Emperor Jun. There’s no way he would give the immortal medicine to me.”","A thought surfaced in Zu An’s mind. “Leave the immortal medicine to me. Please protect Yaoji’s body in the meantime. Make sure no damage comes to it.”","“I am Shennong. This much is nothing to me,” Shennong replied with a frown. “The immortal medicine can grant not just my daughter, but anyone in the world, a new lease of life. There’s no way Emperor Jun will give us that.”","“Leave that to me. I have my ways,” Zu An said. He grabbed Xihe’s hand, and the two of them flashed out in a seven-colored light.","Along the way, Xihe said, “Don’t expect me to beg on your behalf. I've already gotten Emperor Jun’s bad side by escaping the marriage ceremony, but even if not for that, I doubt that he would give something that valuable to me.”","“Who says I’ll make you beg for it? I’ll march right into the Celestial Court and take it myself,” Zu An replied. A robe appeared around him as his appearance changed. He exuded a terrifying aura. “Return with me for our marriage.”","Xihe was stunned."]},{"number":2941,"title":"Chapter 2941: Chapter 2893: Marriage","paragraphs":["Xihe was shocked to see Zu An transform into Emperor Jun. For a moment there, she wondered if he was the real Emperor Jun, and if he had staged this farce in order to win her fancy. The so-called Goddess of Wu Mountain could also just be one of Emperor Jun’s women. And she had to concede that his strategy worked. She did feel something for him now.","“Are you really Emperor Jun?”","“Of course not. I’m not so bored as to create a new identity just to self-cuckold!” Zu An huffed.","Xihe also didn’t think that Emperor Jun would go this far for a woman. “How did you transform into him?”","Noticing her shock, Zu An reverted to his original appearance and replied, “I have an ability that allows me to transform into others.”","“How do you know what Emperor Jun looks like?”","“I've clashed with him in the future.”","Xihe’s eyes lit up. “Is it over me?”","Zu An pondered. “You could say so.”","“Who won?” Xihe’s eyes twinkled with curiosity.","“I wasn’t a match for him then, but I foiled his ploy.”","“Tsk. You’re just saying that to salvage your reputation.”","“The future you still chose me. Isn’t that a victory?”","Xihe blushed. “You must have misled me somehow...”","This was dangerous territory. She was still engaged to the Celestial Emperor. It was one thing for her to escape from the marriage ceremony, but it was another thing for her to get involved with another man.","She banished the miscellaneous thoughts in her mind and asked, “Do you intend to march into the Celestial Court to steal the immortal medicine just like that?”","“Earlier, those celestial guards mentioned that Emperor Jun went missing. This is a good opportunity to sneak in now that he’s absent. No one will question my identity, especially if I have you, the Celestial Empress, to testify for me,” Zu An said.","Xihe felt as if she had been forcefully brought aboard a pirate ship. “If you leave right after stealing the immortal medicine, I’ll have to bear the consequences.”","“By then, you wouldn’t be the only one to have been fooled by my disguise. They won’t be able to single you out and demand that you take responsibility,” Zu An said.","Xihe thought those words made sense. She had a bold personality, or else she wouldn’t have escaped from her marriage ceremony with Emperor Jun. She was fascinated by Zu An’s plan.","It’d be wonderful if he remained as Emperor Jun from now on... As soon as that thought surfaced in her mind, she jolted in horror. She hurriedly suppressed those notions.","Along the way, Zu An asked Xihe for more details about the Celestial Court. Only then did he learn that the Celestial Court in this world was located elsewhere.","Other than Emperor Jun, the Celestial Court also had War God Donghuang Taiyi, who was placed on the same level as Emperor Jun; there were also the transcendent Nuwa and Fuxi[1], though those two hadn’t revealed themselves for many years now.","Under Emperor Jun were the Ten Fiend Generals, of which Guiche was a member.","The Yellow Emperor Xuanyuan and Flame Emperor Shennong were both powerful fiends who opposed Emperor Jun. The two had joined forces in hopes of replacing him.","Emperor Jun himself was the Fiend races’ King of Myriad Birds. Everyone revered him.","The Yellow Emperor ruled the Dragon race, which had an irreconcilable grudge against the Fiend races.","The Flame Emperor had the Vermilion Bird’s bloodline, which should have put him on closer terms with Emperor Jun. However, the Vermilion Bird and the Golden Crow had always been rivals competing for the position of the Fire God, putting them on terrible terms.","Besides, the Flame Emperor also had the Divine Ox’s bloodline. That was why Xuanyuan invited him to join forces and deal with the stronger Emperor Jun.","Worried for Yaoji’s safety, Zu An made haste and soon arrived at the Celestial Court.","At the southern Celestial Gate, Zu An noticed red lanterns strung up and ‘喜 (Joyous Wedding)’ characters plastered everywhere. However, the celestial guards had grim faces devoid of the slightest joy.","“Who is it?!” The celestial guards tensed up upon sensing someone heading in their direction.","“It is I,” Zu An placidly replied.","His magnanimous yet graceful speech pattern won Xihe’s admiration. This fellow’s acting is impeccable. Could his claim of being my future lover be a lie as well...","“Celestial Emperor!” Surprised but delighted, the celestial guards quickly bowed to him.","Zu An nodded before heading in with Xihe.","Soon, the other people from the Celestial Court heard the news and rushed out to welcome him. Powerful individuals rushed in from all directions. Xihe secretly introduced them to Zu An.","Just then, a voice echoed, “Demoness, how dare you return!”","It was Guiche. It was about to rally the surrounding people to curb Xihe when it noticed Zu An. It shuddered, and it suddenly found itself at a loss as to what it should do.","Zu An coldly said, “She is my wife and the future Celestial Empress. Is this the attitude you have been taking toward her?”","The intense pressure coming from Zu An horrified Guiche. Not knowing how to justify its actions, it hurriedly bowed and said, “I deserve to die...” It didn’t know how to explain its action.","Just then, immortal music played. A nebula suddenly formed out of nowhere, and light gushed out from within.","A figure manifested from the light. He had silver hair resembling the celestial river and flames that blazed at his hair tips. That same hair naturally left dao marks in space. He wore a black emperor robe with dark golden embroidery that appeared to be forged into countless primordial beasts. His very presence emanated authority.","Xihe tensed up upon seeing him. She wanted to inform Zu An that the man was Donghuang Taiyi, but she feared that he would sense her telepathy. She became anxious, fearing that Zu An would give himself away.","“Taiyi.” But Zu An had met Donghuang Taiyi before, so he wouldn’t make a mistake here.","“Guiche has already reported the matter to me. It’s not at fault for this matter. There is a misunderstanding.” Donghuang Taiyi stared intently at Xihe. “Where’s that fellow who has a seven-colored divine halo?”","Xihe’s heart clenched up. Before she could think of an answer, Zu An pulled her behind him and said, “I’ve already killed that fellow.”","“Oh?” Donghuang Taiyi was surprised.","“You doubt me?” Zu An’s face darkened.","Donghuang Taiyi chuckled. “Of course not, brother. No one is a match for you in this world.”","Guiche had described that mysterious man to be a formidable expert, but no matter how strong that fellow was, how could he be stronger than Emperor Jun?","Donghuang Taiyi continued asking curiously, “Brother, you have been missing for some days now. Where did you go?”","“There was a matter that I needed to verify. Later, I learned about what happened to Xihe, so I headed over to fetch her back.” Zu An didn’t give a concrete answer. There was no need for him to do so, since no one in the Celestial Court would dare interrogate the Celestial Emperor.","As expected, Donghuang Taiyi didn’t probe despite Zu An’s vague reply. “You returned on time. We can finally complete the marriage ceremony.”","Xihe’s heart beat nervously. Am I really going to marry the man who refuses to even divulge his name to me?","1. Nuwa and Fuxi are said to be the creators of humanity. ☜"]},{"number":2942,"title":"Chapter 2942: Chapter 2894: Outrageous Behavior","paragraphs":["Xihe thought Zu An would find a reason to postpone the wedding, but he accepted it right away. “Alright!”","She stared at him with widened eyes. Had they been alone, she would have confronted him over that right away. I accompanied you here to help you steal the immortal medicine, but you’re taking advantage of me?","The atmosphere lightened up, and the celestial guards offered their congratulations. Zu An and Xihe were escorted into the Celestial Palace.","Looking at the red lanterns hanging around, Donghuang Taiyi roared in laughter. “Big brother, the Celestial Court was in chaos when both you and sister-in-law disappeared several days ago. Even our frontline against Xuanyuan wavered. Since we’re gathered here today, why don’t we proceed with the marriage and let the word out, to ease the people’s minds?”","“Yes, many rumors have been floating around recently. Everyone is feeling uneasy.”","“Xuanyuan’s side has been spreading rumors about your death. Many powers are beginning to stir due to those rumors.”","...","The Fiend Generals approved of the immediate wedding as well. Clearly, the Celestial Court was in an extremely precarious situation at the moment.","Xihe panicked. She hadn’t expected such a situation to happen.","But Zu An remained perfectly calm. He wrapped his arm around her waist and roared, “That would be for the best!”","Xihe was stunned as cheers erupted from the crowd. Fairies escorted her away to dress her up. She was dazed for the entire duration. It was only when they put a phoenix robe and a coronet on her, and she saw her dress up in the mirror, that she finally snapped out of it.","“You’re gorgeous, Celestial Empress. No goddess in heaven can compete with you,” one of the fairies complimented her.","Xihe abruptly stood up. This isn’t right! How can I marry him just like that?","This flustered the fairies dolling her up. “Celestial Empress, where are you going? We haven’t finished your makeup yet!”","“I’m going to look for the Celestial Emperor!” Xihe gnashed her teeth. She suspected that the fellow was making use of the situation to take advantage of her.","The fairies chuckled. “Celestial Empress, there is no rush. There is plenty of time for you to exchange sweet nothings after the wedding.”","The teasing remarks made Xihe blush furiously. She wanted to throw a tantrum, but she couldn’t find the right words to do so.","Just then, the door opened, and Zu An walked in.","The fairies hurriedly bowed to him. “Paying respects to the Celestial Emperor!”","“Step out for a moment. I need to talk to her.” Zu An waved them off.","The fairies exchanged looks. This defied convention, but the Celestial Emperor’s words were the law here. No one dared to refute him. So, they quickly left the room with suppressed smiles. The lady can’t wait to meet her man, and the man can’t wait to meet the lady, too.","Xihe noticed their reactions, and that made her face burn even redder. “It’s all your fault! Who knows how they're going to talk about me behind my back!”","“There’s no point paying too much attention to what others say.”","“Easier said than done!” Xihe was irked. “What are you scheming? We’re supposed to be here for the immortal medicine, so why am I getting married to you now?”","“You also saw the situation earlier. Everyone is hoping to push through with our marriage, so we might as well play along.” Zu An chuckled.","“What do you mean, play along?” Xihe nearly fainted from anger. “How can you take marriage so lightly?”","Zu An looked her in the eye. “I met you too late. You said that I owed you a wedding. This is my chance to make it up to you.”","“Is this even considered as making it up to me?” Xihe was infuriated. “Didn’t you say that I became Emperor Jun’s wife in the future?”","“I am Emperor Jun now.” Zu An looked at her with tender eyes.","Xihe blinked. She felt as if he was running circles around her, so much so that the logic was getting all muddled up. It took a moment before she recovered. “But you aren’t Emperor Jun!”","“If everyone thinks I'm the real Emperor Jun, even the fake can become real,” Zu An calmly said. He had been thinking a lot in the meantime, and he vaguely sensed that he had caught onto something.","“Aren’t you worried that interfering with the past will change the future?” Xihe was confused.","“History is forged and written by humans.” Zu An was accustomed to this as a Time Scribe.","“What if Emperor Jun returns?” Xihe huffed. Does he think it's that easy to impersonate a Celestial Emperor?","“The Celestial Emperor abruptly disappears, and no one can find him at all. Isn’t there also a chance that he might never return?” Zu An replied contemplatively.","“How can that be? He’s the strongest individual in the world, the Celestial Emperor! Who can possibly harm him?” As much as Xihe disliked Emperor Jun, she didn’t think that a mishap could befall someone as strong as him.","“Strongest? Not necessarily.” Zu An remembered how Emperor Jun had become Zhuanxu’s successor in the future. This showed that Emperor Jun had failed in this era, and that someone had altered history. Otherwise, who would dare to put down the lofty Emperor Jun?","Now that I think about it, is the future Emperor Jun the real Emperor Jun? And who’s the one who altered history?","Xihe was oblivious to Zu An’s thoughts. “I’m only helping you out of goodwill. I don’t intend to marry you... Wuuu ...”","Zu An pulled her into his embrace and kissed her before she could finish saying her piece.","Xihe’s eyes widened. She tried to push him aside, but his arms were as firm as metal bars. She felt as if she had been electrocuted. Is this what kissing feels like...","She soon recovered and gathered a mini sun in her palm, but Zu An continued sealing her lips as if he was oblivious to her actions. A searing flame blazed in her hand for a long time, but in the end, she didn’t attack him. Am I out of my mind? Why am I letting him trample all over me?!","Some time later, Zu An finally loosened his grip and looked at her with a smile.","Xihe’s face reddened. She explained in a fluster, “Don’t think too much into it! The only reason I didn’t attack you is to avoid bringing attention to us here, lest it expose this sham.”","Zu An gently touched her cheek and said, “Marry me.”","Xihe bit her slightly swollen lips. How can this fellow be so domineering and shameless? But what flustered her more was the fact that she wasn’t averse to him at all. She subconsciously blurted out, “But I don’t even know your name!”","Zu An chuckled. “I am Zu An.”","“What a horrible name.” Xihe quietly marked that name down in her heart. She worriedly asked, “Didn’t you say that I don’t know you in the future?”","“Something must have happened in between.” Zu An gently held her hand. “I've missed out on too much. It wasn’t easy for me to find you, so I don’t want to leave any regrets behind.”","Xihe’s lips curled up, but she retorted, “You’re only thinking about me now? I feel like I’m only a substitute.”","Zu An shook his head. “I was worried about influencing history before. I thought that you were different from the you whom I met in the future. But I've thought things through now. Are you willing to marry me?”","Xihe’s heart pounded furiously. She knew that this was an outrageous act, but she could no longer ignore the adrenaline running through her veins. “Alright!”"]},{"number":2943,"title":"Chapter 2943: Chapter 2895: World Gate","paragraphs":["After Zu An left, the fairies returned to continue dolling Xihe up.","“Our lady is on such close terms with the Celestial Emperor.”","“They're stuck together like glue. They can’t even bear to be apart for a while.”","...","The fairies’ kind teasing made Xihe blush furiously.","She also had no idea why she would suddenly agree to marry that fellow. They hadn’t known each other for a long time, and it was just moments ago that she'd learned his name. Everything else about him remained an enigma.","Is it because he said he’s my future lover? What if he’s lying to me?","All kinds of thoughts filled Xihe’s mind, making her feel insecure.","...","Zu An returned to Emperor Jun’s chamber. He began thinking about everything that had happened ever since he arrived in this world. He sensed that something was amiss, but he couldn’t put his finger on what it was.","Just then, he heard knocks on his door. “Brother, I need to talk to you about something.”","It was Donghuang Taiyi!","Zu An opened his eyes, and the door quietly opened.","Donghuang Taiyi walked in with a smile and closed the door behind him. An invisible might enveloped the surroundings, and golden runes appeared around them, isolating them from the rest of the world.","“What are you doing?” Zu An looked at him coldly.","“Brother, what is the result of your investigation?” Donghuang Taiyi looked at him with fervent eyes.","Zu An’s heart skipped a beat. It looks like Emperor Jun’s disappearance was a lie. At least Donghuang Taiyi knows what he was up to. But how am I supposed to know what Emperor Jun was investigating?","Thus, he replied vaguely, “You must have thought that I returned too quickly... or would you rather that I didn’t return at all?”","Donghuang Taiyi’s smile stiffened. “What are you saying, brother? I am overjoyed to have you back. I could tell from your grim face back then that your journey would be fraught with danger. Now that you have returned safely, I’m sure you have brought good news back with you.”","“Not necessarily so.” Zu An churned his mind. He had to extract more information from Donghuang Taiyi without incurring the latter’s suspicion.","But Donghuang Taiyi’s face immediately darkened. “You aren’t my brother. Who are you?”","Zu An frowned. “What do you mean by that?”","“I knew something was amiss right from the start. I was merely verifying it,” Donghuang Taiyi sneered coldly. “My brother was going to do something dangerous. If he returned alive, it could only mean that he had succeeded. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have returned. You’re answering vaguely to extract information from me. Who are you?”","Zu An sighed. I guess there are no fools among the top powerhouses of any world. At the same time, he wondered what Emperor Jun was up to that would endanger him.","He faced Donghuang Taiyi’s searing gaze and smiled. “I am your brother, Emperor Jun.”","“Trying to take advantage of me?” Donghuang Taiyi scoffed.","A miniature golden bell suddenly appeared in his hand. He gently flicked it, and a shockwave rushed at Zu An.","A celestial river suddenly manifested in front of Zu An, and the terrifying shockwave disappeared in its midst.","“The River of History? How are you related to Zhulong?” Donghuang Taiyi widened his eyes.","Zu An was startled. This is a Memory ability. Why would he think that it’s related to Zhulong?","Zhulong was the leader of the Ancestral Shamans. Zu An had gotten caught up in ploys involving Yayu twice in dungeons. The crucial figures in those two incidents were all Zhulong’s sons.","“Do you want to alarm everyone in the Celestial Court by fighting here?” Zu An asked.","Donghuang Taiyi lifted his eyebrows. This fellow isn’t panicking despite being exposed as an impostor. He remains shockingly calm. “You’re the impostor here. What do I have to fear?”","Zu An laughed. “If that’s what you truly thought, you wouldn’t have limited your East Emperor Bell’s area of attack. You must have realized that it doesn’t matter whether I’m the real Emperor Jun or not; the Celestial Court needs an Emperor Jun here to hold the fort.”","Donghuang Taiyi’s face darkened. He hadn’t expected the other party to see through him. “Indeed, the Celestial Court requires an Emperor Jun, but it doesn’t need a weak impostor.”","He threw out his East Emperor Bell at Zu An, unleashing waves of dao notes that sought to imprison the latter.","However, his smile soon stiffened up. He watched in horror as Zu An casually walked away from the East Emperor Bell’s attack unscathed.","“Impossible!” Donghuang Taiyi exclaimed. The East Emperor Bell was an intrinsic divine item, boasting overwhelming defensive and offensive prowess. For many years, no enemy had been able to escape from its imprisonment.","“Can we talk now?” Zu An’s Primordial Mirage allowed him to switch between a physical entity and an ethereal being. The East Emperor Bell couldn’t hope to hold him in place.","Donghuang Taiyi fell silent. He couldn’t faze the other party, even with his East Emperor Bell. This showed that the other party’s strength was worthy of his respect. “Are you the man with the seven-colored divine halo that Guiche spotted beside Xihe?”","Judging from the cooperation between Zu An and Xihe, he could tell that they were on close terms. Other than that mysterious man, he couldn’t think of anyone else whom Xihe would assist.","“It doesn’t matter who I am. From this day on, I will be Emperor Jun. We should be on the same front, no?” Zu An said. “Can you tell me what the real Emperor Jun is up to now?”","Donghuang Taiyi’s face flickered. He was reluctant to divulge the secret.","Zu An took this chance to press on. “You've already made a thorough analysis of the situation. The odds of Emperor Jun returning alive are slim, and it doesn’t help that you haven’t received any news from him. I wouldn’t have dared impersonate Emperor Jun if not for that.”","“I don’t even know your background. How could I divulge such an important secret to you?” Donghuang Taiyi coldly pointed out.","“My background isn’t important. You just need to know that our interests are aligned. You need an Emperor Jun, and I want to play the role of Emperor Jun to be with Xihe.”","“You’re taking such a huge risk just for a woman?” Donghuang Taiyi found that hard to believe.","“She’s not just any woman. Our bond lasts across lifetimes. I have already lost two very important people to me. I can’t lose her as well,” Zu An replied wistfully.","Donghuang Taiyi frowned. “Pardon me, but your reason isn’t convincing enough for me. However, I don’t mind revealing this secret to you. I’m worried that no one else in the world will know about it if something happens to me too.”","“I’m all ears.”","Donghuang Taiyi took some time to compose his words before saying, “Emperor Jun wishes to open the World Gate and see what lies on the other side.”","“The World Gate?” Zu An frowned. “What’s that?”","“No one knows what that gate is. It’s rumored that the biggest secret in the world lies on the other side. Emperor Jun is already the strongest entity in the world. Nothing in the world can interest him anymore, other than the unknown.” Donghuang Taiyi’s voice carried a tinge of excitement."]},{"number":2944,"title":"Chapter 2944: Chapter 2896: Lady of the Nine Heavens","paragraphs":["Zu An was startled. What could lie behind the World Gate that has captured Emperor Jun’s attention? “Where is the World Gate?”","Donghuang Taiyi shook his head. “No one knows where it is. I posed that question to Emperor Jun as well, but he said that if he didn’t return, it could only mean that approaching the World Gate would bring destruction upon us. He didn’t want me to follow in his footsteps. He said that he would tell me about it if he returned safely.”","He lowered his head in melancholy. “Some time has passed since, but he hasn’t returned yet. Something might have happened to him.”","Zu An fell silent. I should ask Mi Li or Meng about the World Gate when I return from this dungeon. They should know the answer to this question.","“Now, I have told you what I know. It’s time for you to tell me your motive for impersonating Emperor Jun. Stop using Xihe as an excuse.” Donghuang Taiyi stared at Zu An.","“The immortal medicine.” There was no way for Zu An to explain his relationship with Xihe, so he offered a more reasonable explanation instead.","Donghuang Taiyi finally nodded. “Fine. If you can stabilize the situation as Emperor Jun, I’ll aid you in obtaining the immortal medicine.”","“Where is the immortal medicine?”","Zu An had already searched Emperor Jun’s residence, but he hadn't found any traces of the immortal medicine. That was why he wanted to marry Xihe and continue searching the rest of the Celestial Palace.","“The Queen Mother of the West gave the immortal medicine to Emperor Jun and Xihe to congratulate them for their wedding, but one went missing and the other fled. Naturally, the gift didn’t go through. As long as you get married, the gift will be returned,” Donghuang Taiyi replied.","There was no way to conceal this matter once the Queen of the West’s envoy arrived.","Zu An widened his eyes in realization. No wonder I couldn’t find it anywhere.","“I need you to help me deal with Xuanyuan and Shennong,” Donghuang Taiyi said.","“I can’t interfere in history.” Zu An shook his head.","Donghuang Taiyi’s face turned cold. “You want the immortal medicine and my sister-in-law, but you refuse to do any work in return? We can call it quits here. I’ll expose your identity, and you won’t get anything at all.”","“Calm down. Aren’t I already doing you a huge favor by appearing as Emperor Jun? If not for me, the Celestial Court’s morale would have collapsed by now,” Zu An said. “I can help you stall Shennong, but you’ll have to deal with Xuanyuan yourself.”","Donghuang Taiyi’s darkened expression was alleviated a little. In the end, he nodded grimly. “Fine!”","There had been a huge panic in the Celestial Court because the enemy had two powerhouses, Xuanyuan and Shennong. The Celestial Court had other powerhouses as well, but they were of transcendent standing and had expressed that they wouldn’t get involved in this conflict.","Previously, Emperor Jun and Donghuang Taiyi had barely held the upper hand over Xuanyuan and Shennong, but with Emperor Jun gone, Donghuang Taiyi wouldn’t be enough against them.","But if this fake Emperor Jun could stall Shennong, Donghuang Taiyi was still confident that he could subdue Xuanyuan. In the first place, as long as he had the East Emperor Bell, an artifact renowned for its invincible defensive prowess, he couldn’t be defeated.","The two of them discussed the details of their cooperation and an auspicious time to hold the wedding.","To rouse the Celestial Court, Donghuang Taiyi planned the wedding to be exceptionally grand. Colorful phoenixes and luans would form a staircase to herald the bride’s arrival.","Divine lights shone as powerhouses from all over the world gathered to witness the ceremony. They had arrived some time ago, only for the groom and bride to disappear. They'd waited for a while longer afterward before leaving. As soon as they caught wind of the news, though, they returned as soon as they could.","A beautiful aurora filled the sky as immortal music played. Petals rained from the sky. These weren’t real petals, but the world’s blessing for the Celestial Emperor and the Celestial Empress.","Donghuang Taiyi was stunned. He had intended to use his divine power to recreate the phenomenon, but for some reason, the fake Emperor Jun was able to somehow resonate with the world.","What’s going on?","The wedding proceeded smoothly.","Just then, immortal music began playing from afar. A guard reported that the Lady of the Nine Heavens had come to deliver the Queen Mother of the West’s gift.","The gods were envious. They had heard about the Queen Mother of the West’s gift. An immortal medicine was an invaluable treasure that could grant anyone a new lease on life!","Those who had never met the Lady of the Nine Heavens were awed. As expected of the number one goddess under the Queen Mother of the West. She’s gorgeous. She can stand on equal grounds with today’s bride.","Zu An had heard about the Lady of the Nine Heavens from the Goddess of Wu Mountain. The old him would have been curious to know how the Lady of the Nine Heavens looked, but his mind was currently fixated on the immortal medicine. It made no difference to him no matter how gorgeous or hideous the other party was.","Soon, a figure dressed in plain clothes arrived on a cloud. Her body radiated the Primordial Radiance, a trait unique to Kunlun. Beautiful music played.","“May the world bear witness to the union of the Sun and the Moon. The Queen Mother of the West, with a 9000-year-old immortal peach growing at Kunlun’s peak and the nectar from the Jade Pond, wishes the Celestial Emperor and the Celestial Empress to be joined in their hearts for eternity!”","Xihe’s reddened cheeks suddenly turned pale. Her mind had been overflowing with thoughts about love and romance when she suddenly realized something. Did this fellow marry me to obtain the immortal medicine? Was he just making use of me...","She turned to look at Zu An, hoping to receive his silent promise. Yet he wasn’t looking at her at all. His eyes were fixed on the immortal medicine.","She smiled miserably. I knew it. What a joke I am...","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +333... +333... +333...","The sudden influx of rage points snapped Zu An out of his daze. He grabbed Xihe’s hand and gently told her via telepathy, “Xihe, are you jealous because I was looking at the Lady of the Nine Heavens?”","Xihe was surprised. Was he looking at the Lady of the Nine Heavens instead of the immortal medicine?","That filled her with happiness, but a moment later, she suddenly felt frustrated. Hold on, shouldn’t I be angry that my husband is looking at another woman during our wedding?","She looked at the Lady of the Nine Heavens. The latter radiated a pristine light. Her eyebrows resembled the distant mountains, and her lips were lightly tinted like the first snow falling on a cinnabar. Her hair flowed freely like an ink painting...","Even from afar, one could smell a light fragrance coming from her. This was the manifestation of her pure life force, harnessing the great dao. No wonder Zu An was captivated by her.","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +433... +433... +433...","“My gratitude to the Queen Mother of the West and the Lady of the Nine Heavens.” Zu An did his best to maintain a calm tone. He'd thought that his attention would be on the immortal medicine, but the sight of the Lady of the Nine Heavens left him in a daze.","This beautiful woman was none other than Qiu Honglei! But he couldn’t tell whether she was the real Qiu Honglei, or her previous incarnation, like the Goddess of Wu Mountain."]},{"number":2945,"title":"Chapter 2945: Chapter 2897: An Honest Exchange","paragraphs":["After the wedding, Zu An found a chance to have a private conversation with the Lady of the Nine Heavens. “Lady of the Nine Heavens, you have my gratitude for delivering the immortal medicine.”","The immortal peach and the Jade Pond’s nectar were top-quality medicine. They would no doubt be enough to save Yaoji’s life. This put him in a good mood.","“You’re too courteous, Celestial Emperor.” The Lady of the Nine Heavens bowed before taking her leave. Her distant attitude showed that she had little interest in the Celestial Emperor, perhaps even harboring contempt toward him.","Zu An suddenly called out, “Honglei?”","The Lady of the Nine Heavens jolted. She turned around in shock, but upon seeing Emperor Jun’s face, she quickly regained her composure and asked, “What did you say, Celestial Emperor?”","But Zu An had noticed the change in her expression. He tried his best to suppress his overflowing joy, lest other celestials see through his disguise, and said in his original voice, “It’s me.”","The Lady of the Nine Heavens’s wary and cold eyes suddenly melted into delight. “Ah Zu?”","Zu An nodded.","Unfortunately, they were the two most eye-catching figures in the Celestial Palace. Despite having only exchanged a few words, quite a few gazes had already drifted toward them.","Emperor Jun was notorious as a philanderer. Everyone thought he was interested in the Lady of the Nine Heavens.","This scum! He’s flirting with another woman during his wedding day!","“Wait for me in the room over there,” Zu An told her telepathically.","“All right,” the Lady of the Nine Heavens replied with reddened cheeks. She first took her leave. Only when she was out of everyone’s line of sight did she secretly take a detour back into the Celestial Palace.","Meanwhile, Zu An traded pleasantries with other guests. Some time later, he couldn’t bear to wait anymore and found a pretext to make his way to the agreed location.","When he opened the door and saw a familiar silhouette, he rushed over. “Honglei!”","But the Lady of the Nine Heavens took a step back. Zu An belatedly realized that he was still disguised as Emperor Jun, so he quickly reverted to his original appearance.","Qiu Honglei was overjoyed and confused at the same time. “Ah Zu, what are you doing here?”","“I found a Nature Jade. I wanted to return to the Celestial Court world to save the Goddess of Wu Mountain and the ancient Mermaid Queen, but for some reason, I was transported into this era,” Zu An explained.","Upon confirming Zu An’s identity, Qiu Honglei leaped into his arms and exclaimed, “Ah Zu, I thought I’d never see you again!”","Zu An also embraced her tightly. “You were all gone by the time I returned to the Cultivation World. I only heard from others that you entered the Longevity Divine Palace. How did you end up here?”","“I participated in a few trials in the Longevity Divine Palace, but for some reason, I was transported to this world. Initially, I thought I'd returned to the same Celestial Court world, but I soon realized that this world dates even further back...”","The two of them shared everything they had been through while they were apart.","Just then, Zu An suddenly sensed something and looked outside. Xihe, who was dressed in a red bridal gown, was staring at them from the entranceway with a cold sneer.","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +444... +444... +444...","This fellow is atrocious! He has just gotten married to me today, so how can he get intimate with another woman right after?","Now that I think about it, he came to this world for another woman. Is he really not Emperor Jun? I feel like if I went out and met ten fairies, eleven of them would have some kind of tie with him.","Zu An awkwardly explained, “Xihe, it’s not what you’re thinking.”","“What’s the point of this marriage?” Xihe was about to take off her coronet when Zu An rushed over to stop her, but that only made her expression turn colder. “If you like the Lady of the Nine Heavens so much, you should get married to her instead. I can make an announcement to the world and step aside for her.”","“Big sister Xihe, you have truly misunderstood us. We met each other a long time ago,” Qiu Honglei hurriedly explained. “We were on close terms in the future.”","Xihe was stunned. She turned to Zu An and asked, “She’s from the future, too?”","Zu An nodded. He shared Qiu Honglei’s background with Xihe.","Xihe was speechless. “You cried so pitifully outside the Frost Palace that I thought you were a devoted man. I didn’t expect you to be an even bigger philanderer than Emperor Jun!”","Qiu Honglei chuckled. “He is a philanderer, but I think he’s better than Emperor Jun.” She had been in this world for some time now. Naturally, she was no stranger to Emperor Jun’s reputation.","“Since you were originally a couple, there is even less reason for me to get in between the two of you.” Seeing how close they looked, Xihe’s heart was plunged into despair.","But Qiu Honglei grabbed her arm and said, “The two of you are a couple in the future as well. I didn’t expect you two to reunite in this world. This is something to be celebrated!”","Xihe exclaimed, “...How many things are you still hiding from me?!”","Seeing that she had truly gotten angry, Zu An knew that he had to explain things to her, or else this could leave a deep scar in her heart. So, he shared some details about the future with her.","Xihe thought that he was only coaxing her, but her expression gradually grew more solemn.","“You’re saying that we met in the future because you shot down nine of my sons?” Xihe clenched her jaws and glared at Zu An in hostility.","“That was an accident. I suspect someone was toying with karma,” Zu An explained.","Xihe’s face remained cold. “No matter the cause, you still killed my sons!”","Qiu Honglei looked at the two of them worriedly. She had no idea why Zu An had told all this to Xihe. Won’t this affect the future?","Xihe was incensed. “How can you be so shameless as to still take advantage of me now?”","Zu An’s face turned solemn. “I’m not taking advantage of you. The real Emperor Jun could very well be dead now. I suspect that I’ll be Emperor Jun in the foreseeable future, and your sons will naturally be my sons as well.”","Xihe looked conflicted. “Are you saying that you’ll personally kill your own sons?”","Qiu Honglei hurriedly added, “He brought the Golden Crows back to life in the future.”","“That’s only reincarnation,” Xihe coldly pointed out.","“There could be a way to turn things around,” Zu An said.","“How? You said that I tried everything I could in the future, but I couldn’t reverse their deaths!”","“I forgot to tell you that I have another identity. I am also a Chaos and Enigma envoy, a Time Scribe. My field of specialty lies in rewriting history,” Zu An replied. It was the first time he was glad to have this identity.","Xihe blinked in confusion.","Qiu Honglei explained, “Big sister Xihe, it’s not his first time doing something like that. He also helped Chang’e and the Goddess of Wu Mountain...”","All of a sudden, she thought of something and exclaimed, “Oh no! Big brother Zu, the Queen Mother of the West’s immortal medicine can grant a person a new lease of life, but those who have already died will turn into monsters. Have you forgotten about what happened to Yayu?”","Zu An’s face darkened."]},{"number":2946,"title":"Chapter 2946: Chapter 2898: The Underworld","paragraphs":["Zu An had been so blinded by his anxiety to save Yaoji that he forgot this crucial fact.","Neither the Six Paths of Reincarnation nor the Netherworld existed in this world. It was impossible to find someone’s soul after death. Even if he brought Yaoji back to life using the immortal medicine, she would only be a walking corpse.","Xihe was startled. “Doesn’t the immortal medicine have the power to revive the dead?”","Qiu Honglei shook her head. “That’s a misunderstanding. Only a small handful of people at the Queen Mother of the West’s side know about the immortal medicine’s downside, and we don’t spread it to outsiders.”","Zu An’s body turned cold. He had always been a resourceful person, but he felt as if his brain had melted into goo at this moment. If the immortal medicine can’t save Yaoji, the Goddess of Wu Mountain might cease to exist. If so, won’t Pei Mianman be in danger?","No, that’s not right. If I met them in the future, things must have worked out somehow. I must find the key to this issue!","He grimly asked, “Are there no ghosts in this world?”","Qiu Honglei instinctively turned to Xihe. It hadn’t been long since she came to this world, and she had spent most of her time with the Queen Mother of the West at Kunlun, so her grasp of this world was limited.","Xihe asked in surprise, “Are you able to save someone if you can find their ghost?”","“Feeding the immortal medicine to a corpse will only turn it into a mindless monster. To truly bring a person back to life, we need not just the immortal medicine, but the person’s soul as well,” Qiu Honglei replied.","Xihe replied, “A person’s soul usually lingers around their body right after death, but it has been days since Yaoji’s passing. She should have gone to the Underworld.”","“Underworld?” Zu An found that name familiar.","“It’s rumored that all beings go there after their death. It's an enigmatic place no living being can set foot in,” Xihe replied with a frown.","Qiu Honglei turned to Zu An. “He should be able to do it.”","“Are you dead?” Xihe was horrified. She looked at Zu An with nervous eyes.","Qiu Honglei chuckled. “Of course not. He’s the future master of the Netherworld. He’s able to cross the boundary separating life and death.”","Then, she added out of curiosity, “Is there a master of the Underworld here? Will there be a clash of faith with big brother Zu?”","Xihe replied, “There is indeed a master of the Underworld—Houtu. However, she has an eccentric personality and avoids outsiders. It won’t be easy to reach out to her.”","“Houtu!” Zu An was startled. He had met Houtu in the sealed world, and it was under her guidance that he'd begun collecting the six power insignias to forge the Six Paths of Reincarnation. He asked, “How can we go to the Underworld?”","“To enter the Underworld, one has to pass through the Ghost Pass,” Xihe racked her brains before answering. “Legend has it that in the middle of the vast sea lies the Dushuo Mountain. Atop the mountain is a huge peach tree with roots and trunks that extend for thousands of li. Between its branches lies the Northeastern Ghost Gate, where countless ghosts roam.","“Two divine beings live on the peach tree—Shencha and Youlei. They judge the ghosts, and those who harmed mortals will be bound and fed to a divine tiger.”","She turned to Zu An and consoled him, “Don’t worry, Yaoji should be fine.”","Zu An fell into deep thought. The Ghost Pass should be the Ghost Gate in the future. Shencha and Youlei are similar to gate deities or wardens like Ox Head and Horse Face. The Underworld does have a close tie with the future Netherworld.","He hurriedly asked, “Where is Dushuo Mountain?”","Xihe shook her head. “The Underworld has always been shrouded in secrecy. No one knows where it is. Many people have sought Dushuo Mountain, but no one has been able to find it. However, someone of Donghuang Taiyi’s stature might know.”","“Thanks!” Zu An rushed off to look for Donghuang Taiyi.","Xihe’s eyes drooped as she watched Zu An head off in a hurry.","Qiu Honglei, as a fellow woman, picked up on Xihe’s subtle change in mood and said, “Big sister Xihe, big brother Zu is a sentimental man. He doesn’t hesitate to risk his life for his lovers, not to mention that the Goddess of Wu Mountain has waited tens of thousands of years for him. He has always felt immense guilt for her.”","“Did he save you like that before?” Xihe asked.","“He did.” Qiu Honglei smiled tenderly. “I was on the verge of death when he rushed over with the immortal medicine to save me...”","Xihe felt a rush of jealousy. “Did he save me like that as well?”","Qiu Honglei’s smile stiffened, but she quickly replied, “I’m not sure about the situation between the two of you, but when your future incarnation was in dire straits, he rushed over to help you in your time of need.”","“What was my future incarnation like?” Xihe’s interest was piqued. “Tell me more.”","“Your future incarnation became sisters with the person who later occupied the Frost Palace...” Qiu Honglei was awed by how wondrous fate was. She patiently shared the future with Xihe.","...","Meanwhile, Zu An visited Donghuang Taiyi and told him about his intent.","“Dushuo Mountain? Why do you want to go there?” Donghuang Taiyi was surprised.","“I’m looking for a person.”","Sensing Zu An’s reluctance to explain further, Donghuang Taiyi said, “I can tell you where it is, but it has to be three days from now.”","Zu An frowned. “Why?”","“How can you leave right away when you have just gotten married? There are plenty of people who suspect that you’re an impostor. You have to spend the next three days convincing the rest of the world that Emperor Jun is still in the Celestial Palace before I’ll tell you the location of Dushuo Mountain.” Donghuang Taiyi briefly paused before adding, “Otherwise, there’s no way you can find it yourself.”","Zu An fell silent. A while later, he replied, “Fine.” Yaoji was the Flame Emperor’s daughter. Nothing would happen to her soul within three days. Besides, he did owe Xihe a lot.","He returned to his room, only to find two women staring at him.","Xihe asked, “When are you leaving?” After hearing stories about Shang Hongyu from Qiu Honglei, her grudge against Zu An had alleviated considerably.","“Three days from now.”","Xihe was confused. Zu An looked at her with tender eyes and explained, “We've just gotten married. It wouldn’t be right for us to leave the Celestial Palace so quickly. The world is looking at us.”","Xihe’s face reddened. “It’s a fake marriage in the first place!”","Zu An chuckled. “I am the Celestial Emperor, and you’re the Celestial Empress. The world has borne witness to our union. How can it be fake?”","“You should know better!” Xihe replied in a fluster. She hadn’t expected Zu An to take the marriage for real.","Qiu Honglei looked at them with a bizarre expression. “I shan’t disturb you two anymore. I’ll return in three days.”","She fled the scene, leaving Xihe to panic alone.","Zu An grabbed her hand and said, “Even though we were together in the future, we had to keep things under wraps and remain discreet. I finally had a chance to give you a grand wedding in the open. Let’s not leave any regrets behind.”","Xihe bit her lips. Her mind was in a mess. “But if we truly get together, we’ll be walking down the same path. You’ll be shooting down my... our children!”","Zu An embraced her. “Trust me. I’ll find a way to solve this problem.”","“How?”","“Let’s start with making our children.”"]},{"number":2947,"title":"Chapter 2947: Chapter 2899: Hou Yi Shooting the Sun Once More","paragraphs":["Embarrassed, Xihe hammered Zu An with her fists. Zu An just laughed and lifted her in a princess carry.","“What are you doing? Let me down.” Xihe panicked.","“We have completed our ceremony. It’s time to consummate our marriage.”","“No way! The ceremony was an act!” Xihe frantically kicked her legs.","Zu An gently looked at her and said, “But to me, it’s all real.”","Xihe found herself getting lost in Zu An’s starry eyes. She felt his overflowing affection in his gaze. Her heart stirred, especially when she recalled Qiu Honglei’s talk about her future self. But this was still too fast.","Before she could say anything, Zu An kissed her. Her eyes widened. She tried to push him aside, but he embraced her tightly. His lips were aggressive yet gentle. Her mind went numb, and her arms fell still before she could realize it. She had no idea whether this was the right thing to do, but it all felt like fate.","And we have already gotten married...","When Zu An’s hands attempted to go further, she suddenly grabbed them. Her eyes had regained their earlier resolve. “I’ll kill you if you deceive me!”","Zu An wasn't sure if she was talking about their future relationship as a couple, or his promise to change the fate of the ten suns, but neither was a lie. “Our relationship transcends lifetimes. I wouldn’t lie to you.”","Xihe’s gaze softened. She had heard stories about her future incarnation from Qiu Honglei and knew about the regrets between her and Zu An in the future.","She leaned in and kissed him. The two of them embraced each other tightly, as if they were trying to knead each other into their bodies. Xihe’s wedding gown slipped off, revealing a body that was more radiant than any sun.","That night, Zu An fired nine shots into the sun.","...","In the following days, Zu An met the leaders of other powers as Emperor Jun. Donghuang Taiyi was worried that Zu An would expose himself, but the latter’s disguise was impeccable. Zu An naturally commanded the authority and magnanimity of an emperor. Some people still doubted his identity and tried to test him out by attacking him, but they were swiftly subdued by bolts of lightning.","With that, the unrest in the Celestial Palace finally calmed down for good.","Meanwhile, Xihe continued probing Qiu Honglei for more information about the future. She wanted to know everything related to Zu An, even if it didn’t involve her.","Qiu Honglei was initially worried that divulging the future would derail the trajectory of fate, but after receiving Zu An’s permission, she shared everything she knew with Xihe. Due to that, they grew extremely close.","One day, Xihe suddenly asked, “Honglei, aren’t you jealous that that fellow has so many lovers? Come to think about it, you even played matchmaker for us.”","Qiu Honglei sighed. “Of course I’m jealous. But I also saw how hard he worked and the sacrifices he made to save my life when my body and soul were on the verge of dissipation. Since then, I could no longer bear to remain angry at him.”","She suddenly changed her tone and continued, “But while I can’t be angry at him, I can still be angry at other women. That Chu Chuyan and her master are the worst of the lot! They pretend to be cold and lofty, but for some reason, men just buy into that act! My master and I suffered a lot because of that!”","Xihe was horrified. “A master and a disciple sharing a husband? Hold on! How is your master involved in this as well?”","“My master and I are demonesses from the Devil Sect, so such a thing is normal for us. But those two pride themselves on being righteous heroes from the orthodox sects,” Qiu Honglei ranted. “Don’t you think they're hypocritical?”","“A little,\" Xihe said, giving Qiu Honglei a strange look. She hurriedly asked for more information about Chu Chuyan and her master.","Qiu Honglei introduced those two, but she also added, “Big sister Xihe, you mustn’t join their side in the future. Their faction is already powerful as it is.”","“I’ll stand on your side!”","How could Xihe, the Celestial Empress, lower herself before other women? It irritated her that this Chu Chuyan woman had taken on the role of the main wife, which made her more inclined to support Qiu Honglei’s revolution.","When he entered the room and saw the two women with eyes gleaming with excitement, Zu An was perplexed. “What are you two talking about?”","“Nothing,” Xihe and Qiu Honglei replied in unison. They felt conscience-stricken. He didn’t overhear us talking badly about Chu Chuyan, did he?","Zu An was surprised by how close the two women were.","Qiu Honglei changed the topic and asked, “Has Donghuang Taiyi told you the location of Dushuo Mountain yet?”","Zu An waved the jade token in his hand. “I spent the last few days helping him calm down the turmoil in the Celestial Palace. In return, he told me the location.”","Not daring to delay the matter anymore out of worry for Yaoji’s safety, he got moving right away. Qiu Honglei and Xihe volunteered to accompany him.","When they saw the Lady of the Nine Heavens and Xihe walking out of the room with him, the people of the Celestial Court were awed, flanking him. As expected of the Celestial Emperor. Not even the Lady of the Nine Heavens can withstand his charm.","Donghuang Taiyi’s cheeks twitched. Only he knew that this Emperor Jun was an impersonator. Who is this monster? It’s one thing for him to win Xihe’s fancy, but to think that he has won over the Lady of the Nine Heavens as well.","He felt a surge of jealousy, though that faded very quickly. He knew such matters weren’t important for a ruler. My real brother is already dead, so it doesn’t matter even if this fellow gets together with all my sisters-in-law. He just needs to continue as the Celestial Emperor.","...","Zu An took the two ladies to the coordinates provided by Donghuang Taiyi via Rainbow Morph. Soon, they arrived in the middle of the ocean.","Xihe was unaccustomed to being embraced by a man together with another woman, but due to her growing ties with Qiu Honglei, she couldn’t lash out now.","Qiu Honglei was perplexed. “There’s nothing here. Did Donghuang Taiyi fool us?”","Zu An took out the jade token. It emanated a golden light, and the surroundings began to transform. There was a distortion of light and shadow, and a massive island revealed itself.","There was only a single peach tree on the island, but it covered the island, forming an entire forest by itself. The trio flew to the highest point of the peach tree and looked in the northeast.","Just then, two cold voices echoed, “Who dares barge into the Ghost Gate?”"]},{"number":2948,"title":"Chapter 2948: Chapter 2900: Houtu’s True Face","paragraphs":["Two golden-armored immortals appeared on a distant branch of the peach tree. They had hulking figures and looked imposing.","The one on the left had a calm expression and wielded an axe. The one on the right had a heavy expression and wielded a halberd. They were the legendary guards of the Ghost Pass, Shencha and Youlei.","Xihe roared, “Audacious! How dare you not bow in the presence of the Celestial Emperor?”","The two golden-armored immortals were taken aback. They took a good look at Zu An before replying, “Ah, so it’s the Celestial Emperor. May we know why you are here?”","Zu An replied, “I need to make a trip to the Underworld. I’ll have to trouble you two to open the Ghost Pass.”","In view of ‘Emperor Jun’s’ polite attitude, Shencha and Youlei replied respectfully, “Celestial Emperor, it’s not that we don’t want to grant you passage, but only the deceased can enter the Underworld.”","“That isn’t a problem. I have my own way to enter the Underworld.” As Zu An spoke, death energy began to shroud his body, making him appear like a ghost.","Shencha and Youlei were taken aback. As expected of the Celestial Emperor. His capabilities are impressive.","Even Xihe was amazed. There was a famous saying that the celestials governed heaven, whereas Houtu governed earth. Both parties had their own, separate jurisdictions. So, it was astonishing to see Zu An’s authority extending from heaven to earth.","Shencha and Youlei exchanged looks before saying, “Please hold on, Celestial Emperor. We need to report this to Lady Houtu first.” Both of them closed their eyes to communicate with a certain entity.","Zu An wondered if he would be able to meet Houtu in the flesh this time. The last time they met, Houtu had already transformed into the Six Paths of Reincarnation.","Soon, Shencha and Youlei opened their eyes. “Lady Houtu invites the Celestial Emperor in.”","The two of them crossed their halberd and axe before pulling them apart. A pitch black door opened from their intersection. The Underworld’s energy emanating from the door prompted Xihe and Qiu Honglei to instinctively step back. Not even someone of Xihe’s divine stature could withstand the Underworld’s concentrated aura. No living being could hope to ever enter the Underworld.","With a wave of his hand, Zu An enveloped Xihe and Qiu Honglei with a unique aura. “Don’t worry. Follow me.”","As the Netherworld’s master and someone who wielded a portion of Death’s authority, he had the power to bring people into the Underworld with him.","The two ladies quickly followed him into the Ghost Pass. They were filled with curiosity about the legendary Underworld.","After those three had passed, Shencha and Youlei began to gossip.","“The one emitting blazing heat is Celestial Empress Xihe, right? Who is the other fairy?”","“She seems to be the Lady of the Nine Heavens. I saw her from afar once.”","“I can already see it. The Celestial Emperor will die a lecherous ghost.”","“Should we tie him up and feed him to the divine tiger when the time comes?”","“Shh! Are you tired of living?”","...","Passing through the Ghost Pass, the trio were transported into a dark world. A frigid gale rushed at them; it chilled not their bodies, but their souls.","Zu An took the lead to deal with any dangers that could come their way.","Qiu Honglei, who was walking at the back, sneezed. Despite having consumed the immortal medicine, her near-death experience still left her extremely prone to catching a cold.","Upon seeing that, Xihe grabbed her hand. She was the Sun Goddess, an entity who brought warmth and light to others.","Qiu Honglei looked at her gratefully. “Big sister Xihe, your hands are so warm.”","Zu An had turned around after hearing the sneeze, and he happened to overhear Qiu Honglei’s remark. He felt a stir in his heart as a thought surfaced. Well, she was much warmer during our consummation night. That had been such an unforgettable experience that now and then, he found himself being transported back to that time.","Xihe appeared to have thought of the same thing. Her face reddened and she shot a glare at Zu An, warning him not to let his thoughts wander.","Many ghosts wandered in their surroundings, but they steered clear out of fear of the trio's auras.","The trio advanced for a long time. There were so many ghosts wandering this world that it felt nigh impossible to find Yaoji’s soul among them.","Just then, an authoritative voice echoed from the distance, “Pardon my lack of hospitality, Celestial Emperor. Please head here for a chat.”","A ray of light shot out from the distance and formed a path.","The trio exchanged looks before advancing. They were top experts in this world; they weren’t worried about the Underworld’s master luring them into a trap.","Moments later, Qiu Honglei tugged Zu An’s sleeves and exclaimed, “It’s the Oblivion River!”","Zu An had noticed it, too. There was a raging, blood-yellow river that was clearly the Oblivion River. There was also an enormous mountain range in the distance that he recognized as the Yin Mountains. This Underworld was the foundation of the future Netherworld.","The ray of light formed a translucent bridge across the Oblivion River. Xihe grabbed Zu An’s arm and said, “Be careful, this river feels extremely dangerous.”","“This is an invitation from Lady Houtu. She won’t tamper with the bridge.” Zu An smiled as he took the two ladies’ hands and stepped onto the light bridge.","As she walked on the bridge that was as thin as a cicada’s wing while looking at the raging Oblivion River beneath, Xihe couldn’t help but shudder.","Fortunately, nothing went wrong in the process.","A chuckle echoed in the air. “I’m impressed by your guts, Celestial Emperor.”","A figure leisurely walked out from the faraway Yin Mountain. Her footsteps were casual, but it only took an instant for her to travel up to them.","Zu An had experience dealing with Houtu, but he had only seen her silhouette on the Reincarnation Platform. He hadn’t seen her true face yet. He was curious to know what the woman who had accrued so many merits looked like. But he was stunned when he saw her face.","Xihe was also startled. She hadn’t expected the Underworld’s master to be so beautiful. She had always thought that she was the most beautiful person in the world, and thus far, she hadn’t met anyone whom she thought surpassed her in terms of appearance. But the moment she saw Houtu, she suddenly felt a sense of defeat.","Very few people in the world had ever seen Houtu’s true appearance. It was rumored that she was an average-looking woman, and all the time she'd spent holed up in the Underworld had made her hideous and savage.","Right now, Xihe just wanted to scream at those people. If Houtu is considered hideous and savage, all other women in the world can just slam their heads into blocks of tofu right now!","She instinctively turned to Zu An, thinking that the latter would surely lust for Houtu, but the situation was worse than she thought. Zu An was staring straight at Houtu without blinking at all! I know she’s beautiful, but do you really have to make it so blatant?","Xihe gritted her teeth. She was about to throw a tantrum when Qiu Honglei suddenly called out, “Big sister Yu?”","Xihe blinked. What’s going on? Is she yet another one of that fellow’s lovers?","Zu An felt as if a tsunami had crashed down on his heart, whirling it around with the currents. Lady Houtu looked exactly like Yu Yanluo, though she exuded an air of solemnity and divinity."]},{"number":2949,"title":"Chapter 2949: Chapter 2901: There Is A Problem!","paragraphs":["Zu An’s prior experience with the Goddess of Wu Mountain and Xihe held him back from rushing up to Houtu and embracing her, though he didn’t expect Qiu Honglei to speak up first.","“Big sister Yu?” Houtu was taken aback. She first assessed Qiu Honglei before asking, “You should be the Lady of the Nine Heavens, right? Why would you call me that?”","Her voice was pleasant, but it was starkly different from Yu Yanluo’s. Yu Yanluo spoke in a tender and feminine manner, whereas Houtu’s voice exuded purity and compassion.","Qiu Honglei was taken aback. She looked at Zu An with conscience-stricken eyes, not knowing whether to speak the truth or not. The person standing before them was the lofty Lady Houtu. Revealing to her that they were from the future could bring about unforeseeable disasters.","Zu An replied, “You resemble our friend a lot. No, it’s not just a resemblance. The two of you are identical.”","Xihe rolled her eyes. I knew it! Yet another one of his lovers. It almost feels like he has a lover within a ten-kilometer radius no matter where we go. This bastard is a worse philanderer than Emperor Jun!","“Identical?” Houtu’s pupils widened. That was enough for an entity of her stature to vaguely sense that something more was at play here. She suddenly frowned and remarked, “You aren’t Emperor Jun. Who are you?”","The Underworld was her turf. She could sense everything here. The man before her was as powerful as the Celestial Emperor, but for some reason, he was able to control the Underworld’s aura. Emperor Jun governed heaven, whereas she governed earth. There was no overlap in their jurisdictions.","Xihe immediately put up her guard. Houtu is a legendary figure. If a fight breaks out, we have to make the first move to curb her first.","But seconds later, she suddenly laughed. Houtu is one of his lovers as well. There’s no way they would come to blows.","Zu An took off his mask and revealed his original appearance.","Houtu was confused. Who is this fellow? How is he able to impersonate, of all people, the Celestial Emperor? I have never met him before, but he gives off a sense of familiarity.","Zu An proceeded to construct an isolation barrier around them.","Houtu said, “You don’t need to be so careful. The Underworld is my territory. No one else can overhear our conversation.”","But Zu An still completed his barrier before he finally revealed the truth. “I am from the future.”","Houtu was surprised. “Continue.”","“I traveled here from the future to save a friend, but I went farther back in time than I expected. My friend passed away due to an accident. I found the immortal medicine, but I’ll need her soul from the Underworld in order to revive her.”","“It sounds like you’re a loyal friend...” Houtu cast her gaze on Xihe and Qiu Honglei. Bringing two other women to save a woman? Perhaps I’m too hasty in my judgment. “But why did she call me big sister Yu earlier?”","“She was referring to Yu Yanluo, who is also one of my good friends.”","Houtu’s gaze turned weird. “By good friend, you mean like them?”","Her pure, compassionate gaze made Zu An feel incredibly awkward as he answered, “Yes, we have braved life and death situations together.”","Houtu fell silent. Anger flickered across her face as she thought that Zu An was taking advantage of her, but on second thought, she didn’t think that anyone would crack that kind of joke. So, she asked, “Does that Yu Yanluo really look identical to me?”","“Yes, but you have different demeanors. She’s gentler, whereas you’re more solemn,” Zu An replied.","Houtu’s face turned grim. “Someone of your level should understand that if anyone looks identical to people of our stature, the chances are that they are those people's future incarnations.”","“Yes, I understand.”","The old Zu An might have shrugged it off as a coincidence, but having met the Goddess of Wu Mountain and Pei Mianman, Gong Suyin and Shang Liuyu, as well as Xihe and Shang Hongyu, there was no way he would think it was just a coincidence anymore. The only other possibility was that Yu Yanluo, like Qiu Honglei, had somehow traveled to this world as well, but that clearly wasn’t the case here.","“Impossible. There’s no way I’ll reincarnate,” Houtu declared firmly before giving Zu An a hostile gaze.","“Because you plan to become the cycle of reincarnation?” Zu An replied with a sigh.","Houtu was startled. “How do you know that?” That was her biggest secret. She had never told anyone about it. In fact, it was nothing more than a conceptual plan at the moment.","“Didn’t I tell you that I’m from the future?” Zu An explained. “You must think that you can’t possibly reincarnate because you'll have already turned into the Six Paths of Reincarnation, right?”","“Six Paths of Reincarnation...” Houtu’s eyes lit up. “I see. I need to gather the authorities of the Six Paths first.”","Zu An was astonished. He'd thought that she would already have that figured out. What a turn of fate it was that he was the one who gave her the final piece to that puzzle!","Houtu looked at Zu An and said, “Words are empty. Show me the memories between you and that Miss Yu.”","“Sure.” Zu An accepted the request.","Houtu was surprised that he agreed to it, but she didn’t hesitate to get into action. With a wave of her sleeves, she tapped into her powers and began projecting images in the air. They showed Zu An’s first meeting with Yu Yanluo outside Brightmoon City, as well as everything that happened afterward.","Xihe watched the projections in a daze. She'd heard stories from Qiu Honglei, but she hadn’t experienced it herself. Witnessing it in person shook her heart. She couldn’t help but grit her teeth when she saw how Zu An had nearly died saving Yu Yanluo several times. He really goes all out for his flirting!","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +233... +233... +233...","After watching the projections, Houtu felt conflicted. “I wouldn't have expected us to have such emotional entanglements in the future.”","Zu An felt conflicted as well. “I also didn’t expect you to be Yu Yanluo’s previous incarnation...” He was filled with respect for Houtu. The latter had sacrificed herself to become the Six Paths of Reincarnation. He dared not sully her.","Houtu extended her hand to Zu An and said, “Come here...”","Qiu Honglei and Xihe shot Zu An bizarre looks, but Zu An walked over to grab Houtu’s hand. The moment their fingers touched, Zu An’s surroundings morphed. He had been transported into another space, where Qiu Honglei and Xihe were nowhere to be seen.","Zu An was startled, but Houtu reassured him, “Don’t worry. I just want to speak to you in private, lest they bring you danger.”","Zu An noticed the grimness in her voice, and his face turned severe as well.","“I have always wondered if there are even more powerful entities than the Saints, and your memories confirmed that. I didn’t expect there to be universal deities above the Saints.” Houtu looked at Zu An. “I saw in your memories that my incarnation happens to also be the incarnation of the Deity of Love and Beauty?”","“Indeed. That’s also why I was so surprised when I saw your appearance.” Zu An was filled with doubts. It was one thing for Yu Yanluo to be the Deity of Love and Beauty’s incarnation, but how had she become Houtu’s incarnation as well? Did that mean Houtu was also one of the Deity of Love and Beauty’s incarnations?","Houtu looked as if she had an epiphany. “Something is wrong with this world.”"]},{"number":2950,"title":"Chapter 2950: Chapter 2902: Revival","paragraphs":["Zu An hurriedly asked, “Lady Houtu, did you figure something out?” Even though Houtu was likely to be Yu Yanluo’s previous incarnation, they were still two separate individuals. He felt obliged to address her respectfully.","Houtu replied, “I have had a vague feeling that something is wrong with this world in recent years, but whenever my thoughts drifted in that direction, I’d always be distracted by some other matter. This might not have occurred to me at all if you hadn’t mentioned it.”","“Are you saying that someone is controlling everything from the shadows?” Zu An’s heart lurched. Houtu was already one of the strongest entities in this world. He couldn’t imagine what it would take to manipulate her without her noticing.","“I’m not sure.” Houtu lowered her head and pondered.","“Lady Houtu, have you heard about the World Gate?”","“World Gate? Where did you hear that from?” Houtu was startled.","Zu An told her that Emperor Jun had left to explore the World Gate, only to go missing afterward. Houtu was Yu Yanluo’s past incarnation, and she had sacrificed herself to better the world. It was worth trusting someone like that.","Houtu’s eyes glowed. “I see, I see!”","Zu An patiently waited for her answer.","Houtu finally continued, “I don’t know where the World Gate is, but I have a few guesses. I’ll need more time to think them through and verify their plausibility. In the meantime, why don’t you tell me the traits of the friend whose soul you wish to rescue from the Underworld?”","Zu An was overjoyed. He waved his hand and projected Yaoji’s appearance in the air before sharing some of her traits.","Houtu nodded. She closed her eyes to look for Yaoji.","A second later, a wisp of light appeared before them. The wisp enlarged into a transparent bubble, where a beautiful woman was curled within. It was none other than Yaoji! But this Yaoji was younger and feebler than how Zu An remembered her. Her soul was translucent, and it looked like she could dissipate at any moment.","With a tap of her finger, Houtu channeled her energy into the bubble. Yaoji’s soul became more corporeal. Houtu explained, “Her soul is extremely weak, and she passed away at a young age. If she weren’t the Flame Emperor’s daughter, her soul would have dissipated by now. Even so, she has sustained some losses wandering in the Underworld. She would have dissipated if you had come mere days later.”","“Thank you for your help, Lady Houtu.” Zu An was grateful.","Houtu continued, “Her body is innately deficient. Even if you save her with the immortal medicine, she’ll still have a weak body that is prone to illnesses. I don’t think she’ll turn out the same way she does in the future with just that.”","She tapped her finger once more. A clump of dirt imbued with divine light appeared in Zu An’s hand. Houtu explained, “After returning her soul to her body, you can nourish her in this divine soil. In due time, she should make a full recovery and fix her innate deficiency.”","Zu An sensed the overflowing life force inside the divine soil and carefully stowed it away. “I shall thank Lady Houtu on Yaoji’s behalf.”","“Go and save her. I need some quiet time to process what you have just told me.” Houtu waved her sleeve, and the two of them flew out of the unique space.","Qiu Honglei and Xihe rushed to Zu An’s side. Upon seeing that he was safe and sound, they exhaled in relief.","“I’ll send you out,” Houtu said. A gentle divine light enveloped the trio and escorted them out of the Underworld.","Zu An morphed back into Emperor Jun in time to not be caught by Shencha and Youlei.","“Sending off the Celestial Emperor!” Shencha and Youlei looked at the three departing figures and couldn’t help gossiping once more.","Zu An used Rainbow Morph to transport the three of them to the Firecloud Cave.","Shennong had been camping next to his daughter. When he saw the Lady of Nine Heavens, his eyes lit up with hope. He anxiously asked, “Did you find the immortal medicine?”","Having been to the Kunlun Mountain, he knew that the Lady of Nine Heavens was the Queen Mother of the West’s subordinate.","Zu An nodded. He carefully opened his palm to guide Yaoji’s soul into her body. Anyone else would have struggled with this task, but he was the Netherworld’s master and wielded Death’s authority. It wasn’t too difficult for him to accomplish this feat.","When her feeble soul entered her feeble body, Yaoji’s pale cheeks regained some redness.","Shennong was overjoyed. “Yaoji has come back to life!”","Xihe coldly remarked, “It isn’t that simple.”","Indeed, Yaoji’s soul was in danger of tearing away from her body. If not for Zu An temporarily sealing her soul inside her body with his divine power, it would have drifted back out. Given how weak her soul was, it would dissipate before it could reach the Underworld.","Qiu Honglei anxiously took out the peach. “Quick, use the immortal medicine to save her!”","Yaoji had to consume the immortal medicine to return to life, but how could a deceased individual consume a peach?","Zu An grabbed the peach, took a bite, and used his divine power to envelop its nourishment. Then, he transferred it into Yaoji’s mouth through a kiss. Just like that, he fed Yaoji a mouthful at a time.","Shennong’s eyebrows shot up, but he didn’t kick up a fuss.","The peach transformed into life force to nourish Yaoji’s body. At the same time, her soul gradually fused into her body.","“She has resumed breathing!” Qiu Honglei was delighted.","Shennong was moved to tears. “Thank you for saving my little daughter’s life.” He knew it had to be an arduous undertaking for Zu An to find the immortal medicine and retrieve his daughter’s soul. He had no idea how he could thank him.","Zu An’s face remained grim. “Lady Houtu mentioned that Yaoji suffers from an innate deficiency, and that her body would remain weak even after returning to life. So, she lent me her divine soil to resolve this problem.” He took out the divine soil and scattered it around Yaoji. It was a small pinch of soil, but it grew into a vessel around her.","“Lady Houtu’s Five-Colored Divine Soil!” Shennong recognized the divine soil. He took out a crimson whip and gently struck Yaoji, who slowly transformed into a pristine little grass.","Zu An was horrified. “What did you do?”","Shennong explained, “This is the best way to resolve Yaoji’s innate deficiency. With the Five-Colored Divine Soil’s nourishment and my Ochre Whip’s wood essence, Yaoji can reforge herself in the form of a jade grass. When the jade grass matures, she’ll be born anew. Not only will her innate deficiency be resolved, but she’ll also receive unique traits.","“The only problem is that the Firecloud Cave is too warm. It’s not suited for the growth of jade grass. We’ll have to find a location that is humid and rich in ki to nourish he”","A thought surfaced in Zu An’s mind. “I know a suitable place—Wu Mountain’s Goddess Peak!”"]},{"number":2951,"title":"Chapter 2951: Chapter 2903: Where The Problem Lies","paragraphs":["“I have been to the Wu Mountain to harvest herbs. It is a good place.” Shennong frowned. “But it’s too far from the Firecloud Cave, and I cannot leave my clansmen for too long. There are still many matters I need to attend to...”","“Don’t worry, I’ll escort Yaoji over and protect her.” Zu An looked at the young jade grass with tender eyes.","Shennong hesitated. His daughter was more vulnerable than ever. It felt too risky to entrust her to someone of an unknown background whom he had only met two days ago.","Xihe saw through his thoughts and got straight to the point. “Be it procuring the immortal medicine or retrieving Yaoji’s soul from the Underworld, these feats are difficult enough to win over any woman in the world. Shouldn’t these be enough to prove his feelings for Yaoji? What else are you worried about?”","“Xihe, don’t say that.” Zu An knew that she was speaking up for him, but those words were still overboard.","“The Sun Goddess’s words are jarring, but they carry grains of truth. I was too inflexible,” Shennong said with a self-deprecating smile. “You have done more than enough to prove your feelings for Yaoji. I can rest at ease knowing that she’s safe in your care.”","He took out a formation disc and handed it to Zu An. “This is a Mountain Protection Formation. It can alter Wu Mountain’s environment, enriching its ki to support the growth of flora and fauna. At the same time, it can also protect Wu Mountain from intruders. This is the only thing I can do for my daughter now.”","Zu An accepted the formation disc. They discussed several more details before Zu An carefully took the jade grass and made his way to Wu Mountain.","Upon reaching the Wu Mountain, even Xihe couldn’t help but exclaim, “This is a good place to cultivate at.” She had to consciously suppress her flames to avoid ruining the environment.","Zu An took out Shennong’s formation plate. Even with his mastery of formations, he still thought that the Mountain Protection Formation was top-notch. He made some quick improvements to it before tossing it into the air.","A light green barrier enveloped Wu Mountain. The clouds became dreamy, and a spirit spring flowed down the mountain peak to nourish its greenery. Ki suffused the entire mountain. Just taking a breath in this environment could lengthen a mortal’s lifespan.","Next, Zu An flew up to the Goddess Peak. In truth, the Goddess Peak was still without a name in this era, and it was only half as tall as it would be in the future. It looked more like a plateau among the mountains.","Zu An planted the jade grass wrapped in Five-Colored Divine Soil atop the Goddess Peak.","Qiu Honglei passed him some nectar from the Jade Pond. “Big brother Zu, the Jade Pond’s nectar harnesses life force and energies from the universe. It has the power to nurture immortal medicine. I’m sure it will be of help to Yaoji.”","Zu An took the jade bottle and carefully poured a droplet on the jade grass. He didn’t dare to use too much, fearing that the Jade Pond’s nectar was too much for the currently feeble Yaoji to bear. He would have to wait for her to grow a little bigger before pouring more.","As soon as the jade nectar landed, the slim jade grass grew a little bigger, and its body emanated a pristine green glow.","Zu An was overjoyed. “Honglei, I can’t be more glad to have met you here! This must be fate!”","“Fate truly works in mysterious ways.” Qiu Honglei knew that Zu An had been blaming himself for failing to save the Goddess of Wu Mountain all these years. His eyes always carried a tinge of regret even when he was smiling. This was the first time in a long while that he finally smiled without burden.","Xihe felt sour. They are as close as family members. I, the wife, am the outsider here.","A pair of warm hands suddenly embraced her. “Xihe, thank you for your accompaniment. Come to think about it, we have been through three generations together now.”","Looking into Zu An’s starry eyes, Xihe’s anger drifted away. This fellow is really my nemesis. Even his smile is enough to spark joy in me.","So, the three of them settled down on Wu Mountain. They spent their time caring for the jade grass while enjoying one another’s company. It was a warm and relaxing time.","Xihe learned more and more about Zu An. As she fell deeper in love with him, she began to worry about why the future her didn’t remember all of these things, as well as the incident of Hou Yi shooting down the suns in the future. But she suppressed her worries instead of shattering this rare moment of happiness. I’ll trust him since I have already chosen him.","In contrast, Qiu Honglei was much more relaxed. She and Zu An fully relished in the joy of a couple’s long-awaited reunion.","During such times, Xihe would make her way to the Goddess Peak to water the jade grass. Seeing it growing greener each day lifted her mood, and she talked idly to it.","“Yaoji, you should quickly grow up and see just how much of a philanderer this fellow is with your own eyes. He actually wants me to join them. How can I, the Sun Goddess, do something like that? That Lady of Nine Heavens is also something else. I thought that she would be a calm and collected person, but she just keeps egging me on.","“I know what she’s thinking. She wants to pull me to her side, so that we can join forces against that Chu Chuyan. I heard that your future incarnation is a close friend of that Chu Chuyan woman. Is she that scary?","“Haaa. I’m taking care of you now. You must help me save my sons in the future.”","...","Donghuang Taiyi had been urging Zu An to return to the Celestial Palace, but Zu An insisted on guarding Wu Mountain because he was worried about Yaoji.","As Zu An had fulfilled his end of the promise by stopping Shennong from joining forces with Xuanyuan, Donghuang Taiyi could only let this matter drop. He decided to confront Xuanyuan with the Ten Fiend Generals.","After sending off the envoy, Zu An chuckled to himself. What’s the point of clawing at each other’s throats to become the Celestial Emperor in this world? There is already a problem with this world.","A spatial pulsation suddenly rippled, and Houtu emerged from the void. After leaving the dark Underworld, she looked even more ravishing.","Zu An quickly pulled himself together and asked, “Lady Houtu, what brings you here?”","Xihe had previously mentioned that Houtu had never left the Underworld.","Houtu got to the point and said, “I have been thinking things through, and I suddenly realized something. You said that I would forge the Six Paths of Reincarnation in the future, but why didn’t I just do it now?”","Zu An was taken aback.","Indeed, the future Houtu was merely a shadow of her former self; she had to entrust the job of collecting the six power insignias to the relatively weak Zu An in the future. That was a risky move, and she would run the risk of never completing the Six Paths of Reincarnation. In contrast, the current Houtu was a powerhouse comparable to the Celestial Emperor. There was no better time to forge the Six Paths of Reincarnation than now.","Houtu continued, “You are the current Celestial Emperor, and I still retain my strength now. I believe I should forge the Six Paths of Reincarnation right now before figuring out where the problem lies.”"]},{"number":2952,"title":"Chapter 2952: Chapter 2904: Mount Meru","paragraphs":["“Alright.” Zu An was also perplexed as to why the current Houtu hadn’t created the Six Paths of Reincarnation.","Houtu continued, “I have conceptualized ideas about the Six Paths of Reincarnation, but there are still many details that I have yet to sort out. You told me that all entities can be categorized into six paths—the Celestial Path, the Human Path, the Hell Path, the Beast Path, the Hungry Ghost Path, and the Asura Path. That makes sense to me, so let’s go with that.","“You are now the Celestial Emperor, so you wield the power insignia of the Celestial Path. I am also the Underworld’s master, so I wield the power insignia of the Hungry Ghost Path.","“I have always thought the Underworld should differentiate between benevolent ghosts and vile ghosts. You mentioned the concept of eighteen levels of hell. It sounds reasonable to me. Since you are the future master of the Netherworld and govern the eighteen levels of hell, it stands to reason that you also wield the power insignia of the Hell Path.”","Zu An nodded. “Yes, that's right.”","On top of being the Netherworld’s master, he also wielded a portion of Death’s authority. It wouldn’t be too difficult for him to create the power insignia of the Hell Path.","Houtu continued, “The current human race was created by Nuwa, so she should wield the power insignia of the Human Path. I am on close terms with Nuwa, so I shouldn’t face many problems obtaining a portion of the Human Path’s power insignia from her.”","“The only troublesome ones are the Asura Path and the Beast Path.” She frowned. “The Asuras are obsessed with fighting, and they are on bad terms with the Shaman races. It won’t be easy to acquire their power insignias.”","“The Asuras...” Zu An recalled a beautiful silhouette, and that brought him a tinge of melancholy. “My future self has some ties with the Asuras. They are hot-tempered, but they aren’t that difficult to get along with. I’ll make a trip to the Asura race and see if I can secure their power insignia.”","Houtu was surprised. “You have been to many places. Someone of your strength is bound to have his ways. However, there is one more problem. The Beast Path has no power insignia.”","Worry flickered across her beautiful face as she continued, “The birds and mammals of the Beast Path are not sentient yet, and they have no king, either. There is no way to acquire their power insignia. How did the future me solve the problem of the Beast Path’s power insignia?”","Zu An replied with a frown, “The lower-ranked fiends in this world eventually moved to the Monster World and formed a civilization. However, I don’t know if the Monster World exists in this world yet.”","“The Monster World?” Houtu did some calculations on her fingers before shaking her head. “Based on what I know, such a Monster World doesn’t exist.”","Zu An was taken aback. Does this mean that the Monster World has yet to come into existence?","“I’ll pay a visit to Nuwa. I’ll trouble you to make a trip to the Asura race.” Houtu bowed to Zu An.","Zu An hurriedly returned the bow. “You don’t have to be so courteous, Lady Houtu. You have done me a huge favor in the future, so it’s only right for me to do what’s within my ability for you. However, the Six Paths of Reincarnation cannot be formed if the Beast Path’s power insignia doesn't exist yet. Our efforts might be in vain.”","Houtu smiled. “Aren’t we languishing if we put aside our immediate responsibilities with the notion that things will just work out in the future? Fate is capricious. You never know if our current effort might be what lays the groundwork for future success.”","Zu An nodded in realization. “Your words have enlightened me.”","Houtu directed acknowledging nods toward the others before she turned around and left.","Qiu Honglei and Xihe worriedly asked, “Are you heading to the Asura race?”","Zu An nodded. “Houtu is right. The future might not be realized if I don’t do anything right now. I’ll make a trip to the Asura race. Please help me take care of Yaoji in the meantime.”","Qiu Honglei spent a moment in thought before saying, “This place is layered with Shennong’s Mountain Protection Formation and your formations. I should be able to take care of Yaoji alone. I heard that the Asuras are belligerent and have never been on good terms with the Celestials. In particular, the Asura King is a powerful entity. It’ll be dangerous for you to head there alone, so it’ll be better if big sister Xihe accompanies you.”","Xihe was moved, knowing that Qiu Honglei was creating opportunities for them to be together since their time together was destined to be limited. However, she was too proud to accept such goodwill. “He is strong enough to travel across spacetime. Surely a mere Asura race wouldn’t be a problem for him. There’s no reason for me to accompany him.”","Zu An had gotten a grasp of Xihe’s personality. He replied with a smile, “Madame, please have mercy on your husband and help him out. I don’t even know where the Asura race resides.”","Xihe’s lips curled into a smile, but she quickly suppressed it. “ Cough cough. In view of your sincerity, I’ll bring you to the Asura race before returning to accompany my little sister Honglei.”","Qiu Honglei secretly chuckled under her hand. I didn’t expect big sister Xihe to have such a youthful side.","Zu An and Xihe waved Qiu Honglei farewell before making their way to the Asura race's territory.","“Most Asuras reside on Mount Meru,” Xihe said.","“Mount Meru?” Zu An was surprised. When he met the Asuras in the future, they were already residing in the Underworld, fighting against the remnants of the Shaman races. He hadn’t expected them to originally reside on Mount Meru.","“The Asuras are a warring race. They have been at war with the Celestials for a long time now. Both sides are roughly equally matched, though the Celestials held the upper hand. You can tell from how Emperor Jun often brings his subordinates to kidnap the Asura race’s beauties,” Xihe spat. “Asura men are savage and hideous, but asura women are gorgeous. Most fairies in the Celestial Palace are asuras.”","Zu An hadn’t expected such enmity between the two sides. He had noticed that the Celestial Palace was filled with beautiful fairies, but he hadn’t expected them to be asuras.","“You shouldn’t head there as Emperor Jun, or else the Asuras will skin you alive,” Xihe said with a snicker, as if she couldn’t wait to watch the spectacle.","Zu An assessed Xihe from head to toe.","Feeling unnerved, Xihe asked, “Why are you looking at me like that?”","“I can put aside my identity as Emperor Jun, but your reputation as the Sun Goddess is resounding as well. The world knows that you have recently become the Celestial Empress. Won’t you give us away?”","Xihe harrumphed. “That’s easy to deal with.”","She transformed into a graceful gentleman holding a foldable fan. “This should be fine.”","Zu An was awed. “I finally understand why some emperors in history were into men. It’s because of people like you that some men are led astray.”","“Stop messing around...” Xihe spat, though she felt gleeful at the compliment.","It didn’t take long for them to reach their destination.","As soon as they stepped onto Mount Meru, tens of hideous asura guards surrounded them and roared, “These two must be spies from the Celestial Court!”","Zu An and Xihe were speechless."]},{"number":2953,"title":"Chapter 2953: Chapter 2905: Asura Lady","paragraphs":["Zu An clasped his fist and said, “You have misunderstood. We are here to request an audience with the Asura King. We beseech you to relay our request.”","“The Asura King?” The faces of the asura guards darkened. “The Asura King has been assassinated. We are searching for the culprit right now. You two are suspicious. Who knows if you are related to the culprit?”","Zu An was dumbstruck. He had shrugged off Lady Houtu’s warning that the Asuras were extremely belligerent, since he was on good terms with the future Asura royal family. With this connection, he'd thought that it would be easy for him to befriend them. Little had he expected the Asura King to be assassinated.","Xihe retorted, “We have only just arrived here. We don’t even know what happened in your Asura World, so how can we be related to the culprit?”","“Follow us to Iron City. We’ll know the truth once we interrogate you. You’ll be released once we confirm your innocence,” the leader of the asura guards coldly spat.","Zu An had learned from Xihe that the Asura World had three major cities—Golden City, Silver City, and Iron City. These three cities were helmed by the three strongest asuras. Golden City was under the Asura King, whereas the other two cities were ruled by asuras of comparable stature to the Asura King.","Xihe scoffed, “We have come to visit a friend, yet you want to detain us without a legitimate reason. Do you take us for three-year-old kids?”","Once they were imprisoned, they wouldn’t have a say as to whether they were innocent or not.","The leader of the asuras was infuriated. “Arrest them!”","The asuras were about to make a move when a seven-colored light flashed and the world spun before their eyes. By the time they snapped out of their daze, Zu An and Xihe were already gone. They exchanged looks, wondering if they had been hallucinating.","Zu An and Xihe entered Meru Mountain.","It was a mountain, but it pierced into the clouds, towering as high as heaven. There were three floating cities at the foot, the midpoint, and the peak of the mountain. The city at the mountain peak emanated a radiant golden glow even from a great distance away. That was the legendary Golden City, the Asura race’s capital and where the Asura King lived. The city located at the midpoint of the mountain reflected a white gleam. That was Silver City. And the iron-gray city closest to Xihe and Zu An was Iron City, where the bulk of the Asura King’s army was stationed.","After the earlier encounter, Zu An and Xihe chose to conceal themselves and snuck into Iron City. Zu An even disguised himself as a hideous asura and crafted an ugly mask for Xihe. Asura men were notorious for their ugliness, after all. If they scaled Mount Meru with the appearance of ordinary humans, they would be discovered right away.","Xihe regretted crossdressing. How was she to know that there had been an upheaval in the Asura World? Her previous getup would have worked for the old Asura World, which had its fair share of visitors from other races. But the current Asura World was shrouded in an air of desolation. The guards patrolling the streets didn’t hesitate to capture and interrogate anyone whom they deemed suspicious. There was no one from the other races around. Perhaps they had all been thrown into prison.","“Is the Asura King really dead?” Zu An was worried. He would have no idea where to find the Asura Path’s power insignia if that was the case.","Xihe rolled her eyes. “Aren’t you from the future? Why don’t you know about this?”","Zu An sheepishly replied, “I'm not familiar with the Asura World’s history. I only had a brief encounter with them in the future, so my understanding of them is limited.”","Xihe sighed before saying, “The Asuras worship the strong, and the Asura King is the most powerful individual in the Asura World. His strength rivals Emperor Jun and Donghuang Taiyi. That’s how the Asuras have survived their countless fights against the Celestials. I can’t imagine someone like that being assassinated.”","Zu An sighed. “Even someone as powerful as Emperor Jun has died without leaving a trace.”","Xihe also fell silent. Could the Asura King have met with the same fate as Emperor Jun? This feels like the calm before the storm.","Zu An suddenly frowned. “Someone is approaching.”","Xihe looked over. “It seems to be a woman.”","A slender woman from another street was rushing in their direction. She wore a veil that obscured her facial features, but judging from her physique and air of youthfulness, it wasn't difficult to imagine that she was a beauty.","Xihe sneered, “I hope you aren’t feeling sorry for her, are you?” This fellow is too much of a philanderer.","Zu An huffed in response, “I intervene based on the situation, not whether the other party is a woman or not.”","Through his divine sense, he saw a group of asuras pursuing the masked woman, but he didn’t want to get involved before getting to the bottom of the situation. Besides, he had other matters to attend to here.","The masked woman turned at the bend of the street and headed toward them. Her hair was woven into little braids. She was scantily dressed, revealing her slender waist and youthful thighs. It was difficult to resist the urge to take a second look at her.","Zu An was dazed, not because of her beauty but because she reminded him of someone.","Xihe noticed his expression and sneered.","The masked woman was startled to see the two of them, but she quickly exclaimed joyously, “You’re finally here!”","Xihe was stunned. This cunning woman is dragging us down in hopes that we’ll create an opening for her to escape?","She nearly laughed out of sheer anger. But before she could explain, the asura guards had already unleashed attacks on them.","Zu An frowned. With a wave of his hand, he conjured a void that devoured all the attacks targeting them.","The asuras widened their eyes as if they had seen a ghost.","The masked woman was startled as well. She had only intended to use these two to stall her pursuers; she hadn’t expected them to be this powerful. Realizing that she had trifled with the wrong people, she hastened her footsteps to escape.","But Xihe grabbed her shoulder and said, “Miss, you’re being too optimistic if you think you can get away after dragging us down into the mud.”","By this point, the asuras had realized that Zu An and Xihe weren’t enemies they could deal with. They immediately turned tail and fled.","“We can’t let them get away! We’ll be goners if this matter reaches the ears of the lord of Iron City, Lozento!” the masked woman exclaimed.","Due to her struggling, her veil fell, revealing a beautiful but flustered face.","The sight of her face made Zu An’s heart skip a beat. With a wave of his hand, he quickly captured all the asura guards into his seven-colored halo."]},{"number":2954,"title":"Chapter 2954: Chapter 2906: Princess Liuli","paragraphs":["Xihe snorted in disdain, “I knew it. You’re taking pity on her because she’s beautiful.” She had also caught sight of the masked woman’s face. Even after seeing the Lady of Nine Heavens and Lady Houtu, she was still enchanted by the woman before her.","The asura woman wore a leather breastplate that exposed a belly devoid of excess fat. She had a slender frame, but she wasn't skinny. Her body seemed to harness explosive strength. It was the kind of body that enchanted men. She wore an extremely short skirt that didn’t look crass in the least. On the contrary, her firm thighs and honeyed skin added to her vibrant, youthful charm.","Xihe was stunned. She had heard a lot about the beauty of Asura women, but she hadn’t expected a random girl they bumped into would be this gorgeous as well. How could the fairies of the Celestial Court compete with this?","Meanwhile, Zu An stared intently at the asura woman.","Xihe frowned. Is it yet another one of his lovers?","“Mo Xi?” Zu An called out with a quivering voice. He shouldn’t have been this shaken up since it wasn't his first time encountering such a situation, but the woman standing before him wasn't one of his lovers; it was Valkyrie Mo Xi!","He had left Mo Xi in the Frost Palace to accompany Gong Suyin, hoping that she could grow stronger and later use her ‘Farewell, Nanchao’ ability to sever the Frost Palace’s restraints on Gong Suyin. But he later lost contact with the two of them.","It was with great difficulty that he finally returned to the Celestial Court world. He had managed to find Yaoji, though she wasn’t the Goddess of Wu Mountain he knew yet, but there had been no news about Gong Suyin and Mo Xi at all. Given that, he was shocked to see Mo Xi here. To top things off, she was speaking! Could she have had a fortuitous encounter here and regained her soul?","There were so many questions in Zu An’s mind that he had no idea where to start from. So, he revealed his true appearance, hoping that the other party would understand what was going on from that.","Xihe rolled her eyes. Do you think you can do whatever you want just because you’re good-looking? Look at how beautiful this lady is. I’m sure she has plenty of hot suitors...","But her thoughts were quickly put to a halt. The asura woman’s eyes lit up as she exclaimed, “Woah, you’re handsome!”","Xihe was stunned. She belatedly remembered that this woman was an asura, and asura men were unbelievably hideous.","But Zu An was disappointed. “Is that all?”","Xihe gritted her teeth in anger. Aren’t you getting ahead of yourself here?","The energetic asura woman blinked in confusion. Seconds later, she widened her eyes in realization and added, “You’re strong, too!”","Indeed, Zu An was formidable to have instantly subdued all the asura guards on her tail.","The sliver of hope Zu An had been clutching to was extinguished. “Who are you? Why are there asura guards pursuing you?”","“They were mesmerized by my beauty and harbored lustful thoughts toward me,” the asura woman replied. Her expression was so pitiful that most men would go to all lengths to exact vengeance for her.","But Zu An wasn't like most men. He frowned upon hearing her words.","Xihe, as a woman, was immune to her seduction. She sneered, “The asuras might be savage, but they won’t stoop so low as to have official guards kidnap a lady in broad daylight. I heard the Asura King has been assassinated, and the Asura World is searching for the culprit right now. From the looks of it now, you must be the culprit.”","The asura woman hurriedly waved her hand to deny it. “It wasn’t me! And the Asura King hasn’t been assassinated. He has been imprisoned by those traitorous subjects!”","Zu An and Xihe exchanged shocked looks.","Xihe continued, “You’re lying. The Asura King is the strongest individual in the Asura World. How can anyone imprison him? And how would you know of such a secret?”","“You aren’t asuras.” The asura woman bit her lips while assessing the duo. All of a sudden, her face warped in shock. “I sense a celestial aura. You are the dogs of those celestials!”","Zu An was speechless. He'd heard that the Asuras had been at war with the Celestials for a long time now, but he hadn’t expected their grudge to be this deep-seated. He replied, “I'm not a celestial, but a human. She is my friend.”","The asura woman was surprised. “I would have never expected there to be such a powerful expert among the weak humans! And to think that a celestial would befriend a human.”","Xihe was starting to lose her patience. She tightened her grip on the asura woman’s shoulder as she snorted, “I don’t think you understand the situation you’re in. We’re the ones asking the questions.”","“Ouch ouch ouch...” The asura woman looked at Xihe. “Oh? You are a woman. A celestial woman getting together with a human man. How interesting.”","Xihe was taken aback. “How do you know I’m a woman?” She was confident in her disguise.","“No man would treat me like this,” the asura woman replied with a sigh.","Xihe was stunned. This asura woman has guts. I’m already holding her hostage, but she is still in the mood to kid around with me.","Zu An coldly remarked, “There’s no point beating around the bush. Do you believe me when I say that I can read your memories?”","“Alright, alright! I don’t doubt that you have the power to read my memories.” The asura woman finally put on a serious tone. “I doubt a human and a celestial would become the lackeys of Lozento and Pimosh, and I don’t mind telling you two.”","Startled, Xihe filled Zu An in on the details through telepathy, “Lozento is the Asura War God. He is the master of Iron City, and he commands the Asura race’s strongest army. Pimosh is their First Elder. He is the master of Silver City, and he is highly respected in the Asura World. Lozento, Pimosh, and the Asura King are the three strongest experts of the Asura race. If the two of them joined forces, it is possible for them to have imprisoned the Asura King.”","The asura woman continued, “I am the Asura King’s daughter, Princess Liuli. Lozento and Pimosh suddenly staged an uprising in a recent ritual and killed my father’s loyal guards. My father bought time for me to escape, but he was captured by them. I fled from Golden City to Iron City, but a traitor exposed my whereabouts. Lozento immediately sent his troops to capture me.”","...","“So you are Princess Liuli. I have heard of you.” Xihe exhaled in relief. If even an ordinary asura woman was this beautiful, it would be time for the fairies of the Celestial Court to smash their mirrors.","“Who are you, big sister? Someone as beautiful as you must be a renowned goddess. Are you the Lady of Nine Heavens, the Sun Goddess...” Princess Liuli named several people.","Xihe tried her best to maintain a straight face lest she give her identity away. She turned to Zu An and asked him about how they should proceed.","Zu An replied, “If those two have gone to the extent of staging an uprising, why don’t they just kill the Asura King instead of imprisoning him?”","“They won’t be able to acquire the Asuras’ power insignia if they kill my father,” Princess Liuli replied.","Zu An and Xihe’s hearts skipped a beat. They had struck the jackpot!"]},{"number":2955,"title":"Chapter 2955: Chapter 2907: Special Envoy","paragraphs":["“What does the Asuras’ power insignia look like?” Zu An asked. Power insignias manifested in different forms in different worlds. It could be a scepter, a gemstone, or something intangible like a law.","“Only my father knows. That’s why those two imprisoned him but dared not take his life,” Princess Liuli replied.","“You’re lying. Lozento is an upright individual. That’s why the Asura King entrusted the most elite Asura army to him in the first place. Someone like that wouldn’t betray the Asura King,” Xihe interjected.","Princess Liuli frowned. “That confuses me as well. My father must have trusted him and lowered his guard, or else he wouldn’t have been taken down that easily.”","Zu An couldn’t help but secretly ask Xihe, “Why aren’t you doubting Pimosh?”","Xihe rolled her eyes. “It’s all because of you.”","“What does this have to do with me?” Zu An was baffled.","Xihe finally explained, “The Asura World envied the Celestial World’s beauty and prosperity, so they married the most beautiful Asura woman off to Emperor Jun to forge closer ties. That woman’s name is Shezhi, which means ‘Sincerity’ and ‘Pleasure’ in the Asura tongue. That greatly delighted Emperor Jun, and he took her into his harem.","“Later, Shezhi began missing home, so she wanted to invite her father, Pimosh, and close friends to the Celestial World as guests. Emperor Jun acceded to her request.","“Pimosh was flattered by the gesture. He gathered a huge bunch of friends and headed to the Celestial Court to visit his daughter. Actually, visiting his daughter was of secondary importance; he wanted to brag by showing the other asuras the Celestial World.","“Unfortunately, their huge group was stopped at the Celestial Court’s entrance. To be fair, the Celestials were extremely arrogant then and looked down on the Asuras from the bottom of their hearts. On top of that, they didn’t speak a common language. In the end, they failed to enter the Celestial Court.","“Pimosh wanted to brag about his daughter’s marriage before the other asuras, but he ended up being locked out instead. He saw that as an affront. As soon as he returned to the Asura World, he began stoking the flames of war against the Celestial Court. Many asuras also felt insulted by the Celestial Court’s arrogance, and there was already a deep-seated grudge between both worlds. Under his rally, practically the entire Asura World joined the battle.”","“It was a terrible war. The celestials and the asuras suffered a lot of casualties. The ruins of the battlefield felt like a glimpse of hell... and it was all because of you!”","Zu An was rendered speechless. “Isn’t Emperor Jun the culprit behind this mess? What does this have to do with me?”","“Aren’t you Emperor Jun right now?” Xihe glared at Zu An with contemptuous eyes.","Zu An was speechless. He still harbored some doubts regarding this matter, though, so he asked, “Emperor Jun already accepted Shezhi’s request to invite asuras into the Celestial World, so why was Pimosh blocked at the entrance?”","“You’ll have to ask Emperor Jun.” Xihe harrumphed. “Those arrogant celestials probably just looked down on the asuras and didn’t want to let them in, and Emperor Jun let them have their way to appease them. What does a promise to a woman count for?”","Zu An wisely didn’t refute Xihe’s words. He turned to Princess Liuli and asked, “Where is your father imprisoned? How many people are still loyal to him?”","He wasn’t so arrogant as to think that he could slaughter his way through the asuras. Pimosh was an expert strong enough to wage a war against the Celestial Court; he was likely to be around Emperor Jun’s level. Similarly, Lozento led the most elite army of the warlike asuras. Even Zu An would have to tread carefully around them.","“My father is imprisoned in Golden City, though I’m not sure about the exact location,” Princess Liuli said. “Most asuras should still be loyal to my father, except for Pimosh and Lozento’s kin and aides. However, the asuras revere the strong. If they learn that my father has been imprisoned, there is no saying whether they might switch loyalties to Pimosh and Lozento. Still, there are a few major factions that are extremely loyal to my father. They should be able to help us if we can get into contact with them. It’s just that Mount Meru is currently on high alert. There’s no way for me to make it to them.”","“I’ll take you there,\" Xihe suddenly spoke up. She turned to Zu An and said, “In the meantime, you should investigate why Lozento betrayed the Asura King and see if there’s any way to mend ties with him. Otherwise, even if we gather the other major factions, it’ll still be hard for us to stand against his army.”","She was worried that Princess Liuli would fall in love with Zu An. Instead of risking that, she would rather take Princess Liuli with her.","Zu An was oblivious to her thoughts. “Alright!”","Princess Liuli looked at the duo with curious eyes. “Who are you? Why are you helping me?” The tides were no longer on her side. There was no reason for these two to take such a huge risk to help her.","“We need to borrow the Asuras’ power insignia,” Xihe said. She glanced at Zu An and added, “And this fellow likes to play the hero.”","Zu An chuckled. He didn’t think that Princess Liuli’s resemblance with Mo Xi was a coincidence, and he was intrigued to know how she would end up as Mo Xi.","Princess Liuli looked at Zu An. “I can sense an Asura Tear from you. Asuras only bleed; they don’t cry. An asura woman would only cry for someone if they were deeply in love with them. I don’t know who that asura woman is, but since she’s willing to trust you, I’ll do the same, too.”","Zu An was taken aback. He remembered the forlorn look in Princess Ni Huang’s eyes when he took his leave, and that dampened his mood.","Xihe gritted her teeth in anger. No wonder this fellow said that he has experience dealing with the Asuras. It turns out he's in a relationship with an asura woman! Is there anywhere in the world where he doesn’t have any lovers? For a moment there, she even suspected that Zu An was actually Emperor Jun.","Princess Liuli quickly explained Mount Meru’s situation to the two of them, as well as provided Zu An some leads to work with when investigating Lozento. Only then did they part ways.","Xihe and Princess Liuli would be heading to the three major camps to liaise with the Asura King’s aides, whereas Zu An would head to the towering City Lord Manor located at the center of Iron City.","Security in Metal City was tighter than ever, especially for the City Lord Manor. Nevertheless, Zu An still easily snuck in using his Myriad Transformations. He followed Princess Liuli’s instructions and soon found Lozento. The latter was meditating inside a sealed chamber alone, seemingly conversing with a portrait.","Zu An was hesitant to get any closer, fearing that he would alarm Lozento. The latter was after all one of the top three asura experts.","Just then, someone outside reported, “Marshal, the First Elder’s envoy requests an audience.”"]},{"number":2956,"title":"Chapter 2956: Chapter 2908: Another Familiar Face","paragraphs":["Zu An narrowed his eyes. This uprising was staged by Marshal Lozento and First Elder Pimosh. Since Pimosh’s envoy was here, he could eavesdrop on their conversation to find out why they had joined forces.","There was a moment of silence before Lozento said, “Let him enter.”","The doors of the sealed chamber opened and a figure draped in a black robe walked in. He was skinny compared to the other asuras, but the guards along the way still treated him with utmost respect.","That’s the robe of an asura priest. He doesn’t seem to be a righteous figure, Zu An thought.","The casually seated Lozento looked at the black-robed man and asked, “Why didn’t Pimosh come in person?”","The black-robed man replied, “The First Elder has other matters to attend to, so he sent me here to liaise with the marshal.”","Zu An was startled. It was a feminine voice, though her way of speaking sounded unnatural. She might have been trying to conceal her original voice. On top of that, she had a peculiar aura that suggested that she might not be an asura.","From the moment Zu An entered the City Lord Manor, he had already sensed a faint aura shrouding the place. If he had to describe it, it felt like a demonic aura. Asuras were already fiery-tempered, and the demonic aura only further stoked their bloodthirst.","Lozento was about to respond when he suddenly looked in Zu An’s direction and roared, “Who’s there?” He tossed his spear in Zu An’s direction.","Zu An hurriedly dodged the spear. It was good that he did, as the spear completely obliterated the place where he'd been hiding before. He was awed by Lozento’s strength, but at the same time, he was also perplexed to know how Lozento discovered him. Was I distracted and accidentally revealed my aura?","Lozento was surprised as well. He couldn’t believe that Zu An had dodged his attack so easily, especially when he had utilized 70% of his full prowess in the earlier spear throw. Not daring to underestimate his opponent, he stood up, conjured nine arms, and began to attack Zu An.","An asura’s strength was determined by their number of arms. The Asura King that Zu An had previously met in the Netherworld had nine arms as well.","Lozento sealed off the space around Zu An, determined to capture him alive. However, he quickly frowned when his nine arms failed to grab anything.","The black-robed woman was surprised. “He managed to escape?” She knew how strong Lozento was. Even First Elder Pimosh would have to go all out to withstand a simultaneous attack from his nine arms, but that mysterious man was able to escape so easily.","“It felt like he had momentarily phased out of this world,” Lozento said in astonishment. He had sealed off the space around Zu An earlier, but that wouldn’t do anything if the other party turned intangible. If not for him being confident in his judgment and the black-robed woman watching from the side, he would have thought that he was seeing things.","Zu An wiped off his cold sweat. That could have turned out disastrous if not for his new skill. Asuras were known to be warlike, and Lozento was the Asuras’ War God. His strength was likely to be on par with Emperor Jun's. On top of that, Iron City was his turf, and he had a huge asura army here. If a battle broke out here, it was only a matter of time before Zu An was worn down.","Zu An didn’t dare to infiltrate the City Lord Manor anymore, so there was no way for him to uncover Lozento and Pimosh’s scheme. That said, he did have a conjecture, and what he had to do next was to verify it. He hid outside the City Lord Manor and waited two hours until the black-robed woman secretly left via the back door.","She was extremely vigilant. She constantly scanned her surroundings to ensure that no one was tailing her, and she took huge detours, occasionally turning into a wisp of black smoke.","Of course, Zu An hadn’t camped outside the City Lord Manor just to let her throw him off. After the earlier precedent, he was more careful than ever. It was a relief the black-robed woman was nowhere as powerful as Lozento, so she didn’t notice him.","In the end, the woman arrived at a barracks outside the city. Zu An had learned from Princess Liuli earlier that this was where Lozento’s most elite Blood Sea Army was stationed.","Zu An was perplexed. Didn’t the black-robed woman just engage in secret negotiations with Lozento? What is she doing at the Blood Sea Army’s barracks? He turned intangible and infiltrated the barracks.","The black-robed woman entered a tent. Judging by its size and the guards stationed around it, it was likely the vice-commander’s tent.","“Did you accomplish the task I entrusted to you?”","“I’m almost done. What about what the First Elder promised me?”","A strong but hideous asura looked at the black-robed woman. Zu An could sense a powerful aura coming from that asura. The other party was only slightly weaker than Lozento.","“Rest assured. You’ll get everything you want once we resolve things at the Abyss of Eternal Night,” the black-robed woman calmly replied.","“If you are deceiving me, I’ll kill even the First Elder!” the vice-commander said grimly.","“Don’t worry. Lozento is too hot-headed and isn’t suited for schemes. The Blood Sea Army has to be under your command,” the black-robed woman consoled him.","“You know what I want isn’t the Blood Sea Army.”","“Of course. You’ll become the lord of one of the three cities.”","...","Zu An could guess what was going on based on their conversation. The black-robed woman was playing the role of a double agent—she had reached out to Lozento for a partnership, but at the same time, she was also colluding with Lozento’s aide. She was exploiting the vice-commander’s ambition to make him do things that Lozento didn’t want. It was hard to tell whether this was the black-robed woman’s intention or the First Elder’s ploy.","Politicking is inevitable, be it in the human society, the Celestial Court, or the Asura World. But I wonder what the Abyss of Eternal Night she mentioned is.","Zu An was tempted to subdue the black-robed woman and the vice-commander so he could bring them before Lozento. This could drive a wedge between Lozento and the First Elder, thus hindering their partnership.","Unfortunately, this was the barracks of the Asuras’ most elite Blood Sea Army. He had no choice but to give up on that notion. Instead, he waited for the black-robed woman to leave the barracks and followed her.","A while later, the black-robed woman suddenly stopped her footsteps and said, “How much longer do you intend to follow me?”","Zu An revealed himself in midair.","The black-robed woman frowned. “You’re the man who was at the City Lord Manor?” The mysterious figure whom even Lozento failed to capture.","Zu An was perplexed. “You aren’t afraid of me.”","The black-robed woman laughed. “Why should I be afraid of you?”","She had a pleasant voice that evoked sympathy from all men. Zu An realized that it was a high-level seduction skill, but he wouldn’t fall for such cheap tricks. The other party’s composure unnerved him, so he decided to go all out lest a mishap happen. He brought out a seven-colored divine light.","The black-robed woman immediately put up her guard, but the next moment, she murmured in a daze, “Big brother Zu?”"]},{"number":2957,"title":"Chapter 2957: Chapter 2909: Heavenly Devil Empress","paragraphs":["Zu An quickly stopped what he was doing.","The black-robed woman took off her hood, revealing a beautiful face. It was the leader of Bluefield Country, Tushan Yu. The two of them had shared many unforgettable memories back when the Fiend races passed by Bluefield Country, but it was a pity that they weren’t able to meet much afterward. Later, Zu An learned that she had entered a Divine Palace. He hadn’t expected to meet her here.","“What brings you here?” Zu An was overjoyed. He ran up to her.","But Tushan Yu took several steps back while staring at him hesitantly. “Your face...”","Zu An belatedly remembered that he had altered his appearance to conceal his true identity. He quickly reverted to his original appearance. Only then did Tushan Yu breathe a sigh of relief. She leaped into his arms, and the two of them embraced.","“Big brother Zu, I thought I’d never see you again!” Tushan Yu’s voice quivered.","The two of them hadn’t been able to meet much even back when they were both in the Cultivation World. She hadn’t hesitated to join a Divine Palace because she didn’t want to stray too far away from her lover. But after entering the Divine Palace, she was transported from one foreign world into another foreign world. Unknowingly, she had drifted very far away from her homeland, to the point where she wasn’t confident of ever returning to the Cultivation World, let alone reuniting with her lover.","Meeting a familiar face in an unknown land was a joyous event, let alone a lover.","“What are you doing here?” Zu An couldn’t believe that the beautiful woman in his embrace was the same enigmatic black-robed woman from earlier.","“This isn’t the place to speak...” Tushan Yu looked around before concealing themselves and pulling Zu An into a remote hut.","“What about you, big brother Zu? What are you doing here?” She looked visibly more relaxed after closing the door. She took off her black robe to reveal her graceful figure.","“I came here to obtain the Asuras’ power insignia,” Zu An replied. Living would be too tiring if he couldn’t even trust someone like Tushan Yu.","Tushan Yu was taken aback. “You’re here for the power insignia as well?”","“Who else is after the power insignia?” Zu An asked.","“First Elder Pimosh of the Asura Council also hopes to become the new Asura King,” Tushan Yu replied with a frown.","“You seem to be his subordinate,” Zu An asked.","“Just in name. Someone like him can’t possibly order me around.” Tushan Yu harrumphed.","“You joined the Bliss and Desire Divine Palace, right? Did you come to this world under your universal deity’s edict?” Zu An thought about how this world was free from the universal deities’ influence despite being filled with all kinds of powerful figures. Was this world strong enough to resist the universal deities, or had the universal deities yet to discover this world? Both possibilities didn’t seem likely.","“How did you know that, big brother Zu?”","“I returned to the Cultivation World but couldn’t find you. I did a quick investigation and discovered that you entered the Bliss and Desire Divine Palace.”","Tushan Yu wrapped her hand around Zu An’s arm. “Big brother Zu, I didn’t think that you would look for me and get nervous when you realized that I'd disappeared. I’m so happy.”","Zu An laughed. “Isn’t that normal?”","Tushan Yu shook her head. “You’re the strongest expert in our world, and the women around you are of lofty stature, be it the Little Fiend Empress or the Human race’s Crown Princess. I am ordinary compared to them. It’s already a blessing to have won your favor. I dare not hope for anything else.”","Zu An looked at Tushan Yu’s beautiful face. Her unique disposition as a member of the Fox race made her appear innocent yet seductive at the same time. I think you have a misconception as to what ‘ordinary’ means.","He gently held her hand and said, “I judge people by their personality, not by their strength or background.”","“I am only realizing that now, and that’s why I’m very happy.” Tushan Yu curled up in his arms, her white tail waving around in delight.","Zu An thought about the time they had spent together. Her tail would always wag like this whenever she was extremely happy. It stirred lewd thoughts in his mind. Knowing that he had more important business here, he reined in his thoughts and asked her about her agenda here.","Tushan Yu enjoyed his touches. She lazily adjusted herself into a more comfortable position as she replied, “I’m not qualified to receive orders from a universal deity yet. I was sent here by the Heavenly Devil Empress.”","“Heavenly Devil Empress?” Zu An was startled. He belatedly remembered that there were Devils in the Celestial World as well. They had the power to stir the most carnal desires. Countless Celestials and Asuras had fallen into depravity under their temptation.","Later, the Celestials banded together and launched a crusade against the Devils, but as long as desires remained in the world, the Devils wouldn’t vanish entirely. While they defeated the Devils, they knew that it was only a matter of time before the latter made a comeback. However, it had been a long time since anyone had heard of the Devils, to the point where many people had forgotten about their existence.","“Mm.” Tushan Yu nodded. “She ordered me to infiltrate the Asura World and exploit the Asuras’ jealous and violent temperament to stir an internal conflict. I’m not sure what the Empress’ goal is, either.”","Zu An fell silent. “Why did Lozento and Pimosh join forces?”","“Pimosh harbors hatred against the Celestials for snubbing him. Lozento lost his only son in a battle against the Celestials several years ago, so he bears animosity against them. However, the Asura King believes that the Asuras will be destroyed if they continue fighting the Celestials, so he wishes to push for a ceasefire. Pimosh and Lozento were already opposed to that, so it only took a bit of meddling from the Empress to provoke an uprising,” Tushan Yu explained.","Zu An frowned. This complicates things. Pimosh and Lozento harbor hatred against the Celestial World, and the Heavenly Devil Empress is pulling the strings from behind. It’s unlikely that this matter can be resolved peacefully.","“You've already forged a partnership with Lozento, so why are you liaising with his vice-commander as well?”","“The Empress doesn’t think that Lozento is trustworthy. Lozento might have lost his son, but he is loyal to the Asura World. If he notices anything amiss, he could foil the Empress’ plan. That was why the Empress sent me here to drive a wedge between Lozento and his aides,” Tushan Yu replied.","“What’s going on with that Abyss of Eternal Night?”"]},{"number":2958,"title":"Chapter 2958: Chapter 2910: Golden City","paragraphs":["“The Abyss of Eternal Night is a forbidden area in the Asura World. It is located deep in a sea outside Mount Meru. It’s rumored that those who enter never return,” Tushan Yu explained. “I mentioned the Abyss of Eternal Night because Pimosh is planning to hold a ritual there.”","“Ritual?” Zu An’s eyes twitched. A ritual held in a world of gods and demons didn’t bode well. There had been a huge mess when Hermes held a ritual to revive his beloved goddess as well.","“That’s right. I think he’s planning to revive the Asura Progenitor Demon God,” Tushan Yu replied. “The Asuras are warlike, but even the strongest asura recognizes that the Celestials are powerful and have many strong allies. The Asuras can’t be a match for them. Their only option is to borrow the Asura Progenitor Demon God’s strength to deal with the Celestials.”","“The Asura Progenitor Demon God?” Zu An frowned. “Is it possible to revive someone who has been dead for so long?” He was the Netherworld’s master and had a portion of Death’s authority, but even he would require an immortal medicine and the individual’s soul to revive a person.","No matter how formidable the Asura Progenitor Demon God was, the other party had been dead for countless years now. His soul had to have disintegrated by now. It seemed unthinkable to revive someone like that.","“I don’t know, but they have made thorough preparations. They might just be able to pull it off,” Tushan Yu replied.","Zu An fell into deep thought. If the Asura Progenitor Demon God was as strong as the universal deities, he might have been able to keep his soul from disintegrating. Otherwise, even if he’s revived, he’ll just become a monster like Yayu...","Hold on. They're planning to just pit the Asura Progenitor Demon God against the Celestial World. They might not require him to be sentient.","“What kind of person is the Heavenly Devil Empress?” The thought that someone was orchestrating the Asura World’s uprising from the shadows was unnerving to Zu An.","“I have never met the Heavenly Devil Empress in person. I only know she is an extremely attractive woman whose charms have never failed before,” Tushan Yu replied with a look of respect.","“She isn’t in the Asura World?” Zu An asked.","Tushan Yu shook her head. “I’m not sure. She might be busy with other matters, since she entrusted this task to me, but someone of her strength should be able to descend to the Asura World as and when she wants. It’s also possible that she’s in the Asura World, just that she has concealed herself.”","Zu An pondered for a moment before asking, “How is the Asura King doing?”","“The Asura King has been subdued by Lozento and Pimosh and is currently imprisoned in Golden City’s Blood Crystal Royal Court. The two of them are only keeping him alive to obtain his power insignia. He won’t be able to make a comeback,” Tushan Yu replied.","Zu An was perplexed. “What is the Asuras’ power insignia? If they have the power to imprison him, why can’t they just snatch it from him?”","Tushan Yu shook her head. “I don’t know either. While Pimosh and Lozento have defeated the Asura King, he doesn’t seem to be carrying the power insignia with him. Those two are also at a loss. They worry that they will never be able to obtain the power insignia if they kill him, so they decided to imprison him for the time being.”","Zu An wondered if the power insignia was intangible. He had previously obtained the Asura Path’s power insignia in the future, but that didn’t mean it was the same power insignia as the one here.","“Bring me to the Golden City. I’d like to talk to the Asura King,” Zu An said.","Tushan Yu nodded without hesitation. “Alright.”","Zu An was worried. “Will this put you in danger?”","Tushan Yu laughed. “This is nothing. Fulfilling your request is my priority.”","“What about your mission? The Bliss and Desire Divine Palace should have assigned you a mission here, right?” Zu An asked out of worry.","Tushan Yu shook her head. “I did receive missions for the previous worlds, but in this world, I only received orders from the Heavenly Devil Empress. There was no mission from the Divine Palace.”","Zu An was surprised. The Heavenly Devil Empress has the power to stoke a person’s deepest desires. Could she be related to the Deity of Bliss and Desire?","He continued asking more questions about the Asuras and the Devils before the two of them made their way up Mount Meru.","Mount Meru was the Asuras’ turf. They wouldn’t allow anyone to freely fly through their territories. One had to first pass through Metal City and Silver City before they could reach Golden City at the mountain peak.","However, the whole place was on high alert after the uprising. Even if Zu An used Myriad Transformations, it would still be hard for him to pass through their tight security. But with Tushan Yu leading the way, the two of them passed through the checkpoints without a hitch. Some asuras stopped them for checks, but they saluted respectfully the moment they saw her token.","Zu An teased, “It looks like you’re someone in the Asura World.”","Tushan Yu chuckled. “I’m merely borrowing Pimosh’s name. He still needs the Heavenly Devil Empress’s help.”","Silver City was made entirely out of silver. The tallest silver tower in the city was Pimosh’s City Lord Manor. Pimosh wasn't in the city, however, as he was busy watching the Asura King in Golden City.","Zu An didn’t stop to admire Silver City, instead opting to advance straight toward the gleaming Golden City. Thanks to Tushan Yu’s token, they were also able to enter Golden City without a hitch. There, the city's sheer extravagance nearly blinded Zu An. Even the pavement was made out of gold. The sheer fortune amassed in this city was enough to buy several worlds.","Zu An couldn’t help but notice that there were fewer asuras in Golden City. It seemed like only higher ranking asuras were qualified to reside here. There were also asura guards patrolling the city. According to Tushan Yu, they were Pimosh’s subordinates.","The asuras residing in Golden City didn’t seem to be aware of the uprising. Most were confused by the abrupt changes, but they simply went with the flow and accepted things.","The two of them made their way to the Blood Crystal Royal Court. Tushan Yu said worriedly, “The Asura King is imprisoned in there, but Pimosh is standing guard there. I won’t be able to bring you in without alarming him.”","“It’s fine. You've already saved me a lot of trouble on this journey,” Zu An smiled. It would have been far more troublesome to reach Golden City if Tushan Yu hadn’t been around to open the path for him.","Just then, a voice echoed, “Tushan Yu, you’re already back? Have you completed your task?”","Tushan Yu was startled. It was evident from her expression that the person who had just spoken was First Elder Pimosh."]},{"number":2959,"title":"Chapter 2959: Chapter 2911: Green Light","paragraphs":["Tushan Yu sent a telepathic message to Zu An, “Big brother Zu, I’ll stall him. You look for the Asura King.”","“Be careful,” Zu An replied. He needed to first meet the Asura King to decide on his next move.","Tushan Yu smiled. “Don’t worry. I have been faring well in the Asura World even before you arrived.” She put on her hood and made her way toward Pimosh.","Meanwhile, Zu An quickly flashed toward the Blood Crystal Royal Court, which was also the royal palace. It resembled a huge blood crystal, symbolizing the Asuras’ ferocious nature in a graceful manner. That was also how it had gotten its name.","Upon reaching its vicinity, Zu An turned intangible and snuck in. To his surprise, the court was nowhere as tightly guarded as he thought. Is Pimosh not worried that someone might rescue the Asura King?","Zu An soon found the answer to that question. From the conversations of other asuras, he learned that the Asura King had been transferred to the Abyss of Eternal Night. So, he left the Blood Crystal Royal Court.","He intended to first meet Pimosh, but Tushan Yu was already waiting for him. Surprised, he asked, “Your conversation ended so quickly?”","Tushan Yu nodded. “Pimosh seems to have something on his mind. He relayed some instructions before hurriedly leaving. Did you meet the Asura King?”","“I didn’t. He has been transferred to the Abyss of Eternal Night. I captured a few asuras for questioning, but none of them know where the Abyss of Eternal Night is. On top of that, they seemed fearful when talking about that place,” Zu An replied with a frown.","“The Abyss of Eternal Night is a forbidden ground in the Asura World. Asuras have been forbidden from approaching that place for countless years now. It’s normal for most asuras to not know where it is located,” Tushan Yu replied with a smile. “It just so happens that Pimosh instructed me to head to the Abyss of Eternal Night to make some preparations. I’ll take you there with me. That should save you a lot of trouble.”","Zu An was relieved to have met Tushan Yu. “Let me meet my friends and update them first.”","“Are they women?” Tushan Yu asked with an unreadable expression.","“You should know them too...” Zu An explained the situation to her.","Tushan Yu’s interest was piqued. “I hadn’t expected you to conquer the Sun Goddess of this world. How did you end up together?”","Zu An had to fill her in on the details along the way. At the same time, he told her about his conjecture that she was Shang Hongyu’s previous incarnation.","Tushan Yu couldn’t help but remark, “They sure are extraordinary. I don’t have any previous or future incarnations.”","Her remark brought focus to a problem that Zu An had been overlooking thus far. He had encountered several of his lovers’ past incarnations to date, but it was bizarre how he had only met the past incarnations of his lovers and no one else’s.","Furthermore, based on his understanding of Death and the Six Paths, those who entered reincarnation were supposed to emerge as completely different beings, be it in terms of appearances or memories. They weren't supposed to look the same as before. Could there be something different about these few?","Amid their chatter, the two of them reached the Silver City before they knew it.","Zu An was able to sense Xihe and Princess Liuli, so it didn’t take him long to find them. Xihe was initially overjoyed to be reunited with him, but upon seeing that he was accompanied by another beautiful lady, she froze on the spot.","I’ve only been away for moments, but he's gotten involved with another woman? Even Emperor Jun doesn’t flirt as quickly as that.","You have successfully trolled Xihe for +66... +66... +66...","Under her seething gaze, Zu An awkwardly introduced Tushan Yu. “Her name is Tushan Yu. She is a close friend of mine...”","Tushan Yu sensed Xihe’s hostility, so she provocatively wrapped her hand around Zu An’s arm.","Princess Liuli stared at Tushan Yu’s robe and frowned. “You are from the Priest Order? You were involved in the encirclement against my father!”","You have successfully trolled Princess Liuli for +110... +110... +110...","Zu An was speechless. Since arriving in the Asura World, he had heard much about how terrible the battlefield where the Celestials and the Asuras clashed was. He had never been to that battlefield, but he felt like he might as well have been there right now.","Tushan Yu lowered her posture and said, “Pardon me for my offense, Your Highness. I didn’t know about the relationship between you and big brother Zu.”","Princess Liuli gnashed her teeth in anger, but she couldn’t blame Tushan Yu for this turn of events.","Zu An was worried that the three women would come to blows, so he quickly changed the topic and asked, “How is it going on your side?”","Princess Liuli replied, “We have made contact with a general. He’s willing to liaise with the other two generals on our behalf.”","Zu An frowned. “Is he reliable?”","Princess Liuli nodded. “He’s a loyal subject, and my father nurtured him from the ground up. He should be reliable.”","“That’s good.” Zu An shared the results of his investigation. “I found that the Asura King had been transferred to the Abyss of Eternal Night. Pimosh is planning to hold a ritual to awaken the Asura Progenitor Demon Go”","Princess Liuli was concerned. “It’ll be harder to rescue my father now that he has been transferred to the Abyss of Eternal Night. I wonder how he’s faring.”","Xihe frowned. “The Asura Progenitor Demon God caused great destruction back then. Countless celestials had to sacrifice themselves to take him down. It’ll be another massacre if he were to return to life.”","“That’s why we have to stop them,” Zu An replied. “I’ll first head to the Abyss of Eternal Night to investigate the situation. In the meantime, you should rally the armies of the other major factions together to reinforce me.”","“All right. Take care of yourself!” Xihe wanted to accompany Zu An into the Abyss of Eternal Night, but Princess Liuli was simply too important here. The latter was needed to persuade the three major camps to join their cause, so her safety was a priority.","They spent some time discussing their next moves before parting ways.","Princess Liuli turned to Xihe and said, “Thank you, big sister Xihe.” Her heart was warmed by how Xihe had stayed by her side even though she was at her lowest point.","Xihe consoled Princess Liuli with a smile, but the thought that she was working for one of Zu An’s lovers while Zu An himself was enjoying couple time with another lover made her feel like she had been cuckolded.","“Achoo~” Zu An sneezed. Xihe must be talking behind my back again.","Tushan Yu said, “Big sister Xihe doesn’t seem to like me. Princess Liuli might not have said much, but she probably doesn’t like me either because of what happened to her father.”","Zu An couldn’t help but think that foxes were truly the worst enemies of women. In a way, Tushan Yu was a bona fide vixen.","“They’ll know that you’re a good person once you spend more time together...” he consoled her.","Some time later, they arrived before a boundless sea.","Tushan Yu looked at the sea and said, “The Abyss of Eternal Night is right below.”"]},{"number":2960,"title":"Chapter 2960: Chapter 2912: Show of Hands","paragraphs":["“This is a forbidden area. No asura is allowed here,” Tushan Yu explained.","Zu An saw stern guards stationed before the only passageway. It was unlikely that he could sneak in unnoticed, even with his Myriad Transformations. Fortunately, there was no need for him to do so, since he could just strut in with Tushan Yu with him.","Armed guards rushed forth and encircled the two of them. At the same time, large siege weapons in the distance began shifting to target them.","Tushan Yu didn’t bother uttering a word. She simply took out a peculiarly shaped token. The guards hurriedly stowed their weapons, bowed respectfully to the duo, and stepped aside for them to pass.","Tushan Yu calmly led Zu An into the passageway, leaving him amazed. It’s so much easier when you have connections.","The two of them stepped onto a little boat, which automatically navigated into the sea. Some time later, the boat abruptly stopped.","Zu An noticed the sea region they were in was ink-black. The deeper the sea, the darker its color. The sight of such a dark sea stirred his fear. Is this the Abyss of Eternal Night?","The sea in front of them whirled. The seawater converged to form two huge asuras, who inspected the two of them with ferocious gazes. In response, Tushan Yu took out her token once more. The two huge asuras returned to the sea and formed a pair of double doors, which opened to reveal a staircase descending into the middle of the sea.","Tushan Yu turned around and smiled. “Big brother Zu, let’s head down.”","Zu An nodded. He looked at the smooth walls of the descending passageway—they were all made out of seawater. Even though he could accomplish the same feat through his Crown of the Ocean Deity, he still wondered which great power in this world had done this.","It was unknown how long Zu An and Tushan Yu walked for; it felt like ages before they finally reached the bottom of the long descending staircase. They were now deep in the sea, a space that ought to be devoid of light, yet this place wasn't dark. Glowing jellyfish and corals floated around. It wasn't as bright as the outside world, but it was enough to see everything clearly.","As Zu An ventured further in, he couldn’t help but frown.","“What’s wrong?” Tushan Yu noticed his expression and asked.","“This scenery looks familiar.”","“Familiar? But you shouldn’t have been here before.” Tushan Yu was perplexed.","Zu An took another good look at his surroundings. It didn’t take him long to trace where the feeling of familiarity stemmed from. While the buildings were different, this place greatly resembled the Tomb of Ten Thousand Dragons en route to the Netherworld in the future. Hold on, this place is also known as an abyss. Could the Abyss of Eternal Night be...","He rushed ahead and soon arrived at a cliff. Ahead of the cliff was a pitch-black abyss that looked as if it would devour everything. It evoked a sense of familiarity and intimacy. It was the same abyss he had encountered in the future Tomb of Ten Thousand Dragons.","He explained the situation to Tushan Yu. The latter widened her eyes in amazement. “Big brother Zu, won’t you take me to the Netherworld for a tour when we return to the future?”","“Sure,” Zu An replied with a smile. He wondered if the world beyond this abyss was still the Netherworld. Lady Houtu’s Underworld should be the previous form of the Netherworld, though. Guessing was futile, so he decided to head into the abyss to take a look.","“I’m a bit scared,” Tushan Yu hesitantly spoke up. “The Abyss of Eternal Night looks like a beast that devours humans. It’s also rumored that the Asura Progenitor Demon God is buried here.”","“Don’t worry, I’ve been into the abyss before. Wait here. I’ll be right back.” Zu An planned to head down alone, but Tushan Yu didn’t want to part ways with him.","This wasn't Zu An’s first time bringing someone into the abyss, so he wrapped her with his divine energy before the two of them leaped in. The abyss was different from what he remembered, though. It was suffused with bloodthirst and malevolent intent. The gravitational pull was also stronger than before. Were it not for Zu An becoming stronger, he would have been ripped into shreds in an instant.","“It looks similar on the outside, but there are significant differences. Something must have happened in between that resulted in the abyss becoming tamer in the future,” Zu An murmured under his breath.","Just then, he landed on sturdy ground. He first turned around and saw a swirling pitch-black door behind him—it was the Abyss of Eternal Night’s exit. Then, he surveyed his surroundings and noted that he wasn't in the Netherworld, but a completely different world. This place was monotonous, with no noteworthy features other than the meandering mountains in the distance.","Zu An felt uneasy; he had been feeling this way ever since he descended the steps. He hadn’t been paying close attention on his way here because he was too focused on checking out the Abyss of Eternal Night. But now that he looked back on it, this place seemed to be shrouded in an eerie formation. And this world was likely the formation core.","He was about to look around when he sensed something. “Someone’s coming.”","Tushan Yu was taken aback. She looked around in a panic. “There aren’t any hiding spots.”","But Zu An remained calm. He embraced her and turned incorporeal, disappearing from sight.","Right after they disappeared, the pitch-black vortex door behind them stirred, and three figures emerged from it. Zu An recognized two of them—they were Lozento and his vice-commander, Tologa. The last one emanated an aura that was on par with Lozento.","Tushan Yu wrote words on Zu An’s chest, informing him that the third person was First Elder Pimosh.","Zu An was forced to admit that Tushan Yu was indeed a vixen. Even her gestures seduced him. If not for the inappropriate occasion, he would have had a passionate time with her right away. But he quickly reined himself in and focused on the situation at hand. Why would the Asuras’ powerhouses appear here at this time?","Lozento asked, “Pimosh, how do you intend to revive the Asura Progenitor Demon God? I heard you’re preparing a ritual, but what is the tribute?”","“Who told you that?” Pimosh was surprised.","“It doesn’t matter who told me that. Is it true?”","“As expected of the War God. You have your sources. You even uncovered such a confidential secret. Yes, I’m planning to hold a ritual to revive the Demon God. The tribute is, of course, the Asura King,” Pimosh replied.","Lozento frowned. “I don’t understand rituals, but if it’s possible to revive the Demon God by sacrificing the Asura King, why hasn’t anyone done that yet?”","“What are you trying to say?” Pimosh asked.","“I sensed a devil aura from your envoy. Are you working with the Devils?” Lozento coldly glared at Pimosh.","“The Devils are from the Celestial World, but we have a common enemy. There’s no harm joining hands with them,” Pimosh calmly replied.","“Devils are treacherous beings who beguile hearts. Working with them will only bring destruction upon the Asuras,” Lozento said grimly. “If my guess is on the mark, you intend to sacrifice my Blood Sea Army as well. Am I right, my beloved vice-commander?”","Tologa’s eyes widened in horror. Without any hesitation, he unleashed his full prowess and attempted to launch a preemptive attack, but Lozento was much faster. He grabbed Tologa’s neck with a swift swipe.","Tologa’s hands immediately fell limp by his sides. He didn’t dare fight back anymore."]},{"number":2961,"title":"Chapter 2961: Chapter 2913: Assassination","paragraphs":["Zu An and Tushan Yu exchanged shocked looks.","Lozento was actually aware of Tologa’s betrayal, and he'd subdued Tologa with absolute ease.","“What do you mean by this?” Pimosh asked with a frown.","“You should know better. You colluded with him to use my Blood Sea Army as tribute. Did you think I was really unaware of it?” Lozento asked coldly.","Pimosh calmly replied, “Did you hear about that from Princess Liuli?”","Zu An felt uneasy. He knows about Princess Liuli. Did they find Xihe and the others?","Kacha!","Lozento snapped Tologa’s neck.","To think that the Asuras’ vice-commander would be killed so easily, like a little chick.","“It’s all to revive the Asura Progenitor Demon God. With his revival, we’ll be able to defeat the Celestials and cleanse the Asuras’ shame. Their sacrifice will be worthwhile,” Pimosh said with a zealous expression.","Lozento was infuriated. “You’re sacrificing the elite Blood Sea Army to revive a god that might not necessarily exist? Even if he comes back to life, there’s no guarantee that he’ll help us fight against the Celestial World. If the Asuras lost all their elites as a result, the victory would also be meaningless.”","“How is it meaningless? As long as we govern the Celestial World, we’ll have an ocean of resources at our disposal! It won’t take long for our Asuras to recover from the blow and surpass our previous peak. Our descendants will be thankful for their sacrifice!” Pimosh was imagining the bright future awaiting them after their victory.","Lozento was shocked. “You’re out of your mind! You're blinded with hatred for the Celestial World because of what happened with Shezhi back then. You’re just exploiting our people for your own private vendetta!”","“Private vendetta?” Pimosh was enraged to hear that. “Which of us doesn’t have a deep grudge against the Celestial World? Would you have staged an uprising with me if not for your son dying in the hands of the Celestials?”","Zu An widened his eyes in realization. No wonder Princess Liuli mentioned that Lozento was upright and couldn’t understand why he had participated in the uprising.","“Yes, I want vengeance for my son, but I’m not going to sacrifice my brethren for that!” Lozento roared.","“You are the Blood Sea Army’s commander. You have fought many battles against the Celestials. You should know what our odds are better than anyone!”","Lozento fell silent. Indeed, they had lost more than they had won in recent years. The Asuras were on the decline, and it didn’t look like they would be able to turn the tables anymore.","Pimosh softened his tone and said, “I know you don’t want to sacrifice your subordinates, but don’t you see that this is all for the Asura World? At this rate, the Asura World will be destroyed, and many more of our brethren will die as a result. This bit of sacrifice is worthwhile as long as we defeat the Celestials!”","Lozento, as the Asura War God, wasn't so weak as to be easily swayed. “You keep talking about sacrificing for the greater good, so why don’t you do so?”","“I’d happily sacrifice myself if it means defeating the Celestials, but I have to be around to ensure that everything goes according to plan. I can’t die yet,” Pimosh replied.","Lozento scoffed in disdain, “You have no qualms sacrificing others, but you sure have a lot of excuses when it comes to sacrificing yourself.”","Pimosh’s face turned cold. “I wanted you on board to maximize our odds of victory, but it looks like you simply refuse to see sense.”","Lozento sneered, “Why? Are you planning to make a move on me?”","Instead of answering that question, Pimosh remarked, “I don’t know why you dare to meet me alone in the Abyss of Eternal Night when you already know about my plan.”","Lozento proudly replied, “Have you forgotten my title?”","Pimosh laughed. “Indeed, you’re our Asura War God. Even the Asura King might not be a match for you in a one-on-one battle. You must think that you can subdue me with ease.”","Lozento frowned. “There is one thing you are right about. A war against the Celestials is imminent. We don’t have many experts in our ranks. I don’t want to have an internal conflict with you at this juncture, lest we lose a powerhouse even before the war begins. So, you better stay put and don’t try anything.” With that, he turned around to leave via the black vortex door.","All of a sudden, Lozento’s eyes widened as he hurriedly dodged to the side. At the same time, he hurled a punch forth to push back the attacking enemy. “Pimosh, are you seeking death?” He couldn’t understand why Pimosh was attacking him despite being the weaker one.","Pimosh laughed. “Do you really think you can defeat me?”","Lozento frowned. “Where does your confidence stem from? We both know you aren’t a match for me. We’re the only ones here. Why aren’t you nervous in the least?”","“You already know that I’m working with the Devils. Have you forgotten about their traits?” Pimosh laughed eerily.","Lozento’s face warped in shock. A light shone from his body as he did everything he could to guard against an unknown threat.","Nevertheless, it was still too late. A shadow was cast on his body the moment he summoned the light, and a figure emerged from the shadow. Then, a black hand pierced through his chest and ripped his beating heart out.","Lozento was horrified. His nine arms flailed in an attempt to grab the figure, but the moment his heart was captured, his movements stalled to a complete halt.","Devils specialized in evoking desires. As long as one’s heart carried desires, they would be vulnerable to devils. Lozento desired to avenge his son by defeating the Celestials, and his wish was enough for a devil to infiltrate his heart. Pimosh’s attack had created an opening for the devil to strike. No one would have expected the Asura War God to be defeated in a single move.","Zu An, who had been watching the situation, wanted to leap in to rescue Lozento. Their conversation had given him a grasp of Lozento’s thoughts and character, and he thought Lozento could be a potential ally. Naturally, he couldn’t let the other party die just like that. But the moment he moved, his body suddenly shuddered. He stared at Tushan Yu in disbelief.","Tushan Yu revealed an eerie smile. “What are you planning to do, big brother Zu?”","“You aren’t Tushan Yu!” Zu An exclaimed. Tushan Yu wouldn’t have done this. Could someone else have taken her place back when Pimosh summoned her?","Pimosh looked over and grinned victoriously. “You aren’t as dumb as I thought.”"]},{"number":2962,"title":"Chapter 2962: Chapter 2914: Tribute","paragraphs":["Zu An’s heart sank. It was apparent that Pimosh had known that he was here all along. But he was more concerned about Tushan Yu now. He initially thought that someone else had impersonated her, but he didn’t find anything amiss when examining her with the Eye of Truth.","Indeed, a black aura rose from Tushan Yu’s body, and Tushan Yu collapsed to the ground. The body was hers, but someone else was controlling her. And clearly, the person controlling her was a devil. The two black auras converged to form a black devil silhouette.","“What a dashing gentleman you are. You look much better than these asuras.” The devil silhouette laughed coyly. It was a feminine voice.","Pimosh was speechless. Yes, asura men are ugly, but can you not say that in front of me? But in view of her identity, he didn’t refute her.","The devil silhouette clenched her fist, crushing Lozento’s heart. Blood essence flowed through the cracks of her fingers and dribbled to the ground. Lozento pointed his fingers at the devil silhouette and Pimosh while flapping his lips, but he failed to utter a word before dropping to the ground. His body disintegrated as if something invisible was eroding it.","Bizarre beams of blood-red lights shone from the dark ground toward the distant mountain, where they converged to form a sinister formation. Only then did Zu An realize that that wasn’t a mountain. It was likely the Asura Progenitor Demon God’s body.","“Are you the Heavenly Devil Empress?” Zu An asked.","“You’re a smart one,” the devil silhouette replied cheerily.","“But I wasn’t smart enough, or else I wouldn’t have fallen for your trick,” Zu An replied with a sigh. Tushan Yu was the subordinate of the Heavenly Devil Empress, who was skilled at hiding in the hearts of others. He should have guessed as much.","“That’s because I’m smarter,” the devil silhouette replied gleefully.","Pimosh didn’t like how chummy their interaction was, so he interjected, “How are we going to get the Blood Sea Army into the Abyss of Eternal Night now that Lozento and Tologa are dead?”","The devil silhouette replied, “That isn’t a problem. There are other commanders in the Blood Sea Army, and those asuras have desires, too. I have already taken control of them, and they are already waiting outside now.”","Pimosh’s complexion darkened. He was an asura, too. He was carrying an artifact that prevented anyone from infiltrating his heart, but he was still fearful of what the devils were capable of.","He waved his hand, and a projection appeared in midair. Indeed, the Blood Sea Army was waiting at the square outside the Abyss of Eternal Night. A smile finally formed on his lips. “We’re almost there. Let’s begin right away. This fellow is decently strong as well. Why don’t we offer him as tribute, too? I’m sure the Progenitor Demon God will be pleased with that.”","“That won’t do. I like this lad. I want to keep him as a toy,” the devil silhouette replied with a crystal-like laugh that resembled the tinkling of bells. It was a pity her words were unnerving.","Black streaks formed on Pimosh’s face. Why do women like these moochlords? They should learn to appreciate the valiance of asura men as well! But there were more important things at hand than to fuss over such trivialities.","Pimosh rose into the sky, opened his nine arms wide, and grew larger until he was as towering as a mountain. Then, he took out a book and began mumbling a sutra. The ritual had begun.","Another figure rose from the distance, bound to a flagpole. He had nine arms as well. Sensing his life force being siphoned away, the asura awakened from his slumber, examined his surroundings, and immediately understood what was going on. He roared in anger, “Pimosh, are you planning to lead the entire Asura World to its doom?”","Pimosh coldly scoffed, “Under your leadership, the Asuras have suffered consecutive losses to the Celestials. We’re only becoming weaker with time. You even plan to lower your head and become subservient to them. Is that not destruction as well?”","The bound nine-armed asura was Princess Liuli’s father, the Asura King.","The Asura King roared in anger, “I only planned to have a temporary ceasefire for the Asura World to recover. How can that be called subservience?”","“You might be able to fool other asuras with those words, but you can’t fool us. Why else do you think we joined hands to overthrow you?” Pimosh sneered.","The Asura King glanced at Tologa’s corpse and Lozento’s famous armor lying on the ground before sneering, “ We? Where is Lozento now?”","Pimosh snorted, “There’s no point arguing with you right now. Once I sacrifice you and the others, I’ll be able to revive the Asura Progenitor Demon God and defeat the Celestials. Time will prove that I am right. I shall become the hero of the asuras.”","“You’re out of your mind!”","Pimosh ignored the Asura King and continued the ritual. Soon, the Asura King’s life force began to be siphoned into the formation.","From the projection, Zu An could see that the Blood Sea Army outside was starting to get restless. They stared confusedly at the blood vortex that had suddenly appeared above them. They didn’t know what was happening, but they knew it didn’t bode well.","Zu An turned to the devil silhouette and asked, “What’s your name?”","Now that everything was on track, the devil silhouette was feeling more relaxed than ever. “Don’t you already know that I’m the Heavenly Devil Empress?”","“That’s your title, not your name.”","The devil silhouette remarked in surprise, “Is that what you’re bothered by now?”","Zu An smiled. “The Heavenly Devil Empress is renowned across the Three Realms. It’d be my greatest regret to die in your hands and yet not know your name.”","The devil silhouette replied with a laugh, “No wonder you were able to seduce my loyal subordinate into betraying me. You have a dashing face and a glib tongue. However, I’ll have to disappoint you. I don’t have a name, or rather, I am just known as the Heavenly Devil Empress. That has been my name ever since I came to be.”","“I see.” Zu An was surprised. “I have heard that the Heavenly Devil Empress is the most beautiful woman in the world. Isn’t there a saying that men who die under the peony flower become carefree ghosts? I’ll have no regrets if I can see you in person once before I die.”","“What a glib tongue. Why should I fulfill your request?” The devil silhouette reined in her smile.","Zu An sighed. “I guess the rumors are untrue. You aren’t as beautiful as the world makes you out to be, which is why you dare not reveal your true face.”","The devil silhouette harrumphed. “Are you taunting me now?”","You have successfully trolled the Heavenly Devil Empress for +444... +444... +444...","“It isn’t a taunt. I’m merely stating the truth. I have never met a beautiful woman who goes to great lengths to conceal her appearance. Rather, it’s those who aren’t that beautiful who put on a veil of secrecy to build their reputation as a beauty.”","It wasn't that Zu An wanted to see the other party’s appearance, but that the Heavenly Devil Empress was simply too elusive a target for him at the moment. There was very little he could do about her until she revealed herself."]},{"number":2963,"title":"Chapter 2963: Chapter 2915: Giving the Devil an Inner Demon","paragraphs":["A harrumph echoed. The black silhouette converged as flower petals began raining on the desolate land. A light fragrance wafted across the world, leaving one with a floating sensation. A figure stepped out from the void, and the dark world suddenly lit up as if the moon had emerged from its concealment.","It was a woman dressed in a black phoenix-plume dress fastened with a dark gold silk belt. Stars seemed to move whenever her dress swayed, and the belt made her waist look as slim as if one could wrap one’s arm around it. She wore a thin red veil layered above her dress that obscured her smooth skin. Her black hair cascaded like a waterfall down to her waist, adorned with a solemn jade hairpin. A light breeze tugged at her hair, making her look ravishing. Her face was absolutely gorgeous. She had eyebrows like the high mountains, a nose resembling sculpted jade, lips as vivid as a crimson cinnabar, and a snowy complexion.","Despite her delicate features, she didn’t come off as weak at all. If anything, she exuded a frigid aura. The world seemed to pale before her lofty and proud gaze.","She slowly descended from the sky. With every step she took, a faint ringing filled the air, and a blood lotus blossomed beneath her foot, only to dissipate swiftly afterward. Nine vague figures flickered behind her; they resembled the woeful sighs of living beings or the adulation of countless devils, but in any case, they heaped great pressure on those standing in her presence. Even Pimosh’s breath was taken away by her captivating beauty, causing the ritual to temporarily halt.","The Heavenly Devil Empress gazed down on Zu An and said, “You were goading me, but I’ll let you have your way this time. So, am I beautiful?”","Zu An stared intently at the gorgeous Heavenly Devil Empress with widened eyes.","It was not the first time men had gawked at her senselessly. The Heavenly Devil Empress scoffed in disdain. This man is no different from the others. I overestimated him.","But Zu An suddenly called out in astonishment, “Daji?”","The Heavenly Devil Empress was stunned. “What?”","Zu An took a moment to compose himself before replying, “I have a maid who looks just like you. Her name is Daji.”","He was shocked because the Heavenly Devil Empress looked just like Daji! It wouldn’t be apt to call Daji his maid as they had a special contract. In a sense, he could be considered Daji’s master. But saying that out loud could irk this Heavenly Devil Empress, so he called her his maid instead.","The Heavenly Devil Empress hadn’t expected to hear such an answer. She sneered, “That’s quite a crude way to draw attention.”","Zu An replied, “It’s not a lie. I do have such a maid.”","Questions surfaced in his mind. He knew that two people wouldn’t share the same appearance by sheer coincidence; rather, there had to be a connection between them. Could this mean that Daji’s previous incarnation was the Heavenly Devil Empress? But how did she lose her soul and become a valkyrie in the Keyboard System?","“Say whatever you want, but you would be naive if you think I’d spare you over this.” The Heavenly Devil Empress was starting to lose her patience. This man is pathetic. Why did Tushan Yu fall in love with someone like that? Why does he look so valiant in her memories?","Tushan Yu was her subordinate, and she had the power to infiltrate the hearts of others. She could read Tushan Yu’s memories to some extent. That was what piqued her interest in Zu An, going to the extent of even revealing her true form. / But it had become evident to her that Zu An was just a shameless braggart. Tushan Yu had been fooled. No wonder people said that a woman in love couldn’t be trusted.","“I can prove it.”","The Heavenly Devil Empress was about to burst Zu An’s heart when she heard those words. “How can you prove it?”","“I can summon that maid.”","“Are you trying to fool me into releasing your restraints, so you can launch a counterattack?” the Heavenly Devil Empress scoffed. Is this fellow a fool, or do I just look naive to him? There’s no way I’d fall for such a crude trick.","You have successfully trolled the Heavenly Devil Empress for +444... +444... +444...","Zu An chuckled. “There’s no need for that. I can summon her right now.”","He summoned Daji. A woman who looked identical to the Heavenly Devil Empress appeared. The two women stared at each other; they felt as if they were looking into a mirror.","Pimosh’s eyes nearly popped out. He even misread the incantation, causing the ritual to come to an abrupt halt. He had scoffed earlier when he heard Zu An’s words, thinking that no woman would fall for such old-fashioned words, let alone the Heavenly Devil Empress. That brat is just asking to be slaughtered.","But the world was truly funny at times. Zu An was really able to summon his maid, and his maid looked identical to the Heavenly Devil Empress. The only difference was that the Heavenly Devil Empress was dressed in black, whereas his maid was dressed in white.","Are they sisters? Or is this some kind of feint? Pimosh, as one of the top three asuras, had fought in many battles against the Celestial World, and that had greatly broadened his horizons. He could tell that the woman was not an illusion, but a real, living person. The only thing that baffled him was the woman’s lack of soul.","The Heavenly Devil Empress was shocked as well. Seeing her doppelganger shocked her so much that an inner demon nearly popped out inside her. “Who is she?”","Zu An sighed. “Didn’t I just tell you that she’s my maid? I’m her master.”","The Heavenly Devil Empress’s face darkened. It was uncomfortable for her to learn that someone who looked identical to her was subservient to someone else. Who knows what kind of weird things he does to his maids?","But that was the least of her worries now. She understood that there must be a connection between them, considering how identical they were from head to toe. Is she the future me, or perhaps me from another world?","“Where’s her soul?” The Heavenly Devil Empress also noticed the anomaly.","Zu An shook his head. “I don’t know. She was like this from the time I met her. Other than not having a soul, she’s no different from other living beings. That’s also why I wanted to ask you about this. You devils specialize in devouring souls.”","The Heavenly Devil Empress' earlier crushing of the Asura War God Lozento’s heart was just a feint. In truth, she had devoured his soul, and that was what led to his death."]},{"number":2964,"title":"Chapter 2964: Chapter 2916: Incinerate My Body","paragraphs":["The Heavenly Devil Empress examined Daji before shaking her head. \"Her soul has been separated from her body, and it shouldn't have disintegrated yet. Otherwise, her body would have decomposed by now. But it's perplexing how her soul is able to survive outside of her body. How did she achieve that?\"","The soul and body were complementary entities. A soul was needed to move a body, but could only survive within the protection of a body.","\"Heavenly Devil Empress, don't forget our promise!\" Pimosh was alarmed by how friendly the two of them were getting. He was worried that she would defect over to Zu An's side.","The Heavenly Devil Empress scoffed, \"I don't need you to interfere in my business.\"","Pimosh was speechless. No wonder they say that Devils are eccentric and unreliable.","\"I'm fond of your maid. I'll be taking her.\" The Heavenly Devil Empress pulled Daji to her side, but moments later, she frowned. \"Huh? I'm unable to sever your master-servant ties.\"","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. The Keyboard System is surprisingly powerful. I wonder who created it.","\"I'm getting more and more interested in you. How did you obtain her?\" the Heavenly Devil Empress asked.","Zu An looked at the projection in the sky; the Asuras were screaming in agony. The weaker ones had disintegrated into dust, taken by the formation as tribute. He replied, \"Tell me why you're working with Pimosh first. You've seen my maid, so you should understand that our ties go deeper. Why don't you join my side instead?\"","The Heavenly Devil Empress chuckled. \"We Devils are usually the ones doing the seducing. I didn't expect someone to seduce me one day. You make a tempting proposal, but you can't give me what Pimosh can. I can only regretfully turn down your invitation.\"","\"Did he promise the Asura souls to you?\" Zu An asked.","The Heavenly Devil Empress shook her head with a smile. \"You underestimate me.\"","Just then, Pimosh roared angrily, \"Stop talking nonsense with him. Kill him, lest he hinder our plan!\"","The Heavenly Devil Empress finally looked at Zu An. \"Lad, while you interest me, there are more important things here that I have to prioritize. I'll have to devour your soul first. Don't worry. I'll dote on you after you fuse with me.\"","She leaned in as if to kiss Zu An, and a powerful suction force gripped Zu An's soul, threatening to pull it out of his body.","Soon, however, her expression distorted in shock. She realized she had lost track of Zu An.","Using Primordial Mirage, Zu An could traverse between reality and illusion, allowing him to bypass most attacks. While they were chatting, he had secretly used the Heaven-Devouring Sutra to unravel most of the seals on him.","He didn't miss this opportunity to strike. As soon as the Heavenly Devil Empress revealed herself, he conjured countless weapons to bombard her. He knew he couldn't hold back against an enemy of this caliber.","It was an attack that could destroy a planet, but it still fell short.","The Heavenly Devil Empress appeared to have traversed into an illusion just like him. Her dissipated silhouette converged once more, and her coy laughter echoed in the surroundings. \"How heartless. You're using so much force that you're hurting me.\"","Zu An laughed. \"Aren't you the heartless one? You nearly disintegrated my soul.\"","Devils were unique entities. They didn't have bodies. As long as there were living beings and souls in this world, they could slip into and hide inside them. It was extremely hard to kill them thoroughly.","Zu An had intentionally baited the Heavenly Devil Empress to reveal herself with his words, but even his surprise attack had failed to hurt her.","\"I only wanted to become one with you so we could be together forever. But you tried to take my life,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress grumbled grudgingly.","Zu An didn't bother responding to her and instead went for Pimosh. Since he had no idea how to deal with the Heavenly Devil Empress for the time being, that was the easier target.","Pimosh was at a crucial phase of his ritual and was unable to properly fight back. He dodged Zu An's attacks while roaring, \"Stop him, Heavenly Devil Empress!\"","In a matter of moments, Zu An had severed two of his arms. If not for powerful Asuras having nine arms, the ritual would have already stopped there and then.","\"Men are always so fussy,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress said with a laugh. She appeared in front of Zu An to stop him. \"Darling, your enemy is me.\"","This put Zu An in a tough spot. That woman didn't have a tangible body, making it hard to hurt her.","In the past, the Celestial Court had gone on an all-out war against the Devils, and despite winning the war, they had failed to eradicate the Devils. That was the unique nature of the Devils. As long as there were living beings and desires in the world, they were indestructible.","So, Zu An gave up on directly confronting the Heavenly Devil Empress and instead used Primordial Mirage to extract her memories and desires. He intended to construct an illusion for her to temporarily trap her.","Devils were usually the ones who constructed illusions for others. Little had the Heavenly Devil Empress thought that she would fall for someone else's illusion one day. She returned to the day she was defeated by the Celestials, and the death of her brethren caused tears to stream down her face.","Pimosh was baffled. The Heavenly Devil Empress had such a powerful entrance, only to be toyed around with by that brat!","But Zu An dared not lower his guard. He knew that Devils were masters of illusion, especially the strongest Heavenly Devil Empress. His illusion wouldn't stop her for long, so he needed to end things quickly. So, he hurled beams of divine light at Pimosh.","In the blink of an eye, Pimosh lost three more arms. He couldn't withstand Zu An's onslaught while channeling the ritual, but if he gave up on the ritual, all of his hard work would have been in vain.","He swiftly made up his mind and plunged his dagger into his own heart. \"Incinerate my body, roaring sacred flames!\"","Flames ignited around his body, instantly reducing him to ashes. Only a venomous voice echoed through the air, saying, \"Return to life, Progenitor Demon God. Destroy everything in this world and the Celestial World!\"","His hatred for the Celestials ran bone-deep. He was even willing to sacrifice his life to destroy them.","The mountain in the distance trembled. An overwhelming demonic aura suffused the surroundings. Even the arrogant Asuras outside trembled in fear. They fell to their knees as if worshiping something."]},{"number":2965,"title":"Chapter 2965: Chapter 2917: Suppression","paragraphs":["With Pimosh laying down his life to awaken the Asura Progenitor Demon God, the ritual was greatly hastened. The Asura King's flesh and blood withered even faster, and his hair turned snowy-white as the life force drained from his body. The Asuras of the Blood Sea Army outside burst into bloody mist, which were then absorbed by the surrounding formation runes.","Just then, the sun suddenly appeared in the sky and illuminated the dark world, exposing the hidden formation runes. Blasts of light were hurled at the formation runes, causing the formation to flicker in uncertainty. The rate at which it absorbed the asuras' blood and flesh slowed down.","\"It's the Sun Goddess!\"","As a long-time enemy of the Celestials, the Asuras recognized her right away and trembled in fear. They wondered if this was a ploy from the Celestials, and the thought that the Celestials had already infiltrated their forbidden land terrified them.","Just then, a gorgeous woman riding on a white elephant rode into the battlefield and shouted, \"The Sun Goddess is my friend. She has come to save us!\"","\"Princess Liuli!\"","Some of the Asuras recognized her and cheered.","The previous uprising had been contained within the upper echelons, so the Asura King and Princess Liuli still enjoyed tremendous prestige among the normal Asuras.","Princess Liuli quickly said, \"This formation siphons away your blood essence and life force. Heed my order and destroy the formation runes.\"","Her voice wasn't particularly loud, but it was clearly relayed to every Asura.","The Blood Sea Army had just lost its vice-commander before being plunged into this abrupt crisis. They were without a leader at the moment. Now that Princess Liuli had taken their reins, they finally began to display the strength of the Asuras' most elite army. In an organized manner, they started destroying the surrounding formation runes.","Princess Liuli breathed a sigh of relief. The other three major factions, whom she and Xihe had liaised with, were on their way here. They'd thought that there would be a fight with the Blood Sea Army, only to see a vile formation plaguing them. It was a good thing that they could resolve this peacefully.","While Xihe illuminated the sky, she looked toward the Abyss of Eternal Night worriedly, wondering how Zu An was faring inside.","Zu An looked at the sight with a smile. He'd been worried that those two could have met with danger. It was a huge relief that they were fine.","The impairment of the formation prevented the Asura Progenitor Demon God from regaining its original strength.","Just then, Zu An heard a sigh beside him. \"Darling, you have ruined my plan.\"","The Heavenly Devil Empress was a top expert specializing in illusions, after all. Zu An's illusion couldn't possibly trap her for long. The moment she snapped out of the illusion, she realized that the Asura Progenitor Demon God was nowhere as powerful as she expected it to be. That made her so angry that she clenched her jaws.","But Zu An didn't have the spare energy to answer her. The Asura Progenitor Demon God had already locked onto him, viewing him as the culprit who had hindered him from returning to his previous peak. He raised his leg, which seemed to cover the entire sky, to trample on Zu An.","Zu An sensed space constricting around him. He felt like Sun Wukong being faced with the Rulai Buddha's palm. But unlike Sun Wukong, Zu An was adept at spatial transformations. There was no way he could be trapped that easily. With a simple instantaneous movement, he dodged the devastating attack.","At the same time, he conjured countless swords to bombard the Asura Progenitor Demon God. When his target was that big, there was no need to aim at all.","But Zu An narrowed his eyes. He noticed runes glowing on the Asura Progenitor Demon God's skin the moment his attacks landed, neutralizing his sword ki. There wasn't the slightest wound inflicted.","The Heavenly Devil Empress laughed. \"The Asura Progenitor Demon God is an entity who single-handedly fought off countless celestials back then. He carries the Asura Blessing. No weapon, fire, or water can get through his skin.\"","Zu An had also noticed the Asura Progenitor Demon God's insanely high physical and magical immunity. No wonder Pimosh had such faith in him and believed he could turn the tables.","Enraged by the attack, the Asura Progenitor Demon God rushed at him with a roar.","An Asura's strength could be estimated based on their number of arms. Even the strongest, the Asura King, only had nine arms, but this fellow had over a hundred arms! If he had regained his full strength, he could even have had thousands, if not tens of thousands of arms.","Zu An knew better than to clash directly with such an entity. His eyes glowed with a mysterious light—Primordial Mirage! It took a target's memories and desires to construct an illusory realm and trap them within.","While the Asura Progenitor Demon God was powerful, he had been dead for many years now. Even if he had retained some of his soul due to his overwhelming strength, that soul was now in an extremely feeble state.","On top of that, the ritual had been incomplete. There hadn't been enough sacrifices for him to make a full revival. Even saying that he had been revived was a misnomer; he seemed more like a zombie if anything. A powerful body driven by a weak soul could only act on sheer instinct.","Unsurprisingly, the Asura Progenitor Demon God clutched his head and wailed in pain. He flailed his hundreds of limbs around, but it was futile. He had already lost his target.","The memories Zu An had extracted from the Asura Progenitor Demon God were about his fight against the Celestials. No wonder the Heavenly Devil Empress wanted to join forces with him. She can relate to him.","\"You brat! This move again!\" The Heavenly Devil Empress had been watching the show when this happened. Naturally, she couldn't allow the Asura Progenitor Demon God to be trapped in an illusion. She rushed forward to save him.","You have successfully trolled the Heavenly Devil Empress for +444... +444... +444...","But Zu An didn't give her the chance to do that. He flashed to the Asura Progenitor Demon God's side and, with a light wave of his hand, conjured the River of History to devour the other party's head.","By the time the River of History faded, the Asura Progenitor Demon God had already lost his head. His hundred hands flailed around in futility before he collapsed to the ground, turning back into a vast mountain range.","The Asura Progenitor Demon God was powerful enough to survive all attacks, but not even he could withstand the erosion of time.","The Heavenly Devil Empress glared at Zu An angrily. \"You have rendered my many years of effort futile. I'll take your soul as compensation for what you have done!\""]},{"number":2966,"title":"Chapter 2966: Chapter 2918: The Showdown","paragraphs":["\"I think we should have a good talk.\" Zu An didn't want to fight her. There were too many doubts in his mind that he wanted to thrash out.","But the Heavenly Devil Empress wasn't interested in communicating. \"I'll know what I want to know once I devour your soul.\"","She transformed into a surge of black aura that enveloped Zu An. Her intangible form made it hard for Zu An to attack her.","However, he summoned his seven-colored light, and the black aura immediately vanished. He had transported it away into his space.","The black aura converged back into the Heavenly Devil Empress. She examined the seven-colored world and remarked, \"This is a decent skill. You were even able to transport me here. But do you think you can subdue me just like that?\"","Zu An smiled. \"It's easier for me to deal with you now that you're in my domain.\"","The Heavenly Devil Empress frowned. \"Why does it seem like you have gotten stronger?\"","There was no way Zu An would explain his power spike to her. He had just killed the Asura Progenitor Demon God and devoured the latter's energy using his Heaven-Devouring Sutra, thus raising his level to 95.","The Heavenly Devil Empress harrumphed. \"You can't defeat me even if you have gotten stronger.\"","Devils were special beings. Even the powerful Celestials had struggled to hurt her main body in the past. As long as desires existed in this world, she was indestructible. Since even the Celestials were filled with desire, it was impossible to kill her. The moment Zu An revealed a crack in his mind, she would swoop in and devour his soul.","She had to concede that Zu An had an exceptionally strong mind. There was practically no opening for her to exploit. Unfortunately, he was a living being. He couldn't possibly keep his guard up all the time.","\"I've finally caught you.\" The Heavenly Devil Empress sensed a brief fluctuation in Zu An's soul. She didn't hesitate to rush into his mind to devour him.","Moments later, however, she reappeared in midair. She stared at Zu An in disbelief. \"Impossible! Why can't I devour your soul?\"","That had been an opening for her to strike. Had it been the Celestial Court's Emperor Jun, Donghuang Taiyi, or even the old Asura Progenitor Demon God, she was confident she could have devoured their souls if they had shown such an opening.","Yet she had failed. She had dealt some damage to Zu An's soul, but the latter was strong enough to recover in an instant.","\"You can't hurt me.\" Zu An's confidence stemmed from his Love Sage title.","Love Sage: You can more easily earn a woman's goodwill. Damage inflicted on women is reduced by 50%. Damage received from women is reduced by 70%.","Zu An had become so strong that it was hard for the Heavenly Devil Empress to inflict damage on him under normal circumstances; a further 70% reduction was crippling. It felt almost like an ant biting an elephant.","\"Impossible!\" the Heavenly Devil Empress exclaimed. All of a sudden, she smiled coyly at him and suggested, \"If you are that confident in yourself, why don't you let me do whatever I want to you?\"","\"Sure.\"","Zu An wouldn't have made such a decision under normal circumstances, but his skills couldn't hurt the Heavenly Devil Empress, either. He could deal with ordinary devils, but the Heavenly Devil Empress was simply too powerful. He needed to convince her to work together with him.","Another coy laugh shook the world. The Heavenly Devil Empress dropped her bloodthirst and flitted up to him. \"My darling, you are the most formidable man I have seen in many years.\"","\"I have never seen a woman as formidable as you, either,\" Zu An replied with a sigh.","The Heavenly Devil Empress was a temptress. All the bewitching and seduction arts Zu An had faced in the past were nothing compared to her, as she targeted the soul directly.","The Heavenly Devil Empress sat down on him and nuzzled against his chest. Then, she suddenly laughed. \"I thought you had an unwavering heart. You kept saying no, but your body is surprisingly honest.\"","Black streaks covered Zu An's face. He was speechless. Did we get the wrong scripts?","Starting to feel impatient, he asked, \"What do I have to do for you to give up? I want to talk to you.\"","\"You want to talk? Sure, let's talk.\" The Heavenly Devil Empress's lips brushed across his cheeks and lips.","As her hands reached into his clothes, Zu An frowned. \"What are you trying to do?\"","\"I'm trying to talk,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress replied. Her gaze could make any man in the world succumb to her.","Zu An was speechless. This wasn't what I meant.","\"Darling, are you going back on your words now? You agreed to let me do whatever I wanted to you.\" It was just moments ago that the Heavenly Devil Empress seemed like a demonic monster, but now, she exuded an ethereal air that felt even more heavenly than fairies in the Celestial World.","Zu An took a deep breath and asked, \"Is this how the Heavenly Devil Empress seduces men?\"","\"Are you jealous, darling?\" The Heavenly Devil Empress chuckled. \"You don't need to worry. I rarely have to resort to this when dealing with others. A mere flick of my finger can plunge them into the torture of eternal pleasure. You're the only one I need to use my real body on.\"","Zu An's eyebrows shot up. \"Your real body? Doesn't that mean I have a chance to kill you?\"","\"How cruel, darling. You don't have to kill me when you can... ravage me,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress whispered into his ear. Her gestures were so bewitching that no man could resist her allure... unless that person wasn't into women.","As the Heavenly Devil Empress's voice grew mellower, a field of pink flowers blossomed. At the center of the field, Zu An sat firmly like an unwavering sage, while the Heavenly Devil Empress moved so bewitchingly that it felt like she could bend even the sturdiest metal with her tenderness.","...","Some time later, a voice resembling a purr scratched Zu An's ears. \"Darling, you have finally succumbed. I'll let you die in extreme bliss. I don't know why, but I can't bear to kill you... Huh? How are you able to devour me as well?!\"","Zu An sighed. \"I wouldn't completely lower my guard against a devil.\"","It felt like there was a black hole in the Heavenly Devil Empress's body, but Zu An's Heaven-Devouring Sutra was also a black hole. The two suction forces neutralized each other, forming a tense balance.","\"How sly, darling. You were scheming against me,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress grumbled.","Zu An smiled. \"Aren't you the same, too?\"","\"Let's see who can last longer. I don't believe you can outlast me,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress said. This was the Devils' field of specialty. As their leader, there was no way she would lose to anyone in this.","But Zu An had no intention to fight her on even ground. To ensure that everything went his way, he used the Golden Phoenix's power. He had initially resolved to never use this power again, but after everything he had been through, he had matured enough to understand that morality didn't exist inherently within skills; it was about how one used them.","Since the Heavenly Devil Empress wasn't playing fair, there was no reason for him to hold back.","Confusion flickered across the Heavenly Devil Empress's eyes for a brief instant. \"What did you do to me?\""]},{"number":2967,"title":"Chapter 2967: Chapter 2919: I Bedded a Universal Deity?","paragraphs":["\"Nothing. It's just a little trick for us to further develop our feelings for each other,\" Zu An smiled. The Heavenly Devil Empress's body was a masterpiece. He felt joy sprouting from his very soul. It was no wonder no being could resist her temptation.","The Heavenly Devil Empress's eyes gleamed dangerously as she suddenly exuded an air of loftiness. \"You're trying to make me fall in love with you... That's the Deity of Love and Beauty's ability. How are you related to Love and Beauty?\"","Zu An was taken aback. The other party spoke in a tone completely different from that of the earlier Heavenly Devil Empress, as if she were another persona.","The Heavenly Devil Empress was hiding in Tushan Yu's body, but it turns out there's another entity hiding in the Heavenly Devil Empress as well? Is she a Russian doll?! But what kind of entity could have been hiding in the Heavenly Devil Empress without the latter noticing?","He suddenly thought of a possibility that made him shudder.","A divine aura suddenly suffused the surroundings, and the Heavenly Devil Empress looked at Zu An as if he were a mere ant. He was familiar with this pressure. It was the authority exclusive to universal deities!","Which universal deity are they? I don't think I've met them before.","The universal deity was about to speak when they noticed an anomaly.","Zu An was startled. He hurriedly switched into his Heaven Plunderer title lest they see through his thoughts. He was astounded. As far as he knew, no one had ever seen a universal deity's true appearance, let alone interact with them so intimately.","He hadn't intended for this to happen, either. He had been fighting the Heavenly Devil Empress. How was he to know that she would suddenly turn into a universal deity?","He quickly composed himself and carefully said, \"Exalted universal deity, I didn't mean to offend you. I hadn't expected you to descend into the Heavenly Devil Empress' body.\"","The unknown universal deity harrumphed. \"The Heavenly Devil Empress is one of my clones.\"","Zu An was bewildered. He had a feeling that he was doomed. There was no way to talk his way out of this situation. Despite having encountered many dangers in his lifetime, he didn't think any of them could compare with this moment. He thought that he had grown strong enough not to be helpless before others, but he still found himself powerless in the presence of a universal deity.","He was stuck between a rock and a hard place.","Even when he misspoke in Mi Li's or Meng's presence, he could still find ways to salvage the situation. But how could he talk his way out of this? His slightest movement would remind the other party of his blasphemy, prompting them to blast him into bits.","But staying still wasn't a solution, either.","Zu An was speechless. I'm doomed.","Feeling the sensations beneath her, the mysterious universal deity sneered with a frown, \"You are the most brazen person I have ever seen.\"","Zu An felt like crying.","I don't want this to happen as well, but I can't control myself... but on that note, I'm surprised that this universal deity is still talking to me. Anyone else in their position would have already blasted me into bits. Could it be...","I'm already doomed anyway. Let me give it a try!","He leaned in and sealed the universal deity's mouth with a kiss.","The explosion of warmth left the Heavenly Devil Empress with widened eyes. It had been countless years since she last met anyone as audacious as this. Despite knowing that she was a universal deity, he still dared to treat her so rudely!","Yet she didn't feel angry in the slightest. Instead, she asked with a frown, \"Humble little thing, do you not fear death?\"","\"I do, but what I am doing now is revering you.\" Zu An was pulling out everything he had to turn the tide around. He had to hold back against his lovers because their bodies couldn't withstand him, but here, there was no need for him to hold back at all. The other party could withstand any damage in the world.","The Heavenly Devil Empress's eyebrows shot up before laughing. \"You have figured out my identity.\"","\"Who else other than the great Deity of Bliss and Desire can exude such charm?\" Zu An answered. That would explain why Tushan Yu was working for the Heavenly Devil Empress despite having entered the Bliss and Desire Divine Palace. Considering the nature of Bliss and Desire, he decided to dive right in for a chance at survival.","\"You're a smart and dashing lad, and your skills aren't too bad,\" the Heavenly Devil Empress remarked. \"But aren't you worried about offending the other universal deities? There are quite a few ladies among the universal deities.\"","\"I'm speaking the truth. The other universal deities would not bestow such grace upon me.\" Zu An had figured out that Mi Li and Meng were women through the Eye of Truth, but he couldn't care that much right now. Overcoming this ordeal took priority.","\"You have a sweet mouth as well.\" The Heavenly Devil Empress gently touched his forehead with her slender finger. \"But I'm perplexed as to why I'm unable to read your thoughts.\"","\"I have received the grace of the other universal deities.\" Zu An subtly hinted at his backing, so the Deity of Bliss and Desire would have some reservations when dealing with him.","\"I have heard your name. I recall it now. You're Mi Li and Meng's...\" The Heavenly Devil Empress burst into laughter. \"Those two have always had an antagonistic relationship. I have always wondered why they would pick the same person as their envoy. I can see why now.\"","You don't know shit. My relationship with them is hardly as normal as you think, Zu An thought, but he dared not refute her at a time like this.","\"The book you offered me during the Deity of Death's trial, The Master Player, was to my taste. Later, I heard about your conflict with the Annihilation Progenitor from my followers. You are indeed not bad.\" The Heavenly Devil Empress laughed. \"Your ability to win women's affection must be from the Deity of Love and Beauty then, right?\"","Zu An answered her question perfunctorily, though he was astonished to receive confirmation that the Golden Phoenix's ability was from the Deity of Love and Beauty.","The Heavenly Devil Empress wrapped her arm around his neck and said, \"I'm getting more and more interested in you. Do you know why I'm the Deity of Bliss and Desire?\"","Zu An shook his head, not knowing what she was getting at.","The Heavenly Devil Empress leaned into his ear and whispered, \"I am a connoisseur of all bliss and desire myself, just as much as I am someone who fulfills desires to bestow endless bliss.\""]},{"number":2968,"title":"Chapter 2968: Chapter 2920: The Truth Behind the World Gate","paragraphs":["Zu An felt extreme bliss before he could even respond.","A fountain of bliss erupted not just from his body, but his very soul. The thought that the other party was a universal deity only made him more excited. For a brief moment, he even thought that he had lived his life in vain.","His previous lovers—Chu Chuyan, Manman, and the sort—flashed through his mind, but even the sum of them couldn't compete with the bliss he was currently experiencing.","However, his willpower had been forged by the many difficulties he had been through. His relationship with his lovers also transcended mere physical pleasure; they had braved through many life and death situations together.","It didn't take long for Zu An to notice an anomaly. As expected of the Deity of Bliss and Desire. I didn't expect her to be able to affect me so much without me knowing.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire remarked in surprise, \"You're able to maintain your clarity? Is it because of Death's authority, or did Mi Li and Meng leave a mark on you...\"","Zu An thought her words made sense. It would take a universal deity's power to counteract another universal deity's power.","\"Shall I pull out?\" He thought it would be awkward to continue like this.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire laughed softly. She wrapped her arm around his neck and said, \"I never intended to control you through this. That was merely my power leaking out.\"","Zu An shuddered. The feeling of incomparable bliss suddenly assaulted him once more. He quickly pulled himself together and asked, \"You mentioned that the Heavenly Devil Empress was one of your clones, right?\"","\"Indeed~\" Even the deity's sigh pulled at the heartstrings.","\"What's the situation with Daji?\" Zu An voiced his doubt. Considering their identical appearances, Daji had to be related to the Heavenly Devil Empress. Could that mean that she was related to the Deity of Bliss and Desire as well?'","The Deity of Bliss and Desire flicked her finger, and Daji flew to their side. She gently touched Daji's face and said, \"How beautiful. As expected of me.\"","Zu An asked in surprise, \"That's you as well?\"","\"It'd be more apt to call that the future of this clone,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire replied. \"If not for this existing connection, do you think I'd have done this with you?\"","It suddenly occurred to Zu An that his soul contract with Daji might have been the reason he was so compatible with the Deity of Bliss and Desire.","\"But where did her soul go?\" Zu An asked.","\"She's my clone. Naturally, her soul is with me...\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire started sounding less confident at this point. \"Something might have happened, prompting her to take precautions.\"","Zu An was surprised. \"You don't know?\"","\"Universal deities aren't omnipotent. We have our troubles too. Do you know why I had to send the Heavenly Devil Empress down to this world?\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire asked.","Zu An shook his head. Before he met the Deity of Bliss and Desire, he had also been perplexed as to why the universal deities' influence didn't seem to extend into this world.","He asked, \"Are you trying to avoid something?\" But what could a universal deity be avoiding?","The Deity of Bliss and Desire didn't answer the question directly. Instead, she changed her pose and sat in his embrace. \"Have you heard about the World Gate?\"","Zu An widened his eyes. \"I heard that this world's Emperor Jun went into the World Gate and went missing.\"","The Deity of Bliss and Desire scoffed, \"He had to be killed because he stumbled upon the truth.\" She spoke so casually, as if killing a supreme deity was no different from squashing an ant.","\"What truth?\" Zu An asked. He knew that this world was fraught with danger, so he expected that the deity would beat around the bush.","To his surprise, however, the Deity of Bliss and Desire gave a proper reply, \"Do you know what lies behind the World Gate?\"","\"Is it an entity that even universal deities fear?\" Zu An thought about how even the Deity of Bliss and Desire had to hide inside her clone in this world.","\"Not exactly. The Deity of Knowledge lies behind the World Gate.\"","Zu An felt a jolt in his mind. He had never expected this answer. He had never interacted with the Deity of Knowledge; he only knew that the other party was the manifestation of all knowledge in this world, the smartest being in the Myriad Worlds. He couldn't understand why the Deity of Knowledge was behind the World Gate, and he couldn't comprehend why the Deity of Bliss and Desire was fearful of them, too.","Seemingly reading his thoughts, the Deity of Bliss and Desire said, \"This world was created by the Deity of Knowledge. Isn't it normal for me to tread carefully on their turf?\"","\"What?!\" Zu An was shocked beyond words. Many things suddenly made sense to him.","This wasn't his first time arriving at the Celestial World, but each time, there were some anomalies that didn't make sense. He had always attributed it to him arriving at different times, but who could have known that the Celestial World was an illusion all along?","\"Stop getting distracted,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire grumbled in dissatisfaction. \"I won't share any more secrets with you if you refuse to focus.\"","Mi Li and Meng had always refrained from answering Zu An's questions directly. The Deity of Bliss and Desire was the only one who answered his questions properly. He knew that this golden opportunity might not present itself again, so he quickly pulled himself together and focused on presenting bliss and desire to her.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire smiled in approval. \"We universal deities have long noticed a terrible crisis encroaching on us. Each of us is using our own method to resolve that crisis, and the Celestial Court is the solution devised by the Deity of Knowledge.\"","Zu An asked, \"What exactly is that crisis?\"","\"Dear, it's still too dangerous for your current self to learn about it,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire replied. \"The Deity of Knowledge created the Celestial Court and allowed it to develop freely like a simulation. They were hoping to find a solution across countless parallel worlds, but it looks like their efforts are doomed to fail.","\"Each time they failed, they would restart the world, alter the parameters, and begin another round of simulation. That was what gave rise to the countless parallel worlds.\"","She added, \"You have come into contact with technological worlds, so you should be familiar with civilization-style games. It's the same idea. Different choices lead to different outcomes.\"","Zu An was shocked. Are you saying that the dungeons I've entered thus far are all artificial worlds created by the Deity of Knowledge?","\"Does that mean that the people I met are fake as well?\" Are the Goddess of Wu Mountain, the Mermaid Queen, and the current Xihe all fake?"]},{"number":2969,"title":"Chapter 2969: Chapter 2921: The Previous Generation of Universal Deities","paragraphs":["\"Of course not,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire replied. \"Not even universal deities can conjure things out of thin air. It's one thing to create ordinary people, but important figures have to be created out of original models. When he created this world, the Deity of Knowledge drew inspiration from the Myriad Worlds. He even captured some existing individuals to throw them into this world.\"","Zu An breathed a sigh of relief. As long as Xihe and the others aren't just illusions.","\"The Deity of Knowledge's divine power befuddled the wisdom and memories of this world's living beings, preventing them from realizing that they were living in an artificial world,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire added.","\"To find a solution to the problem, the Deity of Knowledge set the average battle power of this world to be extremely high. After several cycles of destruction and creation, some individuals in this world grew strong enough to sense this world's anomaly, thus beginning the legend of the World Gate.","\"Many sensed that the truth of this world lay in the World Gate, and Emperor Jun was one of them. He attempted to push open the World Gate, so the Deity of Knowledge had no choice but to kill him.\"","Zu An widened his eyes in realization. Can I really know about these secrets just like that? He asked, \"Why are you telling me these things?\"","He suspected that the Deity of Bliss and Desire was planning to kill him after toying with him, which was why she didn't mind divulging these secrets to him.","\"What do you think?\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire hugged him so tightly that it felt as if she wanted to engulf him.","Zu An first eliminated the possibility that he had managed to pleasure her. He wasn't so arrogant as to believe that he could win her over with his skills. If anything, she had brought him far more pleasure.","A thought surfaced in his mind, and he said, \"I am in contact with other universal deities. You wish for me to cooperate with you in dealing with the Deity of Knowledge.\"","\"You're a smart one. It's not on the mark, but it's a close guess,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire hummed. \"The Deity of Knowledge has been occupying this world, which prevents other universal deities from interfering in this domain. But a chance to change everything has finally surfaced!\"","\"But why should I help you?\" Zu An asked. \"The Deity of Knowledge is a universal deity as well. I wouldn't dare to get involved in a fight between universal deities.\"","Going up against a universal deity, especially the Deity of Knowledge, on their turf felt tantamount to suicide.","\"Are you going to help them instead of me? They wouldn't be so intimate with you,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire replied with a chuckle.","Zu An frowned. The Deity of Bliss and Desire had brought him amazing pleasure, but she was looking down on him if she was trying to buy him over with just this much.","\"What a heartless man. You're already shirking responsibility when you haven't even pulled up your pants yet,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire grumbled. Her expression was so delicate that it could melt the heart of any man in the world.","But Zu An remained unfeeling like a rock.","\"Fine, I shan't tease you anymore.\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire's disposition suddenly changed. The air around her felt sacred and solemn. \"Do you remember the terrifying thing that the universal deities have to face that I just talked about?\"","Zu An nodded. He was curious about that.","\"Every universal deity is preparing for it in their own way, but some of us recently realized that it's impossible to deal with individually. We have to join forces. The Deity of Knowledge, however, is obstinate about doing it by themself. They believe that they are the most intelligent entity in the world, and that the other universal deities are as dumb as pigs before them.\"","Zu An had to suppress his laughter lest he offend the other party. \"I'm surprised you didn't join forces to obliterate them.\"","\"Hmph, the Deity of Knowledge is still not utterly incompetent. It's not that easy for us to find them in this world,\" the Deity of Bliss and Knowledge replied. \"That's why we need to steal his authority over this world and make him admit his failure to force him to work with us.\"","Zu An suddenly thought about something and asked, \"Which universal deities are working with you?\"","The Deity of Bliss and Desire laughed. \"Are you probing into the universal deities' internal affairs now? How brazen. But it's not a big deal for me to tell you. Who sent you here?\"","Zu An was astonished. Does this mean that the Deity of Memory and Deity of Chaos and Enigma knew about this all along?","It also suddenly occurred to him that carrying Death's authority and Reproduction's seed could be seen as bearing the will of these two universal deities as well. It made him wonder if those two had been in on this as well.","But aren't the Deity of Memory and the Deity of Chaos and Enigma enemies? Many doubts surfaced in Zu An's mind.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire lifted his chin with her finger. \"Mi Li and Meng have good eyes. It feels good that I'm taking a bite of the juicy apple they have chosen first.\"","Those words left Zu An stifled. He launched a counterattack to express his dissatisfaction.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire chuckled. \"You have quite the temper.\"","Zu An quickly calmed down and continued, \"This is all a one-sided story from you. How can I know you aren't lying to me?\"","There was also a possibility that the Deity of Bliss and Desire was weaving lies to fool him into cooperating with her. If so, he could potentially be backstabbing Mi Li and Meng here by working with the Deity of Bliss and Desire.","\"If you doubt my words, why don't you ask them directly?\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire looked at Zu An's expression and suddenly laughed. \"Ah, I understand. You must be worried that they'll get angry if you reach out to them in this condition.\"","Zu An's face reddened. That was indeed the reason. If those two universal deities saw how intimate he was being with the Deity of Bliss and Desire, they could feel offended and unleash divine retribution on him.","\"You're thinking too much. This is the Deity of Knowledge's domain. I was only able to slip into here through the Heavenly Devil Empress, but the other universal deities wouldn't be able to do the same,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire replied gleefully. \"But your worry is not unfounded.\"","There was a brief pause before she added, \"You'll be helping yourself by helping me.\"","\"What do you mean by that?\"","\"I noticed you were nervous about your little lovers earlier.\"","\"What does this have to do with them?\" Zu An's expression turned cold.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire chuckled. \"Have you never wondered why there are so many people in this world that resemble your future lovers?\"","Zu An was taken aback. He had wondered about that before. Souls that had been reincarnated through the Six Paths weren't supposed to have bodies identical to their previous incarnations.","\"This world has been through countless rounds of simulations. Many beings have been reincarnated many times, but only a handful of special women retained their appearances. Do you know why?\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire looked at Zu An with playful eyes.","Zu An looked at the Deity of Bliss and Desire, followed by Daji, and his eyes suddenly widened in astonishment. \"Are you saying that they are universal deities as well?\"","The Deity of Desire and Bliss shook her head. \"Not exactly. They aren't the universal deities you know about. They are the previous generation of universal deities.\"","Zu An was speechles."]},{"number":2970,"title":"Chapter 2970: Chapter 2922: Its Her","paragraphs":["Zu An was stupefied. \"There are multiple generations of universal deities?\"","\"Yes, that's right.\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire explained, \"We aren't the primordial universal deities of the Myriad Worlds. Those were the universal deities governing the elements such as metal, wood, water, fire, earth, ice, wind, lightning, light, and dark. They are the ones who constructed the Myriad Worlds' foundation, and they wield incredible power.","\"But as the Myriad Worlds prospered and life flourished, emotions and desires slowly grew into a powerful force. Correspondingly, that gave rise to a new generation of universal deities.","\"The first generation of universal deities preached the cold observance of natural law and refrained from interfering with the world. That created space for us, the subsequent generation of universal deities, to rise to power.","\"A war eventually broke out as the two generations of universal deities began competing over authority. As we enjoyed a steady influx of faith from the world, we slowly claimed the upper hand and eventually became the new generation of universal deities.\"","Zu An was astounded. He hadn't thought that there would be such a war among universal deities. Can I really know such secrets?","It could have been due to the presence of the Deity of Bliss and Desire, but he didn't face any inexplicable power striking him down. He calmed himself down and said, \"The war must have gone on for a long time. Why aren't there any records of it?\"","There was no lack of ancient civilizations and powers in the Myriad Worlds, but he had never heard anything that suggested this history.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire laughed. \"Have you forgotten her jurisdiction?\"","Zu An was stunned.","The Deity of Memory Meng governed memories, but she sought to record all events accurately. However, it was very probable for the Deity of Chaos and Enigma Mi Li to have concealed records about the war among the universal deities.","Not wanting to risk speaking ill of Mi Li, Zu An changed the topic and asked, \"What happened to the first generation universal deities after the war?\"","\"They were ultimately universal deities who governed the fundamental laws of the Myriad Worlds. While they may have fallen from grace, they didn't face true death. Instead, they returned to the world. At least that was what we thought initially,\" the Deity of Bliss and Desire said with a distant gaze.","Zu An gestured for her to continue.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire rolled her eyes at him. Only this fellow would dare do something this bold. \"It was a close fight between the first generation and the second generation. We had the upper hand, but it was a tough fight. The turning point came when one of the first generation universal deities defected to our side.\"","\"Oh?\" Zu An was confused. There was a fundamental difference in the beliefs of the first generation and second generation of universal deities, so it didn't make sense for someone from one side to defect to the other side.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire bit his ear as she whispered, \"Who do you think it was?\"","Zu An's heart stirred. He racked his brains and a face surfaced in his mind. \"The Deity of Love and Beauty?\"","The Deity of Bliss and Desire smiled in approval. \"You are indeed a smart one. No wonder Mi Li and Meng favor you so much.\"","Zu An was silent. It hadn't been too hard to guess. The Deity of Bliss and Desire had hinted that the first generation universal deities were related to his lovers, and then stated that one of them had defected to the second generation universal deities.","So far, Zu An had only seen the Deity of Love and Beauty's true face, and the latter looked identical to Yu Yanluo and this world's Houtu. Those factors pointed to her being the traitor. But knowing Yu Yanluo, Zu An couldn't imagine her being a traitor.","\"She was still known as the Deity of Earth back then. We didn't doubt her when she joined our side because she carried not just the traits of the first generation but the second generation of universal deities as well. Upon learning about her betrayal, the remaining first generation universal deities lost their will...\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire harrumphed. \"We only knew about her scheme much later.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Zu An anxiously asked.","\"Her defection was a scheme. The first generation universal deities knew that the tides were against them, and that their loss was inevitable. So, they devised a plan.\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire's tone hinted at her fury and admiration. \"The first generation universal deities fell one after another, and we thought that they had returned to the dao. It was many years later that we realized that the Deity of Love and Beauty had aided them in their reincarnation, and they were planning to make a comeback.\"","Zu An was shocked. For some reason, the revelation brought him relief. Yu Yanluo had her reasons for doing so!","But his head hurt right after. The Deity of Bliss and Desire had to know about his close relationship with Yu Yanluo and the others, so she would have guessed that he could stand with them. So, what could be her reason for divulging these secrets to him?","\"As the Deity of Earth, she governed reincarnation. She secretly put the first generation universal deities through reincarnation.\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire gritted her teeth in anger. \"By the time we realized that, it was already too late. The first generation universal deities had already successfully reincarnated, and it was extremely difficult for us to uncover their whereabouts.\"","The details clicked. The Deity of Love and Beauty, the Deity of Earth, and Lady Houtu were the same person. That would explain why they wielded the power of the Six Paths of Reincarnation.","Zu An quickly recalled the Deity of Love and Beauty's demise, and his expression turned cold. \"So, the second generation universal deities banded together to kill her out of anger?\"","\"We were livid. We banded together to question her, but she was prepared for that. She went into reincarnation as well.\" The Deity of Bliss and Desire propped up Zu An's chin with her long nails as she asked, \"What's wrong, dear? You look angry. Are you thinking about avenging her?\"","Zu An fell silent for a moment. He was nowhere strong enough to defeat a universal deity in a fight, but the bed was a different battlefield. He transformed into an avenger and furiously assaulted the Deity of Bliss and Desire, prompting shocked exclamations from the latter.","...","Some time later, the Deity of Bliss and Desire finally spoke up. \"Enough. Consider it your victory. Your body doesn't feel like that of a human at all.\"","Exhausted, Zu An lay down beside her. His mind was surprisingly clear. \"Why did you tell me all that? Did you think I'd help you deal with the first generation universal deities?\"","The Deity of Bliss and Desire propped herself up. Her hair cascaded down on his chest like a waterfall. \"Of course not. I'm here to seek a partnership with you all.\""]},{"number":2971,"title":"Chapter 2971: Chapter 2923: The End","paragraphs":["“Partnership?” Zu An hadn't thought that a lofty universal deity would have to partner with him.","“I told you that we, the universal deities, have encountered something terrifying. For countless years, we have been trying to resolve it using our own methods, but aside from the obstinate Deity of Knowledge, the others have already conceded that our efforts were futile.”","The Deity of Bliss and Desire's words sparked a sense of danger from Zu An. If even the universal deities felt helpless, normal mortals wouldn’t stand a chance at all.","“That’s why I want to work with the first-generation universal deities to devise a solution for this ordeal,” the Deity of Bliss and Desire said while staring at Zu An expectantly.","Once again, Zu An had to acknowledge that she was the peak of femininity. However, he maintained an unwavering heart and said, “You sought to destroy the first-generation deities. It wouldn’t be surprising for them to harbor a deep-seated grudge against you. How can you expect them to work with you?”","The Deity of Bliss and Desire wrapped her smooth arm around Zu An’s neck and said, “That’s why I need your help. You’re on good terms with them. It’ll work if you mediate between us.”","She quickly added, “This ordeal concerns not just us universal deities, but all lifeforms in the Myriad Worlds as well. Even if the first-generation universal deities return to power, they will still have to face this problem. I think that is reason enough for us to put aside our differences and work together.”","“I don’t even know what the ordeal is. How can I know if you’re speaking the truth, let alone persuade them on your behalf?” Zu An said in dissatisfaction. Learning about the secret could put him in danger, but a lack of information could easily lead to a lapse in judgment.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire fell into deep thought. Moments later, she said, “Fine. You’re already caught up in it, so you deserve to know about it. Nevertheless, this secret is still way too dangerous, so you should prepare yourself.”","She leaned in and gently kissed Zu An, and a surge of pure ki flowed into his body. It resembled origin ki, but it seemed to harness some kind of law on top of that.","Zu An was taken aback. “That was...”","“It’s a sliver of my divinity. It’ll protect you from being obliterated by the heavenly laws after learning about the secret.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire gently touched Zu An’s chest. “Did you think I did it with you because I coveted your body? It was a ritual for me to transfer my divinity to you.”","Zu An knew that divinity was a universal deity’s authority, so he understood how valuable this gift was. “Thank you...”","“Don’t be in a rush to thank me. Hear me out first.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire pressed her finger against his lips. “You should have met the Annihilation Progenitor’s worshipers, right?”","Zu An narrowed his eyes. “Is the calamity ‘Annihilation’?”","The Annihilation Progenitor had recently siphoned away Order’s and Reproduction’s powers. Clearly, the balance of power among the universal deities had already been shattered.","“Him? He isn’t worthy.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire harrumphed. “I only mentioned him to make it easier for you to understand the situation. The Annihilation Progenitor’s worshipers have been bringing destruction upon the world, whereas the ordeal I mentioned would result in the end of the Myriad Worlds, including the universal deities.","“The Annihilation Progenitor knows that, and such a fate happens to be aligned with his dao, so he decided to push ahead with it and completely embrace the end.”","It could have been due to the sliver of divinity from the Deity of Bliss and Desire or the additional piece of information, but many things suddenly made sense to Zu An.","No wonder the Deity of Memory wants to record everything. She hopes to restore the Myriad Worlds after everything comes to an end. As long as she collects enough memories, she can bring the Myriad Worlds back into existence.","The Deity of Chaos and Enigma fears that the lack of variables will result in an inevitable end, so she seeks to confuse the history of as many worlds as possible in hopes of averting the end.","...","But it seemed that their efforts had failed.","“How can I help you?” Zu An asked. He was also a part of the Myriad Worlds, so its destruction would also spell the end of him and his loved ones. Naturally, he couldn’t let that happen.","“The Deity of Love and Beauty might have reincarnated the first-generation universal deities, but a universal deity’s authority is too great to be wielded by their reincarnated selves. Furthermore, to avoid our detection, they chose to undergo several generations of reincarnation.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire briefly paused before adding, “You need to gather their fragmented souls and restore their memories.”","“Who are the reincarnations of the first-generation universal deities?” Zu An asked with a nervous heart.","“You should ask yourself. No one knows them better than you do.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire sensed his dissatisfaction, so she added, “I can sense the souls of universal deities from those two women outside. Look at how worried they are for you. Aren’t you a capable one?”","Zu An looked at the projections of Xihe and Princess Liuli in the sky, and his eyes widened in realization.","“If we’re going to work together, you ought to share more detailed information with me to save time lest we hinder each other,” he said. “Since you entered this world as the Heavenly Devil Empress, you must be planning something.”","“What an impatient man you are.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire harrumphed. “Help me change this world controlled by the Deity of Knowledge first. They will descend in person to meet you. I don’t have a clear idea of who the first-generation universal deities have reincarnated into, but the Deity of Knowledge should know. You can get the answer from them.”","“How can we change this world?”","“We have to shatter the Deity of Knowledge’s rules. They decreed that the Celestials govern the sky, and Emperor Jun and Donghuan Taiyi are the leaders of the Celestials. If you tap into the power of the Asuras, overthrow the Celestial Court’s rule, and plunder all the authorities, you will be able to change this world.”","A plan was already starting to form in Zu An’s mind.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire noticed Zu An’s expression and smiled. “You are indeed a resourceful one. I can’t bear to leave you.”","“Then don’t.” Zu An wrapped his hand around her waist. Since he was planning to overthrow the world, he could start with the woman before him.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire was startled, then her eyes turned cold. “Don’t get ahead of yourself. That was a ritual I held to protect you. That doesn’t mean I permit your impertinence.”","“I’ll be going up against a universal deity anyway. Where can I find the courage to oppose the Deity of Knowledge if I can’t conquer you?”","The Deity of Bliss and Desire was merely a sliver of consciousness occupying the Heavenly Devil Empress’s body. She was unable to overcome the limitations of her body. “You rascal! You wouldn’t dare to treat Mi Li and Meng so insolently as well!”"]},{"number":2972,"title":"Chapter 2972: Chapter 2924: Where the Authorities Are","paragraphs":["Some time later, the Deity of Bliss and Desire left. By then, it was hard to tell who was the one bringing bliss to whom, but she was very satisfied with what she had gotten.","Zu An had already reaped a lot of rewards. He had previously felt like everything before him was obscured by a layer of fog due to a lack of information. The Deity of Bliss and Desire had shared information with him unreservedly, even protecting him from the backlash of the secret.","It felt like he had learned much more from her in a single night than what he had from all his encounters with the Deity of Memory and the Deity of Chaos and Enigma. The frustrations that had been bubbling inside him were let loose just like that.","But again, the Deity of Bliss and Desire had to resort to such a method to reveal secrets to me. There’s no way Mi Li and Meng would do the same as well...","He quickly reined his thoughts in. He was harboring blasphemous thoughts right now.","He turned to Daji, whose fair skin had been dyed with a tinge of redness. Her beautiful appearance now looked even more enrapturing. He wondered if Daji’s senses were linked to the Deity of Bliss and Desire.","Surely not. She’s just a shell without a soul now.","While he was glad to have learned Daji’s background, he was confused as to why the Deity of Bliss and Desire had prepared such a clone. And she didn’t take Daji away with her...","Zu An first stowed Daji away before opening the Abyss of Eternal Night’s spatial vortex. The formation outside had been significantly weakened after Pimosh’s death. It was still a difficult fight, but the Asuras, under Xihe and Princess Liuli’s leadership, had successfully destroyed the formation.","Xihe was glad to see Zu An returning safe and sound. She grabbed his hand and examined him, asking, “You aren’t hurt, are you?”","Zu An’s heart felt warmed. He replied, “I’m fine.”","He felt guilty that he had been enjoying himself while Xihe and the others were having a tough battle outside. I was sacrificing my body for precious intelligence though...","Xihe breathed a sigh of relief, but moments later, she frowned. “Why do you smell so fragrant? It’s a woman’s scent, too.”","Zu An was speechless. Why do women have such a sharp sixth sense? Though I have to admit that the Deity of Desire and Lust smelled pretty nice...","He quickly reined his thoughts in and explained, “Pimosh colluded with the Devils. I had a showdown with the Heavenly Devil Empress.” Yep, it was a difficult battle, and I won in the end.","Xihe was taken aback. “Those despicable Devils? You can’t lower your guard down around them! Devils can infiltrate a person’s heart and wreak havoc when the opportunity presents itself.”","The Celestials had clashed with the Devils on numerous occasions. She understood just how tricky dealing with the Devils was.","“I’m fine.” Zu An feared that he would give himself away at this rate, so he quickly turned to Princess Liuli and changed the topic. “Your Highness, the Asura King is in there. He is injured, but he is safe.”","While the Deity of Bliss and Desire had no idea which of his lovers were incarnations of the first-generation universal deities, she had provided him with an invaluable clue: Those people retained their appearances across lifetimes. Normal beings were incapable of that.","Xihe, who looked identical to the future Shang Hongyu, had to be one of the first-generation universal deities. Zu An wondered which element she represented.","The same was true for Princess Liuli. Zu An hadn’t expected Mo Xi to be one of the first-generation universal deities. But then again, considering that Daji was the Deity of Bliss and Desire’s clone, it shouldn't have been a huge surprise that Mo Xi was also related to a universal deity.","But why does the Asura race’s Princess Ni Huang resemble them as well? Now that I think about it, she bears some resemblance to Murong Qinghe.","Zu An was dazed for a moment.","Xihe followed his gaze and realized that he was staring at Princess Liuli. She snorted in annoyance, “You’re staring at her very hard . Are you thinking about telling her to betroth herself to you to repay the favor?”","Zu An replied, “I’m thinking about something else.”","“Of course you are.”","Zu An kept quiet.","Princess Liuli’s face reddened. “Which woman wouldn’t like a hero like that? I understand why big sister is keeping such a close eye on him.”","Xihe was speechless.","The peculiar atmosphere made Zu An feel awkward, so he broke the silence with a cough before bringing the other asuras in.","“Father!” Princess Liuli rushed over to free the unconscious Asura King from the altar.","“Don’t worry. Pimosh’s formation has siphoned away some of his life force, but fortunately, we terminated the ritual in time. He isn’t in any danger,” Zu An said.","In truth, the Deity of Bliss and Desire had merely knocked out everyone in here and blocked their divine senses, as the conversation between her and Zu An had to be kept private. Now that she had departed, the Asura King would recover in due time.","And speak of the devil, the Asura King began opening his eyes. He first saw his daughter and exclaimed in delight, “Liuli!”","Princess Liuli was extremely relieved. “Father, it’s all thanks to big brother’s help that we were able to rescue you.”","The Asura King quickly got up and thanked Zu An. He had witnessed how Zu An defeated not just Pimosh but the Asura Progenitor Demon God as well. Those sights had given him a huge shock.","Zu An traded pleasantries with the Asura King before revealing his intent here. He felt that after his conversation with the Deity of Bliss and Desire, time was tighter than ever, so he didn’t want to waste any more time.","“The Asura Path’s power insignia...” the Asura King trailed off.","Princess Liuli quickly spoke up for Zu An, fearing that her father would get angry and turn down Zu An’s request.","The Asura King laughed. “This young hero saved our Asura race. I’d willingly relinquish my position to him, not to mention that all he wants is to temporarily borrow the power insignia. I’m hesitating because the power insignia is not with me.”","After hearing the Asura King’s words and sensing his hesitation, Zu An quickly constructed a barrier around them so that they could talk in private. “Is there something you can’t say in front of others?”","The Asura King was impressed by how sharp Zu An was. “The Asura Path’s power insignia is sealed within Liuli’s body.”","“Ah?”","Princess Liuli wasn’t the only one taken aback. Even Zu An and Xihe were flabbergasted.","“I already had a premonition that this would happen many years ago, so when Liuli was first born, I sealed the power insignia inside her body as a precaution. If not for that, Pimosh and the others would have long succeeded,” the Asura King replied. “Liuli, you’ll have to make the trip to help them.”","Princess Liuli’s face glowed in excitement. “Alright!”","She had felt close to Zu An from their first meeting, and after witnessing how he saved the Asura race, she now admired him more than ever. Naturally, she wanted to spend as much time as she could with him.","Xihe was annoyed. What was the Asura King thinking, putting the power insignia in his daughter’s body. “Won’t this be dangerous to Her Highness?”","The Asura King replied, “It would be dangerous if you needed the entire power insignia, but Liuli will be fine if you only require a sliver of it.”","“Yes, I’ll be fine.” Princess Liuli beamed a radiant smile at Zu An, with her eyes curved like the crescent moon.","Xihe harrumphed. She turned to Zu An and asked, “Where should we head next?”","“We’ll look for Lady Houtu,” Zu An replied with a slight frown. Has she awakened her consciousness as the Deity of Love and Beauty yet? And what’s her motive for forging the Six Paths of Reincarnation?"]},{"number":2973,"title":"Chapter 2973: Chapter 2925: True Identity","paragraphs":["The Asura King still needed to settle the unrest in the Asura World. Even though Pimosh and Lozento were now dead, they still had many aides. A misstep could still lead to him being put in a bad position.","But Zu An couldn’t be bothered with that. He had a lot of things to settle now and had no time to waste. If the Asura King couldn’t take control even after Pimosh and Lozento were both dead, he would be truly unworthy of the position.","Thus, he turned down the Asura King’s banquet invitation and left with Xihe and Princess Liuli.","Xihe was displeased. It should have been a couple's outing, but they were suddenly stuck with extraneous baggage.","Princess Liuli was oblivious to Xihe’s terrible mood. She continued pestering Zu An, asking him all sorts of questions like a boisterous girl.","“Big brother, why are the two of you so strong?","“How did you meet big sister?","“Who gave you that Asura Tear? Were you in a passionate relationship with an asura?”","...","Xihe was initially annoyed, but she pricked up her ears at the last question. She had heard about the situation surrounding the Asura Tear. The fact that a female asura had cried for Zu An meant that she must truly love him down to her core.","This fellow is even more of a philanderer than Emperor Jun!","Zu An’s head hurt. He was stuck between a girl with insatiable curiosity, and a woman who burned with jealousy but was gossipy at the same time. He couldn’t imagine them being first-generation universal deities.","No wonder the first-generation universal deities were defeated. They don’t exude an air of authority at all.","He thought about it but decided against telling them about their identities. He was safe after learning about the secret because the Deity of Bliss and Desire had protected him. He wasn’t confident that he could protect the two of them if he were to share the secret with them.","That said, he still told them about everything that would happen in the future so they could mentally prepare themselves.","When she learned from him that he had encountered another asura princess in the future, and that the other party looked just like her, Princess Liuli stared at Zu An with gleaming eyes. It must be fate’s decree!","Xihe harrumphed. “Do you say that to every woman you meet? How can there be so many women who resemble one another in the world?”","Zu An chuckled. “That’s why you’re special.”","Xihe’s face reddened. Despite knowing that those were just honeyed words, his dashing face paired with his earnest tone still made her heart skip a beat.","Along the way, Zu An told the two of them about the future events that involved not just them, but the others as well.","Princess Liuli was hooked on the stories, but she slowly sensed that something was amiss. She felt a little uneasy. “You have been intentionally vague all this time, fearing that divulging too much will change the past. Why aren’t you that worried about it now? Did something happen?”","Zu An had learned that this was nothing more than a simulated world created by the Deity of Knowledge, so there was no reason for him to worry about such things anymore. After a moment of silence, he said, “We have to go meet Lady Houtu now. You need to be careful.”","Princess Liuli chuckled. “Both you and big sister Xihe are so formidable, and we Asuras never shy away from a battle. I don’t think we need to fear that Lady Houtu or anything.”","But Xihe keenly picked up something from Zu An’s words. “You suspect Lady Houtu?”","Considering how Zu An had shown great respect toward Houtu thus far, his change in attitude was too abrupt for her not to notice.","“It’s better to err on the side of caution.”","Zu An still hadn’t figured out what was going on with the Lady Houtu of this world. The ‘Deity of Earth’ had betrayed the first-generation universal deities to join the second-generation universal deities. There was no telling what she was planning right now.","“Don’t worry, Liuli is right. There’s no need to fear her even if a fight breaks out.” Xihe was the Celestial Court’s Sun Goddess, whereas Liuli was the princess of the warlike Asura race. Houtu was strong, but the two of them weren’t weak, either.","Soon, the group arrived at the Underworld.","Houtu had already returned. She cast a surprised look at Princess Liuli before hurriedly asking, “Have you found the Asuras’ power insignia?”","Zu An didn’t answer right away. “Did you find the Human Path’s power insignia?”","Houtu smiled. She opened her palm to reveal a crystalline light that illuminated the surroundings. “I’m on good terms with Nuwa. She expressed support for my plan and shared a sliver of the Human Path’s power insignia with me.”","Zu An nodded. “Can I talk to you in private, Lady Houtu?”","Lady Houtu was surprised by the request, but she still nodded. “Alright.” She turned to Xihe and Princess Liuli and said, “I’ll have to trouble the two ladies to wait here for a moment.”","With a wave of her sleeve, she transported Zu An into a special space.","Xihe and Princess Liuli exchanged nervous looks. They thought about Zu An’s earlier reminder, and they wondered what he was worried about.","In the special space, Lady Houtu looked at Zu An with clear eyes that seemed to pierce right into one’s soul. “Did something happen in the Asura World?”","“Something unexpected did happen, but I gained a lot from the trip,” Zu An replied. “Lady Houtu, may I know how you intend to resolve the issue regarding the Beast Path’s power insignia?”","Lady Houtu smiled. “It sounds like you have obtained the Asura Path’s power insignia. The Beast Path’s power insignia does pose some trouble. While there are many beasts in the world, they are nowhere as significant as the other five paths yet. That means their power insignia has not been formed yet.”","Zu An patiently waited for her to continue.","“I have been pondering this problem. Your experience baffles me. Why can the Six Paths of Reincarnation only be completed in the future? Something must have prevented the Six Paths of Reincarnation from being completed in this era.” Lady Houtu paused before turning to Zu An. “I sense the change in your attitude. You may have concealed it well, but you can’t fool me. You don’t intend to hand the Asura Path’s power insignia to me.”","Zu An stared at Houtu. “I want you to answer my question first.”","“Go ahead.”","“Should I call you Lady Houtu... or the Deity of Love and Beauty?”","Lady Houtu was stunned, only to smile a moment later. Her voice became more melodious, albeit less graceful and authoritative. Even the most symphonic orchestra in the world couldn’t compete with her voice. Her appearance was the same as before, but her previously plain clothes became much more refined and beautiful. She emanated a dreamlike glow. She was the most beautiful goddess in this world.","“I didn’t expect us to meet again so soon. I mentioned last time that I hoped to hear a different answer from you. So, are you going to choose me or those two women?”"]},{"number":2974,"title":"Chapter 2974: Chapter 2926: Exchange","paragraphs":["Zu An was taken aback. Despite having guessed as much, he was still surprised to learn that Lady Houtu really was the Deity of Love and Beauty. Her disguise had been too convincing.","“Wait, that doesn’t make sense. You had already fallen then, and you were speaking to me through a fragment of your soul. How do you know all these things?” Zu An sensed that something was amiss.","“Don’t attempt to comprehend us universal deities using your mortal mind. Time may be linear for beings like you, but it isn’t for us. I knew what happened at the Order Ceremony right away,” the Deity of Love and Beauty replied with a ravishing smile that felt as if spring had come and flowers were blossoming. Even the surroundings became dreamlike.","Zu An was momentarily dazed. She really lived up to her reputation as the Deity of Love and Beauty. However, he quickly pulled himself together and asked, “What are you after?”","“I’m after what I'm after.” The Deity of Love and Beauty drifted over to Zu An’s side. Her opulent robe gently tickled his face, making his heart waver. “I am the one asking the questions here. Are you going to choose me or them?”","Zu An sighed. “Do you know the greatest weakness of a man?”","“Lust?” the Deity of Love and Beauty replied.","“No, it’s greed.” Zu An opened his arms wide. “I don’t want to choose. I want it all!”","A second passed before the Deity of Love and Beauty burst into laughter. “You are the most brazen person I have ever met. You dare utter such words in the presence of a universal deity.”","Then, her expression turned cold. “What do you take me as?”","“I take you as the most beautiful woman in the world,” Zu An replied with a smile.","The Deity of Love and Beauty shook her head. “Such crude compliments won’t work on me. Make your choice.”","“Will you turn around and accuse me of being heartless if I choose you?” Zu An reined in his smile as well. “They are your sisters. Do you really intend to kill them?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty narrowed her eyes. “Did someone tell you something?”","“Are you able to seal off this space to ward off eavesdroppers?” Zu An asked.","“I can, but my patience is limited.”","Zu An stared at her beautiful face and remarked, “So, should I be calling you the Deity of Love and Beauty... or the Deity of Earth?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty’s expression warped. “How do you know that? Did Mi Li or Meng tell you about me? No, that’s not like them.”","“It doesn’t matter how I know. The question is what you’re scheming,” Zu An replied. “You pretended to join the second-generation universal deities to secretly put the first-generation universal deities through reincarnation. Were you trying to protect them, or were you intending to stage a comeback in the future?”","“You know quite a bit.” The Deity of Love and Beauty snapped out of her initial shock and regained her composure. “What else do you know?”","Zu An frowned. “I think I have already shown my sincerity, but you refuse to speak. How can I trust you like that?”","“You are the one who wants something from me, not vice versa.” The Deity of Love and Beauty laughed. “I advise you to hurry up. Those two outside won’t last long. They don’t have memories of their awakening, so they won’t be a match for me.”","Zu An’s expression darkened. “I know that the Myriad Worlds are facing impending doom, and it’s a crisis that not even the universal deities have the power to stop.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty’s eyes flickered. “Continue.”","“Tell me which universal deities they correspond to first.” Zu An refused to let her dominate the flow of the conversation.","“Xihe is the reincarnation of the Deity of Light, whereas Princess Liuli is the reincarnation of the Deity of Lightning,” the Deity of Love and Beauty replied casually. She thought that there was no need for her to withhold such trivial information.","Xihe, as the Sun Goddess, embodies light and warmth. Princess Liuli is the princess of the warlike Asuras, whereas lightning also has a warlike trait as well. It looks like their elements correspond to their nature in one way or another.","Zu An replied, “The universal deities are dealing with the impending doom in their own ways, and I reckon that’s what you're doing now as well.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty didn’t respond to that remark.","Zu An continued, “But many years have passed since. You should have realized that you won’t be able to pull it off on your own.”","“Hmph.” The Deity of Love and Beauty finally grasped the situation. “You’re here as their envoy. We suffered so much under their oppression back then, yet you think that you can get us to help them with mere words?”","“It seems like you feel a greater sense of belonging to the first-generation universal deities,” Zu An remarked.","“Of course. I might have joined their ranks, but they still viewed me with skepticism and scorned me for betraying my comrades. In the end, they even banded together to kill me. Why should I help them?” the Deity of Love and Beauty sneered.","“You aren’t helping them but the people you care about,” Zu An replied. “Isn’t that what you're doing now? You should have realized by now that there is only so much that you can do alone.”","“Enough. You don’t have to speak up for them.” The Deity of Love and Beauty wouldn’t change her mind over a couple of remarks from Zu An. “I won’t help them, but it’s time for you to make your decision. Are you going to help them or help me?”","“I don’t even know what you’re doing. Why should I help you?” Zu An replied bitterly.","The Deity of Love and Beauty chuckled. “I wasn’t able to tell you anything before because it would put you at risk of heavenly retribution. Now that you know about the situation, it saves me some hassle. It won’t hurt for me to tell you a bit more.","“I have been trying to create the Six Paths of Reincarnation so there will be a place for souls to go after their bodies die. Of course, the law of nature still dictates that those who have undergone reincarnation must have their memories wiped,” the Deity of Love and Beauty said. “That will allow the dead to have a new lease on life.”","Zu An frowned. “What if the Six Paths of Reincarnation are destroyed in the impending calamity?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty fell silent. She had considered this possibility as well. “The Six Paths of Reincarnation are a fundamental law of the Myriad Worlds. As long as even a speck of the Myriad Worlds exist, the Six Paths of Reincarnation will surely reappear. No one can be absolutely certain in the face of the end, but I believe that my plan has the highest chance of success.”","Zu An finally replied, “I’ll help you with the Six Paths of Reincarnation. In return, I want you to tell me who the reincarnations of the first-generation universal deities are, and how I can restore their powers and memories.”"]},{"number":2975,"title":"Chapter 2975: Chapter 2927: The Real and the Fake","paragraphs":["The Deity of Love and Beauty stared at him for a few seconds before shaking her head. “I can’t tell you.”","“Why?” Zu An panicked.","“Have you forgotten that you’re the envoy of both the Deity of Chaos and Enigma and the Deity of Memory?” the Deity of Love and Beauty sneered. “Not to mention that you’re carrying Death’s authority, Reproduction’s seed, and the Deity of Bliss and Desire’s scent. How can I trust you?”","Zu An was speechless. He might have withheld some information from her, but there was no way he could hide these details from her when they were in such proximity. Still, he said, “It’s not our first time dealing with each other. You should know what kind of person I am. This time, the second-generation deities want to reach out to you to deal with the impending calamity.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty shook her head and smiled. “It’s not that I don’t trust you; I just don’t trust the people looming behind you. This matter is too big for you. You won’t be able to stop them if they choose to betray me.”","Zu An fell silent before finally conceding, “Yes, your words make sense. Fine, you don’t have to tell me those things. I’ll help you.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty was surprised. “Oh? The strong tend to have strong convictions as well, such that even death can’t change their perspective. I’m surprised that you’re taking a step back here.”","“I’m just being objective.” Zu An had just thought things through. It struck him that there was no point in interfering with the affairs of the universal deities now when he had limited say. He would have no recourse if the Deity of Bliss and Desire double-crossed him in this matter.","“I could be deceiving you as well,” the Deity of Love and Beauty pointed out.","Zu An replied, “You went to great lengths to protect the first-generation universal deities. From that, I don’t think that you’re that kind of person. Besides, you are Yanluo’s previous incarnation. I trust Yanluo, so I’ll trust her previous incarnation as well.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty laughed. “The world celebrates my beauty. There is no lack of people who demean their lovers to compliment me. It’s only with you that I become someone else’s substitute.”","The sudden charm from the Deity of Love and Beauty made Zu An’s heart pound. He hurriedly lowered his eyes and said, “We shouldn’t be fighting among ourselves now.”","“I didn’t expect you to be so shy,” the Deity of Love and Beauty teased, “I thought you feared nothing at all.”","Zu An sighed. “You’re the Deity of Love and Beauty, and I’m not made of stone. There’s no way I can resist your charm.”","“You say that when you have chosen another woman over me,” the Deity of Love and Beauty harrumphed. That person was her future incarnation, but it still displeased her.","Zu An quickly changed the topic with a cough. “We only need the Beast Path now. I might have an idea.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty immediately resumed her air of majesty upon talking about serious affairs. “Even I am unable to do anything about it in this special world. What ideas can you have?”","Zu An replied, “The idea came from the future. Our future selves successfully forged the Six Paths of Reincarnation, and the Beast Path’s power insignias came from the Monster World. I always wondered what the deal with the Monster World was, but I think I know what’s going on now.”","The Deity of Love and Beauty closed her eyes as if to inspect her memories across spacetime. Soon, she opened her eyes and asked, “You wish to create the Monster World?”","“That’s right.”","The Monster World’s upper echelons had been very intent on finding the Fiend races’ Celestial Court, believing the latter to be their ancestors. Later, they found out that they were merely sentient beasts reared by the Fiend races’ Celestial Court.","Zu An had wondered why those monsters had forgotten about their birthright, but looking at it now, perhaps someone had intentionally deceived them right from the start. Only then would they be desperate to find the Celestial Court, leading up to their eventual meeting with his future self. That was what gave him the chance to obtain the Beast Path’s power insignia.","The Deity of Love and Beauty frowned. “It looks like you’re the only one who can create the Beast Path now. However, the Beast Path is still one of the Six Paths, after all. It’ll take time for it to be properly established.”","Despite being a universal deity, many of her abilities were limited, as she was in the Deity of Knowledge’s world. Furthermore, this wasn't her complete body. She would be in danger if she caught the Deity of Knowledge’s gaze.","“That’s why the Six Paths can only be formed in the future.” Zu An felt conflicted, especially when he thought about how the Monster World had invaded other worlds and brought calamity upon the Cultivation World. Who could have thought that he was the mastermind behind it all?","And yet the establishment of the Six Paths was necessary to save even more lives. He had always snorted in disdain in response to the trolley problem, but in a cruel twist of fate, he found himself facing such a choice now.","“Alright. Tread carefully. Don’t catch the Deity of Knowledge’s gaze.” The Deity of Love and Beauty had long transcended mortality. She wouldn’t fuss about the deaths of a handful of lives. “I’ll slowly reveal necessary information to you when the time calls for it. May our partnership go smoothly.”","Zu An nodded grimly. His surroundings blurred, and before he knew it, he had been transported back to Xihe and Princess Liuli’s side.","The two women surveyed the surroundings warily. “Where is Lady Houtu?”","“She has gone elsewhere. Let’s return to the Celestial Court first.”","Xihe was delighted, as that was her home, as well as where they had gotten married. She was glad to be able to return home.","Princess Liuli, on the other hand, was hesitant. “The last time an Asura was brought to the Celestial Court, there was a war between the two worlds...”","Xihe laughed. “There’s no need to worry about that. I’m with you. Who would dare to stop...”","She regretted saying those words right away. She was only bringing trouble to herself by bringing such a beautiful lady back.","Zu An laughed. The Xihe in this world harbored much greater jealousy compared to the other Xihes he had met in the other spacetime fragments, though that was to be expected. She was the Celestial Empress in this world, and she had just gotten married as well.","Soon, the three of them returned to the Celestial Court.","Some Celestials were alarmed to see Princess Liuli and tried to stop her, but Princess Liuli grabbed Zu An’s arm and said, “I have been captured by him as his slave.”","The Celestials guffawed heartily upon hearing that. “All hail the Celestial Emperor!”","They felt like they had scored one against the Asuras, so naturally, there was no reason for them to continue blocking Princess Liuli anymore.","That spared Zu An's group the hassle of creating a pretext, but Xihe gritted her teeth in annoyance. This little vixen doesn’t hesitate to say anything at all.","As soon as they returned to the Celestial Court, Zu An began preparing for the creation of the Monster World. He ordered every Celestial to offer a droplet of their blood essence to him. That caused a huge commotion.","Even Donghuang Taiyi, who was busy fighting against Xuanyuan at the frontlines, sent a sliver of consciousness back to question him.","“How’s your battle against Xuanyuan going?” Zu An asked.","“It’s all within our grasp,” Donghuang Taiyi replied proudly.","“Is it? I heard that you’re slowly losing your upper hand.” Zu An chuckled.","Donghuang Taiyi’s expression darkened. If only the real Emperor Jun was still here, we could have joined hands, and Xuanyuan wouldn’t have been anything at all!","Zu An continued, “Xuanyuan has the upper hand now because he has rallied many races to his side. I ordered the Celestials to offer a droplet of their blood essence to bestow sentience upon the beasts. They should become a considerable army for you in due time.”","Donghuang Taiyi’s breathing hastened. Indeed, having more soldiers would lighten his burden. Still, he remained vigilant. He eyed Zu An with skepticism and asked, “What’s your goal?”","“I want to become the real Celestial Emperor. I can have all the women I want in the world, from the Celestial Empress to Princess Liuli. What can be better than being the ruler of the world?” Zu An laughed. “I’m not about to let Xuanyuan take this away from me.”","Donghuang Taiyi’s expression turned cold. “You’re just a fraud.”","“But you need this fraud. Even a fraud can become real with enough time.”"]},{"number":2976,"title":"Chapter 2976: Chapter 2928: I’ll Still Fall In Love With You","paragraphs":["Donghuang Taiyi’s expression turned cold. “Don’t get arrogant. Do you think the Celestial Court will crumble without you?”","“Is that not the case?” Zu An calmly replied. “You’re alone. How are you going to deal with Xuanyuan and Shennong? How are you going to deal with the Asura race? Will you only be satisfied if I join their side?”","Donghuang Taiyi’s face turned livid. He understood that Zu An was currently indispensable to the Celestial Court, but he couldn’t take it. How could a supreme god like him be pushed around by a fake?","You have successfully trolled Donghuang Taiyi for +399... +399... +399...","Zu An didn’t want to provoke Donghuang Taiyi as he was busy with other matters, so he said, “Don’t worry. I won't undermine your authority. In fact, I’ll slowly recede from the front stage after some years and hand things over to you. By then, you can call the shots in the Celestial Court. I just want to enjoy the benefits of being the Celestial Emperor for now.”","Donghuang Taiyi’s complexion finally looked a bit better. “Fine. I hope that you aren’t playing tricks on me, or else I’ll reveal that Emperor Jun is dead.”","He did need an Emperor Jun to hold the fort for the time being before power was handed to him. Besides, Zu An had contributed by convincing Shennong to steer clear of the war. For those reasons, it wasn’t a big deal to let Zu An enjoy the privileges of the Celestial Emperor for the time being.","“Sure. It’s my pleasure to work with you,” Zu An said with a smile.","Donghuang Taiyi harrumphed, but he still came to an agreement with Zu An. Thus, the two of them joined forces to enlighten the beasts. Under their authority, the remaining celestials had no choice but to reluctantly contribute a bit of their blood essence.","Zu An used the collected blood essence to awaken sapience in the beasts. Looking at them, he knew that they would eventually form one of the Six Paths. Afterward, he returned to the Underworld to visit the Deity of Love and Beauty and hash out their plans.","That piqued Xihe’s jealousy. She noticed how Zu An and Houtu were always speaking in private, so she couldn’t help but suspect that they were doing something else on top of that. These days, she was closer to Princess Liuli instead.","Meanwhile, Zu An and the Deity of Love and Beauty were able to work out the details. The latter would split the Asura Path’s power insignia inside Princess Liuli into two pieces, while transporting a sliver of herself into the future. That would make it harder for the other universal deities to interfere in her plans.","In the meantime, the Deity of Bliss and Desire secretly visited him and asked him about his progress. Zu An told her that it would take longer for him to establish a relationship of trust, and she was delighted by the answer. She had expected the Deity of Love and Beauty to remain skeptical, but it was already a good sign that the latter didn’t outright reject them, but instead displayed a willingness to engage with them.","In that delight, she gave Zu An another generous reward. It was just that she couldn’t bring her true body into this world, or else the Deity of Knowledge could notice her intrusion. So, she could only deal with Zu An as the Heavenly Devil Empress.","Unfortunately, this body was nowhere as resilient as Zu An’s. Her eyes eventually flipped upward, and she was forced to beg for mercy.","...","While sparring, the two also decided on their next course of action.","As it turned out, Xuanyuan was a Bliss and Desire envoy. The Deity of Bliss and Desire wanted Zu An to replace Xuanyuan as her envoy, but Zu An rejected her offer. He was more than happy to let Xuanyuan take the heat while he secretly leaked crucial intelligence from the Celestial Court to Xuanyuan. Thanks to that, Xuanyuan’s faction slowly gained the upper hand.","As a result, Donghuang Taiyi encountered setbacks on the battlefield and became easily irritable. He tried to ask Zu An for help, but the latter insisted that he had only agreed to stall Shennong and the Asuras, and that Donghuang Taiyi should deal with the rest by himself. Donghuang Taiyi was frustrated, but there was nothing he could say.","Zu An spent his following days leisurely. He often visited Wu Mountain to take care of the yao grass. Slowly but surely, the Goddess of Wu Mountain was being born anew.","He spent other days with Xihe in the Celestial Court. Before long, Xihe became pregnant and gave birth to several suns. While she basked in the joy of motherhood, worry and fear slowly took over her heart. She still remembered the plight of the Ten Suns in history. She asked Zu An about that several times, but the latter refused to tell her a concrete plan, claiming that other entities might intervene if they sensed his intention.","Frustrated, Xihe threw several tantrums, but in the end, she still chose to trust him. That said, she wasn’t about to stake everything on an individual. She secretly made preparations. This way, she would still have other ways to save her sons in case her future lover turned out to be lying to her.","More time passed. Donghuang Taiyi failed, and Xuanyuan was crowned as the new Celestial Emperor, taking the title of the Yellow Emperor.","Zu An joined hands with the Deity of Bliss and Desire to rewrite the world’s history. As a Chaos and Enigma envoy, he specialized in weaving falsehoods into the fabrics of history. It also helped that he had the support of the Deity of Bliss and Desire and the Deity of Love and Beauty. Soon, history was reshaped under his influence, turning into what he was more familiar with.","Emperor Jun and Donghuang Taiyi were no longer the supreme gods who had ruled since the inception of the Celestial Court. Instead, the first Celestial Emperor was the Green Emperor, who had two sons, the Flame Emperor and the Yellow Emperor.","The Flame Emperor became the second Celestial Emperor, but then the Yellow Emperor defeated the Flame Emperor to become the third Celestial Emperor.","Following his defeat, the Flame Emperor descended to earth. Since then, the Flame Emperor’s lineage and the Yellow Emperor’s lineage were perpetually in conflict.","Each Celestial Emperor eventually had to go into seclusion in order to achieve Sainthood. Before that, they had to pass the Celestial Emperor’s position down to someone else.","After the Yellow Emperor abdicated, his son, the White Emperor, took over as the fourth Celestial Emperor.","Zhuanxu, the White Emperor’s nephew, later became the fifth Celestial Emperor.","...","Through the Time Annal, Emperor Jun became the White Emperor’s child who sought to take back the Celestial Emperor’s seat from Zhuanxu. Thus, he schemed from the shadows and incited a war between the Fiends and the Shamans. He wanted to replace Zhuanxu as the Celestial Emperor, while eliminating the Shaman races as well so that the Fiend races could dominate the world.","To avert the war, Zhuanxu sacrificed his descendant to sever heaven from earth, but Emperor Jun wasn’t happy with that. He continued scheming, and eventually, he successfully incited a war between the Fiends and the Shamans. In the end, he sacrificed his ten sons, the Golden Crows, in an attempt to obtain unparalleled power.","...","One of Emperor Jun’s disregarded sons, Yao, attempted to lift the Human race up to achieve Sainthood. Despite knowing about Emperor Jun’s scheme, he secretly pushed the matter forth to overthrow both the Fiends and the Shamans, so that the Humans could take over.","In the end, Yao became the Human Emperor.","...","Eliminating an important historical figure could induce a severe backlash from the River of History. However, Zu An went about it through the Time Annal, and he mixed truths and falsehoods to muddy the water. That greatly reduced the backlash.","It was at this point that Xihe finally understood Zu An’s plan. To close the loop, she took the initiative to seal off her own memories.","Zu An couldn’t bear it, but Xihe was unbothered, saying, “You said that we’ll be together in the future, and I believe that. Even without these memories, even if my identity changes and we reunite in a different era, I believe that I’ll still fall in love with you.”"]},{"number":2977,"title":"Chapter 2977: Chapter 2929: Master","paragraphs":["In the end, Xihe still sealed off her memories.","Zu An felt wistful when they parted ways. Memories of the time they had spent together flashed through his mind. He hadn’t expected her to fall so deeply in love with him.","“Big brother Zu, are you going to leave?” Princess Liuli asked sorrowfully.","By now, the two of them had already left the Celestial Court. Now that both Xihe and Zu An were about to leave, Princess Liuli felt downcast.","Zu An nodded. “I need to return to verify some matters.”","He couldn’t blindly trust the Deity of Bliss and Desire or the Deity of Love and Beauty. To be safe, he thought it would be best to return and confirm the matter with Meng and Mi Li first. Despite their lofty attitudes, he could tell that they cared about him and had been protecting him. Unfortunately, he couldn’t contact them in the Deity of Knowledge’s world.","Princess Liuli bit her lip. “Will we never meet again?”","Zu An was taken aback. “Huh? I’m planning to take you with me.”","“Really?” Princess Liuli’s face lit up. “Can I really go as well?”","She belonged in this part of spacetime. Leaving would put her at risk of being corroded by time. It was one thing for her to die, but she couldn’t bear the thought of instantly aging countless years in front of Zu An. That would ruin his impression of her.","“Of course.” Zu An smiled. “This world might be ‘fake’, but it is a real, existing world. With the power of the Nature Jade and a universal deity, I should be able to take you out of here.”","He had already discussed this matter with the Deity of Love and Beauty, as he didn’t want a repeat of what had happened with the Goddess of Wu Mountain and the ancient Mermaid Queen.","Fortunately, Princess Liuli didn’t have a huge impact on the timeline from this point onward, especially after the Deity of Love and Beauty had extracted the sliver of the power insignia needed from her to craft the Six Paths of Reincarnation.","“That’s wonderful!” Princess Liuli was overjoyed. She embraced Zu An tightly while kissing his cheeks profusely.","She had thought that she would leave an Asura Tear on his shoulder, and she even wondered if the Asura Tear Zu An held had been from her. She hadn’t expected there to be such a turnaround, and that they wouldn’t need to part ways.","Her vibrant energy lifted Zu An’s dampened mood. She continued kissing Zu An while the two of them made their way to Wu Mountain.","At Wu Mountain, Qiu Honglei rolled her eyes upon seeing them. “Wipe off the rouge on your face.”","She gnashed her teeth in anger. Here she was, taking care of his lover, while he was out philandering with another woman. She felt a strong urge to bite Zu An's neck.","Zu An wiped off the rouge on his cheeks before employing all his skills to coax Qiu Honglei. He intended to make one last trip to the Underworld before bidding this world farewell. The Goddess of Wu Mountain had come back to life, but he decided not to disturb her now, as their fate was in the future.","Qiu Honglei hesitated. She was the Lady of Nine Heavens in this world, and she had come to this world as the Deity of Longevity’s envoy. She didn’t know if there would be any problems if she abruptly departed from this world.","Just then, the sky darkened.","Qiu Honglei was startled. “It seems to be a powerful entity.”","The group rushed out of the cavern. The world had turned dark, and two massive eyes were visible in the sky. The eyes were closed, but they were so big that they loomed over the entire world. There were scales around them, but instead of feeling cold, they felt divine.","“What’s that?” Qiu Honglei murmured as she got into a battle pose.","Zu An stared intently at the humongous body that was coiled in the black fog. A thought surfaced in his mind as he wondered, “Zhulong?”","The last few times Zu An visited this world, Yayu’s death and the immortal medicine had been extremely important incidents, and Yayu was Zhulong's son. Zhulong was the leader of the Ancestral Shamans. He had been an elusive figure thus far, hardly ever appearing in person. Zu An had no idea whether his abrupt appearance was a boon or a bane.","Just then, the terrifying eyes in the sky opened and stared straight at Zu An. At the same time, light returned to the world. Zu An put up his guard.","Zhulong was powerful, but Zu An had become strong enough to not have to fear him. Besides, he was backed by the Lady of Nine Heavens and Princess Liuli. If a fight really broke out, it was Zhulong who ought to be intimidated.","Just like that, the two of them locked gazes for a while longer before Zhulong said, “My master invites you over.”","Zu An was confused.","Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli were astounded. Given their positions in this world, they understood just how powerful and exalted Zhulong was in this world. He was the leader of the Ancestral Shamans, which put him on the same pedestal as the Celestial Emperor and the Asura King. Yet Zhulong was serving someone?","Zu An narrowed his eyes. “Who is your master?”","“You’ll know once you’re there.” Zhulong lowered himself to allow them to climb on his body.","Zu An smiled. “It’s fine. We’ll just follow you.”","Even though this was an artificial world created by the God of Knowledge, Zhulong was still the leader of the Ancestral Shamans. It was beneath him to be used as a mount. Zu An decided not to cross Zhulong, considering that in the future he still needed to deal with the latter.","Zhulong took a deep look at Zu An and said, “I’ll remember this.” He flew forward to lead the way.","Zu An turned to the two ladies and said, “You two wait here for me.”","He suspected that he would have to deal with that person , and these two wouldn’t be able to help even if they tagged along. It would be safer for them to remain here.","Qiu Honglei clutched Zu An’s arm and said, “No. We’ll go with you.” Her eyes carried conviction. She feared that it would be an eternal farewell.","Princess Liuli also spoke up, “That’s right. We Asuras don’t cower even in the face of a formidable enemy. If we die, we die together!”","The two women had also realized that Zhulong’s master had to be an extraordinary entity.","Zu An felt heartened. “Very well. Let’s deal with this together.”","After going through so much, he had come to understand that his lovers were also the most outstanding people in this world. They weren’t flowers in a greenhouse that would wilt in the face of danger.","Soon, the group arrived at a mountain. It was Zhong Mountain, where Zhulong resided. Many major events would happen there in the future.","Zhulong transformed into an old man and stood at the cavern’s entrance. “My master is waiting for you inside.”","Zu An nodded before entering the cavern with the two women. Considering Zhulong’s physique, they had expected the cavern to be spacious, but instead, they found themselves stepping into the middle of space as if the mountain was a mere illusion.","A waterfall of glowing digits appeared before their eyes. An ethereal but grand voice echoed, “We meet again.”"]},{"number":2978,"title":"Chapter 2978: Chapter 2930: The Power of Fate","paragraphs":["Zu An was stunned. He had already guessed the other party’s identity before coming here; after all, Zhulong was already one of the most powerful entities in this world. Who else could be worthy of being his master other than the creator of this world, the Deity of Knowledge?","But he hadn’t expected the voice to sound so familiar. He had heard it before. In the past, to resolve Ji Xiaoxi’s poison constitution, he had visited the Firecloud Cave to inquire about the whereabouts of some medicine. The voice that had answered him then was identical to the voice he was hearing right now.","This gave him the chills. It suddenly dawned on him that he was under the Deity of Knowledge’s surveillance all this time.","And I told them about the Six Paths of Reincarnation back then. Doesn’t that mean that they knew about the Deity of Love and Beauty’s plan the whole time?","Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli looked at Zu An with worried eyes. They were prepared for battle. Zu An gently grabbed their hands to console them before leading them in.","What awaited them inside was not a cave but a starry sky. The stars converged to form an old man with a white beard. He had a kind face, and he emanated a sacred white light.","“Paying respects to the revered Deity of Knowledge.” Zu An bowed to the old man. Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli quickly followed suit, having somewhat guessed what was going on.","The Deity of Knowledge replied tenderly, “Are you curious why I manifested not as a supercomputer, but a human?” He then looked at Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli with a complicated expression.","Noting the Deity of Knowledge’s amicable tone, both women heaved a sigh of relief.","Zu An smiled. “I am indeed surprised. I was honored to have met some of the other universal deities, but their majestic forms remain an enigma to me.”","“I have to manifest in a form that is coherent to the world lest I plunge it into chaos,” the Deity of Knowledge replied. “I have been observing you in recent years. There is wisdom in your actions. You are suited for the path of knowledge.”","Zu An’s heart shuddered. Being constantly observed by a universal deity was definitely not anything good. “I am already serving other universal deities. It would be inappropriate for me to switch to other paths. I seek your pardon for that.”","“Is that so? You seem to be on good terms with the Deity of Love and Beauty, and you had some interactions with the Deity of Bliss and Desire not long ago. Do your two masters know that?” The Deity of Knowledge stared at Zu An.","Zu An’s heart skipped a beat. It was fortunate that he had the Heaven Plunderer title, so the Deity of Knowledge couldn’t see through his thoughts.","Based on the Deity of Knowledge’s words, he had known that the Deity of Love and Beauty was Houtu all this time, though he didn’t seem to know how deep Zu An's interactions with the Deity of Bliss and Desire went.","“Now that I think about it, I met you the earliest of all the universal deities. We encountered each other outside the Firecloud Cave,” Zu An remarked. “May I ask what you are planning, and how I can be of service to you?”","“What a cunning fellow,” the Deity of Knowledge remarked. “It’s not much of a plan. It was merely a piece I placed on a whim, though your growth far surpassed what I have expected. You are qualified to discuss a partnership with me.”","As he waited for the Deity of Knowledge to continue, Zu An’s expression turned grim.","“I created this world to simulate countless possibilities, but I couldn’t resolve the impending doom. The Deity of Bliss and Desire is right. We need to work with the first-generation universal deities,” the Deity of Knowledge slowly said. “I noticed the Deity of Love and Beauty’s infiltration a long time ago, but instead of stopping her, I gave her a push to see if her intervention would induce new possibilities. And indeed, there were surprises, but they were far from enough. We need a proper alliance with the first-generation universal deities to have any chance of overcoming the impending doom.”","Zu An sighed. “But the first-generation universal deities have become a thing of the past. There’s no way of knowing where they have gone, and the Deity of Love and Beauty doesn’t trust you all.”","“Universal deities have unique divinities that are preserved even across reincarnations. The Deity of Love and Beauty feared that we might track the first-generation deities, so she sent them through several generations of reincarnation. The only way to restore their memories and divinity is to gather their soul fragments.” The Deity of Knowledge looked at Princess Liuli, knowing that she was one of the incarnations.","Zu An had thought about this as well. “But those soul fragments have been scattered across worlds over a long time. It would be nigh impossible to gather all of them aimlessly.”","“That might be true for others, but you are the exception. You are the only one in the Myriad Worlds capable of pulling it off.” As he spoke, the Deity of Knowledge looked deeply into Zu An’s eyes.","“Why?” Zu An frowned. This wasn't necessarily good news.","“You’ll know soon in the future.” The Deity of Knowledge seemed reluctant to divulge too much on this matter. “While the incarnations of the first-generation universal deities have been scattered across spacetime, over countless years of calculation, I found that they have been gathering in a certain realm. This might be the only time all of them intersect all of known spacetime. This chance may not surface once more. You have to grasp it.”","Zu An was confused. “The Deity of Love and Beauty intentionally scattered the first-generation universal deities to prevent all of them from being captured in a single swoop. It doesn’t make sense for all of them to be gathered at the same point in spacetime.”","“You should know of the phenomenon of planetary alignment before, right? Different civilizations have different explanations for it. Some believe that it’s the work of gravity. Some claim that it is the natural law of cause and effect.” The Deity of Knowledge paused. “In my view, it is fate that granted them a chance to reunite.”","Zu An pondered those words before asking, “Why isn’t there a Deity of Fate?”","The Deity of Knowledge looked at the universe and remarked, “Entities like us can dictate the fate of countless lives, but who can dictate our fate? If a Deity of Fate exists, they are bound to be far stronger than the rest of us. Maybe such an entity simply cannot exist, or we are unable to sense their existence.”","“How can I find the first-generation universal deities’ soul fragments after going to that world?” Zu An asked.","“You’ll know once you see them.”","Zu An wanted to complain about the ambiguous answer, but a thought suddenly occurred to him. Most of the first-generation universal deities were incarnations of his lovers, and that in itself was already a distinctive trait.","“What kind of world is it?” Zu An asked.","The Deity of Knowledge waved his hand, and the surrounding space turned into an immersive projection that displayed a vast world.","Reading the introduction and hearing the rampaging armies clash, Zu An asked in astonishment, “Isn't this the final years of Eastern Han, the era of the Three Kingdoms?”","The Deity of Knowledge smiled. “That’s why no one else in this world is more suited for this mission than you. However, you can’t drop your guard. It isn’t a normal world. Everyone there is a powerful entity. The world is overflowing with transcendent powers. You will be susceptible to danger, even with your current strength.”"]},{"number":2979,"title":"Chapter 2979: Chapter 2931: Please Choose Your Champion","paragraphs":["Zu An raised a question that had always been bugging him. “Why are these worlds set in backdrops I'm familiar with? This isn't the first time either. All of the dungeons I entered happen to follow the history I know.”","It could have been a coincidence if it had been only once or twice, but it kept happening all the time. There could be some discrepancies due to the existence of transcendent powers, but it was still weird. He even wondered if everything he had been through was just a simulation from the Deity of Knowledge.","“That’s why you are the one chosen by fate.” The Deity of Knowledge stared deeply at Zu An. “Only a person with great luck can have such intricate ties with both the first-generation and the second-generation universal deities.”","Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli were stupefied by the overload of information. What first-generation universal deities and second-generation universal deities?","The Deity of Knowledge noticed their confusion and lightly tapped his finger. Two specks of light flowed into their heads, providing them with all the information they needed to know. He then turned to the worried Zu An and said, “Don’t worry, this is a simulated world I created. External forces can’t probe into this place.”","After learning the truth, Princess Liuli’s usually bubbly expression seemed to gain a touch of divinity. “Can we enter the world as well to help big brother Zu?”","“Of course. He won’t be the only one descending into the world. There will be many other entities as well,” the Deity of Knowledge replied kindly.","Zu An frowned. “Will it be like the Order Ceremony?”","“You can think of it that way, but unlike the Order Ceremony, you won’t be taking the dominant position. That world’s indigenous population is extremely powerful, such that you might even be swept along by their momentum.” The Deity of Knowledge briefly paused before adding, “Some wield the strength of a universal deity. Others are even universal deities themselves.”","Zu An nodded. He had expected that, since the Deity of Knowledge had mentioned that the first-generation universal deities’ soul fragments were gathered in that world. Those incarnations could most definitely be considered on par with universal deities. He asked, “Who is my enemy?”","“Unless you turn them into your friends, they may all be your enemies.”","Zu An was speechless. This old fellow sure knows how to be cryptic.","The Deity of Knowledge noticed his dissatisfaction and further elaborated, “You might be blessed with great luck, but the universal deities will not stake everything on you. They have other worshipers in that world as well, or rather, some of the indigenous populace are envoys chosen by the universal deities.”","Zu An caught his drift and nodded. “I’ll give it a try, but I need to communicate with several people first.”","Maintaining vigilance was important. It wouldn’t be wise to blindly trust the Deity of Knowledge.","The Deity of Knowledge laughed. “Of course. It will be tough for you to liaise with your two masters in this world, so let me help you.”","He waved his hand. Several bundles of dreamy lights suddenly appeared in the sky, and familiar auras began to emerge.","“Oh? You've kept this world guarded against us as if you’re worried that we’ll sully your precious treasure. What made you change your mind today?” the Deity of Chaos and Enigma, Mi Li, said.","“The fate of this world appears to have been altered. I sense Bliss and Desire’s aura, as well as the aura of that hateful Time Scribe,” the Deity of Memory, Meng, said.","These two universal deities manifested as dreamlike entities, concealing their true forms.","“You’re too stoic, Meng. Why don’t you let me give you a taste of bliss?” the Deity of Bliss and Desire suggested seductively. She manifested as the Heavenly Devil Empress.","Zu An’s eyelids twitched. He felt like things could get dangerous for him if the universal deities continued talking, but fortunately, the Deity of Bliss and Desire didn’t mention her interaction with him. Otherwise, he wouldn’t know how to face his two masters.","“Aren’t you embarrassing yourself by flaunting your charms in front of the Deity of Love and Beauty?” Meng coldly pointed out.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire was speechless.","Zu An belatedly noticed another bundle of hazy light. It was Lady Houtu, also known as the Deity of Love and Beauty.","Objectively speaking, while the Deity of Love and Beauty was the manifestation of beauty, the Deity of Bliss and Desire commanded her unique charms as well... although there was no way he would dare to say those words aloud.","The Deity of Love and Beauty frowned. She ignored the other two and instead turned to the Deity of Knowledge. “It looks like you’re aware of my actions.”","The Deity of Knowledge smiled. “You have set up many things in my world. I’d be ashamed to call myself the Deity of Knowledge if I knew nothing at all.”","Zu An subconsciously looked at the Deity of Bliss and Desire. It would be awkward if the Deity of Knowledge had witnessed their ‘intimate exchange’ as well.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire blinked at him, hinting at him not to worry.","Unfortunately, their interaction piqued Mi Li’s suspicion. She coldly harrumphed. “Look for your own envoy. Don’t even think about seducing mine.”","The Deity of Bliss and Desire looked at the Deity of Memory and said, “Meng, she’s talking about you. You stole her envoy. She’s like a helpless husband throwing out sarcastic remarks after having her wife stolen.”","Mi Li was speechless.","Meng replied mirthfully, “Your words have never sounded more pleasant.”","“My mouth has always been sweet. Do you want to have a taste?” The Deity of Bliss and Desire licked her lips.","...","It was complete chaos. Zu An was worried that they would come to blows, so he quickly stated the reason they had been summoned here. In response, the universal deities finally put on their serious faces.","“I don’t agree with this matter, but if it’s you, it might be worth a try,” Mi Li said.","“I don’t have any opinions. Just make sure that you faithfully record everything,” Meng replied.","The Deity of Bliss and Desire cheerily remarked, “We have already had an intimate exchange. I’ll support you in your endeavor.”","Those words alarmed Mi Li and Meng.","Zu An quickly changed the topic. He turned to the Deity of Love and Beauty and asked, “What about you?”","The Deity of Love and Beauty eyed Princess Liuli as if looking at an old friend. A moment later, she finally turned to look at Zu An. “I don’t trust the rest of them, but I trust you.”","The Deity of Bliss and Desire grumbled to Mi Li, “Your envoy is surprisingly good at placating everyone. It’s completely at odds with your abhorrent personality.”","Mi Li sneered, “You don’t have to speak to prove that you aren’t mute. Are you looking for a fight?”","“Do you think I’m afraid of you?” The Deity of Bliss and Desire didn't back down.","Zu An felt a headache settling in. “I’m about to enter a dangerous world. Aren’t you going to bestow me with some advice or a gift?”","The universal deities briefly discussed the matter before the Deity of Knowledge said, “That world is a unique one. Unless you’re a universal deity’s soul fragment or part of the indigenous populace, you’re doomed to remain a nobody. None of your endeavors will go well. We can help you obtain an indigenous identity, so you can enjoy their benefits and luck.”","Zu An’s eyes lit up. “Can I be anyone I want?”","He raised a few examples, like Emperor Ling of Han. If he could start his journey as an emperor, the tremendous influence he wielded would make whatever he wanted to do much easier.","“Of course not. You can only take the identity of those whose luck has yet to surface, or else you might plunge the worldline into disarray and be rejected from the world,” the Deity of Knowledge said.","The Deity of Memory added, “Choose someone who aligns with your path, or else you risk being rejected by the world as well, despite our help. It might lead to unforeseeable outcomes.”","Zu An pondered for a long time before saying, “I’ll choose the imperial uncle, Liu Bei, Liu Xuande.”"]},{"number":2980,"title":"Chapter 2980: Chapter 2932: The Three Kingdoms","paragraphs":["Chapter 2932: The Three Kingdoms","“Liu Bei?” The Deity of Knowledge frowned. “He is indeed one of the protagonists of that space-time, but his rise to prominence comes too late. He already did a good job, but he still failed to change the tide. Are you sure you can do better than him?”","As a universal deity, he could read the flow of history. His skepticism was understandable. The protagonists of each period in were naturally endowed with good luck in their endeavors. Even those who were stronger and wiser struggled to do better.","“I’ll try,” Zu An replied grimly.","The Deity of Memory asked, “Are you sure you want to walk Liu Bei’s path? If the will of the world senses misalignment in your paths, not only will you not be blessed with good luck, but you might even be cursed with misfortune. You’ll become an entity despised by the world. You’ll face tall hurdles in all your endeavors. Even water may get stuck in between your teeth.”","Zu An closed his eyes. He hadn't been fond of Liu Bei when he first read ‘Romance of the Three Kingdoms’ back when he was young. He'd thought that Liu Bei was incompetent and only knew how to cry, making him nothing compared to the ambitious and carefree Cao Cao, or the invincible Lu Bu, who had the beautiful Diaochan as his companion.","But as he went through life, he began to appreciate Liu Bei’s character. Liu Bei was a compassionate ruler, and he proved that through his actions. There were many emperors in history, but if their subordinates were granted a chance to start anew, only a small handful would be willing to serve the same master. In contrast, even though Liu Bei was defeated in the end, his subordinates would still be willing to fight alongside him a second time for a chance to change fate.","Another thing that moved Zu An was Liu Bei’s unyielding spirit. The latter was unlike Yuan Shao, whose clan was so eminent that they dominated the three most important positions of the imperial court for four generations; or Cao Cao, who was backed by the powerful Xiahou Clan; or Sun Quan, who inherited his father and brothers’ influence.","No, Liu Bei had started from a blank slate. There was nothing outstanding about his capabilities, be it his wits, martial prowess, or commanding competency. Compared to the bright stars that shared that era, he was second-rate at best. Yet despite being exiled for half his life and being over fifty years of age, he never gave up on his dream and eventually became one of the three great warlords of that era.","Many people harbored dreams as children, believing themselves to be the protagonists of the world. But the cruel beating of reality forced them to open their eyes to the fact that they were just normal people. Eventually, they resigned themselves to fate and gave up.","Only those who had been beaten down would understand how difficult it was for Liu Bei to persist in his dreams despite his repeated defeats.","...","Many thoughts rushed into Zu An’s mind before he solemnly replied, “Yes, I’m certain.”","“All right.” The universal deities had a quick discussion before acknowledging his decision.","Zu An wanted to return to bid his lovers farewell, but the universal deities stopped him.","The Deity of Chaos and Enigma said, “You won’t be able to see them even if you return now. They have places where they need to be. The threads of fate will eventually reunite you with your lovers.”","Zu An could only give up on that idea. He confirmed a few details with the universal deities before agreeing to set off.","The universal deities joined forces and suffused the surroundings with a surge of power. A space-time vortex manifested in front of Zu An, and images seemed to flash across the vortex.","Zu An held Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli’s hands, consoling them while leading them forward.","“What a sentimental man. He doesn’t forget to flirt even when marching into danger,” the Deity of Bliss and Desire teased.","“He wouldn’t have been able to rekindle his ties with his old friends if not for those feelings tying him down,” Mi Li replied casually.","“Do you think he’ll succeed?” Meng had never felt so lacking in confidence before as a universal deity.","“You'd better pray for his success,” the Deity of Love and Beauty coldly remarked. “This is the only chance I’m giving you.”","“I have conducted a holistic assessment of all factors. He is the most likely person to succeed, with a success rate of 29.8%.” The Deity of Knowledge broke his usual composure, sounding inexplicably excited.","The other universal deities fell silent. The Deity of Love and Beauty left with a cold expression. The lights in the sky flashed, and both Mi Li and Meng disappeared as well.","The Deity of Knowledge was confused. “Why are they reacting like that? Isn’t that good news?”","“It has been so many years, but you’re still incapable of calculating emotions.” The Deity of Bliss and Desire laughed seductively before leaving as well.","The Deity of Knowledge stood quietly on the spot for a while before murmuring, “Could that be the reason why my simulation failed despite running for so many years?”","...","Zu An felt the world spin around him. This wasn't his first time experiencing such a sensation. By the time he opened his eyes, Qiu Honglei and Princess Liuli were no longer beside him, but he wasn’t too worried. Given their wits and special identities, they would likely be able to remain safe.","He scanned his surroundings. He was in a crude house with hardly any furniture. There was only a table with simple straw sandals lying beside it. Did I transmigrate into Liu Bei’s younger self?","He looked around for a mirror to check his appearance, but there was nothing of that sort in the room. So, he waved his hand and conjured a bundle of water. Through the water’s reflection, he was able to see his own face.","His ears had grown longer, and his hands were drooping lower, but other than those, there wasn't a big difference in his appearance. That was likely the result of the universal deities’ powers. He had fully taken on Liu Bei’s identity.","He even felt a bit dazed, as he had an inexplicable feeling that he had been born and had lived in this world for many years now.","He pushed open the entrance door and walked out. He was in the middle of a mountain forest. Looking into the distance, he saw a couple of houses scattered around. This had to be the village where Liu Bei’s ancestors resided.","He flew over to a secluded area and unleashed a wave of sword ki. A large swath of trees was chopped down. He tried his own abilities as well, and they functioned as normal.","Zu An felt relieved and nervous at the same time. I retained all my abilities. The original Liu Bei’s martial power should have been at most second-tier in this world. That means this world must be even more dangerous than I expected.","He proceeded to explore the village. All the villagers were astonishingly strong and healthy. He even spotted a white-haired old man flashing across the farmland, tilling an entire acre of land in a single sweep.","These people were comparable to lower-rank cultivators, but they were only normal civilians in this world.","He asked them about the location of the nearest county and began making his way over. He had to get out of this village to gather more intelligence about this world.","—","TL Note:","During the final years of the Eastern Han, the imperial family grew so weak that the emperor became a puppet for the warlords to grasp power.","Several powerful factions emerged, and they battled for power.","For instance, there was Warlord Dong Zhuo, who stormed the palace and installed his puppet emperor and effectively took control of the state. Dong Zhuo was later defeated by Cao Cao, who then took control of the puppet emperor and ruled through him.","There were also Yuan Shao and Yuan An, two brothers who were also powerful warlords. They came from a prominent clan that had accrued much power from dominating the roles of the Grand Protector, Grand Marshal, and Grand Preceptor for four generations.","Liu Bei was a very distant relative of the Liu Imperial Clan (the rulers of the Eastern Han then). He gained supporters due to people opposing Cao Cao’s tyranny after he turned Emperor Xian of Han into his puppet."]},{"number":2981,"title":"Chapter 2981: Chapter 2933: Something is Very Weird About This World!","paragraphs":["Zu An took the straw sandals and the straw mat into the house with him, hoping to use them to conceal his identity. He would have to deal with officials once he reached the county. It would be troublesome if someone figured out his true identity.","However, he quickly realized that the two items were artifacts. The sandals allowed even a mortal to move as lithely as a swallow. The mat contained a simple Ki Gathering Formation, which allowed one to sleep well while gathering natural ki from the surroundings to nourish themselves.","Zu An was amazed by the vast changes in the world. Not a single thing here was normal. At least with his cultivation and formation knowledge, he could easily decipher how the two artifacts were made. I guess I can at least make a living in this world.","He had noticed that even though he retained his abilities, his connection with the world was nowhere near as tight as before. Furthermore, the world laws seemed to be suppressing his strength. His recovery was no longer as fast as before. If he depleted his ki and vitality, he would have to find other methods to replenish them. In fact, he even had to consume food to survive now.","No wonder those villagers are working hard despite being cultivators. That was the reason Liu Bei, despite his abilities, had to weave straw sandals and straw mats to buy ki food and pills.","He followed the information he had gotten from the villagers and made his way toward the nearest county. When he saw the words ‘Zhuo County’ at the entrance, his eyes narrowed. The starting point of this space-time fragment coincided with that of the ‘Romance of the Three Kingdoms’[1].","This was for the best, though. It was a low starting point, but it represented boundless possibilities.","The garrison guards thoroughly checked his body and his goods before letting him in.","According to the discussions around him, Zu An learned that the Yellow Turban Rebellion had just broken out, and the Yellow Turban Army was going around raiding counties. Zhuo County’s officials were afraid that the Yellow Turbans would dispatch a spy to infiltrate their ranks, so they were thorough with their checks.","Based on what Zu An knew, the Yellow Turban Rebellion only lasted a year before it was suppressed. The remnants of the rebellion continued to wreak havoc afterward, but they weren’t enough to pose a threat. However, he also recognized that this world might not necessarily observe the history he was familiar with. There was no guarantee that the Yellow Turban Rebellion would be suppressed so easily.","He spent some time wandering the streets to gain a better idea of the situation. He learned that the governor was recruiting locals into a volunteer army to counter the Yellow Turban Rebellion. Quite a few skilled individuals displayed interest in joining the volunteer army.","He observed the situation without interfering. He had come to Zhuo County to gather intelligence, as well as to recruit the two most important allies in Liu Bei’s life: the two ferocious generals who could rival ten thousand soldiers—Guan Yu and Zhang Fei. Based on the Romance of the Three Kingdoms, they first became acquainted in Zhuo County before eventually taking an oath of fraternity in a peach garden.","Guan Yu and Zhang Fei were Liu Bei’s starter SSR cards. He couldn’t miss them. At the same time, he was curious to know how strong they were. The two of them were supposed to be among the top experts in this world. Through them, he would be able to get a gauge of where he stood in this world.","But despite searching the entirety of Zhuo County, he was unable to find them.","This brought a frown to his face. Could it be that the external interferences in this world have changed its trajectory, such that I can’t trigger the ‘Oath of the Peach Garden’ event anymore? Just thinking about the possibility of having to fight against Zhang Fei and Guan Yu in the future made him tremble in fear. That absolutely couldn’t happen.","He settled down at an empty space in the market to sell his straw sandals and straw mats. At the same time, he pondered about how he could find Zhang Fei and Guan Yu in Zhuo County.","The sun gradually set in the west. He managed to sell most of his sandals and mats, earning several hundred coins. The coins in this world weren’t made from gold, silver, or copper, but a unique metal. They contained trace amounts of natural ki, and they were inscribed with the imperial court’s runes, thus making them hard to replicate.","He was about to head into the shops to buy some ki food and pills to get a gauge of this world’s purchasing power when he heard a commotion.","“Sounds like a fight.”","“Both of them are beauties!”","“Go, let’s take a look.”","Zu An chuckled. It looked like there was no lack of nosy spectators across the world. He initially thought that they might be Guan Yu and Zhang Fei, but he nearly lost interest as soon as he heard that they were women.","But on second thought, his goal here was to find the first-generation universal deities’ soul fragments. As far as he knew, all the first-generation universal deities were women. Though I can’t be so lucky as to stumble upon them just like that, right? Thus, he quickly made his way over.","At the eastern area of Zhuo County, a white-robed woman with a disposition resembling an ice mountain that had been frozen for ten thousand years coldly stared at a black-robed woman. “Are you buying or not?”","The black-robed woman had long, cascading hair. Unlike the frosty white-robed woman, she replied with a flirtatious smile, “What do you sell here?”","The crowd buzzed in excitement as they wondered why these two beauties would descend upon a minor town like Zhuo County.","“How can you be so ignorant? That white-robed woman is an outsider, but that black-robed woman is a renowned merchant in our county! She monopolizes the blood businesses in the neighboring counties!”","As the ordinary populace here were far stronger than the mortals of other worlds, the wild beasts in this world were also extraordinarily powerful. They often preyed on travelers. Their blood and flesh were valuable, as they could replenish one’s vitality and be used for medicine. The black-robed woman had to be extremely powerful to monopolize this lucrative business.","But the white-robed woman remained unfazed. “I sell green ki beans. They can swiftly replenish a cultivator’s ki.”","“Is that so? Let me inspect the product.” The black-robed woman stuck her hand into the bag and pulled out a fistful of green beans. Then, she shrugged. “These aren’t green ki beans but bean powder. Are you a scammer?”","The spectators whispered among themselves.","“The white-robed woman is in trouble.”","“Boss Zhang is clearly here to stir trouble. That woman must have offended Boss Zhang somehow.”","“That white-robed woman looks strong. She might not necessarily lose.”","...","The white-robed woman glared at the black-robed woman. “You’re doing this on purpose.”","“What are you saying? Don’t malign me. You’re the one trying to pass bean powder off as green ki beans,” the black-robed woman replied with a smile.","The white-robed woman chose to ignore her. She picked up her bag of green ki beans and left.","However, the black-robed woman wasn’t about to let her go. She grabbed the white-robed woman’s shoulder and said, “Oi, you can’t leave yet.”","The white-robed woman immediately twisted her body as her hand flew straight for the black-robed woman’s neck. However, the black-robed woman was prepared for the attack and dodged it with ease.","“Heh, I thought you wouldn’t get angry,” the black-robed woman snickered.","The white-robed woman charged at the black-robed woman, using her finger as a sword. A terrifying shockwave rippled from her.","The crowd fled in horror, fearing that they would be implicated in the clash.","Only Zu An remained on the spot, braving the furious winds. He couldn’t help but think that something was very weird about this world.","—","Note from Starve:","To clarify, the Three Kingdoms era is a huge bundle of fiction mixed with facts.","‘Romance of the Three Kingdoms’ is one of the Four Classics in China, and it is through this book that most people learn about the Three Kingdoms. However, this book is fictional, though the events described there are based in history.","For instance, Liu Bei, Zhang Fei, and Guan Yu were known to be close, but the Oath of the Peach Garden is said to be a fictional event.","As I’m translating the raws up to date, I’m not sure if this distinction makes a difference. Nevertheless, I’ll try to highlight it wherever I can.","1. The Three Kingdoms refers to the time period, whereas Romance of Three Kingdoms is a fictional book about the Three Kingdoms’ history. ☜"]},{"number":2982,"title":"Chapter 2982: Chapter 2934: Sleeping On the Same Bed Like Brothers","paragraphs":["Zu An was excited when he first arrived at the scene. The two ladies were familiar faces.","Who else could the white-robed woman be other than Yan Xuehen? Similarly, the black-robed woman was Yun Jianyue. He had parted ways with them for a long time. There was no news whatsoever, and he had no idea where he could look for them amid the vast Myriad Worlds. He hadn’t expected to reunite with them here.","Those two were indeed sworn enemies. They were bickering even in this world.","He intended to reunite with them, only to quickly sense something amiss. Why does it seem like Yan Xuehen doesn’t recognize Yun Jianyue at all?","What bothered him more was how the crowd had addressed Yun Jianyue as ‘Boss Zhang’. It occurred to him that this was a replica of the event where Zhang Fei smashed the green beans that Guan Yu was trying to sell.","Yan Xuehen and Yun Jianyue are my Guan Yu and Zhang Fei?","He had expected two brawny men, but they turned out to be gorgeous beauties instead.","The two women were getting serious in their fight. Terrifying shockwaves rippled from their clashes, wrecking nearby stands and stores.","However, Zu An keenly noticed that the destruction caused was significantly lower than normal. He scanned the surroundings and noticed runes glowing on the distant town walls. There was a formation in the town that was greatly dampening their destructive prowess. If not for their high cultivation, the two women wouldn’t even have been able to damage the buildings while under the formation’s suppression.","Sensing that things might go awry at this rate, Zu An ran in between the two women and shouted, “Stop fighting!”","It just so happened that the white-robed woman and the black-robed woman were hurling punches at each other, and it was too late for them to withdraw their attacks. They could only try their best to reduce their might.","Pah!","Dust flew. Zu An stood in between the two women, separating them with his palms.","The white-robed woman’s cold eyes rippled when she saw Zu An. She was about to speak when the black-robed woman reacted even more intensely.","“Ah Zu!” The black-robed woman dove into Zu An’s arms and embraced him.","The white-robed woman’s eyebrows shot up. She quietly retracted her hand.","“Big sister Yun...” Zu An was moved as well.","Back when he returned to the Cultivation World, he found that many of his old lovers had entered Divine Palaces and ventured into the Myriad Worlds. While he didn’t know their exact whereabouts, he at least had some clues about where they went.","However, Yun Jianyue disappeared despite not having entered a Divine Palace, so he had no idea where he could begin searching for her at all.","Their reunion moved him so much that he felt like thanking fate.","The two of them hugged for a long while, until the white-robed woman coldly looked away and marched off.","Yun Jianyue noticed her movements and quickly stepped back from Zu An’s embrace. She remarked with a smile, “Quick, go and coax her. The ice statue is getting jealous.”","“What do you mean by ice statue?” the white-robed woman asked.","Yun Jianyue was taken aback. She had thought that Yan Xuehen was pretending not to know her, which was why she intentionally provoked the latter. However, it was clear as day now that Yan Xuehen really didn’t recognize her.","Zu An hesitantly called out, “Tingxue?”","Yun Jianyue blinked. What are they roleplaying as now?","But the white-robed woman nodded in response to that name. “We meet again.”","“What’s going on?” Yun Jianyue asked.","Zu An briefly told Yun Jianyue about how he met Tingxue before proceeding to introduce the two women.","Tingxue remarked, “You have a lot of women with you, be it the last time we parted or our reunion now.”","It was a jab, but Zu An wasn’t embarrassed in the slightest. Instead, he remarked, “It’s rare to hear you speak so much.”","Under his intense gaze, Tingxue awkwardly looked away.","“Is she really not the ice statue?” Yun Jianyue frowned. She sensed that there was something between those two.","“By ice statue, you’re referring to Yan Xuehen?” Tingxue asked.","It amused Yun Jianyue to see Yan Xuehen acknowledging her own nickname. “Of course.”","“Why do you call her that?” Tingxue couldn’t understand why she was feeling annoyed. She shouldn’t have been so prone to experiencing emotions.","“It’s because she’s as cold as a lump of stone.” Yun Jianyue struggled to suppress her smile.","Tingxue’s expression turned cold. Even though she had no idea why Yun Jianyue was smiling, she could tell as much that it wasn’t anything good. She felt inclined to start another fight with the latter.","Zu An quickly stopped them. “Let’s not cause a spectacle here. Shall we go somewhere private to chat?”","Yun Jianyue waved her hand. “Follow me.”","Tingxue was reluctant to tag along, but Zu An grabbed her hand and dragged her with them.","Soon, they arrived at a massive residence in the middle of the town. Several servants rushed out to greet them.","“Welcome back, boss.”","Zu An and Tingxue were speechless.","Yun Jianyue struggled to keep a straight face. “I wanted them to call me sect leader, but there already is a Taiping Daoism Sect in this world, and the leader of the Yellow Turban Army, Zhang Jiao, is also being addressed as ‘sect leader’. The imperial court has deemed the Yellow Turban Army as rebels and is cracking down on them. I told them to call me boss instead to avoid being implicated in that.”","Zu An chuckled. Yun Jianyue is addicted to being the boss of the underground world, no matter where she goes.","He looked at the entrance plaque, which contained the words ‘Zhang Manor’, and asked, “Is there someone named Zhang Fei here?”","“Audacious! How dare you call our boss by her name?” the servants roared.","“Who do you think you are shouting at? This is my lover!” Yun Jianyue glared at the servants before leaning against Zu An’s chest with a blissful smile.","The servants were shocked. They had never seen their boss behaving so coyly before. How should we address the boss’ lover?","Zu An was still shocked despite having fathomed a guess. He waited for the crowd to leave before secretly asking her, “Your name is Zhang Fei in this world?”","Yun Jianyue felt embarrassed. “They have been calling me that ever since I got here. I figured it was my identity in this world, so I didn’t bother correcting them.”","Zu An turned to Tingxue dazedly and asked, “Tingxue, is there any chance that you go by the name of ‘Guan Yu’ in this world?”","Tingxue was taken aback as she hadn’t told them yet. “How do you know?”","By then, the three of them arrived at the courtyard. Zu An noticed the peach blossom trees in the courtyard and fell silent.","It was recorded in the annals that Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhang Fei were so close that they shared a bed. That statement gave rise to rumors that Shu Han[1] was filled with gay people. Who could have expected that this was the truth?","Zu An chuckled under his breath. “What a beautiful peach blossom forest. Fate must have brought us together in this foreign world. Why don’t we make an oath of fraternity?”","“An oath of fraternity?” Yun Jianyue smiled. “I’d prefer an oath of marriage.”","Tingxue placidly replied, “Do whatever you two want. Don’t involve me in it.”","I left the last time because this fellow told Firework to do it with my appearance. What is he scheming this time?","—","Some rough background:","The Qin Dynasty united China as one, but it was short-lived.","Liu Bang and Xiang Yu toppled the Qin Dynasty, and the former founded the Han Dynasty (thus the Liu Imperial Family). The Han Dynasty is divided into two time periods—the earlier Western Han and the later Eastern Han.","We’re currently in the final years of the Eastern Han. Unfortunately, there are many underlying problems in this era.","First, the imperial family has failed to keep the officials and nobles in check, resulting in them growing very powerful (think of Korean chaebols and Japanese zaibatsus, but these people have their own armies).","Second, the eunuchs grew too powerful. Eunuchs are palace servants, but the fact that they directly serve the imperial family means they can influence politics and decision-making through their words. It also doesn’t help that some emperors saw the eunuchs as family.","These eunuchs engaged in corruption, taking bribes, placing their family members in important positions, and plotting the deaths of powerful officials who dare to go against them. They were a huge reason the emperor lost the support of quite a few loyal subjects.","Third, there were quite a few disasters and plagues during this time that became the final straw.","—","The leader of the Yellow Turban Rebellion, Zhang Jiao, is a daoist sect leader. He has two younger brothers, Zhang Bao and Zhang Liang. He is known as the General of Heaven, and the three brothers provided care to impoverished patients. They saw how the local government oppressed the peasants through harsh labor and heavy taxes, so they plotted rebellion.","They have a slogan: ‘Heaven is dead. A Yellow Sky will rise in its place.’","The Yellow Turban Army wears yellow headbands, as a symbol of Zhang Jiao’s prophecy that a new era (Yellow Sky) is coming.","1. The nation later founded by Liu Bei. ☜"]},{"number":2983,"title":"Chapter 2983: Chapter 2935: The New Valkyrie","paragraphs":["Zu An whispered the benefits of an oath of fraternity to Yun Jianyue. “Just think about it. If we make an oath of fraternity, we would be master and disciple, lovers, and siblings as well. Isn’t that much more exciting?”","Yun Jianyue’s eyes lit up in excitement. “That makes some sense.”","The notion that her bond with Zu An would be deeper than that of the other women stoked her interest. She grabbed Zu An and Tingxue’s hands. “Let’s go and make an oath of fraternity!”","Tingxue shook off Yun Jianyue’s hand in disdain. “You can do it by yourselves.”","Zu An tried to persuade Tingxue. “Tingxue, we have braved many dangers together. The Myriad Worlds are massive, and it was not easy for us to reunite. What can this be if not fate? Making an oath of fraternity will tie our fates closer together. That will make it easier for us to meet again in the future.”","Tingxue’s eyes wavered, but she glanced at Yun Jianyue and remarked, “I can make an oath of fraternity with you, but not with that woman.”","Yun Jianyue scoffed. “Do you think I want an oath of fraternity with you?”","Zu An thought that these two women were truly sworn enemies. Despite not recalling anything, Tingxue remained hostile to Yun Jianyue. He had no choice but to mediate between them. “Tingxue, you two were sisters. Even though you were enemies at one point, you resolved your differences and became friends.”","Tingxue tilted her head in skepticism. “Are you sure about that?”","“Do you remember me telling you some time back that you greatly resemble a friend of mine?” Zu An asked. “I’ll ask you a few questions now. I hope you can answer them honestly.”","“Go ahead.” Tingxue knew that she was missing a lot of her memories and wanted to know more about her past.","“Is there a little red mole under your right breast? There should also be one around ten centimeters under your belly button...” Zu An divulged several of Yan Xuehen’s physical traits.","Tingxue was startled. Her cheeks reddened, and she stared at Zu An with conflicted eyes.","She didn’t answer Zu An’s question, but her horrified expression said everything. Zu An said, “That’s why I am certain you two are the same person. Otherwise, there’s no way for the two of you to share the same physical traits.”","He had learned from the universal deities that only people with divinity retained their appearances across reincarnations. He thought about the situation regarding Chu Chuyan and the Snow Lady back then, and he figured that Yan Xuehen must have gone through something that led to her becoming Tingxue.","Tngxue fell silent. “After meeting you, I’d occasionally dream. I’d see fragmented scenes in those dreams, but I can never remember any of their contents.”","“It’s fine. I don’t know what you went through, but I’ll help you regain your memories,” Zu An gently consoled her.","Yun Jianyue was taken aback. “She really is the ice statue? What happened to her? How did she become so doltish?”","Tingxue snorted, “I might not remember the past, but I can still feel my loathing for you.”","“Beat me up then.” Yun Jianyue felt particularly refreshed today. Not only did she get to reunite with Ah Zu, but her old rival had also lost her memories.","Tingxue reached for her sword, but Zu An hurriedly stopped her and asked, “Do you know why I came to this world?”","His question caught the two women’s attention. Zu An proceeded to tell them about his mission to find the first-generation universal deities’ soul fragments.","Tingxue remained composed as usual, but Yun Jianyue’s expression flickered a few times before she slowly said, “I might possess the soul fragment of a first-generation universal deity.”","Zu An was stunned. He had suspected that Tingxue was the soul fragment of a first-generation universal deity, but he hadn’t expected that to be the case for Yun Jianyue as well.","Yun Jianyue explained, “I didn’t feel inclined to join any of the Divine Palaces when they first descended upon the Cultivation World. There was a weird feeling of rejection. Later, I was guided into special dungeons to train by an inexplicable force. I traveled to many bizarre worlds, and my cultivation grew by leaps and bounds. However, I gained a lot of bizarre and random memories in the process. I was worried that they were inner demons, but after hearing your words, I suspect that they might be the memories of a first-generation universal deity.”","Overjoyed to hear that, Zu An pulled her into his embrace. He'd thought that it would be an arduous journey to find the universal deities’ soul fragments, so he was surprised to find one so quickly.","If that’s the case for Yun Jianyue, perhaps it’s the same for the others who didn’t enter the Divine Palaces but still disappeared.","“Do you know which universal deity you are?” Zu An asked.","Yun Jianyue shook her head. “I don’t know. I only remember the boundless darkness in my dreams. I tried taking out the ancient lamp, but the darkness refused to budge.”","Zu An was taken aback. “Could it be the Deity of Darkness?”","He told them about the properties of the first-generation universal deities—metal, wood, water, fire, earth, ice, wind, lightning, light, and darkness.","“My artifact is of the light attribute. I didn’t expect I’d belong to darkness,” Yun Jianyue mumbled. She turned to Tingxue and added, “I’ll bet everything that this ice statue is the Deity of Ice.”","Tingxue placidly replied, “You might have misunderstood. I am a Nebula envoy; I can’t be a first-generation universal deity’s soul fragment as you have claimed.”","Yun Jianyue was confused as well. Yan Xuehen had been able to enter the Nebula Divine Palace, and that should have meant she had no relation to the first-generation universal deities.","Hmph. No wonder I find her an eyesore. Turns out we were really enemies all along.","“We have too little clues. Let’s gather more souls to figure out what’s going on first,” Zu An said.","“How do we gather more souls?” Yun Jianyue asked.","“I don’t know. The universal deities said that I’d know once I encounter them.” Zu An was confused, too. Nothing was happening even though he had already bumped into Yun Jianyue.","Yun Jianyue snorted, “Those fellows are unreliable. No wonder we were enemies back then.”","Zu An chuckled. She has gotten into her role. “This is a dangerous world. We’re bound to encounter trouble while gathering the soul fragments of the first-generation universal deities. There’s a chance we might even lose our lives here. If we don’t make an oath of fraternity right now, we might not have a chance to do so anymore.”","He turned to Tingxue. She pursed her lips and finally relented. “Alright.”","Zu An was overjoyed. He pulled the two women into the peach garden to make an oath of fraternity. They had no qualms with him being the big brother, but they had a fallout over who was the second brother. Neither side wanted to be beneath the other.","Left with no choice, Zu An told them to throw lots and leave it to fate.","Tingxue won. A smile finally emerged on her cold face.","Yun Jianyue was vexed. After making the oath of fraternity, she trudged her way back to her room and shut herself in.","Zu An went over to console her. The moment he walked in, a warm body rushed forward to embrace him.","“You weren’t angry?”","“How else can I fool that ice statue?” Yun Jianyue replied with a flirtatious smile. “I prefer to have secret trysts.”","Yun Jianyue was a master of seduction, and the two of them had been separated for too long. There was no way Zu An would be able to hold back. The two lovers intertwined together as if to knead themselves into each other’s embrace.","...","Some time later, Zu An sensed a notification from the Keyboard System.","“A new valkyrie has been detected. Do you want to collect her?”","—","Translator’s Note:","The Eastern Han is made up of multiple provinces. In each province, there are multiple commanderies. In each commandery, there are multiple counties.","So, Eastern Han > Provinces > Commanderies > Counties.","Most provinces/ commanderies’ counties have their own armies, so that they can deal with threats promptly instead of having to report upward, which is clearly unfeasible in an era where transportation and communication are severely limited. (basically, the feudal system).","Under this system of feudalism, the warlords became so powerful that the Eastern Han broke into the Three Kingdoms—Shu Han (Liu Bei), Cao Wei (Cao Cao), and Sun Wu (Sun Quan), with all three seeking to conquer the other two and ‘make China whole again’.","—","Hopefully, these little tips are useful in comprehending the story!","I don’t think I’ll go through every major character, like Liu Bei, Cao Cao, Yuan Shao etc., because that will take forever, so I’ll just sprinkle bits and pieces of background information that may be useful in understanding what is happening in this era."]},{"number":2984,"title":"Chapter 2984: Chapter 2936: A Unique Collection Method","paragraphs":["Zu An was surprised. There had been no news from his Valkyrie System after he collected Daji and Mo Xi. He had thought that it was useless, but much to his surprise, it suddenly popped up at this point.","What in the world is a valkyrie? he thought as he instinctively tapped ‘Yes’.","There was a flash of light, and Yun Jianyue disappeared from his embrace. In exchange, a card named ‘Deity of Darkness’ Fragment’ appeared in his Valkyrie System. It was evident from the outline that it was Yun Jianyue.","Zu An was horrified. He quickly summoned Yun Jianyue, and the latter reappeared on the bed.","Yun Jianyue was stunned as well. “What did you do to me? I felt a mysterious power binding me, then I was transported into an incomprehensible space. I couldn’t move my body at all.”","Zu An quickly explained the situation to her despite his shock. It didn’t take long for Yun Jianyue to grasp what had happened, as she had known about Daji and Mo Xi beforehand. “I've turned into your slave?”","“Of course not! It’s just a soul bond.” Zu An could sense a mysterious power connecting him with Yun Jianyue, enhancing their intimacy.","Yun Jianyue dove into his arms and said, “I’m willing to be your slave.”","She’s truly a vixen, Zu An thought.","Those who knew Yun Jianyue would be shocked to witness this scene. She had always projected herself as an awe-inspiring sect leader, a powerful queen who could hold her ground. No one would have thought that she could be so coy and adorable in private.","I’m curious to know how Honglei will react if she sees her master acting like that.","“You’re smiling sinisterly. You must be up to no good.” Yun Jianyue pinched Zu An as she looked at him with a dangerous gaze.","Zu An laughed off the remark before changing the topic. “How weird. We hugged earlier when we first met as well, but there wasn’t the option to collect you as a valkyrie. What’s going on?”","“Your Valkyrie System seems to be designed to collect the souls of universal deities.” Yun Jianyue also pondered about what the trigger condition could be...","Then they exchanged frowns. It wasn't too hard to deduce the trigger condition, considering that they had only done one thing after entering the room.","“I was in a daze earlier...” Yun Jianyue’s face reddened. Even someone like her felt embarrassed about this situation.","Zu An thought about how her pupils had rolled up earlier.","Do I have to put the soul fragments of the first-generation universal deities in that condition in order to collect them? No wonder those fellows refused to say it out loud and tried to play it off by saying that I’d understand when the time comes.","Yun Jianyue gritted her teeth in frustration. She leaned forward and bit Zu An. “Those universal deities must really like you to entrust such a mission to you.”","Zu An replied with a bitter smile, “It’s not like I’m enjoying this situation. It would be much easier if I only had to win their goodwill or earn their loyalty. This only heightens the mission difficulty.”","Those who possessed a fragment of the universal deities’ souls in this world were no ordinary people. They were all women who stood at the peak of this world. Even Cao Cao, despite having conquered half of the world, was unable to lay his hands on many women. In the first place, it was already difficult for Zu An, as Liu Bei, to reach the same heights as Cao Cao, let alone collect all those soul fragments.","Yun Jianyue snorted, “You’re complaining despite getting the longer end of the stick.”","While the two of them were fooling around, a servant outside suddenly reported, “Boss, soldiers have encircled our residence.”","Yun Jianyue was infuriated. “Which ant dares to disturb this young miss?!”","She was about to march out when she realized that she was still undressed. Her face reddened.","Zu An grabbed her robe and helped her get dressed. “Let’s go out together. The soldiers in this world aren’t as easy to deal with.”","He remembered how a formation in this minor county town had halved the destruction caused by Yun Jianyue and Tingxue’s clash. This made him warier than ever.","Tingxue walked out from the neighboring room and eyed the two of them. She might have lost her memories, but that didn’t mean that she had lost her wits. She still remembered the scene of Firework fooling around with Zu An.","The current Yun Jianyue had lost her sharp edge. Her face was flushed, and her eyes were reddened. It wasn't hard to guess what had happened between her and Zu An earlier.","You have successfully trolled Tingxue for +119... +119... +119...","Zu An was delighted to receive that notification. It was better for Tingxue to display some emotions than to remain impassive, lest she be assimilated into the nebula.","The three of them made their way to the entrance, where a platoon of soldiers stood. These soldiers were far stronger than any others Zu An had seen in the past, though he wasn’t surprised, since even the farmers in this world were cultivators.","He noticed a faint aura emanating from the soldiers. Yun Jianyue had previously told him that the soldiers of this world emitted a unique intimidation aura that could suppress a cultivator’s ki. The greater the number and strength of the soldiers, the more potent the intimidation aura. In other words, individuals stood no chance against an army in this world. Only an army could fight against an army.","Zu An quickly analyzed the situation. There were around a thousand soldiers outside, but the intimidation aura wasn't particularly strong. If a fight broke out, the three of them would probably be able to charge out of the encirclement and escape. This army was unlikely to be an elite one.","An armored commander stepped out from the group and bowed to the trio. “Were you the ones who fought in town earlier?”","As he took a closer look at the trio, his eyes widened in surprise. Those three were clearly no ordinary people. The man emanated an extraordinary air, and the two women were ravishing beauties. When had such people appeared in Zhuo County?","Yun Jianyue was in a good mood, having just reunited with her lover and sharing an intimate moment with him. She replied with a smile, “I was just playing with a friend. I’ll compensate for any damages I caused.”","The commander thought that a member of the Yellow Turban Army had snuck into the Zhuo County to cause trouble, and he had heard rumors that the Zhang clan was powerful, which was why he brought a huge army with him.","But after hearing Yun Jianyue’s reply, he changed his mind and clasped his fist. “I am Commander Zou Jing from You Province. The Yellow Turban Army has been causing trouble all around the world, so the governor has tasked me to recruit volunteer soldiers. I see that the three of you are outstanding experts. Are you willing to serve the country?”","Tingxue had no interest in that. However, Yun Jianyue wondered if she could make use of this opportunity to recruit more people. She could start off as a sect leader, then rise to the position of emperor and usher in an era of unprecedented prosperity. She would then confer Ah Zu as her emperor...","But Ah Zu replied before any of them could react, “We’re flattered by your high opinion of us, Commander Zou. We are more than willing to serve the imperial court!”","Yun Jianyue and Tingxue were speechless."]},{"number":2985,"title":"Chapter 2985: Chapter 2937: Army and Commanding Talent","paragraphs":["Zou Jing was overjoyed. “Wonderful! With three experts of your caliber joining our ranks, we’ll surely be able to guard You Province!”","The standing of women in this world was much higher than in history. This was a world where strength reigned supreme, after all. As long as a woman was strong enough, she could become a general as well.","Zou Jing continued chatting with the trio. His smile further widened when he learned that Zu An and the others were planning to help recruit more people into the volunteer army. He handed an invitation letter[1] to Zu An before taking his leave.","“Ah Zu, are you really planning to become that fellow’s subordinate? Shouldn’t we claim a spot for ourselves in this era of chaos and become our own kings?” Yun Jianyue asked.","Zu An knew that she was reluctant to give up on her ambitions of becoming the boss of the underworld, so he spoke with a smile, “It might be an era of chaos, but the imperial court here wields formidable rallying power. It’ll be easier for us to grow if we borrow the imperial court’s reputation.”","Tingxue was confused. “Based on the history you have shared with us, even though Liu Bei joined Zou Jing’s army and contributed to the quelling of the Yellow Turban Army, his starting point was still much lower than the other warlords. Aren’t we just allowing history to repeat itself here?”","“While it's unwise to completely follow Liu Bei’s footsteps, we're still too weak right now. The best way for us to bulk up is to join the imperial court,” Zu An explained.","Yun Jianyue smiled. “Alright. I’ve been wanting to make it big. You don’t know how stifled I've been, being confined in this small county.”","She ordered her subordinates to gather. All in all, she had around five hundred people.","Zu An was flabbergasted. She’s the kind to make it big no matter which world she goes to.","What further surprised him were Yun Jianyue’s and Tingxue’s weapons. Yun Jianyue pulled out a serpent spear—she had obtained it from another world. Tingxue pulled out a metal stick and connected it to her sword. She called it the Frost Fair Blade, which was also otherwise known as the Green Dragon Crescent Blade[2].","Zu An pulled out the Tai’e Sword and the Skillbreaker Sword he'd forged from the Lord of Slaughter’s fang. Are these my twin swords....","For the next few days, the three of them trained and equipped the five hundred people before heading northeast to Guangyang Commandery’s Ji County to report. You Province’s governor resided in Ji County. The governor wasn't Liu Yan, as was the case in the Romance of the Three Kingdoms, but Guo Xun, as recorded in official annals.","While they were on the road, Yun Jianyue shared more information about this world with Zu An. “On top of the intimidation aura that suppresses individual cultivators, some of the elite armies in this world possess unique abilities. There are also commanders with special commanding traits that can raise an army’s attributes.”","Zu An was intrigued. “Why does our army not have any of that?”","“Our army is too small, and our soldiers haven’t been tempered on the battlefield yet. They might have undergone our strict training, but until they have survived the battlefield, they will remain as the weakest recruits,” Yun Jianyue explained. “As for commanding traits, I’m also not sure what the situation is with that.”","“We can ask Zou Jing about that. He’s a senior commander of You Province. He should know more about such stuff,” Zu An said.","Just then, they noticed several soldiers in the distance, running in their direction. Zu An stopped them and asked about the situation.","From the soldiers, they learned that Guangyang Commandery had fallen to the Yellow Turban Army’s Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan. They had killed You Province’s governor, Guo Xun, and Guangyang Commandery’s marshall, Liu Wei, so there was no one to lead the troops anymore. The soldiers emphasized how fearsome the Yellow Turban Army was and advised them to quickly flee as well.","Yun Jianyue’s expression turned cold. With a sweep of her spear, she beheaded the loudest soldier. “Spy of the Yellow Turbans, how dare you spread rumors to undermine our army’s morale? Die!”","Zu An also knew that fear was contagious. If they allowed those soldiers to continue speaking, their army of five hundred would quickly lose their fighting spirit. He played along and added, “The Yellow Turban Army must be feeling conceited after conquering Ji County. This is the perfect opportunity to spring a surprise attack on them and catch them off guard!”","Yun Jianyue and Tingxue concurred with his judgment, so their army began marching toward Ji County.","Unsurprisingly, it was a complete mess there by the time they arrived. As the administrative hub of You Province, Ji County was prosperous. The Yellow Turban Army, which consisted of peasants from poorer backgrounds, had frenziedly ransacked the city and plundered from the magistrate and the populace.","Zu An dispatched a platoon to the city walls to plant their flags and cause as much of a ruckus as possible, so as to mislead the Yellow Turban Army into overestimating their strength. In the meantime, he would charge into the city with the remaining soldiers.","In contrast, the Yellow Turban Army was scattered around the city to plunder. Zu An’s onslaught caught them off guard. They had no time to figure out what was going on before fleeing in all directions. That allowed Zu An to suppress them despite having a smaller army. He easily crushed the Yellow Turbans that appeared in his path, leaving them no chance to gather its troops to muster a counterattack.","The superior fighting prowess of Zu An and the others shone. They charged at the forefront of the army, unleashing powerful skills that boosted their soldiers’ morale. Zu An keenly sensed that their army was gradually undergoing a metamorphosis. A mysterious power seemed to be gathering around them. It was likely the intimidation aura that Yun Jianyue had mentioned. In the process, they slaughtered their way to the city center.","Just then, a loud roar echoed. The soldiers of the Yellow Turban Army hurriedly got into a military formation. Their commanders, Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan, had finally gotten a grip of themselves and rallied their elites together to fight back.","Zu An pulled out his Rune Weapon Chart. Countless golden ripples appeared in the sky, unleashing a bombardment of sword ki against the enemies. The Rune Weapon Chart was the perfect skill for such area bombardment. He wanted to deal as much damage to the enemy as possible before they were fully prepared.","Blood splattered. Many soldiers of the Yellow Turban Army lost their arms and legs. Some even had their abdomens sliced open.","Cheng Zhiyuan and Deng Mao roared, “Water Talisman Harmony!”","The silhouette of a yellow talisman appeared above the Yellow Turban Army. The injured soldiers began recovering at a visible pace. It didn’t take long for them to return to full health.","Zu An, Yun Jianyue, and Tingxue exchanged looks. That seems to be a group heal ability. Is this their commander’s commanding trait? That explains how the Yellow Turban Army conquered so many provinces and counties so quickly. How can one defeat an army that can heal whenever they need to?","The Yellow Turban Army’s morale surged. They chanted, “Heaven is dead! It’s time for the Yellow Sun to rise! Heaven is dead! It’s time for the Yellow Sun to rise!”[3]","A malevolent black aura seeped from their heads and swiftly enveloped the battlefield. The golden ripples in the sky gradually disappeared as Zu An sensed his abilities being suppressed. Instead of bombarding the entire enemy army, he could now only deploy his Rune Weapon Chart within a radius of thirty meters. At the same time, the Yellow Turban Army’s chants struck fear into the hearts of allied soldiers. Their five hundred soldiers revealed frightened looks, and their bodies trembled uncontrollably.","Zu An was astounded. Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan were just extras in the Three Kingdoms, and the Yellow Turban Army wasn't an elite army. On top of that, the Yellow Turban Army in Ji County was still in disarray, with most having yet to gather. Yet they still turned out to be a formidable force. The disparity between an individual and an army was larger than Zu An had expected.","1. It’s a formality to invite a person into one’s residence. ☜","2. This is Guan Yu’s weapon in history. ☜","3. Heaven refers to the Han dynasty’s Liu Imperial Family, whereas the Yellow Sun refers to the Yellow Turban Army. ☜"]},{"number":2986,"title":"Chapter 2986: Chapter 2938: Encircled by the Yellow Turbans","paragraphs":["It went without saying that Zu An wouldn’t watch idly as his allied troops panicked. He roared, “What you lookin’ at?!”","“I’m looking at you, shithead!” Deng Mao, Cheng Zhiyuan, and some of the enemy soldiers replied, but they were only limited to the frontmost row of soldiers. That said, the black aura visibly dimmed when those people stopped channeling the curse.","Zu An made use of this chance to pull out the Fallen Soul Banner and wave it around. Had it been any other world, the prowess of the Fallen Soul Banner could have obliterated the enemy camp. However, the enemy’s intimidation aura and Water Talisman Harmony neutralized some of its potency. Only a small handful of enemy soldiers crumbled to the ground.","But Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan were still alarmed. The enemy had already shaken their morale several times before they could rally their army together. At this rate, their troops could lose their fighting spirit.","Still, ever since they began this campaign, they had enjoyed a string of successes, killing official soldiers from different places. They wouldn’t fear a measly army of five hundred, especially one led by a moocher and two beauties. Both of them thought, I bet it’s just a young heir bringing his concubines and his servants here as reinforcements. Their confidence is founded in their artifacts.","Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan exchanged looks. Then, they roared in unison and charged forth. They figured that an heir would be unfamiliar with the savagery of the battlefield. With their valiance, they could catch the noble off guard and defeat him in a single swoop.","Their coordination was impeccable. One charged at Yun Jianyue, whereas the other went for Tingxue. Once they took down those two women, the moocher would be forced to surrender. These two women are far more beautiful than the ones we have seen in previous cities. It’ll be perfect if we can capture them and turn them into our wives.","They had already chosen their targets. Deng Mao charged at the seductive Yun Jianyue, whereas Cheng Zhiyuan preferred the cold and ethereal Tingxue.","Yun Jianyue chuckled. “You want to play with big sis?”","Her serpent spear suddenly shot forth, transforming into crescent glaives that pierced Deng Mao’s heart. If Deng Mao had remained in the army formation, they wouldn’t have been able to kill him so easily. It was truly a suicidal move for him to break out of the military formation and charge at her.","Yun Jianyue sighed. “But you aren’t sturdy enough for me to play with.”","Deng Mao gurgled from the blood gushing up his mouth. He wanted to activate the Water Talisman Harmony to heal his wounds, but the crescent glaives that pierced his heart were imbued with mysterious energy that ravaged his body. His regeneration wasn’t working at all. He could only watch helplessly with widened eyes as his life force trickled away.","Cheng Zhiyuan sweated profusely. He knew how strong Deng Mao was, and he couldn’t believe that the latter had been defeated in a single strike. He quickly turned tail to return into the safety of his army formation, but it was too late. Tingxue swung her sword, and Cheng Zhiyuan felt his body suddenly becoming lighter. When he lowered his head, he realized that the lower half of his body had vanished. He screamed in agony as his body returned to the earth.","This completely crushed the Yellow Turban Army’s morale. They disbanded on the spot and fled in all directions. Yun Jianyue’s eyes gleamed in excitement as she charged in with her subordinates to massacre the fleeing enemy troops.","Zu An thought, No wonder she’s the leader of a demonic sect. She’s indeed suited for war and bloodshed.","At some point, Zou Jing arrived with reinforcements. Both sides joined forces and successfully reclaimed Ji County.","Zou Jing intended to execute everyone from the Yellow Turban Army, but Zu An stopped him. He took in those who were willing to surrender and hadn’t committed any heinous crimes thus far. Zou Jing frowned in confusion. The imperial court had ordered the suppression of the rebels. Zu An’s action of taking in the rebels could be considered protecting them, and it could potentially bring trouble upon himself.","There was no way Zu An could explain to Zou Jing that the era of chaos had already begun, and he needed to amass as many troops as he could to compete with other factions. The earlier battle had taught him the importance of having a strong army in this world. Rations were usually the biggest problem when raising a huge army, but the Yellow Turban Army had just plundered the provincial granary. Those could be used as military rations now.","Zou Jing was dissatisfied, but following the deaths of its governor and marshal, You Province was in disorder. Considering that Zu An, Yun Jianyue, and Tingxue had performed spectacularly in the earlier battle, and their strength was needed to deal with the Yellow Turban Army, he decided to tolerate it.","Next, Zu An interrogated the surrendered soldiers. He was curious about the black aura they had unleashed upon the battlefield—that wasn't intimidation aura. After all, the soldiers of the Yellow Turban Army were from poor backgrounds and hadn’t undergone proper military training.","It turned out that Great Teacher Zhang Jiao had come up with a method to gather the populace’s resentment. While the people lacked the intimidation aura, years of oppression by those in power had led to a huge accumulation of resentment. By gathering all this resentment, they could produce an effect similar to the intimidation aura. As for the Water Talisman Harmony, they had to first drink water mixed with the ashes of a talisman paper before marching into the battlefield. The greater their faith in the Taiping Dao and the Great Teacher, the faster their regenerativve ability. It was similar to the power of faith.","Zu An was awed by the Yellow Turban Army’s leader, Zhang Jiao. Not only had he created a method to replace intimidation aura, he'd even created all sorts of incredible army buffs.","Yun Jianyue murmured worriedly, “Zhang Jiao is more powerful than expected. It’s unlikely he will die from illness as he did in history. The suppression of the Yellow Turban Army might not go smoothly. They might even be able to topple the imperial court.”","But Zu An smiled. “That’s not necessarily a bad thing. In history, the Yellow Turban Rebellion was suppressed within a year. There was no chance for someone of humble birth like Liu Bei to shine and rise through the ranks. The stronger the Yellow Turban Army, the more they can curb powerhouses like Dong Zhuo, Cao Cao, Yuan Shao, and Yuan Shu, who were strong from the start.”","Yun Jianyue nodded. “What should we do next? Should we look for the prodigious Sir Zhuge?”","The three of them had agreed that the easiest way for them to collect the universal deities’ soul fragments was to conquer the world. Yun Jianyue had been brimming with confidence, but this battle made her realize that they were still too weak.","“Zhuge Liang is still a child now. He won’t be useful even if we find him now.” Zu An shook his head. He couldn’t use the ‘Longzhong Plan’ that Zhuge Liang had proposed to Liu Bei in history to fight this war, either. That would be a huge waste of Liu Bei’s earlier life.","Tingxue suddenly interjected, “This is not the same world as you know in history. The timeline might be different. It’s possible that Zhuge Liang is already an adult.”","Zu An was taken aback. He thought about the previous dungeons he had been to. “Yes, we can’t exclude that possibility. However, You Province and Yi Province are currently occupied by the Yellow Turban Army. We can’t get to Xu Province to find him.”","The Yellow Turban Rebellion had swept across the world, but the momentum was the strongest in the north. Zhang Jiao and the Yellow Turban Army’s main force were stationed at Julu, in the center of Yi Province. Zhang Liang’s army was stationed at the Bohai Commandery, east of Yi Province. Zhang Bao’s army was stationed at Anping Commandery and Hejian Commandery, north of Yi Province. This army happened to neighbor Zhuo County.","Once news about Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan’s defeat spread, Zhang Bao would surely march over to exact vengeance for them. With the few troops they had, it was unlikely that Zu An and the others could fend against him."]},{"number":2987,"title":"Chapter 2987: Chapter 2939: Ambitions","paragraphs":["For the next few days, Zu An and the others trained the troops, repaired the tattered city walls, and maintained watch to guard against the Yellow Turban Army’s vengeance. However, Zu An also discovered that taking in the surrendered soldiers was easier said than done.","First, the surrendered soldiers resembled bandits more than soldiers. They had many bad habits. It was one thing for them to squabble and cause trouble, but what was worse was their inclination to plunder from the local populace and take advantage of young ladies. Zu An was enraged by their behavior. He ordered for those who engaged in such despicable behaviors to be harshly punished.","Second, the surrendered soldiers didn’t harbor great loyalty for Zu An. If a chance arose, they wouldn’t hesitate to stab him in the back.","Other than those issues, rations were still a problem.","Zu An had picked out three thousand elites from the Yellow Turban Army to join his force, while freeing the others. However, the Yellow Turban Army brought their families along wherever they went. In other words, he had to take care of not just three thousand soldiers but their families as well. An astronomical amount of rations was being expended each day. They were still able to feed everyone thanks to the provincial granary, but this wasn't a long-term plan.","Zu An finally understood why others often said that theory was only as thick as paper.","In history, Cao Cao had accepted a million of the Qing Province’s Yellow Turban Army soldiers, bulking up his force while saving him a lot of money. In contrast, the other marquises massacred the Yellow Turban Army, not showing any mercy. He had thought that the other marquises were foolish to have not taken in the Yellow Turban Army’s soldiers, but it turned out that this option caused difficulties as well.","The problem regarding the rations could be solved later, though. What was more urgent was the crisis right before their eyes.The Yellow Turban Army’s General Gao Sheng had learned about Deng Mao and Cheng Zhiyuan’s fate, and he planned to attack Ji County with his army of fifty thousand. Furthermore, Zhang Bao’s army was on standby, ready to be mobilized if needed.","In comparison, the combined forces of Zu An and Zou Jing didn’t even number ten thousand. While their soldiers were more well-trained than an average Yellow Turban Army soldier, the huge numerical disparity still made this an impossible war to win. They needed to find reinforcements.","In fact, Zu An had already sent someone to Liaodong Commandery to request reinforcement from Gongsun Zan. Gongsun Zan was Liu Bei’s old classmate and Liaodong’s Chief Clerk. As he had to fend against the northern barbarians, he had a division of elite mounted troops. If Zu An could secure his help, their chances of victory would be higher. But Liaodong was located at the easternmost border of Eastern Han, several counties away from Ji County. As the saying went, a distant lake wouldn’t help in extinguishing a fire.","Zu An and Zou Jing discussed the matter, and they decided to part ways and request reinforcement from the nearby provinces and commanderies. Zou Jing would head to Gu Commandery, which he had some ties with, whereas Zu An would make his way to the neighboring Zhongshan Commandery in the west.","Zhongshan Commandery’s marshal, Zhang Chun, had an imposing reputation, and he had a powerful army. In terms of military prowess, he was on par with Liaodong Commandery’s Gongsun Zan. Only Zhongshan Commandery remained relatively unaffected by the Yellow Turban Rebellion.","Zu An planned to travel to Zhongshan Commandery alone, but Yun Jianyue advised him to bring Tingxue with him. He was about to refute that suggestion when Yun Jianyue whispered into his ear, and he ultimately decided to go along with it.","Tingxue was unbothered. She would rather travel with Zu An than deal with miscellaneous matters here. Shortly after leaving Ji County, she asked, “What did she tell you before we left?”","“Nothing much. She just told me to take care of you,” Zu An replied.","Yun Jianyue had advised him that since he had to collect the universal deities’ soul fragments, he needed to grasp every chance he had to bump up his favorability with Tingxue. She could tell that they had an ambiguous relationship that was above friendship, but beneath being lovers. He had to work a bit harder to push through the final hurdle.","She assured him that Ji County was in good hands. She had managed far more people than this back when she was the demonic sect’s leader. There had been an excited gleam in her eyes, as if she was dragging a virtuous lady into the pits of depravity.","Zu An was convinced by her words, though there was no way he could share them with Tingxue. Tingxue stared at him, unconvinced by his excuse, though she didn’t probe any further.","So, the two of them continued traveling in silence. Some time later, Tingxue suddenly asked, “Tell me more about that Yan Xuehen.”","Zu An was delighted to hear that. Her interest in this matter was a good start. So, he shared with her how he met Yan Xuehen and how they eventually fell in love.","Tingxue listened intently without interrupting him. A long time later, she finally asked, “What’s the situation between her and Yun Jianyue? Why are they always fighting with each other?”","“That’s a long story...” Zu An smiled. She might have lost most of her memories, but her disharmony with Yun Jianyue has already become second nature to her.","The two of them continued chatting while avoiding the Yellow Turban Army. Given their cultivation, as long as they avoided the Yellow Turbans’ encirclement, they would be safe even if they bumped into small groups along the way.","The devastation they witnessed along the way left Zu An with a heavy heart. While the Yellow Turban Army was a revolution of farmers and peasants, the ones who were suffering due to war across the provinces and commanderies were also the common populace. Not to mention that Eastern Han hadn’t completely declined yet. The Yellow Turban Army was destined to end in failure.","There were noticeably fewer people from the Yellow Turban Army around by the time they reached Zhongshan Commandery. The local populace they encountered along the way were thriving. Even Tingxue was awed by the capability of Zhongshan’s marshal.","It didn’t take long for soldiers to notice them. They stated their intent and were escorted to Zhongshan Commandery’s administrative capital, Lunu County. They were brought to Marshal Zhang Chun’s residence to seek an audience, but his servants informed them that the marshal was currently out, and they would have to wait several days for the marshal to return.","So, Zu An and Tingxue settled down in the city. While waiting for Zhang Chun’s return, they spent their time scouting for intelligence. They noticed that there were many Wuhuan people in Lunu County. The Wuhuans were an ethnic group in the empire’s north. Their relationship with the Eastern Han was fickle. Sometimes both sides invaded each other, but other times, they would mend ties and become friendly.","Zu An and Tingxue deduced that Zhang Chun must have borrowed the Wuhuans’ cavalry prowess to protect Zhongshan Commandery. This inspired Zu An. There were many ethnic groups north of You Province. They weren’t under the same leadership, and it was common for them to have conflicting interests or even harbor animosity against one another. Zu An could borrow the strength of one group to curb another. If he could maneuver their politics, these groups could just become potent weapons for him to conquer the world. So, he reached out to the Wuhuans, hoping to gather information about the grasslands.","But not long later, a servant approached him and informed him that the marshal had returned. So, Zu An made his way to the marshal’s manor together with Tingxue.","Zhang Chun was sitting in the main seat, leisurely sipping on tea when the duo arrived. His eyes lit up when he saw the beautiful Tingxue, and he quickly stood up to warmly welcome them. “Ah, it’s Lord Liu! Could this be the renowned Miss Guan who slew Cheng Zhiyuan?”","Zu An frowned. He has thoroughly investigated our background. But since he was here to make a request, he politely exchanged pleasantries with Zhang Chun first before revealing his intent.","Zhang Chun looked troubled. “It’s not that I don’t want to reinforce you, but Hejian, Anping, and Changshan have been taken over by the Yellow Turban Army. Zhongshan is facing enemies on three fronts. I have to prioritize the safety of Zhongshan’s populace. However, you don’t have to worry. Why don’t you send a message to Ji County and call your subordinates to head over to Zhongshan? I am at least confident I can protect you all here.”","Zu An’s heart sank. Not only is he refusing to reinforce us, but he also intends to eat us whole.","—","Translator Note:","I’ll be interchanging ethnic group and barbarians .","The exact term used here is 胡人, which is basically used to refer to foreigners. However, foreigners are often viewed with disdain in this era, so the term has a connotation of ‘barbarians’. (Which is not surprising since there were nomadic tribes that often plundered from the people, and wars and invasions were commonplace in that era.)"]},{"number":2988,"title":"Chapter 2988: Chapter 2940: Wuhuan Princess","paragraphs":["“Lord Zhang, we should form a united front against the Yellow Turbans. If Ji County falls, the entirety of Guangyang Commandery and Zhuo Commandery will collapse. By then, Zhongshan Commandery will be surrounded on all fronts. The teeth cannot survive without the lips,” Zu An said.","“I have to disagree with that,” another official in the room spoke up. He was Zhang Ju, Zhang Chun’s clansman. “The Yellow Turbans have proved to be a fearsome adversary. We should be gathering our troops in a single place. We’ll only become easy targets for the Yellow Turban Army if we spread our forces thin. By then, it would be too late for regrets.”","Zu An knew that Zhang Chun was unwilling to dispatch any troops, so he stood up and said, “Since Lord Zhang is reluctant to reinforce us, I’ll be taking my leave now.” He couldn’t waste time here. He needed to seek help from other places before rushing back to help defend Ji County.","“ Haa , youngsters nowadays are too impatient,” Zhang Chun finally spoke up. “I don’t want to leave Ji County in the lurch, but the Yellow Turbans are a threat. We need to devise a strategy for reinforcement. Why don’t you stay here so that we can talk things out? Let’s find a way to ensure Zhongshan Commandery’s safety while circumventing the Yellow Turban Army en route.”","Zu An and Tingxue exchanged looks. Neither of them thought that Zhang Chun was sincere, but since Ji County was in urgent need of reinforcements, they decided to stay behind. They spent the next two days in Zhongshan Commandery. The marshal’s manor held several banquets in the meantime, hosting officials, rich merchants, and talents. Each time Zu An raised the topic of reinforcing Ji County, Zhang Chun would find an excuse to shrug him off.","Meanwhile, Tingxue became the highlight of the marshal’s manor. She was the center of attention in each banquet, and many tried to get close to her, especially Zhang Chun. In the end, Zu An couldn’t take it anymore. During one of the banquets, he got up from his seat and pulled Tingxue out with him. That caused Zhang Chun’s smiling face to darken.","Zhang Ju snorted, “That fellow doesn’t know his place. Why don’t I send someone to...” He pulled a finger across his neck.","Zhang Chun shook his head. “We’re all serving the imperial court. It wouldn’t look good for us if news were to spread. I’ve received news that Zhang Bao and Gao Sheng are leading 150,000 soldiers to Ji County. Soon, they’ll have nowhere else to go.”","Zhang Ju was awed. “You’re brilliant, big brother. It won’t be long before Miss Guan is yours.”","Zhang Chun smiled. “I heard that there’s also a Miss Zhang in Ji County who doesn’t pale in comparison to her. It’s not their beauty that I’m after. If I can bring those two fierce generals over to my side, I’ll be able to fulfill my ambitions.”","“Once Ji County falls, they will have no choice but to come under big brother,” Zhang Ju said.","Zhang Chun laughed heartily.","...","Tingxue was confused why Zu An had dragged her out of the banquet. “Are we leaving now? Why? They are still treating us amicably. Are we giving up on their reinforcements?”","Zu An huffed, “Can’t you tell that they're only interested in you? They have never intended to reinforce us!”","“I can tell.” Tingxue looked at Zu An. “Shouldn’t we use that to convince them to send reinforcements?”","Zu An looked away. “I don’t want you to resort to a honey trap.”","Tingxue was taken aback, then the corners of her lips faintly curled upward.","The two of them continued walking. Tingxue glanced at their connected hands, but Zu An feigned ignorance and continued holding her hand. Tingxue looked troubled, but she didn’t retract her hand. Just like that, the two of them walked out of the city.","“Where should we head next to find reinforcements?” Tingxue asked.","Zu An replied, “We can try the nearby provinces and commanderies. That way, we can make it back in time even if we can’t secure any reinforcements.”","Tingxue proposed, “Why don’t we infiltrate the Yellow Turbans and assassinate their leader?”","Zu An considered the idea. Their individual prowess was severely suppressed on the battlefield, so it could be wiser to utilize their superior strength outside of the battlefield.","Just then, they heard a whistle.","“Waa, that woman looks really beautiful.”","“I have never seen such a woman on the grasslands.”","“Isn’t our little princess beautiful as well?”","“It feels different.”","...","Their clothes and accents revealed that they were from a grassland ethnic group, similar to the Wuhuans Zu An and Tingxue had encountered in the city. These ethnic cavalrymen charged at the pair and tossed their lassos around Zu An’s head and four limbs. Their coordinated movements showed that they did such things often. They could easily defeat their enemy by flooring and dragging the other party around.","They didn’t make a move on Tingxue, however, as they couldn’t bear to hurt the white-robed beauty. They figured that once they subdued the man, the woman would be an easy target.","Zu An’s eyes turned cold. He grabbed all the lassos and tugged them forcefully, causing the cavalrymen to lose their balance and fall off their mounts. The remaining cavalrymen drew their swords and charged at him. There were only thirty of them, but the sheer momentum of their charge was comparable to an army of a thousand in the Cultivation World.","Zu An unleashed a wave of sword ki that was over fifty meters wide with a flick of his finger, decapitating the cavalrymen. It was one thing when he was faced with a huge army, but how could the intimidation aura of thirty cavalrymen possibly suppress him?","“It’s rare to see you killing people so decisively,” Tingxue remarked.","“They harbored malice toward you, and it’s obvious that they engage in such actions often. They deserve it.” Zu An continued holding her hand.","Tingxue’s eyes flickered, but she didn’t say a word.","Shortly after leaving the scene, they felt the earth quaking.","Zu An’s face darkened. “Seems like a cavalry.”","An army of cavalrymen appeared behind them. They were at least a thousand men strong. Judging from their Wuhuan garments, they were likely here to avenge their brethren.","Zu An wasn't intimidated. A thousand cavalrymen could pose some threat to them, but with their strength, it wouldn’t be too difficult for them to slaughter their way out. He even considered using this opportunity to experiment with how different armies affected his fighting prowess.","“Who dares to kill my brethren?” a voice echoed.","The Wuhuan cavalrymen parted to the sides, and a woman riding a red steed emerged. She was masked, but her gender was apparent from her physique. She had a pair of long, eye-catching legs and a beautiful bronze complexion. She wielded a spear that emitted a frosty gleam. On the whole, she exuded an air of valiance.","While Zu An was wondering whether to fight the cavalrymen or apprehend their leader first, the woman suddenly stiffened up before exclaiming in delight, “Brother-in-law?”"]},{"number":2989,"title":"Chapter 2989: Chapter 2941: As Expected of You","paragraphs":["Zu An was taken aback hearing a familiar voice. The woman removed her veil, revealing a young and beautiful face.","“Qinghe!” Zu An was surprised and delighted. He hadn’t expected to bump into Murong Qinghe here. She had gone missing for a long time, since the Divine Palaces descended upon the Cultivation World.","Murong Qinghe was moved, too. She leaped off her steed and ran toward Zu An. It was only at the last moment that she remembered that over a thousand people were looking at her, so she hurriedly stopped with a reddened face. “Brother-in-law, what are you doing here?”","“It’s a long story. What’s your situation?” Zu An eyed the surrounding Wuhuan cavalrymen out of curiosity.","“I am the little princess of the Wuhuans. Do you know the Wuhuans? They are a powerful grassland tribe residing at the borders of the Eastern Han...” Murong Qinghe quickly explained.","Zu An knew the Wuhuans. He quickly introduced his persona in this world to her.","Murong Qinghe’s eyes lit up. “So you’re the Liu Bei who crushed the Yellow Turban Army in Ji County! As expected of brother-in-law!”","“Are you here to capture me?” Zu An asked with a frown.","Murong Qinghe nodded. “I received a report that someone had killed thirty of our tribesmen, so I came here to avenge them. I didn’t expect the culprit to be you.” Her words and gestures exuded the regality of someone in power, as opposed to her previous youthful self.","Zu An filled her in about the earlier situation.","“Don’t worry about it. It’s common for nomads to be killed in the midst of plundering. They are used to it.” Murong Qinghe had long noticed the gorgeous Tingxue. It reminded her of the popular rumors regarding Zu An and Yan Xuehen in the Cultivation World. She had even consoled Chu Youzhao over them. To think that they were really together!","I wonder how big sister Chu will get along with her in the future...","Murong Qinghe evicted those miscellaneous thoughts from her mind. She first ran back to communicate with the Wuhuan cavalrymen before returning to Zu An’s side and explaining, “Don’t worry. I’ve settled things on my side.”","Zu An was surprised. “You seem to be quite respected among the Wuhuans.”","He noticed that none of the Wuhuan cavalrymen had questioned Murong Qinghe’s decision.","“Of course. I am the Khan’s daughter, and...” Murong Qinghe shook her fist with a grin. “...I am quite the fighter.”","Zu An burst into laughter. He noticed that everyone had grown a lot since parting ways, be it in terms of strength or state of mind.","Seeing that the sky was turning dark, Murong Qinghe invited them to the Wuhuan camp. There were still many things that Zu An wanted to ask about, so he accepted the offer. Tingxue noticed that Murong Qinghe was looking at Zu An weirdly, but she still followed Zu An.","Zu An was astonished by the endless stream of tents at the Wuhuan campsite. “You must have brought a lot of people with you.”","“I brought 3000 men in total.” Murong Qinghe puffed up her chest.","“What are you here for?” Zu An noticed that they weren’t here to plunder.","“Zhongshan Commandery’s marshal, Zhang Chun, hired us here to deal with the surrounding Yellow Turban Army,” Murong Qinghe replied.","“Zhang Chun...” Zu An had guessed as much. “Is he that close with the Wuhuans?”","“Our tribesmen trade frequently with him, and he often sends us gifts. Our people has a favorable impression of him. That’s why we took on his request and came here.” Murong Qinghe suddenly frowned. “Hold on. Shouldn’t you be at Ji County? Why are you here?”","Zu An replied bitterly, “Actually, we just came from Zhang Chun’s manor...” He summarized the events that had transpired over the last few days.","Murong Qinghe was infuriated. “That Zhang fellow is shameless! Not only is he unwilling to help, but he even dares to target Sect Master Yan!”","“Actually, she isn’t Sect Master Yan but Tingxue...” Zu An briefly explained Tingxue’s situation.","Murong Qinghe was baffled. She examined Tingxue from head to toe. “Their appearances, physiques, and even dispositions are identical!”","Even Tingxue couldn’t help but say, “I have heard so many people say those words that even I wonder if I’m really the Miss Yan you speak of.”","“You definitely are. Big sister Chu had a similar experience. She lost all her memories at one point, but she eventually regained them,” Murong Qinghe consoled her.","“Let’s hope so,” Tingxue replied wistfully. She felt like something was missing in her heart.","Murong Qinghe then turned to Zu An and said, “Don’t worry, brother-in-law. If Zhang Chun doesn’t help you, I will! I’ll take my subordinates to Ji County right away!”","Zu An was both delighted and worried. “Won’t Zhang Chun protest about that? That might put you in a difficult position in your tribe.”","“He'll have to suck it up. I’m still going to honor our promise to reinforce Zhongshan Commandery, it's just that I’m taking a detour. You don’t have to worry about my standing among the Wuhuans. I have made a place for myself there,” Murong Qinghe said gleefully. “That said, I can't take my tribesmen to fight the Yellow Turban Army head-on. I can only harass their flanks and break their supply routes. Otherwise, my people might revolt against me.”","Zu An was overjoyed. “That would be wonderful. Thank you, Qinghe.”","“We’re one family...” Murong Qinghe suddenly recalled something halfway through her words, and her face reddened.","Zu An thought about the night they had shared, and it stirred something in his heart as well. Meanwhile, Tingxue eyed the two of them with questioning eyes.","Feeling awkward, Murong Qinghe led the two of them into the camp to join in the festivities around the campfire. Grassland tribes entertained themselves with songs and dances. Several tribesmen were mesmerized by Tingxue and wanted to invite her for a dance, only to be coldly turned down.","Murong Qinghe berated her people. “She’s already attached. Stop bothering her.”","The crowd looked at Zu An and sighed.","Tingxue’s face reddened. Unaccustomed to the vibrant atmosphere, she excused herself and retired to a tent.","The atmosphere was so lively that Murong Qinghe decided to drag Zu An forward to dance. Step by step, she taught him the Wuhuans’ wild and passionate dance. Their movements were quite the sight to behold, inviting resounding cheers from the crowd.","Some physical contact was inevitable while dancing, but the two of them had prior intimate contact, so they behaved much more naturally than normal friends. Slowly, the atmosphere heated up.","Murong Qinghe slowly grew bolder. She leaned toward Zu An and whispered the question that had been bugging her for a long time, “Are the rumors between you and Sect Master Yan true?”","Zu An honestly replied, “It somehow happened that way...”","“Does big sister Chu know?”","“She knows. She was the one who told me to court Sect Master Yan.”","Murong Qinghe’s lower jaw dropped. She was utterly shocked. She would never have imagined that cold master-disciple pair to be so close as to accept such an unconventional arrangement. “As expected of you.”","Zu An wrapped his arm around her waist. “Lil’ Qinghe, are you making fun of me now?”","Their bodies were pressed against each other. This familiar feeling of intimacy drove Murong Qinghe into a fluster. “Brother-in-law!”"]},{"number":2990,"title":"Chapter 2990: Chapter 2942: Deity of Lightning","paragraphs":["Murong Qinghe's voice quivered faintly, but it pulled at Zu An’s heartstrings stronger than the surrounding ruckus. Embarrassed to behave in such a manner before her underlings, she excused herself and Zu An, claiming that they had important matters to discuss.","Then, the two of them made their way to her tent. As soon as the curtains were lowered, they tightly embraced each other and shared a passionate kiss, as if this was the only way to relay the feelings that had been simmering in them. There was no need for words. They obeyed their instincts like primal beasts.","It wasn't until Murong Qinghe felt a tinge of coldness on her exposed skin that she regained some rationality. She gently pushed Zu An’s chest back and shyly said, “Brother-in-law, I don’t think it’s appropriate for us to do this.”","Zu An laughed. You’re only thinking about that now? He said, “I promised Youzhao I'd take care of you.”","“Is this the proper way to take care of someone?” Murong Qinghe replied grudgingly.","The person she loved was her big brother Chu, but fate had denied her the happiness she sought. The latter turned out to be a woman. She knew that Chu Youzhao had no other option because of her family, so despite being infuriated at her deception, she still didn’t want to sully her big brother Chu’s reputation. She resigned herself to fate, thinking that she could live like that as long as they remained close.","Little had she expected the Chu clan to go through with the deception and send another man into the consummation room to replace big brother Chu. She suffered a mental breakdown when she first learned about the truth. But when she discovered that the man was Zu An, she suddenly realized that she wasn’t so averse to it anymore. She had even wondered: If she hadn’t met big brother Chu first, would she have fallen in love with the heroic Zu An? She didn’t have an answer to that question then, but perhaps that was also an answer in itself.","Chu Youzhao had a heart-to-heart talk with her afterward. That was when she decided to recognize big brother Chu as her husband-in-name and Zu An as her real husband. However, the Cultivation World was filled with people she knew. They were like shackles on her, restricting her from doing anything that defied convention. But now that she was in a foreign world, the etiquette and propriety that had shackled her thus far all vanished. She could finally follow her will and feelings without considering anything else.","For the longest time, Zu An was the most familiar stranger to her. Despite having the most intimate contact, their interactions remained limited to those of normal friends. But now that they were pressed against each other, her body seemed to automatically relax as if it had already grown accustomed to him.","“Brother-in-law, you can’t tell big brother Chu about this!”","Zu An was perplexed. “Is there a need for that? She doesn’t mind.”","“You can’t tell her!” Murong Qinghe didn’t notice that her tone had turned coy, a contrast from her usual imposing, valiant stature.","Zu An couldn’t hold himself back anymore. “Fine!”","Murong Qinghe’s toes curled up as she embraced her lover.","...","“Call my name, brother-in-law.”","“Are you still calling me brother-in-law, Qinghe?”","“Big brother Zu~”","“Good girl, Qinghe.”","...","Even though Murong Qinghe was married, Chu Youzhao was a woman disguised as a man. Due to their unusual arrangement, Murong Qinghe was no different from a maiden. There was no way she was a match for the veteran of the battlefield, Zu An. It didn’t take long before she collapsed in defeat.","Zu An was taken aback. The Valkyrie System activated once more.","“A new valkyrie has been detected. Do you want to collect her?”","“Yes!”","Another card appeared in the Valkyrie System. It resembled a miniature version of Murong Qinghe, and it was labeled ‘Deity of Lightning’s Fragment’.","Zu An would never have expected Murong Qinghe to be a fragment of the Deity of Lightning, though it made sense when he thought about it. He had always thought that she bore a striking resemblance to Mo Xi.","I guess not all fragments of a universal deity are perfectly identical.","At the same time, he wondered why the option to collect Murong Qinghe as a valkyrie didn’t appear the last time he was intimate with her. Is it only possible to collect the first-generation universal deities as valkyries in this world?","“What did you do, big brother Zu? I felt like my soul almost flew away. No. Even now, I feel a deep bond with you.” Murong Qinghe lay in Zu An’s arms like a tame kitten.","Zu An told her about the Valkyrie System, as well as his mission to collect the first-generation universal deities’ fragments in this world.","Murong Qinghe was astonished. She hadn’t expected to be one of the first-generation universal deities’ fragments. All of a sudden, her reddened face turned pale. “Is that the reason you did it with me?”","Zu An knew that women tended to be the most sensitive at a time like this, so he quickly explained, “Qinghe, I didn’t know that you were a first-generation universal deity’s fragment before this. I was merely following my feelings for you...”","Murong Qinghe was no match for her lover’s sweet nothings. Her mood brightened up, and the couple shared warmth for a while longer. All of a sudden, she looked at Zu An with a frown and asked, “Is this how you're going to collect the other soul fragments?”","“It might just be a coincidence,” Zu An replied sheepishly. He thought it would be weird if he had to collect all of the first-generation universal deities like that.","“As expected of you!” Murong Qinghe felt jealousy bubbling inside her.","Zu An knew that there was no way to win this argument. As the saying went, offense was the best defense.","Murong Qinghe let out an exclamation. She lightly hammered his chest, but her strikes were growing weaker and weaker.","Zu An remarked, “Qinghe, what long and slender legs you have.”","Murong Qinghe was so embarrassed that she tried to curl into a ball, but Zu An grabbed her. There was an unmistakable look of bliss on her face. There was no greater joy in the world than to have one’s love reciprocated.","...","Zu An only took his leave in the morning. He was heading back to his tent when Tingxue walked out from the neighboring tent.","She stared at him with cold eyes that threatened to bore a hole through him, saying, “You spent the night at her place.”","“ Cough . We were discussing plans to interfere with the Yellow Turban Army’s supply route.”","“You mentioned that she was the wife of Chuyan’s little brother.” Tingxue didn’t believe him.","“Youzhao is a woman.” Zu An explained Chu Youzhao’s circumstances to her.","Tingxue was stunned. “How messy!”","Zu An took this chance to change the topic. “This was a fruitful trip. We secured both reinforcements for Ji County and the Deity of Lightning’s soul fragment.”","“You must have plenty of fun collecting the universal deities’ soul fragments,” Tingxue snorted.","You have successfully trolled Tingxue for +99... +99... +99...","Zu An was pleasantly surprised. “Are you angry?”","Tingxue was taken aback. She was feeling irritated for some reason, but that should have been impossible for her. She should have already become impervious to emotional fluctuations.","Zu An said, “It’s a good thing. Nebula’s heavy influence on you is what caused you to lose your memories in the first place. The emotions you feel are a sign that your condition is getting better.”","Tingxue flung her sleeves and walked away. “If this is the way to get better, I’d rather lose my memories for good.”","Zu An chuckled. She really is jealous.","Tingxue completely ignored Zu An during their journey back to Ji County.","When they arrived at Ji County, they noticed that the Yellow Turban Army’s vanguard had set up camp right outside the county. The huge enemy army heaped immense stress on Zu An, leaving him with a heavy heart.","Their previous enemy was only an army of thousands, whereas their enemy this time numbered fifty thousand. It was inevitable that Zu An was under even greater pressure."]},{"number":2991,"title":"Chapter 2991: Chapter 2943: Claiming the Commander’s Head From An Army of Ten Thousand","paragraphs":["Zu An spent a while observing the Yellow Turban Army before saying, “They're currently guarding against Ji County and haven’t noticed us yet. This is a chance for us to launch a night ambush. If we can destroy their base camp, it’ll turn into a one-sided slaughter.”","The constant threat of death kept everyone’s nerves on edge on the battlefield. If a pandemonium occurred at night, fear would swiftly spread, and everyone would be in a rush to escape. The result would be a one-sided massacre.","Murong Qinghe observed the enemy camp as well before slowly shaking her head. “It won’t work. The Yellow Turban Army’s commander, Gao Sheng, is a capable man. He has deployed a scouting formation. He would notice the attack right away and deploy his troops accordingly. We are no match for an entire army of 50,000.”","Zu An took note of those details. War was fought very differently in this world. He needed to familiarize himself with the details, or else he could make a fatal mistake in the future.He asked, “What if we circumvent the scouting formation and suddenly attack them from within?”","“That might work, but it’s nigh impossible for us to sneak in there,” Murong Qinghe replied with a frown.","“You mentioned that your commanding trait is ‘Lightning Movement’, which allows you to quicken the movement speed of an army?” Zu An asked.","“That’s right. I reckon that only Liaodong’s ‘White Horse Righteous Followers’ can keep up with my cavalry,” Murong Qinghe replied proudly.","“That’s our way out!” Zu An shared his plan with her.","Murong Qinghe’s eyes lit up. “As expected of brother-in-law. You were able to figure something out!”","Tingxue, who had been silent all this while, glanced at the duo. Is this some kind of perverted roleplay? They are already sleeping with each other, but one is still addressing the other as brother-in-law.","Murong Qinghe brought Zu An, Tingxue, and her cavalry on a detour first to circumvent the enemy’s main force. Tingxue had also trained some troops back at Ji County, and she had to concede that the mobility of Murong Qinghe’s cavalry was ridiculously fast. It far surpassed any army she knew about. Somehow, Murong Qinghe was always able to instantly slip through between the cracks of the Yellow Turban Army’s patrols. Eventually, they circled to the back of the Yellow Turban Army’s camp and intercepted their supply convoy.","Supply convoys trailed behind the main force for safety. No one in the Yellow Turban Army had expected the enemy to circle around their main force to attack the convoy. Some of the soldiers guarding the convoy tried to fire signal flares to request for help, but Zu An and Tingxue had prepared for that and intercepted those flares.","It was a one-sided battle. The Wuhuans had an army buff—Deadly Shot. Their arrows had a three times higher fatality rate than other armies. Under the relentless barrage of arrows, it didn’t take long before the Yellow Turban’s soldiers were frantically fleeing in all directions. But there was no way they could outrun the Wuhuans’ cavalry. In the end, the supply convoy was destroyed.","The Wuhuans cheered in delight when they saw the mountain of rations. There was no more valuable currency than rations in this chaotic era.","Murong Qinghe apologized, “Brother-in-law, I’ll have to bring back some of these rations as spoils of war.”","“Of course.” Zu An knew that she couldn’t act wilfully despite being the Wuhuans’ princess. There had to sufficient incentive for an army to be mobilized. As much as he wanted the rations as well, he needed to pay the Wuhuans to support him in the upcoming battle.","Murong Qinghe was overjoyed. “You’re the best, brother-in-law!”","She was happy to see that Zu An was thinking on her behalf. Her voice was so sweet that Tingxue got the goosebumps listening to it.","Hm, that seems to be another emotion that I didn’t have in the past.","Zu An was too busy to notice Tingxue’s reaction. He instructed half of Murong Qinghe’s cavalrymen to put on the clothes of the supply convoy’s soldiers, while Murong Qinghe and the remaining half of her cavalrymen held their positions to wait for a chance to strike.","Tingxue was about to disguise herself as a soldier of the supply convoy as well when Zu An stopped her. Infiltrating the enemy camp was an extremely dangerous move. He thought that it was enough for one of them to bear the risk.","That displeased Tingxue. “I have been through greater danger than this.”","Murong Qinghe laughed. “You’re too beautiful, senior. It won’t be easy for you to blend into the supply convoy.”","Tingxue’s eyebrows shot up when she heard the word ‘senior’, but she let it slip. “Fine. We’ll wait for your signal out here.”","Zu An nodded. He used his Myriad Transformations to turn into the supply convoy’s commander before leading the convoy toward the enemy camp. He paced the convoy's movement speed to ensure that they reached at night.","At the Yellow Turban Army’s camp entrace, the guard commander inspected his token before letting them pass. The check was lax as the guard commander recognized the supply convoy commander, whom Zu An was disguised as.","While they were passing through the entrance, the guard commander suddenly remarked in confusion, “Hm? Old Li, why are your men all new faces? I’ve never seen them before.”","Cold sweat rained down the Wuhuans. They instinctively placed their hands on their weapons.","Fortunately, Zu An reacted fast. “Don’t mention it. It’s because of that Zhongshan marshal. He has joined forces with the Wuhuans to deal with us. The Earth Duke General[1] had to reallocate many of my brothers to the west, so I could only take the newbies with me.”","“I see.” The guard commander nodded. “That Zhang Chun is arrogant! Wait till we’re done with Ji County. Zhongshan Commandery will be next! I heard that Zhongshan has always been wealthy, and that Zhang Chun has stockpiled quite a bit of rations and fortune over the years.”","Zu An took a mental note of that information while laughing in response. “You’re right! Let’s plunder everything there!”","Amid laughter, Zu An survived the crisis and successfully infiltrated the enemy camp. Along the way, he noticed many defensive formations that made him glad that he hadn’t attempted a frontal assault. Their army of several thousand was nowhere enough to breach a camp of this scale. He told the Wuhuans to stay put first while he scouted the area. Soon, he obtained the secret code for the patrols tonight.","By the Zi hour (2300 to 0100), most people in the camp were already asleep. Zu An shared the secret code with the Wuhuans and told them to scatter the flammable materials they had hidden beneath the supply convoy around the camp. In the meantime, he would neutralize the camp’s formations. It wasn’t too hard for him to do it given his expertise. Besides, the Yellow Turban Army was vigilant toward the outside but lax on the inside. The soldiers weren’t in formation, so they weren’t emanating a strong intimidation aura.","Once everything was in place, Zu An gave the signal, and the camp burst into flames. The Wuhuans created a loud ruckus to induce chaos. The Yellow Turban Army’s soldiers, who were jolted awake from their sleep, thought that the imperial court had sent an army to suppress them, prompting them to escape in utmost fear.","The general of the army, Gao Sheng, immediately rushed out of his tent while putting on his armor. He had been enjoying a mother-daughter duo plundered from a nearby county when disaster struck.","“Men!” Gao Sheng shouted while gathering his personal guards. He knew the most important thing to do right now was to calm down the troops.","His personal guards rushed up to him. He quickly issued an order, “Relay my orders. All soldiers are to remain in their tents. Anyone running around will be deemed a traitor!”","An incompetent person couldn’t have become a general of the Yellow Turban Army. He knew that the imperial court’s army couldn’t possibly be here, and from that, he decided that someone was trying to induce panic among them. As long as he could quell the pandemonium, the enemy force would be cornered.","While Gao Sheng was busy deploying his troops, he suddenly murmured, “Why do you look unfamiliar...”","One personal guard finally raised his head and looked at him with a sinister smile. There was a flash of cold light, and Gao Sheng’s head fell to the ground.","Zu An would have had to think twice before fighting Gao Sheng and his army, but if it was a one-on-one battle, there was no way Gao Sheng could have been a match for him.","1. Zhang Bao ☜"]},{"number":2992,"title":"Chapter 2992: Chapter 2944: Directing the Trouble Elsewhere","paragraphs":["Gao Sheng’s other personal guards were horrified. Some of them immediately attacked Zu An, but the intimidation aura from a small platoon like this wasn't enough to suppress him. Zu An made quick work of the most loyal guards. The remaining personal guards lost their fighting spirit and fled.","Zu An didn’t bother chasing them. Instead, he stuck Gao Sheng’s head on a flagpole and declared, “Gao Sheng is dead! Gao Sheng is dead! Gao Sheng is dead!”","...","Zu An’s thunderous voice echoed throughout the camp. A few mid-level commanders had been rallying the soldiers together to stage a counterattack when they saw Gao Sheng’s decapitated head and lost their fighting spirit.","Murong Qinghe and the Wuhuans immediately charged over. Tingxue, who was now layered with an army buff, was an unstoppable force. Even a casual swing of her sword unleashed sword ki of over a thousand meters in length. Not a single person survived more than one strike from her.","Even the valiant Wuhuans were horrified. This woman is so ferocious! I bet even the most famous generals in the world also only amount to that.","In Ji County, Yun Jianyue had long noticed the ruckus within the enemy camp. She initially thought that it was a scheme from the Yellow Turban Army to lure them in, but upon closer examination, she realized that their camp was truly in shambles. On top of that, she noticed Tingxue’s unique sword ki. There was no need for further doubt. She immediately mobilized the troops in Ji County to crush the enemy camp.","The Yellow Turban Army crumbled. They could only curse their parents for not giving them more legs to run.","...","By the crack of dawn, the Yellow Turban Army had lost more than ten thousand soldiers. Some escaped, whereas the remaining 30,000 soldiers were captured as prisoners.","Just then, Zu An heard a commotion in the distance and rushed over.","Murong Qinghe’s Wuhuan cavalry was having a stand-off against another cavalry unit. The opposing cavalrymen were all mounted on white steeds, causing quite the visual impact. Despite numbering fewer than the Wuhuans, their aura didn’t pale in comparison.","Zu An had never seen this cavalry before, but he still recognized it right away. It was the famed ‘White Horse Righteous Followers’. These were the reinforcements he had requested from Gongsun Zan a while back. The leader was a well-groomed man with a goatee. From the memories he had of this world, he knew that this man was Gongsun Zan’s younger brother, Gongsun Yue.","“What happened?” Zu An asked.","Murong Qinghe complained to him. Gongsun Yue did the same as well.","Zu An finally got to the bottom of the situation.","Gongsun Zan’s ‘White Horse Righteous Followers’ had forged its fame through hunting ethnic groups. They mainly targeted Xianbeis, but they had frequent clashes with the Wuhuans as well, who resided in the vicinity. It would be a stretch to say that they were arch-enemies, but there was plenty of bad blood between both sides. Naturally, they didn’t welcome each other’s presence. It wasn’t easy for Zu An to placate both sides.","Murong Qinghe approached Zu An in private and explained, “Brother-in-law, my underlings detest the White Horse Righteous Followers and are demanding to return. Furthermore, Zhang Chun has paid us good money to fight on his behalf. If we don’t return soon...”","Zu An understood her difficult position. He supported her decision, but he still tried to persuade her to stay.","Murong Qinghe turned him down. “Brother-in-law, you said that it’ll be much easier for you to collect the soul fragments if you conquer the world. I can help you more by staying with the Wuhuans. I’ll do my best to nurture my aides, so that I can be of greater assistance to you in the future.”","Zu An accepted her decision. They agreed on a medium of communication before reluctantly bidding farewell to each other. He gave her many spoils of war from the Yellow Turban Army.","After Murong Qinghe left with her underlings, Gongsun Yue stepped in and harrumphed. “Those barbarians know no virtue. There’s no point giving them so much.”","Zu An’s head hurt. He could tell that there was no room for reconciliation between both sides. He also shared a portion of the spoils of war with Gongsun Yue to thank him for the reinforcements. Only then did the latter’s expression look slightly better.","The next problem bugging Zu An was how to deal with the captured Yellow Turban Army’s soldiers.","Gongsun Yue’s answer was straightforward. “Isn’t it obvious? We should kill the rebels.”","“It won’t look good for us if we kill surrendered soldiers.” Zu An turned down the suggestion. Putting aside all the lessons he had learned from history, it was also not in his character to execute surrendered soldiers.","“If you release those people, they will just join the rebel army again and continue plundering. More poeple will suffer as a result.” Gongsun Yue frowned.","“Yes, we can’t release them just like that.” Zu An fell into contemplation.","Gongsun Yue frowned. “Are you intending to take them into your fold?” He had noticed some surrendered Yellow Turban Army soldiers in Ji County.","But Zu An understood the realities of the situation. “I don’t have the rations to maintain them.”","It was already a strain on his resources to take in three thousand soldiers, let alone thirty thousand. He had already given away more than half of the rations looted from the Yellow Turban Army to the Wuhuans and the White Horse Righteous Followers as compensation. There wasn’t much of it left anymore. The troops would begin to starve within days if he took all of them in. Furthermore, the rations in this world weren’t ordinary food. They were suffused with ki to replenish one’s blood essence and energy. In other words, Zu An couldn’t just borrow modern knowledge to grow more crops.","“If you can’t raise them, you should just kill them as soon as possible.” Gongsun Yue couldn’t understand why Zu An was hesitating. Why show unnecessary compassion toward the enemy?","“Let me think about it a while more.” Zu An sighed.","Gongsun Yue was displeased that Zu An wasn’t listening to his advice. He didn’t bother persuading Zu An any further, as he thought that the latter would eventually have to kill them all.","Next, Zu An met Yun Jianyue in private and told her about his encounter with Murong Qinghe.","Yun Jianyue was taken aback. “You aren’t just satisfied with conquering the Chu clan’s sisters; you’re even laying your hands on their daughter-in-law? You would have easily qualified as the Holy Son—no, master of the Yin Yang Sect!”","Zu An was speechless.","Tingxue nodded in agreement. “I have never expected to hear you spout something logical.”","Yun Jianyue seethed. “No one will think you’re mute just because you don’t speak.”","Tingxue’s eyes turned cold as her hand fell on her Frost Fair Blade. Yun Jianyue also reached for her serpent spear.","Seeing that a fight was about to break out between the two women, Zu An quickly changed the subject and asked, “How should we deal with the prisoners?”","Tingxue frowned, but she decided not to start a fight.","Yun Jianyue rolled her eyes at Tingxue. “We don’t have the resources to maintain them. You aren’t willing to kill them, but we also can’t release them just like that. Why don’t you negotiate with the Yellow Turban Army’s Earth Duke General? We can ask him to redeem his people with money and rations.”","“What’s the point of asking for money and rations? We can just use this as leverage and demand Zhang Bao go after Zhang Chun instead. This will buy us some time,” Tingxue coldly said.","Zu An’s eyes lit up. That was a decent solution. Even though he had dealt with Gao Sheng’s army, Zhang Bao’s army was still swiftly gathering around them. If Zhang Bao refused to redeem the prisoners, his army morale would plummet, thus greatly reducing his strength. If Zhang Bao accepted the offer, that would be a crisis averted for them."]},{"number":2993,"title":"Chapter 2993: Chapter 2945: The Reappearance of the Bliss Demoness","paragraphs":["The plan was quickly approved. The next step was to select the envoy to negotiate with the Yellow Turban Army. This person had to be quick-witted, decisive, and wield sufficient authority to make decisions on the spot. At the same time, they had to be courageous and strong enough to confront the Yellow Turban Army head-on.","In the end, they concluded that they had no such talent on hand.","“I’ll go,” Zu An said.","Yun Jianyue was worried. “You’re the commander right now. It’s too dangerous for you to negotiate directly with the army. What if the Yellow Turban Army holds you hostage or even outright kills you?”","Zu An smiled. “Don’t worry. I have braved greater dangers than this. A mere Yellow Turban Army can’t bring me down. It won’t be that easy for them to hold me hostage.”","Tingxue added, “Indeed. There’s no one more suited than him for this task. He can disguise himself, and he has many special powers as well. He should have no trouble protecting himself.”","Yun Jianyue harrumphed. “What a heartless ice statue you are.”","“I am just being pragmatic,” Tingxue sneered. “You know that deep down as well, but you choose to feign concern. I guess this is a common move used by women of the Devil Sect.”","Yun Jianyue was infuriated. “Do you think I’d need to resort to such lowly methods?”","Seeing that the two of them were about to bicker again, Zu An hurriedly interjected, “I’m not worried about my safety. I’m more worried about you two coming to blows after I leave.”","“We aren’t that immature,” Yun Jianyue huffed.","Tingxue added, “Hand me half of the previously surrendered troops. I’ll train them separately. This way, I won’t have any conflicts with her.”","“Sure. Shall we compete to see who can train the stronger army?” Yun Jianyue’s competitiveness flared.","“Please talk things out if anything happens. We can’t afford any internal strife right now.” Zu An coudln’t help but worry when he looked at the two of them despite their promises.","Next, he had to prepare for the negotiation. Before he left, Yun Jianyue dragged him into her room, claiming that she needed to hand something to him for self-defense.","“I don’t need any self-defense tools right now. You should keep them...” Zu An was halfway through his words when a pair of fiery lips sealed his mouth. He instinctively wrapped his arm around Yun Jianyue’s slender waist. He noticed that her cheeks were reddened like peach blossom flowers.","Sensing his confusion, Yun Jianyue lowered her head in embarrassment. She asked, “Do you still remember me catching the gaze of the Deity of Bliss and Desire back then?”","Zu An nodded. But I remember she didn’t enter the Bliss and Desire Divine Palace in the end.","“Under their gaze, I became a Bliss Demoness or something. I felt a mysterious power drawing me toward the abyss of desires,” Yun Jianyue said.","Zu An’s heart jolted. In the past, while he was on a starship heading toward Dreamland, Employee 9527 had told him about Bliss Demonesses. They were the ultimate sexual creatures in this world. All beings, be it top-notch experts or ordinary mortals, took pride in sharing a night with a Bliss Demoness. It was rumored to be a soul-enrapturing experience. Bliss Demonesses could bring infinite bliss to others, but at the same time, they also needed bliss to survive. That was why renowned Bliss Demonesses tended to have a long history of men.","Zu An had been worried about Yun Jianyue, but his worries faded when he learned that she hadn’t entered the Bliss and Desire Divine Palace. On top of that, she embodied the fragmented soul of a first-generation universal deity within her.","Why is she mentioning that now? Did something happen?","Yun Jianyue continued, “I am from the Devil Sect. I am the first person to have reached the highest level of the Heavenly Devil’s Temptation in the last few centuries, so I can’t be controlled by lust that easily. On top of that, I had some fortuitous encounters afterward. Thinking back, the Deity of Darkness’s fragmented soul must have protected me, allowing me to suppress my traits as a Bliss Demoness. But now...”","Her face reddened. “I don’t know why, but my urges have been growing stronger in recent days. I missed you more than ever over the last few days.”","Zu An asked worriedly, “When did you notice this change?”","“I think it happened right after our reunion. I suspect that the night I spent with you has awakened my traits as a Bliss Demoness.” Yun Jianyue frowned in frustration. “Why is the Deity of Bliss and Desire so obsessed with me?”","Zu An also frowned. Come to think of it, I was intimate with the Deity of Bliss and Desire not long ago. Could it be because I was carrying her aura, and that inadvertently awakened Yun Jianyue’s traits as a Bliss Demoness?","“Quick, Ah Zu. I can’t hold myself back anymore...” Yun Jianyue’s voice quivered.","Zu An had to concede that he thoroughly enjoyed every encounter he had with her. He had thought that it was because she had mastered the art of temptation, but on hindsight, that could have been due to her trait as a Bliss Demoness instead.","He dared not to continue this indulgence, fearing that the Deity of Bliss and Desire’s aura he carried would worsen Yun Jianyue’s condition. So, he anxiously summoned Mi Li, “Big sister empress, help me!”","Surprisingly, Mi Li didn’t manifest herself. Instead, she asked, “What is it?”","Her voice was slightly off, but Zu An was too concerned about Yun Jianyue’s condition to notice that. He anxiously asked about the situation surrounding Bliss Demonesses.","A while later, Mi Li replied, “Don’t you have the antidote right here?”","Zu An anxiously replied, “I can temporarily alleviate her symptoms, but I can’t fix the root of the problem. I’m also worried that it might just exacerbate her condition in the long run.”","“You’re thinking too much. I’m not referring to you,” Mi Li harrumphed impatiently before explaining the matter.","Zu An’s eyes lit up. He lifted Yun Jianyue up and carried her out.","“Where are you bringing me?” Yun Jianyue’s sight had turned blurry. She felt like her body was melting, and she had no idea how long she could maintain control for. What if others see me in my current state?","Zu An didn’t keep her in suspense for long. He kicked open the neighboring Tingxue’s door.","Tingxue had been meditating when the duo barged into her room. She was momentarily surprised when her eyes fell on Yun Jianyue. She refrained from secular affairs, but it was not too difficult for her to figure out what was going on from Yun Jianyue’s reddened skin, glazed eyes, and ragged breathing. This infuriated her. “Don’t you think that you’re going too far?”","Am I just a part of your play now?","You have successfully trolled Tingxue for +119... +119... +119...","“You've misunderstood...” Zu An didn’t know how to explain the matter, but Yun Jianyue was in a critical condition.","So, he shoved Yun Jianyue into Tingxue’s arm and said, “I need you to help her.”","Tingxue was speechless. How am I supposed to help her?","She was about to flare up when Yun Jianyue began wrapping her limbs around her like an octopus. Yun Jianyue’s searing body warmth caused her usually cold heart to skip a beat."]},{"number":2994,"title":"Chapter 2994: Chapter 2946: Saving Each Other","paragraphs":["“You lunatic! What are you doing?” Tingxue’s usual coldness faded as she tried to push Yun Jianyue aside in a fluster.","However, Yun Jianyue only stuck closer to her. “I want it~”","Tingxue was stunned. She looked at Zu An for an explanation. Her fair complexion was tinged with redness. “Hurry up and take her away. Otherwise, I won’t show mercy.”","Zu An anxiously explained, “She is in a peculiar situation. Please help her.” He proceeded to tell her about the Bliss Demonesses.","Tingxue huffed, “How am I supposed to help her? Shouldn’t you be the one to do it?”","“There’s no way to undo her being a Bliss Demoness anymore, but you are a Nebula envoy. Your nebula intent can neutralize the imprint left on her by the Deity of Bliss and Desire,” Zu An explained.","Tingxue said slowly, “But I don’t want to help her.”","“Do you really want her to remain like this? You two were enemies but also close rivals. She would have helped you if something similar happened to you.”","“Would she? I only see her causing trouble for me every day,” Tingxue scoffed. “Leave the room. You aren’t allowed to come in unless I permit it.”","Zu An was initially worried, but his eyes slowly lit up in delight when he heard the latter half of her words. “Thank you!” He quickly left the room and stood guard outside.","As he closed the door, he heard Tingxue exclaiming with a quivering voice, “Where do you think you’re touching? Stay away from me... Wuuu ... I’ll throw you out!”","...","The voices inside gradually quieted. Zu An felt a burning sensation in his nostrils. Just imagining what was happening inside was enough to ignite his passion.","While he was worrying about whether Tingxue was able to pull it off or not, he suddenly felt a burst of nebula intent from the room, causing the Bliss Demoness aura to weaken. Seeing that their conditions had stabilized, Zu An breathed a sigh of relief.","He turned to Mi Li and said, “My beautiful master, you don’t know how worried I was when I couldn’t get into contact with you.”","“You have been having a lot of fun, even sharing intimacy with a universal deity. The least I could do was to not disturb you, no?” Mi Li huffed.","“Ah. You know about that.”","“We have a soul contract. It’s a given for me to know what’s happening around you.”","Zu An didn’t want to discuss this matter with her, so he quickly changed the subject. “My beautiful master, why aren’t you revealing yourself?”","“This world is special. It’s not convenient for me to reveal myself here. If you want to see me, you should gather the final material as soon as possible,” Mi Li said before falling silent. This time, she didn’t respond no matter how Zu An called her, as if she had gone into hibernation.","Zu An was confused. Why is she acting all secretive? He had wanted to ask her about the first-generation universal deities. She should have known that, but she wasn’t saying anything about the matter. This was unusual.","Some time later, Tingxue’s voice echoed from within, “You may come in.”","Zu An rushed into the room. What he saw nearly caused his nose to bleed. Tingxue was sitting on the bed, wrapped in a blanket. There were clothes scattered around the room. Some belonged to Yun Jianyue, but there were traces of a ripped white dress as well.","Doesn’t that mean that ...","Zu An took a closer look at Tingxue and saw her shoulders exposed. Her skin gleamed brilliantly like snow on a mountain.","“Have you seen enough yet?” Tingxue glared at him in annoyance.","Zu An finally turned his attention to Yun Jianyue, who was deeply asleep off to the side. She was covered in a thin blanket. Zu An began, “Just now...”","Tingxue interjected right away, “Don’t ask anything and take her away!”","Sensing Tingxue’s embarrassment, Zu An secretly chuckled. While Tingxue had become more lively recently, she still emanated a strong nebula aura as if she wasn’t a part of the secular world. However, the earlier incident made her seem much more like a human.","A thought suddenly surfaced in Zu An’s mind. If Tingxue’s nebula aura can neutralize Yun Jianyue’s bliss aura, does that mean that the opposite is true as well?","“You need to take care of her more...” Tingxue murmured before throwing a pillow over.","Zu An’s smile widened. He lifted Yun Jianyue up and carried her to his room. Then, he channeled a surge of ki to condition her body.","Soon, Yun Jianyue regained consciousness. She squirmed out of awkwardness the moment she saw Zu An. “Why did you send me to that ice statue’s side?!” She had still been conscious despite being in a delirious state earlier.","“I cannot cure the root of your problem. Only her nebula aura can neutralize your Bliss Demoness traits,” Zu An explained.","“I have spent a lifetime fighting against her. It’s over now.” As she thought about what happened earlier, Yun Jianyue buried her head in her pillow and rolled all around the bed in distress. Her reputation had been ruined just like that!","Zu An was amused. “Aren’t you a demoness? This is in line with your character.”","Yun JIanyue immediately sat upright, unfazed by her exposed body. Her eyes gleamed. “Yes, you’re right. I am the Devil Sect’s demoness!”","She recalled how she had stripped Tingxue’s clothes earlier, as well as the other things she had done to the latter... I pulled an ice fairy down to the secular world. She should be the one feeling embarrassed!","Zu An’s passion was already stoked from the noises he heard earlier. Yun Jianyue’s beautiful body was the final straw that set his desire ablaze. He immediately pounced on Yun Jianyue.","To his astonishment, Yun Jianyue pushed him aside and said, “Hold on.” She put on her clothes and dashed out.","Zu An was speechless. It didn’t take long for him to find out what she was up to.","“SCRAM!” Tingxue roared from the neighboring room.","Yun Jianyue said with a gleeful smirk, “I thought you were really an ice statue. Your body is honest for someone who acts so cold.”","A huge commotion followed. Shockwaves rippled from the neighboring room, devastating even Zu An’s room. Soon, the two women rose into the air and continued fighting.","The people of Ji County had long grown accustomed to it. Some even placed bets on which one they thought would win today.","Zu An sighed. I don’t think I’ll be getting any action today.","...","Zu An left Ji County with a woeful sigh, regretful that he wasn’t able to indulge himself one last time before going on this journey. It would be wonderful if the three of us can do it together when I return.","Before he knew it, he had already reached Hejian Commandery. He could already see the Yellow Turban Army’s scouts in the distance. The other party had also noticed him and swiftly encircled him. Zu An placed his hands behind his back as he stated the reason behind his arrival.","...","The scouts sneered in contempt when they learned that Zu An was here to negotiate, but they were shocked when they learned about his identity. Who could have expected the leader of an enemy army to personally negotiate with them? That was as good as courting death!","They quickly reported this matter upward before bringing him into their base camp.","Looking at the distant commander tent marked with a ‘Zhang’ flag, Zu An wondered what kind of person Zhang Bao, one of the Three Rebel Leaders, was."]},{"number":2995,"title":"Chapter 2995: Chapter 2947: A Solo Confrontation","paragraphs":["Zu An was brought before Zhang Bao’s camp. It had been set up against a mountain. There were traces of dried blood on the surrounding black fence. The stench of beast mounts filled the air. Two massive beast skeletons were placed by the camp’s entrance as decoration, their empty eye sockets staring ominously at every visitor.","The door opened. The scout told Zu An to enter alone.","Zu An walked in without hesitation. Tangible killing intent rushed at him. There were over a thousand elite, armored soldiers standing in formation, extending from the camp entrance to the middle tent. Not a single person uttered a word; they quietly held their weapons while staring at him as if he were a dead man.","Their cold blades gleamed coldly under the sunlight. Zu An felt as if he were walking through a forest of blades. But what was even more terrifying was the intimidation aura emanated by the soldiers. They greatly suppressed Zu An’s fighting prowess. These soldiers were far more elite than Cheng Yuanzhi’s or Gao Sheng’s troops. These thousand or so soldiers could stand their ground against an army of ten thousand. Any other cultivator in Zu An’s place would have long lost strength in their legs.","Zu An felt the pressure, but he displayed no fear and calmly advanced.","Just then, a one-eyed commander with a hulking physique stepped out with heavy footsteps that caused the ground to quake. He walked up to Zu An and assessed him with disdainful eyes. “Are you the Liu Bei who killed countless of our brothers?”","“I have saved even more people from the Yellow Turban Army,” Zu An calmly replied.","“What a glib tongue you have. How dare you come here? Everyone, what do you think we should do?!” the one-eyed commander asked the surrounding soldiers.","All the soldiers drew their blades and pointed them at Zu An’s vitals, the metallic clangs sounding like the Grim Reaper sharpening its scythe. They roared in unison, “Kill him!”","The thousands of voices resonated to form a sonic boom that distorted even the air. Slivers of black aura rose from the camp as countless resentful spirits rushed at him. Some had their arms severed, others had their chests ripped open, and others were bleeding from their apertures. This was the ‘Myriad Souls Massacre Formation’ forged through countless deaths. Many valiant heroes had crumbled before this powerful formation.","But Zu An’s footsteps remained steady. He neither sped up nor slowed down. His cadence remained steady and precise. When the resentful spirits came within a meter og him, they suddenly disintegrated while shrieking as if they had encountered something terrifying. They hurriedly opened a path for him, not daring to come close anymore. Living beings wouldn't sense it, but the resentful spirits knew that Zu An was the Netherworld’s master. The authority he naturally wielded over them made them tremble in fear.","Zu An felt like laughing. There were far more frightening ghosts in the Netherworld. These people were underestimating him if they thought that they could intimidate him with this.","The one-eyed commander was startled. He tightened his grip on his sword.","Just then, Zu An suddenly spoke up, “I came here to negotiate with the Earth Duke General. That one-eyed commander over there, are you the one calling the shots here now?” His voice wasn't loud, but it was relayed to every nook and cranny in the camp.","The one-eyed commander was infuriated. “What did you say?”","You have successfully trolled Yan Zheng for +444... +444... +444...","His fiery-tempered aides drew their swords. They were ready to mince Zu An at the one-eyed commander’s order.","Zu An halted his footsteps to glance at the one-eyed commander, Yan Zheng. His gaze called the latter to sweat profusely; Yan Zheng felt as if he was dealing with not a young man but a lofty deity. The other party’s clear eyes seemed to emanate a deathly aura.","Zu An smirked as he continued walking forward.","Yan Zheng held his sword with a trembling hand, but somehow, he couldn’t draw his blade. Even he couldn’t understand why he didn’t dare to make a move, even though he clearly held the upper hand here. What did that fellow go through to have such a tranquil yet unfathomable gaze?","The other soldiers exchanged looks. Their morale plummeted, and they instinctively lowered their weapons.","The other higher-ups of the Yellow Turban Army in the tent witnessed this sight, and their disdainful expressions turned into severity. They had thought that Liu Bei’s arrival was nothing but a joke. They held the upper hand here, so what was there to negotiate? So, they decided to intimidate Liu Bei to see him make a fool of himself. But Liu Bei was more formidable than they had expected. They vaguely sensed that the situation was spiraling out of their control.","Zu An entered the general tent. Two rows of commanders were seated inside, and they were guarded by dozens of axemen. He had known that the Yellow Turban Army would prepare something for him, so he didn’t pursue the matter and instead walked straight to the center seat and bowed to Zhang Bao. “Liu Xuande[1] pays respect to the Earth Duke General!”","Zhang Bao wore a loose yellow cloak embroidered with runes, which aligned with the Yellow Turban Army’s style. His face was obscured with a fierce mask, giving him the impression of an enigmatic cult leader.","Zu An wondered if Zhang Bao had never shown his face in public. If so, someone can simply substitute him if he dies in battle.","Someone in the tent shouted, “Why aren’t you kneeling?”","“I only kneel to heaven and my parents,” Zu An replied calmly.","“Audacious!” The other commanders rose to their feet. The atmosphere turned tense.","Zhang Bao waved his hand, gesturing for the crowd to sit down. Then, he assessed Zu An with curious eyes, saying, “Do you not kneel to your emperor, either?” His voice wasn't as authoritative as Zu An had imagined. Instead, there was a tinge of mischief.","“If the Earth Duke Emperor is willing to kneel to the emperor, I can do so alongside you.”","The crowd glared at Zu An furiously.","You have successfully trolled Zhou Cang for +119... +119... +119...","You have successfully trolled Pei Yuanzhao for +119... +119... +119...","You have...","Zu An glanced at Zhou Cang and Pei Yuanshao. They're Zhang Bao’s subordinates?","In Romance of the Three Kingdoms, Zhou Cang was Guan Yu’s loyal aide. Pei Yuanshao had also defected to Guan Yu’s side, but he stole a horse and was stabbed to death by Zhao Yun, who didn’t know that he was an ally.","“What an interesting fellow.” Zhang Bao laughed. “What do you want to negotiate?”","Zu An revealed his intentions. He would free tens of thousands of the Yellow Turban Army’s soldiers in exchange for Zhang Bao’s retreat.","Zhang Bao nodded. “Very well. I accept your terms.”","Zu An was surprised.He had expected a difficult talk. He had even prepared many arguments to persuade Zhang Bao. But things went so smoothly that he wondered if he was dreaming.","1. Liu Bei’s birth name. ☜"]},{"number":2996,"title":"Chapter 2996: Chapter 2948: Matchmaking","paragraphs":["Zhang Bao’s commanders immediately spoke up against it.","“Our army has the upper hand. There’s no reason for us to negotiate with the enemy!”","“We’ll massacre Ji County if they dare hurt our brothers!”","“Please reconsider, Earth Duke General!”","...","The one who opposed it the loudest was the one-eyed Yan Zheng. Zu An frowned as the other party's killing intent seeped out.","Zhang Bao raised his hand and said, “We are fighting so that our brothers and sisters can fill their stomachs. We are fighting for a future for everyone. How would we be any different from those corrupted officials if we turn a blind eye to the plight of tens of thousands of our brothers? I have made up my mind on this matter, so speak no more!”","The Yellow Turban Army’s second-in-charge had made his stance clear. The other commanders exchanged conflicted looks, but they quieted down.","But Yan Zheng refused to step down. “How can we move our army of a hundred thousand so haphazardly? We have spent many rations and money to get here. It’d be inauspicious to retreat without doing anything, and it would undermine our army’s morale as well.”","Zhang Bao nodded in agreement. “Commander Yan is right, but I have my plans. Zhongshan Commandery’s Zhang Chun has been bulking up his forces in recent years, and he’s beginning to pose a threat. On top of that, Zhongshan Commandery has always been wealthy. We won’t be wasting our effort if we switch our target to Zhongshan Commandery.”","Zu An widened his eyes. That had been one of his arguments to convince Zhang Bao not to attack Ji County; he hadn’t expected the other party to propose it.","“The Earth Duke General is wise!” the other commanders complimented him. Yan Zheng had no choice but to sing praises of Zhang Bao as well.","Zhang Bao offered to host a banquet to welcome Zu An. He wanted to know more about the Yellow Turban Army, so he decided to stay.","The Yellow Turban Army’s commanders kept offering alcohol to Zu An, hoping to see the latter make a fool of himself. However, his high cultivation and the Ocean Deity’s water control ability made it impossible for him to get drunk, so he heartily accepted all toasts. That won him some favorability from the crowd. At the same time, he also got acquainted with Zhou Cang and Pei Yuanshao.","Yan Zheng drank by himself in the corner, displeased that Zu An was receiving such a warm welcome.","Right as the banquet was about to conclude, a guard relayed a message to Zu An, saying that the Earth Duke General had invited him to his tent for a chat. Zu An was wary that this could be a trap from Yan Zheng.","The guard brought him to Zhang Bao’s tent, and Zhang Bao was really waiting inside. Looking at the other party's mysterious mask, Zu An asked out of curiosity, “Earth Duke General, do you never take off your mask?”","Zhang Bao laughed. “Many people have wanted to see my face, but they are all dead now.”","“Forget it then. I’m not a curious person,” Zu An replied.","“You are interesting.” Zhang Bao examined Zu An. “I heard that the person who defeated Cheng Yuanzhi and Gao Sheng was a nobody, but you are dignified and young. Above all, the airs you showed earlier today are truly admirable.”","“You’re flattering me. It is nothing compared to the Earth Duke General,” Zu An humbly replied. What is Zhang Bao trying to get at here?","“Are you engaged?” Zhang Bao suddenly asked.","Zu An was speechless. He had thought of countless possibilities, but this wasn't one of them.","“No, I’m not engaged.” Liu Bei was indeed not married at this point in time.","“That’s great.” Zhang Bao smiled. “I have a younger sister who is beautiful and talented. If you don’t mind, you can take her as your wife.”","Zu An was bewildered. Cold sweat trickled down his face. He hurriedly stood up and said, “Pardon me, Earth Duke General. Even though I am not married, I have someone I am interested in. I wouldn’t want to hinder your younger sister’s happiness.”","While the Yellow Turban Army appeared formidable at present, its days were numbered. Marrying Zhang Bao’s little sister would make him a rebel as well. That could potentially lead to his doom.","Zhang Bao’s face darkened. “You said that you weren’t married earlier. Are you coming up with excuses because you look down on my little sister?”","“Please calm down, Earth Duke General. I don't have a fiancée, but I do have a lover, and I don’t want to let her down,” Zu An explained.","“That’s not a problem. You can take my little sister as your wife, and your lover as your concubine. You won’t be letting her down.” Zhang Bao harrumphed.","Zu An’s head hurt. “I’m afraid that won’t do...”","Zhang Bao’s face turned cold. “Or do you expect my little sister to be your concubine?”","Zu An regained his composure and replied, “I’ll be frank, Earth Duke General. I have multiple lovers, and I don’t distinguish between wife and concubines. We have been through thick and thin. I’d be a heartless man if I married your little sister for power. I’m certain your little sister wouldn’t want to marry someone like that, either.”","“I didn’t expect you to be a sentimental man,” Zhang Bao scoffed. “Are you sure you have never let any woman down in your life?”","Zu An was taken aback by the question. Heavy emotions loomed in his eyes, and he eventually heaved a deep sigh. “You are right, Earth Duke General. I have let many people down in my life. But we are separated across worlds, so I fear that I might never see them again.”","Zhang Bao trembled. He tried his best to control his tone as he spoke, “If you see her again, will you still let her slip through your fingers?”","Zu An shook his head. “I’ll hold her tight and never let her go.”","“Big brother Zu...” a feminine voice suddenly echoed in the room. It sounded valiant, yet it carried unbound tenderness.","Zu An’s body trembled. He stared at Zhang Bao with a frown, as he could tell that the voice had come from the other party.","Zhang Bao took off his mask, revealing a beautiful woman’s face. She took off her yellow robe, revealing a slender, armored figure. She had bronze skin, well-sculpted abdominal muscles, and sturdy legs reminiscent of a powerful cheetah. She resembled Murong Qinghe, but her disposition felt much more mature, as compared to Murong Qinghe’s youthfulness. She also resembled Mo Xi, especially in terms of their dress-up, but she was less seductive and more valiant.","“Princess Ni Huang!” Zu An exclaimed in astonishment. He hadn’t expected to see her here. This was their first time meeting since they parted ways in the Netherworld’s Asura race territory.","The woman dove into his chest and embraced him tightly. “Big brother Zu, I thought I’d never see you again!”","Zu An hesitated for a second, but he still gently hugged her. It was commonly said that it was bliss to meet an acquaintance in a foreign land, let alone reuniting in the vast Myriad Worlds.","“Big brother Zu, I thought that you had forgotten about me. I didn’t expect...” Princess Ni Huang lowered her head shyly. “I was happy to hear your words.”","Zu An squirmed awkwardly. He was actually thinking about another woman."]},{"number":2997,"title":"Chapter 2997: Chapter 2949: The First Asura In The World to Beg For Mercy","paragraphs":["Still, no man in the world would be foolish enough to utter the truth in this situation. Feeling guilt-ridden, Zu An hugged Princess Ni Huang tighter. His feelings toward her had subtly changed when he learned the significance of the Asura Tear. He felt like he had to take responsibility for her.","He caressed her cheek as he asked, “What are you doing here? Where’s your big brother?”","Ni Huang replied, “My big brother said that I had seemed depressed since parting ways with you, so he advised me to cultivate at our ancestral dungeons. I thought there might be a chance I could sever spacetime and reunite with you if I became strong enough, so I did it. I spent a long time cultivating in our ancestral dungeons, and before I knew it, I became the strongest being in our Asura race. I became even stronger than my big brother.”","Zu An was surprised. While the Asuras were a warlike race, their ladies rarely fought in battle. They just needed to be beautiful. Yet Ni Huang had become the strongest of her race. She must have faced many dangerous challenges and put in a lot of hard work.","Zu An was moved, knowing that she had done this for him. “It has been tough on you, Ni Huang.”","“It’s not tough at all. I enjoyed becoming stronger. Otherwise, I would never have been able to enter that secret dungeon, sever the curse power on me, and reunite with you here,” Ni Huang said with an excited gleam in her eyes.","“How did you become Zhang Bao? Is Zhang Jiao your older brother?” Zu An asked curiously.","“I took on the role of the Yellow Turban Army’s ‘Earth Duke General’ when I entered this world. It’s fortunate that the original Zhang Bao was a secretive person who wore a mask, so I wasn’t at risk of being discovered by others. War is rife in this world, and there is nothing we Asuras enjoy more than war.” Ni Huang’s eyes glowed when she talked about war.","“As for your earlier question, Zhang Jiao isn’t my older brother. My older brother is still in our original world. I thought I’d be alone here. I didn’t expect to reunite with you here.” Ni Huang couldn’t hold herself back anymore and dove in to kiss his face.","Zu An still had many questions, but those could be left for later. He had just drunk a bit and was feeling frisky.","Sensing Ni Huang’s passion, how could he let down her many years of yearning and waiting? The temperature in the tent rose as she sat in his arms, giving off an air of youthfulness. Years of fighting had tempered her body, leaving her with no excess flesh. Every bit of her muscles exuded a healthy glow.","Princess Ni Huang had been to many worlds, and all this time, she was confident that her spearmanship wouldn’t pale in comparison to anyone’s. She had never cowered before an enemy before, no matter how powerful they were.","But this was the moment she realized that she couldn’t have been more wrong. There was spearmanship in the vast Myriad Worlds that could strike fear in her.","...","A deep moan suddenly echoed from the tent. Alarmed, the guards stationed outside rushed to the entrance of the tent and asked, “Earth Duke General, did something happen?”","Ni Huang felt like she would die of embarrassment, especially if her subordinates barged in right now. She anxiously reached for her mask, but Zu An grabbed her hand and said, “Leave it to me.”","He imitated Zhang Bao’s voice and shouted, “I’m fine. I need to discuss things privately with General Liu, so make sure no one enters the tent without my permission. Otherwise, I’ll execute them personally!”","He had become so skilled at Myriad Transformations that imitating voices was second nature to him.","“Yes, Earth Duke General!” The guards hurriedly backed off.","Ni Huang looked at Zu An. “You sure are good at deception. I doubt that anyone can see through your impersonation.”","Zu An smiled. “Aren’t you worried that someone else is impersonating me?”","Ni Huang replied with a smile, “I can sense the Asura Tear in your forehead. No one can impersonate you.”","Zu An teased, “It sounds almost like a puppy marking its territory.”","Ni Huang’s eyebrows shot up, but she replied sweetly, “I’m only a puppy for you~”","Those words sent Zu An’s heart pumping as if someone had injected adrenaline into him.","...","Some time later, there was a commotion outside. Ni Huang nervously hugged her lover, signaling for him to stop.","“I wish to meet the Earth Duke General!” It was the one-eyed commander, Yan Zheng.","“The general is busy discussing matters with Lord Liu. He has strictly forbidden anyone from disturbing them,” the guard replied.","Yan Zheng frowned. “When did that Liu fellow enter the tent?”","“Around four hours ago.”","Yan Zheng was taken aback. “They have been talking for so long?”","“Commander Yan, please don’t put us in a difficult spot. The Earth Duke General has declared that he would execute anyone who barged into his tent.”","Yan Zheng harrumphed. “They should be almost done with their discussion. I’ll wait outside.”","The guard breathed a sigh of relief. It was all good as long as Yan Zheng didn’t barge in.","In the tent, Zu An saidd with a smile, “It sounds like he has something urgent to report. Aren’t you going to meet him?”","“Who cares? I’m not going to meet anyone else until I beat you once.” Ni Huang flipped her body over.","The Asuras were normally exceptionally talented, but how could an amateur who had never experienced carnal pleasures possibly be a match for a maxed out character?","Ni Huang obstinately held on at the start, but it eventually reached a point where she had no choice but to beg for mercy. Little did she know that her pleas only stoked the enemy’s ferocity.","...","“A new valkyrie has been detected. Do you want to collect her?”","Zu An wasn’t surprised to receive that notification, since Ni Huang bore a striking resemblance to Murong Qinghe and Mo Xi. He immediately tapped ‘Yes’. Moments later, there was a new ‘Deity of Lightning’s Fragment’ in his Valkyrie System.","She’s indeed one of the Deity of Lightning’s fragments.","“What did you do to me?” Sensing the anomaly with her soul, Ni Huang opened her eyes despite her exhaustion.","Zu An told her about the first-generation universal deities’ soul fragments, as well as his mission in this world.","Ni Huang was taken aback. She murmured, “I have always known that I was talented. I learn things faster than my peers, and I cultivate faster than my brother. But I didn’t think I had a universal deity’s soul fragment in me.”","“Don’t think too much about it. To me, you are you...” Zu An said. From prior experiences, he could tell that she was trying to digest the information and was in a sensitive mood.","Fortunately, Ni Huang was able to recover quickly. “Is this how you collect the soul fragments of the other universal deities as well? How many have you collected to date?”","...","Zu An was at a loss for words. Why do they all focus on that? He carefully explained the matter.","Ni Huang frowned, “You have only collected so few? Do you need my help? I know a few people who could be soul fragments of the first-generation universal deities.”","Zu An was taken aback. “Who?”"]},{"number":2998,"title":"Chapter 2998: Chapter 2950: Turning Tides","paragraphs":["Princess Ni Huang replied with a mysterious smile, “I’ll tell you in the future.”","Her mischievous grin reignited the flames of passion in Zu An. Another intense battle ensued.","...","By the time Zu An left the tent, the sun was already up. Yan Zheng, who had waited outside the entire night, was covered in dew water. He was speechless. What was the Earth Duke General discussing with this fellow that held them up the entire night? At least it’s over now. He hurriedly requested an audience.","However, the voice in the tent replied, “I am exhausted. We’ll talk later.”","Ni Huang could already guess that Yan Zheng was here to speak ill of ‘Liu Bei’. That might have worked in the past, but now, she already knew that ‘Liu Bei’ was the lover whom she often dreamed about. There was no way she would allow him to drive a wedge between them. It was only in light of Yan Zheng’s contribution thus far that she didn’t lecture him in person.","Besides, she was feeling weak after an entire night of wrestling. It wasn’t a good time for her to meet guests.","Yan Zheng was oblivious to the truth. He had waited an entire night, only to be turned away. Resentment flickered across his eyes as he angrily stomped off.","...","In the following days, the Yellow Turban Army began advancing toward Zhongshan Commandery. Zu An followed them, and he often met Ni Huang in private to discuss current affairs in this world.","“What? The Yellow Turban Army is on the verge of destruction?” Ni Huang was startled.","“Yes. Even though the Yellow Turban Army seems to wield the upper hand right now, the imperial court’s strength and influence remain. They only lost so much land because they were caught off guard,” Zu An replied with a sigh. He couldn’t help but lament now that he knew that the Yellow Turban Army’s second-in-command was his ally.","“But this isn’t the same world you know. Is there no way to change how things unfold?” Ni Huang was reluctant to surrender just like that. The Yellow Turban Army was extremely strong right now. She couldn’t imagine it crumbling within less than a year.","Zu An explained, “The key events are fixed. Attempting to go against them will result in a backlash. The imperial court hasn’t dispatched its elites yet, and there are many ambitious individuals like Zhang Chun around. They are borrowing the Yellow Turban Army’s hand to pressure the imperial court into loosening the shackles around them.","“Once they acquire the authority they need, they will cooperate with the imperial court to subjugate the Yellow Turban Army. When that happens, the Yellow Turban Army will find itself in a terrible position.”","Ni Huang frowned. “Is there no way to turn things around?”","“The outcomes are fixed, but the paths leading there may vary. We can change the details to something that benefits us more.” Zu An was well accustomed to this situation. He shared with her the lessons he had learned from previous dungeons. “In history, Cao Cao recruited a million soldiers from the Yellow Turban Army, and that became a huge supporting force in his eventual fight for the world. We can copy his move. We’ll pretend that the Yellow Turban Army has been defeated, but in truth, we’ll try to repackage it into something else...”","“That’s a good idea, but I can’t tell my men to surrender to you.” Ni Huang looked troubled. “The imperial court views me as a rebel leader. They won’t pardon me. I’ll only be dragging you down if I defect to your side.","“Furthermore, the army under my command is not full of puppets. Each of them has their own thoughts. They heed my rally because I am the Earth Duke General of the Taiping Sect. If I surrender to you, the basis of my authority will vanish. They won’t follow my orders anymore.","“On top of that, I am currently supporting hundreds of thousands of soldiers and their family members. The amount of rations required for that is an astronomical sum. We can still afford it through plundering towns and cities, but if I join your side, that won’t be a feasible option. We won’t have enough resources to feed them.”","Zu An pondered for a moment before replying, “The first problem can be easily resolved, but the other two require further planning.”","In particular, the shortage of rations was a pressing problem. He was already struggling with just twenty to thirty thousand people, let alone hundreds of thousands of people.","“Forget it. I’ll start from Zhongshan Commandery. Let’s see if I can change fate!” Ni Huang declared impassionedly. Asuras never surrendered in a war, except for last night...","The Yellow Turban Army marched over to Zhongshan Commandery. Zhang Chun had already caught wind of the news and led his army out to confront them.","The defending party would only hole themselves up in a city as a final resort. Their territory wasn’t just limited to a single city; there were civilians, farmlands, and industries operating outside. They couldn’t let the enemy plunder all that.","This battle gave Zu An a better idea as to how armies fought in this world. This wasn’t his first battle in this world, but so far, he had been relying on unorthodox methods like launching sneak attacks. He hadn’t really faced an enemy force head-on.","Zu An couldn’t be seen associating with the Yellow Turban Army in his capacity as ‘Liu Bei’, so he disguised himself as one of the Earth Duke General’s guards while observing the battle.","In summary, the strength of an army was broadly dependent on three factors.","The first was the size of the army. The larger the army was, the greater its strength.","The second was the army commander’s capability. It took a good commander to draw out the true potential of an army. On top of that, outstanding commanders could grant buffs to their soldiers.","The third was how well-trained the army was. An army of peasant militias would struggle to rival an army of veteran soldiers. The more elite an army was, the more traits they would have. Any one of these traits could easily turn the tides on the battlefield.","The commander’s cultivation and valiance could significantly raise an army’s strength as well. The smaller the army, the more significant the commander’s valiance was.","For instance, if the brawny Lu Bu were to confront the brainy Sima Yi on the battlefield, with both sides having ten thousand soldiers each, Sima Yi would surely beat Lu Bu with ease. But if both sides only had three thousand soldiers each, Lu Bu would be able to teach Sima Yi a lesson.","Zu An paid attention to how Ni Huang mobilized her troops. She didn’t just send her army of a hundred thousand to charge blindly at the enemy. Instead, she had her commanders take turns charging the enemy formation. Each clash chipped away at both sides. It was only a question of which side was strong enough to hold out to the end.","Ni Huang explained the importance of an army’s morale to Zu An. If morale plummeted, the army’s fighting prowess would plummet as well. Rising casualties would take a toll on the soldiers’ morale, so Ni Huang would substitute platoons whose morale had fallen beneath a critical point with other platoons.","Zhang Chun was a capable commander; it wasn’t without reason that he had kept Zhongshan Commandery safe for so many years. He had fewer soldiers than the Yellow Turban Army, but his soldiers were far more elite. On top of that, he was supported by ethnic cavalrymen. He stood his ground against the Yellow Turban Army’s onslaught.","Ni Huang harrumphed. She finally personally made a move. With a wave of her hand, the clear sky suddenly darkened, and countless lightning bolts devastated Zhang Chun’s army.","Zhang Chun had no choice but to retreat to Lunu City with his surviving soldiers. The Yellow Turban Army pursued them and encircled Lunu City.","Zu An worried about Murong Qinghe’s safety. He had spotted her and the Wuhuan cavalry in Zhang Chun’s army. To his relief, she didn’t confront the Yellow Turban Army head on, opting to chip at their flanks instead. Her commanding trait ‘Lightning Movement’ allowed her and her cavalrymen to swiftly enter and leave the battlefield, leaving no chance for the Yellow Turban Army to encircle her.","In Lunu City, Zhang Chun was in a fluster. He gathered his commanders to discuss their next step.","“Should we request reinforcements?” someone proposed.","“The other provinces have fallen. Who can reinforce us?” Zhang Chun asked with a frown.","“How about Ji County’s Liu Bei?” Murong Qinghe asked."]},{"number":2999,"title":"Chapter 2999: Chapter 2951: Requesting Reinforcement","paragraphs":["“Liu Bei?” Zhang Chun had the most bizarre expression when he heard that name. It was just days ago that he’d turned down Liu Bei’s request for reinforcements. How could he lower his pride right now to seek help from Liu Bei?","“That’s right. He has just inflicted two crushing defeats to the Yellow Turban Army and enjoys a glowing reputation right now. He might have a way to deal with the Yellow Turban Army. On top of that, Ji County is not too far away from Zhongshan Commandery,” Murong Qinghe replied.","Zhang Ju interjected with a roar, “The Yellow Turban Army was supposed to invade Ji County, but they suddenly changed their target and attacked Zhongshan instead. Who knows if that Liu brat is behind this?”","Murong Qinghe harrumphed. “The Yellow Turban Army poses a threat to Ji County as well. If they conquered Zhongshan, they would have Ji County completely surrounded. That would put him in a desperate position. I believe that he’d put aside past differences and make a rational choice.”","She quickly added, “But Marshal Zhang will have to show some sincerity to placate him as well.”","Zhang Chun’s expression flickered. He didn’t want to ask Liu Bei for help.","“Marshal, if Zhongshan Commandery falls, the rations we have stockpiled for many years will go to waste,” one of Zhang Chun’s aides said.","Zhang Chun looked at the Yellow Turban Army’s base camp and finally made up his mind. “Fine. As long as Liu Bei helps me push back Zhang Bao, I’ll give him half of our stockpiled rations!”","The discussion proceeded to whom they would send as the envoy.","In the end, the mission was entrusted to Murong Qinghe. It was the natural choice, since she and her Wuhuan cavalrymen were the ones who had the highest chance of breaking out of the Yellow Turban Army’s encirclement. But Zhang Ju was worried that Murong Qinghe would flee, so he forbade her from taking all her subordinates with her.","In the end, both sides came to an agreement. Murong Qinghe would take five hundred cavalrymen out with her to request reinforcements.","Meanwhile, Zu An and Ni Huang were busy communicating their feelings when a commotion broke out. A soldier reported that a platoon of cavalrymen had charged out of Lunu City, and their leader was a beautiful but valiant woman. They were so fast that the Yellow Turban Army struggled to stop them.","Zu An knew right away that it was Murong Qinghe. Worried, he quickly put on his clothes.","That made Ni Huang jealous. “I want to see how beautiful that woman is as well.”","Zu An anxiously stopped her. “That won’t do. She won’t be able to escape if you make a move as well, and there’s no way you can free her when everyone is watching. If she somehow flees from your grasp, it’ll only damage your reputation.”","Ni Huang snorted, “You’re just speaking up for her. Hmph, go and save her yourself. I won’t bother myself with this.”","Zu An laughed. He gave her a huge kiss before leaving.","He rushed to the battlefield, only to see that Murong Qinghe had broken out of the encirclement with her ‘Lightning Movement’. The Yellow Turban Army couldn’t catch up with her at all.","So, he secretly left the camp and distanced himself from the battlefield’s intimidation aura. It didn’t take long for him to regain his cultivation, which allowed him to use Rainbow Morph to intercept Murong Qinghe.","Murong Qinghe was initially taken aback. She thought it was a Yellow Turban Army ambush. It was only when she saw Zu An’s face that she exclaimed in delight, “Brother-in-law!” She leaped into Zu An’s arms, and the two of them embraced.","The other Wuhuans weren’t surprised, since Zu An had already stayed in her tent for the night. The grassland tribes were looser about such matters. If anything, they were intrigued about why their leader had never had a man before this.","At the same time, they admired Zu An. He already has that ice fairy as his companion; how did he win our little princess’ fancy as well?","“Brother-in-law, what are you doing here?” Murong Qinghe asked.","“It’s a long story. Why did you leave the city?” Zu An asked.","“We were traveling to Ji County to seek reinforcements from you. I didn’t expect to bump into you here,” Murong Qinghe replied with a smile.","“Seek reinforcements from me?” Zu An was amazed by Zhang Chun’s shamelessness.","Having guessed his thoughts, Murong Qinghe added, “Zhang Chun is willing to pay half of the city’s rations to you as compensation.”","She also highlighted Ji County’s precarious situation; if Zhongshan Commandery fell, Ji County would be in danger as well. She couldn’t care less about Zhang Chun, but that would put Zu An in trouble.","“Half of their rations?” Zu An’s eyes lit up. “That’s worth considering.”","He pulled Murong Qinghe to the side and explained the current situation to her. Murong Qinghe widened her eyes in shock when she learned that Zu An was currently a guest at the Yellow Turban Army. “How did you do it, brother-in-law?”","“It’s a coincidence. I went there to negotiate with them, but I bumped into a familiar face there,” Zu An replied with a smile.","“Oh. It must be a beauty.” Murong Qinghe looked at Zu An with envy and awe. “As expected of you. It seems that you have lovers wherever you go.”","“Qinghe, when did your tongue become so sharp?” Zu An instinctively looked at her mouth, and the same thought occurred to them simultaneously, causing their hearts to stir.","It took them some effort to rein in their passion and discuss the important matters at hand.","“Brother-in-law, what do you intend to do? How do you intend to earn those rations if the Yellow Turban Army’s commander is an ally as well?” Murong Qinghe asked. It didn’t make sense for them to squander their troops against each other just to earn some rations.","“We need to find a way. You head to Ji County to look for Tingxue and Yun Jianyue. Tell them to deploy our troops here. I’ll liaise with the Yellow Turban Army’s commander to figure something out,” Zu An replied.","“All right!” Murong Qinghe reluctantly bade Zu An farewell before advancing to Ji County.","Zu An returned to the Yellow Turban Army’s general tent to discuss the matter with Ni Huang. The latter didn’t answer; she seemed more concerned about Murong Qinghe.","“She is also a Deity of Lightning soul fragment, which makes her your sister in a way,” Zu An consoled her.","“And that relationship is further reinforced because of you,” Ni Huang remarked. “What do you think it will mean to collect all the universal deities’ soul fragments? Will we fuse as one and cease to exist?”","Zu An was taken aback. He had never considered this issue. He grabbed her hands and said, “If that’s the price to pay, I’d rather not get the soul fragments.”","To hell with that apocalypse! The universal deities can resolve that themselves. It has nothing to do with me!","Sensing his sincerity, Ni Huang lay on his chest. “You’re the best, big brother Zu~”","...","After briefly sharing their warmth, Ni Huang said, “On that note, we just received a request for reinforcements from our boss. The imperial court’s Northern Imperial General Lu Zhi led his elite Northern Army’s Five Divisions to encircle our boss at Guangzong County.”","Zu An was surprised. His initial plan had been to put on an act with the Yellow Turban Army to earn Zhang Chun’s rations, but he wasn’t sure how he could convince them to do so. However, there was no need for that anymore."]},{"number":3000,"title":"Chapter 3000: Chapter 2952: Stalemate","paragraphs":["“But there’s still a problem. I heard that Lu Zhi is your teacher. Won’t that put you in a tight spot?” Princess Ni Huang had gathered some intelligence about Liu Bei before marching down to Ji County, so she was aware of his affiliations.","“You don’t have to worry about that,” Zu An replied.","Murong Qinghe refused to believe that fate was set in stone, but she wasn’t willing to bet Zu An’s safety on that. If others were to learn that Zu An was working with the Yellow Turban Army, and the Yellow Turbans eventually fell in defeat, there would be nowhere for Zu An to go.","“But I’ll be joining Lu Zhi in the future,” Zu An replied with a troubled frown. That had been his plan all along, but that was before he knew one of the leaders of the Yellow Turban Army was an ally.","“That will be an issue. Are we doomed to meet on the battlefield?” Princess Ni Huang frowned.","“I’ll do my best to avoid a direct clash with you. You take care of yourself, too. Also, you should advise Zhang Jiao against being too hasty. There could be a window of opportunity if he stands his ground,” Zu An advised.","“Opportunity?” Princess Ni Huang was intrigued. “The imperial court has mobilized its army. Soldiers from nearby provinces and commanderies will only continue to pour in. I heard that a renowned general named Huangfu Song will be leading another elite army toward Yi Province. We’ll be in a difficult position if we don’t eliminate Lu Zhi’s force as soon as possible.”","Zu An told Princess Ni Huang about how Lu Zhi refused to bribe the eunuch dispatched to supervise the army, so the eunuch leveled false accusations against him, causing him to be removed from command and escorted back to the capital. “I’m not sure if it will happen in this world or not, but you can keep a lookout for that.”","Princess Ni Huang’s eyes lit up. “Lu Zhi is a famed general. Even our boss has suffered setbacks because of him. The imperial court will be courting death if it removes him from his position because he refuses to engage in bribery! Alright, I’ll advise our boss to maintain a defensive posture!”","The two discussed several more details.","Princess Ni Huang didn’t retreat right away. Instead, she continued heaping pressure on Lunu City for the next few days, lest Zhang Chun pursue her when she eventually retreated.","There had been so many close calls for Lunu City that Zhang Chun dared not close his eyes. He prayed hard to the moon and the stars. Finally, reinforcements from Ji County arrived, and he nearly burst into tears when Zu An appeared at the outskirts of Lunu City with the White Horse Righteous Followers.","Zu An pretended to clash with the Yellow Turban Army. With Princess Ni Huang as an insider, he enjoyed victory after victory.","Using the Yellow Turbans’ numerical advantage as a pretext, he maintained a defensive posture, refusing to pursue the opposing force when they retreated. Due to that, the Yellow Turbans didn’t suffer severe losses.","After suffering several losses, the Yellow Turbans finally began to back off. Lunu City’s crisis was finally over.","All the soldiers and the civilians were so relieved that they cried tears of joy. With deafening cheers, they welcomed the heroes who had saved them into the city.","Zu An entered the city with his troops, but he was too preoccupied to respond to the civilians’ cheers. After securing consecutive victories against the Yellow Turban Army, he had awakened a commanding trait—’Reputation’.","He was a little frustrated. His commanding trait didn’t seem useful compared to Princess Ni Huang’s ability to summon lightning or Murong Qinghe’s ‘Lightning Movement’. It wasn’t weak by any means, but he would prefer something more formidable.","It would appear that commanding traits are awakened through warfare. I wonder what kind of traits Tingxue and Yun Jianyue will awaken.","...","Zu An briefly traded pleasantries with Zhang Chun before demanding his compensation. As reluctant as the latter was, the Yellow Turban Army was still within the vicinity, so he could only bear the pain and pay up.","Zu An couldn’t be bothered to waste time with Zhang Chun. Upon receiving the rations, he made preparations to return to Ji County.","Murong Qinghe also led her Wuhuan cavalrymen back to her tribe. While the two reluctantly shared their farewells, she promised to nurture her own aides in hopes that she could bring more Wuhuan cavalrymen to his aid one day.","Two days later, Zhang Chun finally received news that Lu Zhi had cornered Zhang Jiao in Guangzong County. He realized that Zhang Bao had retreated not out of fear of Liu Bei, but to reinforce Zhang Jiao. That made him explode with anger.","“That little scoundrel Liu Bei! How dare he deceive me!”","He wanted to dispatch his troops to Ji County to demand the rations back, but his subordinates anxiously stopped him. Their army had suffered heavy losses in the previous battle and needed time to recover. Furthermore, they were all serving the imperial court. If Zhang Chun attacked Liu Bei, that would be tantamount to staging a rebellion!","“Hmph! I’ll return this favor one day!” Zhang Chun made sure to remember this grudge.","Shortly after Zu An returned to Ji County with the rations, Gongsun Yue and the White Horse Righteous Followers took their leave, claiming that they had been out for too long.","Zu An was reluctant to let them leave, but he couldn’t force the White Horse Righteous Followers to stay. So, they bade each other farewell.","Next, Zu An, together with Tingxue, Yun Jianyue, and three thousand elite soldiers, marched toward Guangzong County to reinforce Lu Zhi.","Zou Jing tried to dissuade Zu An, claiming that the Yellow Turbans were still plundering in the region and they needed to prioritize their territory first. However, Zu An said that Lu Zhi was his teacher, so he was duty-bound to reinforce him.","Perhaps due to Zu An’s commanding trait ‘Reputation’, Zou Jing was won over by his explanation and looked at him with glowing eyes. Despite being the superior, he subconsciously heeded Zu An’s words. He offered to guard Ji County so that Zu An could leave without worry.","Zu An and his army of three thousand marched southwest. Along the way, he updated Tingxue and Yun Jianyue about recent events. The two women were impressed. For the first time, they thought that there were benefits to Zu An’s philandering ways.","They didn’t encounter any Yellow Turbans along the way, so they arrived outside Guangzong City without any issue. A huge army was already standing in formation outside the city, and the intimidation aura it emanated surged into the sky.","Even Tingxue and Yun Jianyue felt their cultivation being suppressed despite being a great distance away. Previously, they couldn’t understand how the Yellow Turban Army was defeated within a year despite having built up such a huge momentum. But it all made sense now. The imperial court’s most elite army was far stronger than any army they had seen to date. Indeed, the imperial court hadn’t completely declined yet.","Zu An noticed Princess Ni Huang camping on the other side of the city, but the intimidation aura there was far weaker.","According to their intelligence, Princess Ni Huang had already clashed with Lu Zhi several times, but she hadn’t won a single exchange. Her army’s morale was currently at its lowest. They were initially supposed to attack Ji County, only to abruptly switch targets to Zhongshan Commandery. They suffered setbacks there, and all of a sudden, they had to travel a long way to Guangzong City.","It was fortunate that Zhang Jiao was holding the fort here, and Lu Zhi’s army was much smaller than the Yellow Turban Army. That had led to a stalemate for the time being.","Zu An stationed his army in the vicinity before bringing Tingxue and Yun Jianyue to meet Lu Zhi.","Lu Zhi stepped out of his tent to welcome Zu An. He had grayish-white hair held together by a wooden hairpin, with several loose strands scattered around his thin face. He had sharp cheekbones and a pair of deep eyes that exuded a warm light. Despite his old age, his back was upright.","He looked at Zu An with an approving nod. “Xuande[1], I heard you have turned the tides over at You Province. You protected Ji County, defeated Gao Sheng’s army of fifty thousand, and resolved the threat at Zhongshan Commandery. You are a pillar of the Eastern Han!”","Lu Zhi’s commanders turned to Zu An. This Liu Bei has received such high praises from Lu Zhi. It’s only a matter of time before he becomes known all over the world.","Zu An hadn’t expected news about his accomplishments to spread so quickly. Is this due to the effect of my ‘Reputation’ trait?","He quickly replied with a bow, “It’s all thanks to your teachings.”","Lu Zhi burst into laughter. While he frowned on bootlickers, it was a different story here, as Liu Bei was his student. He turned to the two ladies and asked with a frown, “These two are...?”","—","Some additional context:","As suggested, many local officials ‘overlooked’ the Yellow Turban Rebellion, allowing it to build up, mainly due to displeasure toward the emperor.","In this era, there were two major opposing factions in the imperial court—the eunuchs and the officials.","The eunuchs were intended to serve as a counterweight against the officials and the nobles. The officials and nobles slowly accrued power through the generations, with wealth and power building up to a point where they inspired fear in the emperor. In contrast, the eunuchs had been castrated and were unable to reproduce, so the emperor viewed them as a lesser threat.","Unfortunately, the eunuchs had committed many vile actions over the years, and the emperor seemed to just side with them (perhaps partly because he wanted to weaken the officials, but the justifications there weren’t strong enough).","For instance, the eunuchs had blatantly engaged in corruption right before a national amnesty. The officials learned about it and punished them anyway. This led the eunuchs to complain to the emperor, and the emperor sided with the eunuchs and punished the officials for it.","Such things happened several times, leading to great dissatisfaction against the imperial court. That is what sowed the seeds for the Yellow Turban Rebellion, and it’s partly the reason why many officials chose to overlook it even while it was building momentum.","Ultimately, the biggest beneficiaries of the Yellow Turban Rebellion were really the warlords, who gained permission to build up their private armies.","1. Liu Bei’s courtesy name ☜"]}]);
